window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1801,"title":"Chapter 1801 - 899: Taoist State_4","paragraphs":["But as soon as this thought arose, her heart trembled.","The day she connected the bonds of fate for Mo Hua, affected by a terrifying cause and effect, the broken red thread faintly appeared again before her eyes.","Elder Gu Hong looked deeply at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua didn’t notice anything but took out a bottle of pills and handed it to Elder Gu Hong, \"Sister Xia gave it, for Uncle Gu to take.\"","\"Sister Xia...\" Elder Gu Hong hesitated, \"Was it that girl just now?\"","\"You saw her?\"","\"I saw her.\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then said in a lowered voice, \"With Uncle Gu, wouldn’t she be quite suitable?\"","Elder Gu Hong was stunned, then her eyes brightened, but she soon sighed, \"Cut from the same mold, both with a cold exterior and warm interior, one handsome, the other beautiful, quite a match, but... Changhuai is unworthy...\"","Mo Hua disagreed, \"Why is Uncle Gu unworthy?\"","Elder Gu Hong sighed, \"That’s the Xia family, an ancient family above the fifth grade, a heavenly chasm separates them from ordinary fifth-grade families. Moreover, our Gu family, by strength, counts at most as a quasi-fifth rank, if judged by formal assessment, we might even be considered a fourth-grade.\"","Mo Hua was surprised, \"Is the Xia family that formidable?\"","Elder Gu Hong’s gaze was serious, \"Such an ancient family, one doesn’t know how many old monsters are hidden, their foundation is frighteningly deep, the waters run unfathomably deep, and what you see is just a tip of the iceberg.\"","Mo Hua clicked his tongue but after thinking, still said, \"If it’s meant to be, it could still happen.\"","Elder Gu Hong sighed, \"I hope so.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Mhm.\"","Elder Gu Hong silently glanced at Mo Hua again, thinking to herself, this child, always eager to connect others’ fates, yet his own destiny might be even more extraordinary.","In the future, who knows how much hardship and obstacles await, one heavy chasm after another...","But these words, she kept in her heart, unspoken.","Gu Changhuai awoke, and Mo Hua felt relieved.","The Gu family sent a heap of gifts to Mo Hua as compensation.","Mo Hua did not initially want to accept them.","This matter was merely a small effort, and besides, the true \"compensation,\" he had already received, and on regular days, he received much care from the Gu family.","Wenren Wan advised him, \"If you don’t take it, everyone in the Gu family will feel embarrassed.\"","Mo Hua had no choice but to reluctantly accept it.","Sometimes having good connections is troublesome too, many people are eager to send gifts, and you can’t refuse.","After receiving the pile of gifts, Mo Hua returned to Taixu Gate.","Upon returning to the Sect, the first thing Mo Hua did was to enter seclusion in the Disciple’s Residence, submerging his Divine Sense into his Sea of Consciousness.","Soon, at 1 a.m., the Taoist Stele appeared.","Mo Hua then extracted the God-skeleton he had drawn out from Uncle Gu’s Sea of Consciousness, which he had slain and roughly refined.","The God-skeleton is unlike ordinary Evil Spirits.","Even when slain, it still holds the origin of an Evil God and cannot be casually consumed, or it would instead pollute one’s Divine Soul.","Mo Hua used the Robbery Thunder from the Taoist Stele to annihilate the God-skeleton, \"sanitizing\" it.","Afterward, as expected, brilliant golden Divine Marrow was refined out.","Mo Hua was overjoyed.","All this time, he had been using the God-skeleton without seeing any \"income,\" and now he finally had a harvest.","Mo Hua no longer hesitated and swallowed the God-skeleton into his stomach.","Instantly his Divine Thought into the four limbs and hundred bones, as if nourished by sweet dew, gradually grew stronger again, and the gold in the Divine Thought body also became purer.","The fine wounds on the Divine Thought healed partially.","The integration of Taixu’s origin and the Divine Soul also became more thorough.","And his realm of Divine Thought Taoism was climbing step by step.","So much so that Mo Hua couldn’t help but think, if he could find a way to continually kill God-skeletons and eat Divine Marrow, continuing to \"eat\" like this...","Perhaps, it wouldn’t be long before he could break through the bottleneck of Heaven Yan Jue and reach Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Even the fusion of Taixu’s origin with his own Life Soul would speed up, and the progress of the Godslaying Sword would advance by leaps and bounds..."]},{"number":1802,"title":"Chapter 1802 - 900: Dream Omen","paragraphs":["The Divine Marrow truly is a treasure!","Mo Hua pondered for a moment in his heart.","From the information Sister Xia provided, it was known that the dozen or so Golden Core Demon Cultivators’ leaders in the Demon Sect most likely each harbored a Divine Remain.","The hosting of a Divine Remain was the \"blessing\" given by the Evil God to the Golden Core Demon Cultivators.","Yet, it also turned these Golden Core Demon Cultivators into \"puppets.\"","For Mo Hua, these Golden Core Demon Cultivators were like \"storage bags\" containing Divine Marrow.","As long as he killed these Golden Core Demon Cultivators, he could find a way to obtain the Divine Marrow.","However...","Mo Hua was unable to determine whether killing Golden Core Demon Cultivators to gain Divine Marrow was easier, or if slaying the Evil Embryo and refining the Divine Marrow was simpler.","Both killing a Golden Core and slaying an Evil Embryo did not seem like easy tasks.","In comparison, perhaps slaying the Evil Embryo was more \"practical\"—at least he was earnestly, step-by-step, on the path of \"slaying the Evil Embryo.\"","But killing Golden Core Demon Cultivators... was not only dangerous, but there were also many variables.","Uncle Gu, who was in the Golden Core Realm, nearly lost his life; not to mention himself, just a small Foundation Establishment cultivator.","In the killing game among the Golden Core at the Third-Grade State Boundary, there was no room for him to interfere.","To think of obtaining Divine Marrow by killing Golden Core is almost an unrealistic dream.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","But he couldn’t just ignore the matter.","Because of Uncle Gu’s involvement.","Uncle Gu had \"mixed\" with him for too long; he had his hand in many matters and got wrapped up in too much cause and effect, which led to him being targeted by the Evil God’s force. That’s why a Golden Core Realm Demon Cultivator would rather self-destruct his Golden Core and take him down too...","Although Uncle Gu himself once said he was a Supervisor of the Taoist Court, whose duty was to apprehend Evil Demon Cultivators, which was part of his responsibilities.","But to be honest, there’s much contributed by his presence too.","If it weren’t for him, the \"troublemaker,\" Uncle Gu probably wouldn’t have been entangled so deeply in the puzzle of the Evil God.","Previously, capturing the peak Second Grade Sin Cultivator at the Second-Grade State Boundary was fine.","Now, a Supervisor at the Initial Golden Core stage has to confront the bloodthirsty Demon Sect at the Third-Grade State Boundary, where over ten Golden Core Demon Cultivators reside, fighting openly and secretly.","Living in blood and storm, who knows, he may lose his life due to a slight mistake someday.","Mo Hua sighed.","Even though Uncle Gu is cold and indifferent, he is a great good person, and it would be a pity if he died.","\"Isn’t there a way to help the Taoist Court hunt Golden Core Demon Cultivators, protect Uncle Gu’s safety, and earn some Divine Marrow in the process?\"","Of course, the Divine Marrow is secondary.","His primary concern is Uncle Gu’s safety.","Mo Hua nodded, but after pondering for a long time, he was still at a loss.","Cultivation is like an \"iron wall\" between cultivators.","If your cultivation is insufficient, many things just can’t be done, no matter what.","Besides, the gap between Foundation Building Middle Stage and Golden Core is really too vast to detect.","Mo Hua shook his head.","For now, this matter can only be put aside temporarily, and he can only silently hope in his heart that Uncle Gu will turn misfortune into fortune in the future...","He really couldn’t provide any help.","...","After Mo Hua cultivated for another two days, the seven-day period had arrived.","He had to go to the back mountain to learn swordsmanship from the Patriarch again.","But this time, as Mo Hua burned incense and bathed, preparing completely, and sat obediently in the Disciple’s Residence, waiting for the Patriarch to \"open the door\" and bring him over.","The void in front of him remained still for a long time.","\"What’s going on?\" Mo Hua was somewhat bewildered.","Could the Patriarch have forgotten the time?","That shouldn’t be the case...","\"Or did something happen to the Patriarch?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit heavy-hearted.","He waited for a while longer, but there was still no movement in front of him. Just as Mo Hua thought the Patriarch wouldn’t bring him over to learn swordsmanship tonight,","the void finally started to flicker.","A dark, profound spatial rift appeared, and a bony large hand reached out, grabbing Mo Hua by the collar.","In the midst of the scene changing, Mo Hua once again arrived at the Sword Tomb.","Upon focusing his eyes, Mo Hua saw that the back mountain was still the back mountain, and the Sword Tomb was still the Sword Tomb.","The Patriarch Dugu sitting in the Sword Tomb seemed just like usual, with nothing out of the ordinary.","\"Practice swordsmanship.\"","The voice of Patriarch Dugu remained low and hoarse, ancient as withered stone in the dark night.","Mo Hua hesitated for a moment, then asked, \"Patriarch, which sword moves should I practice?\"","He had already learned the God-slaying Sword.","\"Start from the beginning, practice everything I’ve taught you all over again.\"","Mo Hua was stunned, \"Practice from scratch?\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"Using formation in place of a sword, creating a new path, is a good thing. But don’t forget the basics of the Sword Dao. To some extent, the Divine Thought into sword True Jue is still a sword technique. More practice with the sword will do no harm.\"","Mo Hua felt it made sense, so he nodded.","Though this \"cheating\" way of Divine Thought transforming into a sword mesh well with the path he wants to walk, the original path of swordsmanship, even if not mastered, must still be grasped.","Every aspect of the world is a form of knowledge.","The same applies to Tao cultivation; formations and swordsmanship each have profound principles.","It’s best to study diligently, not fear complexity, and learn thoroughly from the basics.","Yet the Patriarch’s demeanor always made Mo Hua feel somewhat uneasy.","It seemed the Patriarch... was concerned about something?","Mo Hua dared not inquire further and could only bury his head and continue practicing swordsmanship.","Thus, it was as if he returned to the beginning, still walking steadily, starting from sword moves and practicing swordsmanship step by step.","Moreover, what he practiced were Body Cultivation type sword moves.","Of course, he could only practice the moves; they were not powerful, just served as physical exercise.","Having practiced for over an hour, the time was up, and Mo Hua was about to leave.","Patriarch Dugu was silent for a moment, then suddenly pointed at his own forehead, borrowing a wisp of sword intent, and drew a circle on the ground."]},{"number":1803,"title":"Chapter 1803 - 900: Dream Omen (2)","paragraphs":["Within this circle, the Sword Intent was unfathomable, enveloping both Mo Hua and himself inside.","Only then did Patriarch Dugu speak up:","\"Mo Hua...\"","He paused for a moment, then spoke slowly, his voice chilly: \"What did I teach you last time you were here?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, then his pupils contracted slightly as he pondered his response:","\"Patriarch, you taught me the spell point of self severing the Life Soul, to cut away the small self, comprehend the origin, transform the Sword Dao, and achieve the Great Dao.\"","Upon hearing this, Patriarch Dugu fell silent for a long time.","Mo Hua hesitated for a moment, finally swallowing the words \"Supreme Emotion Cutting,\" and asked:","\"Patriarch, is something wrong?\"","Patriarch Dugu did not answer, instead, his expression turned solemn, even frighteningly stern, as he said:","\"Mo Hua, remember, from now on, whatever I teach you, don’t blindly believe it; always think for yourself and keep true to your heart...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"Patriarch...\"","Before he could ask further, the solemn expression on Patriarch Dugu’s face vanished instantly, his demeanor turning indifferent again, as if unburdened by anything in the world.","No sorrow, no joy, no attachment, no thought.","Mo Hua silently held his tongue.","Patriarch Dugu made a cutting motion with his finger, dismantling the \"Sword Circle\" he had just drawn, then lifted his indifferent gaze to Mo Hua:","\"What did I just teach you?\"","Mo Hua was silent for a moment, then said: \"Patriarch, you taught me the spell point of self severing the Life Soul.\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"Very well, learn it well.\"","Mo Hua said nothing further, bowing respectfully:","\"Then, Patriarch, I’ll take my leave now.\"","Patriarch Dugu cast a strange \"admiring\" look at Mo Hua, then broke through the void, sending Mo Hua away.","Only Patriarch Dugu remained in the Sword Tomb.","His figure grew lonelier, even appearing somewhat hunched.","The desolate moonlight shone, making it all the more bleak.","And his expression lapsed into contradiction, at times icy, at times bewildered, at times brow furrowed, and at times as blank as white paper, with no emotion at all.","Amidst these mixed emotions, Patriarch Dugu bitterly said:","\"I shouldn’t have taught... From the start, I should never have taught him anything...\"","\"Junior Brother was right, I... I’ve made another mistake.\"","\"Divine Thought into Sword, can’t be learned...\"","\"Those things should never have been touched, they were sealed perfectly, it was I who opened the door for them...\"","\"I found them a good seedling...\"","\"If he never learned, nothing would come of it, but once learned... the stronger the sword, the stronger the demon, never-ending...\"","\"It’s my fault.\"","\"This sword technique should indeed be sealed, should be buried with me here in the Sword Tomb, turning into bones, turning to dust.\"","\"I...\"","Patriarch Dugu spoke to this point, coughing violently, his face twisted, features dissipating into nothingness, like a faceless person.","Yet though his face had no features, only human skin, it showed a distinct smile:","\"I taught well!\"","\"The seed has been planted...\"","\"He’s begun learning, I can sense it, he’s already started severing...\"","\"Sever, sever quickly, sever the self, sever humanity, sever all karmic ties, all causes and effects...\"","\"Patriarch Dugu\" began to laugh in a low voice, the sound eerie, indistinguishable between male and female, reverberating through the Sword Tomb like a ghostly demon from the Nine Nether.","...","Within the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","He felt that something was truly wrong with Patriarch Dugu.","But exactly what was wrong, he couldn’t say.","With his cultivation, miles away from the Golden Core and even farther from the Heaven Void above Feather Transformation.","The key issue was, he didn’t know what he could do; intervening rashly might very well only worsen the situation.","Mo Hua pondered for a long time, still feeling that he could only observe the changes unfold for now.","He was aware of his limitations.","If Patriarch Dugu couldn’t solve his issues himself, there was no way he’d succeed either.","Better follow the Patriarch’s instructions and focus on practicing his swordsmanship.","But speaking of sword practice...","Mo Hua recalled the Patriarch’s reminder to him just a moment ago:","\"From now on, whatever I teach you, don’t blindly believe it; always think for yourself and keep true to your heart...\"","Don’t blindly believe it, think for yourself, keep true to your heart...","Mo Hua reflected for a moment and immediately realized that the Patriarch might have been subtly warning him to be cautious in practicing certain techniques.","Especially the one that might be the \"Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao\" taught by the Patriarch.","\"Luckily, I was cautious and kept a vigilant eye...\"","Mo Hua silently sighed in relief.","Thinking it over now, his methods also didn’t exactly violate the Patriarch’s words, \"don’t blindly believe it, think for yourself, keep true to your heart.\"","Should be alright...","Mo Hua considered it a moment longer, but matters at the Heaven Void level were like clouded mist on a mountaintop, obscured and unclear.","Mo Hua sighed, having no choice but to let it go for now.","Afterward, Mo Hua continued as usual, following his plan to cultivate and practice swordsmanship, training both the \"Godslaying Sword\" and \"Emotionless Path\" together.","In his daily life, he, a Foundation Building Middle Stage Junior Brother, would also attend the Foundation Establishment Late Stage cultivation courses at Taixu Gate with his Foundation Establishment Late Stage Junior Brothers.","Whenever he had time, he would visit Yu Er.","Ever since Yu Er had been startled last time at the Gu Family and had a nightmare, her spirit had been low.","Inside Yu Er’s room.","Next to Yu Er’s bed, Mo Hua set up some Divine Formation arrays, then lit a stick of Calming Incense he had acquired from Mr. Mei.","The tranquil fragrance spread throughout the room.","\"You’ve been frightened, your Divine Soul unstable, so refrain from studying formations these days. Take more rest and we’ll catch up on missed lessons later,\" Mo Hua said gently."]},{"number":1804,"title":"Chapter 1804 - 900: Dream Omen (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Yu Er obediently nodded, \"Okay, Brother Mo.\"","Mo Hua smiled and turned to leave, but Yu Er suddenly grabbed his sleeve, \"Brother Mo...\"","Mo Hua turned back, his expression gentle, \"What is it? Are you still having nightmares?\"","Yu Er gently shook his head, but his expression still showed some lingering fear.","Mo Hua then patted his head, \"It’s alright, I’ll stay with you for a while. You can sleep peacefully.\"","\"Mm.\" Yu Er gave a slight nod.","Then Yu Er closed his eyes.","His little face was delicate and handsome, looking like a gentle and cute little lamb with his eyes closed.","But before long, Yu Er opened his eyes again, the clarity in them like a fawn’s, filled with intense unease.","Mo Hua was taken aback and asked, \"What’s wrong?\"","Yu Er hesitated and asked, \"Brother Mo, will anything happen to you?\"","Mo Hua was a bit confused, \"What do you mean?\"","Yu Er said, \"I mean... will you encounter danger?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit puzzled but still said, \"Everyone encounters danger in their lifetime. I’ve faced many dangers, but I’ve managed to overcome them. So, it’s nothing to worry too much about.\"","\"Mm.\" Yu Er nodded.","Mo Hua glanced at Yu Er and softly asked, \"Yu Er, do you have something on your mind?\"","Yu Er’s face turned pale, biting his lip tightly, and after a moment, he slowly said:","\"Brother Mo, am I... a Divine Fetus?\"","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted sharply, a slight chill rising in his heart, but he still managed to speak gently:","\"Who told you that?\"","Yu Er shook his head, \"No one told me, I... heard it in a dream...\"","\"A dream?\"","\"Mm,\" Yu Er said, \"that day at the Gu family, Uncle Gu suddenly became very scary, his eyes were black and red, and just a glance at me, I started having nightmares.\"","\"After you, Brother Mo, came, I got better... but later, on and off, I still had some nightmares.\"","\"In the dreams, there seemed to be many mountains, many demons, bloody...\"","\"It seemed, there were also people talking...\"","\"They said something about awakening, something about a rabbit crying, something about one mountain, one river, one person...\"","\"They also mentioned many people would die... blood flowing into the river, bones forming tall buildings, human flesh building cities, all linking together...\"","\"They also said, all this was because of me...\"","\"Because of me, everyone would die, everyone must die...\"","Yu Er’s face grew whiter, his body trembling slightly, seemingly immersed in deep guilt and fear, tears slipping from the corners of his eyes.","Mo Hua, feeling a twinge of heartache, smiled and patted Yu Er’s head:","\"It’s just a dream, often dreams are the opposite of reality. Everyone will live well, there’s no need to worry.\"","Yu Er, tears in his eyes, nodded.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then said, \"Yu Er, do you know about evil spirits and demon monsters?\"","Yu Er shook his head, then nodded, \"Are those what I saw in the dreams?\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Evil spirits and demon monsters are best at enchanting the human heart, taking advantage of when you’re afraid, worried, or not steadfast, to lie and deceive you.\"","\"The words of evil spirits are all lies.\"","\"The more you fear them, the more they’ll bully you. If you’re strong-minded, they won’t dare to deceive you.\"","\"And...\" Mo Hua’s slender eyebrows slightly raised, \"All the evil spirits and demon monsters in this world are no more than feeble chickens and dogs before your Brother Mo. I need only one sword to cut them all down.\"","\"Next time they try to deceive you, just tell me, and I will make sure to slaughter them cleanly!\"","Mo Hua’s voice carried a gentle killing intent.","Yu Er’s eyes gradually brightened, feeling much reassured, he smiled at Mo Hua and nodded.","\"Alright, have a good sleep, when your spirit is strong, evil thoughts won’t bother you.\" Mo Hua said.","Yu Er obediently nodded, then slowly closed his eyes.","Mo Hua stood guard beside him until Yu Er was soundly asleep, then he left with peace of mind.","After Mo Hua left, Yu Er continued to sleep peacefully.","But only a moment later, in his sleep, Yu Er’s brow slowly furrowed.","Near his ear, a sinister and sharp voice sounded:","\"He’s lying to you...\"","\"He’s just a mere Foundation Establishment, how many Evil Spirits can he slay?\"","\"The Demon Monsters are endless, one day sooner or later, he too will be completely devoured by the Evil... drained of blood, flesh eaten up, even his bones will be gnawed away...\"","\"And all of this, is because of you.\"","\"He wants to save you, but he doesn’t know...\"","That terrible voice seemed to echo right by Yu Er’s ear, permeating into his mind, \"... you are the biggest Demon Monster.\"","In the dream, Yu Er looked terrified, \"I’m not...\"","\"You are!\"","That sinister voice seemed to seep into his heart, \"You shouldn’t be living in the first place, as long as you live, your mother, your Uncle Gu, your Brother Mo, will all have to die...\"","\"The more you tell them, the faster they die.\"","\"They will die by your hands...\"","Yu Er curled up his body, tears soaking the blanket, murmuring softly:","\"I don’t want mother to die, I don’t want Brother Mo to die, I...\"","...","Inside the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua thought about Yu Er’s matter, his gaze heavy, muttering to himself:","\"That’s strange...\"","\"No trace of Evil Spirit, no bad Karma, no Evil God parasite... why is Yu Er having nightmares? Even able to hear mumblings?\"","\"Could it be... the Evil God is about to wake up?\"","\"Also, what do the things Yu Er said actually mean?\"","\"What does it mean when the rabbit cried? What is a mountain, a water, and a person?\"","\"The blood will flow into the river, bones will be piled into high buildings, human flesh will build cities...\"","\"Could these be some kind of prophecy?\"","Mo Hua felt an inexplicable sense of urgency in his heart.","He only vaguely knew the outline of the Evil God’s plan, but as for what this scheme really was, he knew very little...","Now it seems, the entire plan for the Evil God’s revival might be more bloody, more cruel, and on a larger scale than he initially thought.","As to the point where... everyone will die?","After that, Mo Hua tried to find more clues, but there was simply no way to start.","The blood oath list had been erased by him, and the Foundation Establishment Sin Cultivators under the Evil God were all eliminated from the Divine Soul level.","Now, the only one remaining is the \"Young Lord.\"","But the Young Lord hides in the shadows, leaving no trace.","He couldn’t investigate the Golden Core Demon Cultivators there.","Elsewhere, there were no effective leads either...","Calculated back and forth, Mo Hua still couldn’t do anything, he could only calm down, focus on Cultivation, and continue practicing the sword...","After more than a month, Gu Changhuai’s injuries have also healed a lot.","He is a Golden Core with a strong foundation, the Gu family is considered a great family, not lacking Pills or spiritual materials, and after taking meticulous care for over a month, his injuries have mostly recovered.","It’s just that his Divine Sense is still depleted, occasionally feeling dizzy and in pain, and residual pain remains in his meridians, preventing him from exerting full strength.","Normally, with his condition, he should be resting at home.","But Gu Changhuai is stubborn and a \"workaholic,\" as soon as he could move, he went straight to take up his position at the Taoist Court.","Mo Hua was somewhat worried.","Last time, Uncle Gu was just lucky.","But next time?","If there’s another next time, he might really lose his life...","A Taoist Court Department of Ceremonies who is in plain sight and injured, how could he possibly guard against a dozen Golden Core Demon Cultivators in the shadows...","But worry was of no use.","The time continued to pass little by little.","Mo Hua’s realm was still stuck, and Divine Thought into sword was still being practiced.","The Evil God’s plan should still be advancing in secret.","The Taoist Court was still eradicating the Demon Sect, Uncle Gu was still shrouded in deadly storms, and Yu Er wasn’t as happy as before...","Mo Hua only felt that the situation was slowly getting out of his control, and he was somewhat helpless.","Until one day, Cheng Mo sent him a token."]},{"number":1805,"title":"Chapter 1805 - 901: Token","paragraphs":["\"Junior Brother! Junior Brother! Do you still want the token?\"","During lunch that day, the disciples were eating in the dining hall when Cheng Mo found Mo Hua and said in a treasure-showing manner.","It was now well-known among the Taixu Sect disciples that their Junior Brother had a hobby of collecting \"tokens.\"","\"Is it a Letter Token?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes.\" Cheng Mo nodded and then handed over a token, stained with blood and engraved with the ferocious image of a Monster Beast, to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was taken aback and asked, \"Where did this token come from?\"","Cheng Mo did not hide anything and told Mo Hua everything from start to finish:","\"A few days ago, during our rest period, I, along with Situ, Hao Xuan, and Brother Yang, took on a mission to capture a wanted criminal.\"","\"The reward wasn’t difficult. After we completed it, we were heading back to the Sect when we saw a group of Sin Cultivators fighting with Court Officials.\"","\"Did you step in to help?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"No.\" Cheng Mo said honestly, \"There were too many of them, and we couldn’t win. Besides, you taught us, Junior Brother, that if the benefit is small and the risk is high, it’s best not to get involved.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Did I say that?\"","Cheng Mo affirmed, \"You did.\"","\"Oh,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"If I said it, I said it. Then what happened next?\"","\"Then, that group of Sin Cultivators was defeated. Some were captured by the Court Officials, but three managed to escape,\" Cheng Mo explained.","\"Did you chase them?\"","\"Yes,\" Cheng Mo nodded, \"We, a group of five, imitating your style, Junior Brother, wore concealment cloaks and quietly followed them.\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","\"Then what happened? What did you find?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Cheng Mo said, \"We followed them to a remote village. They went into an old yard in the village and locked the door tightly.\"","\"Following what you taught us, Junior Brother, we broke the Formation outside and sneaked into the yard...\"","\"The yard looked normal from the outside, but when we searched, we discovered the soil underneath was dark red, soaked with who knows how much blood. That’s when we realized these Sin Cultivators were not ordinary; they might have practiced Evil Skills.\"","\"Dark red blood...\" Mo Hua mused, then asked, \"What did you do next?\"","Cheng Mo said, \"Following your rules, Junior Brother, when the situation inside is unknown and the enemy is gathered, naturally we set up a formation and blew it up.\"","Mo Hua nodded in satisfaction.","\"But, there was a little accident...\" Cheng Mo continued.","Mo Hua took a bite of his chicken leg, listening to him.","Cheng Mo had a strange expression, \"We set up the formation but hadn’t activated it yet when something changed inside the house. The three Evil Cultivators started to ’gnaw’ on each other.\"","\"Gnaw?\" Mo Hua was taken aback and couldn’t resist asking, \"What kind of gnawing?\"","\"The kind where you gnaw on elbows,\" Cheng Mo looked uncomfortable, \"They were biting each other’s necks, breaking the skin and flesh like wild animals, sucking blood from each other...\"","Sucking blood...","Mo Hua was suddenly enlightened and more or less certain of the situation.","This group of Evil Cultivators was likely disciples of the Demon Sect known for spreading \"downline\" members that sucked blood.","Cheng Mo continued, \"The three Evil Cultivators gnawed at each other, covered in blood, flesh and blood torn apart. We waited without doing anything until they fought it out, with two severely injured and one left alive. We then detonated the formation, destroying two and leaving one barely alive...\"","\"Afterward, the five of us acted together, effortlessly capturing the last one unharmed!\"","Cheng Mo looked proud.","\"Well done.\" Mo Hua nodded approvingly.","These Junior Brothers of his were becoming more and more prudent, not letting down the \"training\" he had given them as their Junior Brother.","Cheng Mo added, \"It’s just a pity that these Evil Cultivators were dirt poor. We couldn’t find anything valuable on them except for this token.\"","\"We handed the people over to the Court Officials, but I secretly kept this token and brought it to you, Junior Brother.\"","Mo Hua glanced at the blood-stained token and asked, \"This token looks sinister. Didn’t the Elder confiscate it when you entered the mountain?\"","Cheng Mo nodded, \"They did, but I said it was yours, Junior Brother, and Elder Song hesitated for a moment before agreeing.\"","Now in the Taixu Sect, Mo Hua’s reputation was more useful than that of an ordinary Elder.","After all, without his sudden rise as the \"Number One in Formations,\" the Taixu Sect might not even be among the Eight Great Gates now.","The Three Sects Unification, with the Taixu Sect at the forefront, was in no small part thanks to Mo Hua.","This was something everyone in the Taixu Sect knew.","\"But rules are rules,\" Cheng Mo said, \"Elder Song wants you to register it when you’re free.\"","Such a token imbued with Evil Qi had to be recorded by the Sect, regardless of who was holding it.","Mo Hua was not one to break rules, so he would follow them scrupulously.","\"I understand.\" Mo Hua nodded, then transferred two hundred Merit Points to Cheng Mo, \"You’ve worked hard; split it with Situ and the others.\"","Cheng Mo quickly declined, \"I can’t accept this.\"","\"Even among brothers, accounts must be settled. Since you’re giving me the token, I can’t take it for nothing,\" Mo Hua said.","Of course, it was mainly because he was maxed out on Merit Points and couldn’t use them all. Naturally, he wanted to give some benefits to these Junior Brothers.","Cheng Mo didn’t refuse any further, smiling, \"Thank you, Junior Brother! Then I will accept graciously.\"","If it were anything else, he might have been more modest, but Merit Points were a different story.","Unlike the \"rich\" Mo Hua, these disciples were struggling with their Merit Points.","Especially now, having reached the late stage of Foundation Establishment and their Cultivation Techniques at the final stage of the Second Grade, they needed to prepare to forge their own Magical Treasure and for the Core Formation..."]},{"number":1806,"title":"Chapter 1806 - 901: Token_2","paragraphs":["The merits are spent like running water.","The merits given by Mo Hua are not very many, but they still make them feel much more comfortable.","\"By the way, Junior Brother...\" Cheng Mo asked in a low voice, \"When exactly can you reach the late stage of Foundation Establishment?\"","The group of \"Junior Brothers\" around also looked eagerly at Mo Hua upon hearing this.","Mo Hua sighed.","He also wished he could...","Wasn’t it just stuck at a bottleneck? The hardships of cultivating the Heaven Yan Jue, these Junior Brothers just don’t understand.","\"Eat.\" Mo Hua waved his hand.","\"Oh...\" Everyone then sensibly buried their heads in their meals.","...","After lunch, Mo Hua went to the mountain gate, found Elder Song, and registered this blood-stained token, which was engraved with Monster Patterns and had ferocious fangs, clearly belonging to an Evil Demon Cultivator.","Elder Song did not make things difficult for Mo Hua; on the contrary, he was very kind and friendly to him.","Previously, when Mo Hua took leave, Elder Song would have quite a few words, but now, even if Mo Hua \"skipped classes,\" Elder Song would probably praise him for \"not being confined to forms,\" \"having his own rhythm in Tao cultivation,\" \"not following the crowd\"...","Mo Hua has always been one to show others a foot of courtesy when they show him an inch.","Elder Song was kind to him, and he was very polite to Elder Song in return.","Elder Song was even happier, and after Mo Hua left, he spoke to the nearby elders:","\"Not arrogant, not discouraged, respecting teachers and elders, courteous and polite, he will surely become a great success in the future...\"","The nearby elders nodded in agreement.","Yet, there was a familiar elder who teased him:","\"Elder Song, you didn’t say that earlier. I remember a few years ago, you said that this child, relying on Elder Master Xun’s backing, would often take leaves, mischievous and troublemaking, and certainly would not become great?\"","Elder Song kept a straight face and dissociated himself, \"That was the past me, has nothing to do with the present me.\"","Everyone chuckled at his words.","...","After registering with Elder Song, Mo Hua took the Monster Pattern Token back to his Disciple’s Residence, intending to follow the routine and decipher the text inside after dismantling it.","Initially, Mo Hua was just going through the motions, not paying much attention.","But just as he used his \"skilled\" dismantling technique to pry open the token’s lid, Mo Hua’s expression changed.","Under the Monster Pattern Token, with a framework of White Bone, it was constructed with extremely complex Yuan Magnetic Formation Patterns, and a token structure he had never seen before.","\"This... is not a Letter Token?\"","Mo Hua was stunned for a moment, then his pupils suddenly contracted.","\"This is... a Sect Token?!\"","Mo Hua took a sharp breath.","A Sect Token...","If he was not mistaken, those Evil Cultivators who were mutually devouring and sucking blood were disciples of the Demon Sect, which the Taoist Court was sieging.","That would mean this Sect Token is a token of the Demon Sect?","The \"Demon Sect Token\" brought back by Cheng Mo and a few Junior Brothers was the real deal?","Mo Hua was shocked and found it hard to believe at first.","Then he couldn’t contain his joy.","A Demon Sect Token!","This is truly a once-in-a-lifetime treasure.","In every sect, the most symbolic and important token is the Sect Token.","Here in Qianxue State Boundary, it’s relatively relaxed because after all, it’s a \"teaching and disciplining\" type of sect, with some rules that aren’t too strict.","But Mo Hua heard that many other types of sects, like \"Hidden Sects,\" \"Family Sects,\" \"Spiritual Merchant Sects,\" \"Industry Sects,\" and \"Extralegal Sects,\" etc., have very strict rules on holding Sect Tokens.","Some sects can even be said to be \"as the token exists, so does the person; as the token vanishes, so does the person.\"","If a sect disciple loses their Sect Token, it would be equivalent to losing their identity as a \"sect disciple\" and would suffer severe punishments from the sect.","The extreme ones might even have their cultivation abolished and be expelled from the sect.","Moreover, losing a Demon Sect Token...","For a disciple holding a Demon Sect Token, dying swiftly might not even be an easy option.","The significance of this Sect Token is enormous...","Mo Hua’s heart was pounding, and he then began dismantling this Demon Sect Token with the utmost caution...","This Demon Sect Token is somewhat similar to the Xun Token.","It includes some \"Yuan Magnetic Communication\" functionality, and from the surface, it indeed looks like an ordinary Letter Token.","But besides the \"communication\" function, it must also construct a whole system for sect maintenance, organization, hierarchy, and might even have a task acquisition and reward-punishment system similar to the \"Merit Scroll\" of the Taixu Gate.","The token may be small, but it encompasses all.","From the grade perspective, this Demon Sect Token is certainly not as high as the Xun Token.","But structurally, this Demon Sect Token is more complex than the Xun Token.","The Xun Token is too high-end.","Its internal Yuan Magnetic Formation System is likely a Fifth Grade Array and possibly based on a Yuan Magnetic Array.","The core part is either built deep in Taixu Mountain or enclosed within the Xun Token itself.","The Xun Token Mo Hua can see is just a surface.","And this Demon Sect Token, though constructed more crassly than the Xun Token, precisely because of its crudeness, the internal formations can’t be enclosed, so it appears more complex.","Mo Hua carefully dismantled the structure of the Demon Sect Token, separating the fixed and unfixed magnetic patterns, and began analyzing the fixed magnetic patterns.","But after quite some time of research, he still couldn’t make sense of it.","This structure is more intricate, the unfixed magnetic patterns more variable, and a large portion of the fixed magnetic patterns he simply could not understand.","The biggest problem is, he could not figure out the core principle of the Sect Token, unable to distinguish between the \"Sect Token\" and \"Letter Token,\" what the biggest difference in underlying logic is."]},{"number":1807,"title":"Chapter 1807 - 901: Token_3","paragraphs":["In this way, he had no way to start, to analyze the functional structure of the Sect Token.","Mo Hua felt, for the first time in a long time, that his proficiency in formations was still far from enough...","Learning knows no bounds.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and decided to ask.","If you don’t know, learn; if you don’t understand, ask.","Even if he is now first in the Qianxue Array Competition and the Array Leader, it doesn’t mean he knows everything.","The study of formations is vast and profound, and he is still far behind.","As for who to consult, Mo Hua had already made plans.","He took some time to find Zheng Fang, then asked Zheng Fang to help inquire whether Elder Zheng had any free time recently, so he could pay him a visit.","Soon, Elder Zheng replied, saying he was available.","Thus, a few days later, in the elegant private room of the tea house in Tai Xu City.","Mo Hua and Elder Zheng started having tea together.","After a bit of small talk, Mo Hua got to the point and asked about the \"Sect Token\".","Elder Zheng was a little surprised.","This was not just a matter of going off-topic.","Elder Zheng said sternly, \"Let me remind you, the Sect Token involves sect secrets. If you dismantle someone else’s Sect Token and get found out, you might be hunted to the ends of the earth, with no rest until death...\"","Mo Hua froze, \"Just dismantling it, is it that serious?\"","All he knew was that if the Sect Token was lost, the sect disciple would be in big trouble.","But he didn’t expect that if an outsider dismantled a Sect Token, it would be such a big crime.","Elder Zheng said, \"Simply dismantling it might just be considered damaging the sect token, but... is your ’dismantling’ simple?\"","Elder Zheng looked at Mo Hua, raising an eyebrow slightly.","Mo Hua gave an awkward smile and didn’t speak.","Elder Zheng pondered for a moment, then asked, \"Did Elder Master Xun teach you about this?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","Elder Master Xun only taught some Yuan Magnetic Formations, not much else in depth.","Moreover, he estimated that Elder Master Xun wouldn’t teach him, so he came directly to consult Elder Zheng.","Elder Zheng pondered for a moment, nodding slightly, \"It indeed is a bit off the syllabus, and it’s reasonable that Elder Master Xun wouldn’t teach it. Besides, it’s probably not Elder Master Xun’s forte in formations either...\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Isn’t Elder Master Xun a Fifth Grade Array Master, isn’t he proficient in Yuan Magnetic Formations?\"","Elder Zheng shook his head and said, \"Every trade has its specialty. Formations are vast and profound, and no matter how deep one’s proficiency, an array master can’t be proficient in everything.\"","\"Moreover, the Sect Token involves more complex and special formation principles, which are of great significance.\"","\"The issue is more serious than you think, and Elder Master Xun probably doesn’t teach it to avoid bringing you trouble.\"","Mo Hua nodded, seeming to understand.","Elder Zheng looked at Mo Hua deeply, flicked his fingers, sent a few formation flags flying, placed them around, and then lowered his voice, saying to Mo Hua:","\"If you want to learn this formation, I can teach you, but you must consider carefully. Once you learn it, you mustn’t tell anyone, nor let anyone know.\"","\"Otherwise, if this matter is leaked, you could very likely be put on the ’blacklist’ of most sects, constantly guarded against wherever you go, haunting you to the point where someone might wish to kill you on sight...\"","Mo Hua shuddered inside, his expression becoming much more solemn.","\"Do you still want to learn?\" Elder Zheng confirmed.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then nodded seriously, \"Yes, I want to learn.\"","The more taboo, less open, the more it’s forbidden for others to learn, it precisely shows how powerful this formation is.","Since it’s a powerful formation, how can there be a reason not to learn?","Besides, he already possesses many inheritances that can’t see the light of day, one or two more won’t matter.","Elder Zheng nodded, \"Good.\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, suddenly realizing a question: \"Elder, you said that once I learn this formation, I mustn’t let anyone know. But you learned it too, aren’t you afraid of others knowing?\"","Elder Zheng replied indifferently, \"Others don’t know.\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","Elder Zheng said, \"In this world, the number of people who truly know I can do the Thunder Magnetism Formation is less than you can count on one hand.\"","Mo Hua was shocked.","He didn’t expect that Elder Zheng, with his straightforward and honest appearance, could hide such secrets so deeply.","Mo Hua hesitated and asked, \"Is it really okay for you to tell me such confidential matters?\"","Elder Zheng nodded and said, \"Trust never doubts, and doubt never trusts. Since I’m telling you, I’m naturally aware.\"","Mo Hua felt trusted and a little moved.","\"You can rest assured, I will tell no one,\" Mo Hua nodded solemnly.","Seeing this, Elder Zheng nodded:","\"It’s good you understand, the underlying principles of the Sect Token, I will now teach you, you can start researching, but before reaching the Golden Core, don’t waste too much thought on this.\"","Then Elder Zheng paused, took a sip of tea, organized his thoughts, and began to explain:","\"The Zheng Family inherits the ancient Thunder Formations, and studies the Dao of Eight Trigrams Thunder Skill.\"","\"This ’Thunder’ character, is truly profound, the knowledge too deep. Our Zheng Family has researched the Thunder Dao for so many years and roughly divided it into two sources: one is Thunder, and the other is Thunder Magnetism.\"","\"Above the Ninth Heaven, Thunder is transformed, with boundless power, capable of obliterating all things, with a power to destroy heavens and earth.\"","\"Between Heaven and Earth, Thunder Magnetism is everywhere, pervasive, yet traceless, able to transmit messages over thousands of miles, transmitting thoughts with a single idea.\"","\"The world only knows our Zheng Family researches the ’Thunder’ Dao.\"","\"But this Thunder Dao is so fiercely yang, and its slashing power so significant, that those who cultivate must have an unafraid Taoist Heart, upright and unyielding, and only a minority can cultivate it. Even if they do, it can’t be used lightly.\"","\"Actually, the livelihood of most formation masters in our Zheng Family, is the ’Thunder Magnetism Formation’.\"","\"The Thunder Magnetism Formation is also an offshoot of the Thunder Dao, widely applied, and most disciples of the Zheng Family can learn it...\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Zheng Fang once challenged him for the junior brother position, with a family-inherited basic Thunder Magnetism Formation Diagram to test him.","\"However,\" Elder Zheng’s gaze darkened, \"most cultivators in this world, including many formation masters, misunderstand the Thunder Magnetism Formation.\"","\"Every field is like a mountain apart, especially so in formations. A single category of formation can be like a mountain range apart...\"","\"Basic Five Elements and Eight Trigrams are fine, there are commonalities, but esoteric Eight Trigrams, like the Qian Formation, Kun Formation, Thunder Formation, are very profound knowledge, hardly understood without study.\"","\"As for others, Yin and Yang, Three Talents, Four Symbols, Seven Stars, etc., there’s even less to say.\"","\"Those who study formations are called formation masters, but the differences between formation masters can be as vast and formidable as the difference between humans and dogs.\"","\"The Eight Trigrams Thunder Formation lineage, especially Thunder Magnetism, is also like this.\"","\"Common formation masters who are not proficient in this field often confuse Yuan Magnetism with Thunder Magnetism, but they fundamentally do not understand that Yuan Magnetism and Thunder Magnetism are actually two completely different frameworks.\"","\"’Yuan Magnetism’, at most, is something on an application level, whereas ’Thunder Magnetism’, these two words, involve truly unspoken and forbidden formation secrets...\"","Mo Hua listened with rapt attention.","Elder Zheng taught with utmost seriousness.","Unbeknownst to him, Elder Zheng was opening for Mo Hua a door to perceive the world, to master thunder and magnetism, and to gain insight into the origin of it all..."]},{"number":1808,"title":"Chapter 1808 - 902: Returning to the Source","paragraphs":["Tai Xu City, private room in a teahouse.","Elder Zheng drank tea while explaining the framework of Yuan magnetic and Lei magnetic to Mo Hua.","\"Yuan magnetic and Lei magnetic are different.\"","\"The so-called ’Yuan magnetic,’ the emphasis is on the word ’magnetic.’ Between heaven and earth, it is filled with Yuan magnetic fields, and among Yuan magnetics, there is a natural sensing.\"","\"Cultivators use this sensing to transmit messages. The foundation of the Yuan Magnetic Formation is also constructed using the power of Yuan magnetic, and its core consists of two types of Yuan Magnetic Formation Patterns, namely, fixed magnetic patterns and variable magnetic patterns.\"","\"Variable magnetic patterns are the surface layer and can display text, pictures, and various external Yuan magnetic images.\"","\"Fixed magnetic patterns form the inner layer, interpreting the meaning of the Yuan Magnetic Formation itself, constituting its most basic function.\"","\"Yuan Magnetic Formation Masters study the Yuan Magnetic Array Map, learn fixed magnetic patterns, and build magnetic formation systems to transmit books, messages, or receive magnetic signals, manifest information between different magnetic formations...\"","...","Mo Hua concentrated intently and listened carefully.","Elder Zheng looked at Mo Hua and slowly said:","\"The entire system of ’Yuan magnetic’ is fixed, the framework is inherent. All Yuan Magnetic Formation Masters are learning, constructing, and maintaining various Yuan Magnetic Formations from simple to complex using this ’fixed’ framework, up to the ultimate Yuan Magnetic Array.\"","\"But this leads to a problem...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, \"Is it because the framework is fixed?\"","\"Exactly,\" Elder Zheng nodded with satisfaction, \"The system is fixed, which also means the framework has been fixed by others. You can only learn from others, use others, and build your Yuan Magnetic Formations according to their ’standards.’","\"Even the underlying magnetic patterns of your Yuan Magnetic Formation have been defined by others.\"","\"You only have ’usage rights,’ but no ’modification rights.’","\"Almost all Yuan Magnetic Formation Masters in the world follow others’ rules within the established ’Yuan magnetic’ norms, drawing formations that have been predefined by others.\"","Mo Hua remained silent for a moment and softly asked, \"What if... one doesn’t want to follow these rules?\"","Elder Zheng replied, \"Then that’s another framework.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, \"Lei magnetic?\"","Elder Zheng nodded, \"Change magnetic with thunder.\"","\"Magnetic is fixed; it is normative. Under established rules, cultivators rely solely on their divine sense, or external magnetic patterns, and cannot directly change the existing framework.\"","\"However, Lei magnetic is responsive. If one wants to change magnetic patterns, they must use the ’Thunder Flow.’","\"This is the deepest aspect of this type of formation.\"","\"If we consider only the magnetic pattern level, fixed magnetic patterns are the inner layer, variable magnetic patterns are the outer layer.\"","\"From the overall perspective, both fixed magnetic patterns and variable magnetic patterns are actually surface layers, with Lei magnetic being the deepest layer.\"","\"Use magnetics as the surface, thunder as the inner layer. With changes in thunder flow, magnetic patterns are motivated; this is the true principle of the ’Lei magnetic’ formation!\"","Elder Zheng spoke solemnly.","\"Magnetic is the surface, thunder is the core, change magnetic with thunder...\" Mo Hua contemplated for a while and suddenly realized.","Originally, he was fumbling through the process like crossing a river by touching stones, and indeed researched some aspects of Yuan magnetic, but those were ’unorthodox.’","He knew their function but not the principle behind.","Now, under the guidance of Elder Zheng, he finally understood the real distinction between Yuan magnetic and Lei magnetic, and the actual framework of the overall formation.","\"Then how does one ’change magnetic with thunder’?\" Mo Hua asked for further guidance.","Elder Zheng said: \"You should be quite familiar with the Letter Token, right?\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Until now, he doesn’t know how many Letter Tokens he has dismantled.","There are also many Letter Tokens he has restored and deciphered.","He has learned a lot about the basic Yuan Magnetic Formation Patterns, including fixed magnetic pattern annotations.","At least within the scope of second-grade formations, he can be considered a \"Yuan magnetic expert.\"","\"Let me use the Letter Token as an example,\" Elder Zheng said, \"The formation operation of the Letter Token includes two segments of Lei magnetic conduction.\"","\"One segment is external.\"","\"When you use magnetic ink to write text in the Letter Token and activate the magnetic patterns, naturally Lei magnetic sensing is generated.\"","\"Lei magnetic will spread out and permeate the surrounding heaven and earth.\"","\"Another appropriate Letter Token will sense this Lei magnetic and, according to the fixed magnetic patterns, display the corresponding text.\"","\"This is the basic process of Yuan magnetic communication.\"","Elder Zheng pointed out to the surrounding heaven and earth, \"Our surroundings are filled with Lei magnetic, but these Lei magnetics are extremely subtle, beyond the perception of a cultivator’s divine sense.\"","\"Even if someone is currently using Lei magnetic to communicate, containing their message in Lei magnetic, it might be floating right in front of us without our knowledge...\"","Mo Hua felt the mysteriousness deeply and couldn’t help but ask:","\"Can’t these Lei magnetic be intercepted?\"","Elder Zheng shook his head, \"To intercept requires specific formations and precise formation media, but even if intercepted, without knowing the matching magnetic patterns, it’s still impossible to restore ’Lei magnetic’ into text.\"","\"Thus, the Lei magnetic in this world, although vast as the sea and information-dense, remains elusive, even rarely pursued by Lei magnetic array masters for research.\"","\"What Lei magnetic array masters truly need to study extensively is actually the internal aspect of the Letter Token.\"","\"This is something you’ve researched as well...\"","Elder Zheng looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was startled, \"I’ve researched this too?\" He pondered for a moment and then exclaimed, \"Is it the secondary thunder pattern?\"","Elder Zheng nodded slightly, \"The Lei magnetic in the world is pervasive vertically and horizontally, cultivators cannot perceive and contemplate.\"","\"But the Lei magnetic flow between the formations inside the Letter Token is knowable and controllable.\""]},{"number":1809,"title":"Chapter 1809 - 902: Returning to the Source_2","paragraphs":["\"This is akin to a ’contract’ between fixed magnetic patterns and unfixed magnetic patterns, used to maintain the Secondary Thunder Flow.\"","\"And the traces left by the Secondary Thunder Flow are the Secondary Thunder Patterns.\"","\"To change magnetism with thunder means to use the Secondary Thunder Patterns to generate Secondary Thunder Flow, affecting the Yuan Magnetic Patterns, thereby altering the established magnetic laws and changing the rules of the entire Yuan Magnetic Formation...\"","Mo Hua had a sudden realization, pondered for a moment, and slowly said:","\"Normal Yuan Magnetic Formation Masters follow the existing Yuan Magnetic framework, constructing, using, and maintaining the Yuan Magnetic Formation.\"","\"But these are only things at the Yuan Magnetic level.\"","\"To change the rules, one must start from the ’Thunder’ level, using the Secondary Thunder Patterns to generate Secondary Thunder Flow, leveraging Thunder Magnetic Sensing to influence the underlying Magnetic Patterns.\"","Elder Zheng nodded with satisfaction, \"In general, that’s the case.\"","\"Then how do we learn and use the Secondary Thunder Patterns?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Elder Zheng shook his head.","Mo Hua was somewhat shocked, \"Can’t it be learned?\"","\"It’s not that it can’t be learned,\" Elder Zheng said, \"it’s that you can’t learn it now. The Secondary Thunder Patterns are manifestations of the ’Thunder’ Taoist Laws, more apparent than Thunder Magnetism but still very obscure. With your Divine Sense, you likely can’t perceive it yet...\"","\"What if...\" Mo Hua said softly, \"I can perceive it?\"","Elder Zheng was momentarily stunned, his heart skipped a beat.","Can perceive it?","Even perceive the Secondary Thunder Patterns?","He was shocked, then gave Mo Hua a deep look, pondered for a while, and slowly said:","\"Suppose, and I emphasize suppose, you really can perceive it...\"","\"Then you can seek out some real Thunder Magnetic Formations or Secondary Thunder Array Formations. Remember, they must contain ’Thunder’ and not just be simple ’Yuan Magnetic’ formations.\"","\"Study these Thunder Magnetic Formations extensively, practice and comprehend them. As your understanding of the Secondary Thunder Flow deepens over time, you can then attempt to utilize the Secondary Thunder Patterns to alter the Yuan Magnetic Patterns with the aid of the formations...\"","After Elder Zheng finished, Mo Hua looked at him expectantly.","Understanding Mo Hua’s intent, Elder Zheng sighed, \"I do indeed have Thunder Magnetic Formations in my possession, but...\"","Mo Hua felt a bit disappointed, \"Can’t they be passed on?\"","\"It’s not that they can’t be passed on,\" Elder Zheng shook his head, \"it’s just that these formations are all of Third Grade and above. Even if I gave them to you, you wouldn’t be able to learn them.\"","\"Is there no Second Grade?\"","\"No,\" Elder Zheng said, \"Yuan Magnetic Formations are fine, but Thunder Magnetic Formations are exceptionally complex and obscure. The structure of a Second Grade formation cannot contain such intricate Array Dao Laws, unless...\"","Elder Zheng hesitated to continue.","\"Unless... it’s an Ultimate Formation?\" Mo Hua said.","Elder Zheng was surprised, \"You even know about Ultimate Formations?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"I know a little.\"","Elder Zheng sighed.","This child’s knowledge of formations is truly extensive, even knowing about Ultimate Formations...","Elder Zheng contemplated: \"A Second Grade Thunder Magnetic Ultimate Formation might indeed contain principles of the Secondary Thunder, but a Second Grade Ultimate Formation requires at least Twenty Patterns, and it still requires a Golden Core.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"True...\"","His Divine Sense, although at the Peak of Nineteen-Pattern, is only half a step away from Twenty Patterns.","Yet, this half step seems so close yet so far, and it’s uncertain how long it will take to cross it.","Once again, he’s stuck.","Without a Golden Core, and with a Divine Sense below Twenty Patterns, he cannot learn the profound principles contained in the Thunder Magnetic Formations, nor can he use the Secondary Thunder Patterns to change the Yuan Magnetic Formation Patterns.","In other words, he cannot analyze the internal Thunder Magnetic structure of the Sect Token.","Mo Hua sighed lightly, feeling somewhat disappointed.","Seeing this, Elder Zheng comforted him, \"As I said before, this is just for you to become familiar with. Once you have a Golden Core, you can learn gradually. You’re young with great talent, there’s no need to rush.\"","\"Alright, Elder Zheng.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","After chatting for a while longer, Mo Hua asked some other questions. As it was getting late, Elder Zheng also had to return.","However, before leaving, Elder Zheng thought for a moment and, with a solemn expression, repeatedly reminded Mo Hua:","\"If one day you truly master the Thunder Magnetic Formations, there’s one thing you must remember...\"","\"Never publicly claim to be a ’Thunder Magnetic Formation Master,’ always say you’re a ’Yuan Magnetic Formation Master.’\"","\"That one word makes a world of difference.\"","\"If you encounter someone ignorant, who can’t distinguish these things, Thunder Magnetism and Yuan Magnetism won’t matter.\"","\"But if someone with intent hears it, it could reveal your true abilities and even bring great disaster.\"","\"A treasure can invite trouble, and that ’treasure’ might not just be an artifact, but also a spell point.\"","\"The overt and covert struggles between Formation Masters are many, on the surface they may appear harmonious, but beneath there’s jealousy and competition for names and profits.\"","\"You must be cautious, don’t flaunt your wealth, and don’t show your Dao lightly.\"","Elder Zheng spoke earnestly.","Mo Hua nodded seriously, \"Predecessor, I remember everything.\"","\"Hmm.\" Elder Zheng looked grateful.","...","After returning to the Taixu Gate, Mo Hua took out a Jade Slip, recording all the principles of the Yuan Magnetic and Thunder Magnetic Formations taught by Elder Zheng.","A good memory is no match for a written record.","It’s extremely rare for Elder Zheng to guide him in formations.","Moreover, Yuan Magnetic Formations are already obscure, missing this chance means there might not be another opportunity to seek advice in the future.","These words must be recorded and contemplated often.","After recording, Mo Hua frowned slightly.","Even after discussing with Elder Zheng, his understanding of Yuan Magnetic and Thunder Magnetic Formations is more profound, but the fundamental problem remains unsolved.","His Divine Sense is insufficient to learn Thunder Magnetic Formations.","Without learning Thunder Magnetic Formations, he cannot break the existing ’Yuan Magnetic norms,’ cannot change others’ rules, nor can he analyze the underlying formation principles of the Sect Token."]},{"number":1810,"title":"Chapter 1810 - 902: Returning to the Source_3","paragraphs":["In this way, the \"Demon Sect Token\" in hand feels somewhat insignificant.","Of course, it’s not really insignificant, it’s just that my ability is not enough.","\"Another dead end...\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then retrieved a Formation from his storage ring that he had treasured for a long time:","\"Second-born Thunder Stream Formation\".","This was originally a gift from Aunt Wan, a genuine Second Grade Twenty Patterns Thunder Magnetic Absolute Formation.","Aunt Wan probably didn’t know what this Formation really meant.","Even before my discussions with Elder Zheng, I hadn’t realized how confidential the \"Thunder Magnetism\" Formation was.","This Thunder Magnetic Absolute Formation is definitely a rare Formation Taoist Repository.","Mo Hua opened the formation diagram, studied it for a while, and then shook his head.","Couldn’t quite understand it...","With his current Nineteen Patterns Peak Divine Sense, he could somewhat mimic the Twenty Patterns Absolute Formation’s formation patterns.","But an absolute formation possesses deeper \"Dao Laws\".","Without understanding the laws, one can’t comprehend the formation; merely studying the \"Formation Patterns\" is just treating the symptoms, not the cause.","\"So, what would be the Dao Laws of the Thunder Magnetism Formation?\"","\"Is it... the Secondary Thunder Pattern?\"","According to Elder Zheng, the Secondary Thunder Pattern is a manifestation of the Thunder Magnetism Law, so to master the Thunder Magnetism Formation, the key should be the Secondary Thunder Pattern.","Start with the Secondary Thunder Pattern?","But usually, cultivators first learn the Thunder Magnetism Formation, then they can grasp the Secondary Thunder Formation Patterns.","Given my current Divine Sense capability, I can’t learn the Third Grade Thunder Magnetism Formation, nor can I comprehend the Second Grade Twenty Patterns Thunder Magnetic Absolute Formation; how then can I grasp the Secondary Thunder Pattern?","\"No, that’s not right...\"","Mo Hua suddenly remembered that he had previously spent time researching the Secondary Thunder Pattern.","During that period, in order to learn how to restore the Letter Token and decode the Yuan Magnetic Pattern, I simulated the evolution of the Secondary Thunder Pattern daily, recording each pattern in Jade Slips, amassing a large library of Secondary Thunder Patterns.","These Secondary Thunder Patterns were like \"keys,\" used to test when decryption was needed.","Similar to an \"enumeration\" style of deciphering Magnetic Patterns.","But these \"Secondary Thunder Patterns\" were at best tools.","I merely recorded them simply, which couldn’t be considered understanding, let alone \"mastery\".","Nor did I know how to use the Secondary Thunder Patterns to break others’ rules or \"alter\" Yuan Magnetic Patterns.","\"However, Elder Zheng already told me the principle... the regularity of formations doesn’t deceive.\"","Mo Hua pondered deeply.","According to the principle...","\"The Secondary Thunder Pattern itself is a connection between Magnetic Patterns.\"","\"So its very existence can be understood as a kind of construction, and naturally, it can also be understood as a kind of ’alteration’.\"","\"The Secondary Thunder Pattern is a formless, subtle Thunder Pattern that has diverse and infinite forms.\"","\"And each form of Secondary Thunder Pattern corresponds to a type of Magnetic Pattern change.\"","\"Suppose if the complex and numerous Secondary Thunder Patterns of the same category are grouped together, wouldn’t that integrate a whole class of Yuan Magnetic changes?\"","\"It would be like melding together many keys into a ’universal’ key...\"","\"A universal key can open many locks.\"","\"A ’universal’ Secondary Thunder Pattern can also trigger multiple changes in Magnetic Patterns.\"","\"And when numerous Secondary Thunder Patterns are summarized and gathered together, wouldn’t that be...\"","Mo Hua paused for a moment, then his heart trembled.","Returning to the Source?!","The Five Elements Sect’s... Back Origin Calculation?","Those who Return to the Source simplify complexity into simplicity, unify the many into one.","The ancestors of the Five Elements Sect summarized all the Five Elements Formations together to form a Five Elements \"Source Pattern\".","In other words, if I were to return to the source all the Secondary Thunder Patterns I’ve recorded over time, could I form a...","Secondary Thunder \"Source Pattern\"?","And this Secondary Thunder Source Pattern would then be equivalent to... a Formation Flow?!","The more Mo Hua thought about it, the more shocked he became.","This is the essence of the Five Elements Sect’s Back Origin Calculation?","Is this the method by which the Five Elements Sect created Formation Flows?","Secondary Thunder Formation Patterns, Back Origin Calculation, self-created Formation Flow...","Mo Hua’s heart fluttered.","Momentarily, he realized he had comprehended something remarkable. But upon further thought, he felt some apprehensions.","The \"Source Pattern\" resulting from the Five Elements Sect’s Back Origin seemed like a \"plague\" that could parasitize and multiply, and perhaps even the downfall of the Five Elements Sect was related to this \"Source Pattern\".","Then if I use the Five Elements Sect’s spell point to return the source of Secondary Thunder Patterns, what will I ultimately calculate?","Won’t it also be a source of chaos \"Source Pattern\"?","Mo Hua frowned.","But after pondering for a while, he realized he didn’t seem to fear this thing.","The Five Elements Source Pattern was beyond his reach because it was the collective return to the source by great powers of the Five Elements Sect over generations, being realms above him.","But if it’s something I calculate with my divine thought mastery, I should still be able to handle it.","The key is that an entire Formation Great Dao is in front of me, and to not try makes Mo Hua extremely uneasy.","Especially since it concerns the comprehension of the Thunder Magnetism Array Law.","\"Let’s give it a try first...\"","Mo Hua retrieved a large stack of Jade Slips from his storage bag.","These Jade Slips contained the numerous Secondary Thunder Patterns he simulated, calculated, perceived, recorded down over the years.","In total, there were no less than a thousand.","Mo Hua began attempting to use the \"Back Origin Calculation\" he learned from the Five Elements Sect to return the source of these complex and numerous Secondary Thunder Patterns.","Just like how the Five Elements Sect returned the source of the Five Elements Formations.","Fortunately, although the Secondary Thunder Patterns were extraordinary, their forms were relatively simple, making the return to the source not very difficult, just right for Mo Hua to practice.","Mo Hua started with the simplest, returning the source of two similar Secondary Thunder Patterns into one.","After returning the source two by two, he again \"returned to the source\" the Secondary Thunder Patterns","returning once, then another time, so on, piece by piece, item by item, from few to many, from shallow to deep, always returning to the source...","Initially, things went smoothly, but the further it went, the more challenging the return became, consuming more Divine Sense, requiring enormous Divine Sense calculation power.","Mo Hua had no choice but to employ all available methods, including Heavenly secret Calculation and Heavenly secret Tricky Calculation.","Benefiting from the solid formation foundation and profound formation understanding honed under Elder Master Xun, the robust divine sense at Foundation Establishment Peak, integrating tricky calculations with divine sense calculation power, absorbing Divine Marrow into Dao Hua’s telekinesis, and Elder Zheng’s guidance on Thunder Magnetic Array Theory...","Plus, the copious Secondary Thunder Pattern Library he accumulated early on, which consumed a lot of time and effort.","This entire \"Returning to the Source\" process went unusually smoothly, although it was a tiresome, complex ordeal.","This is the cumulative progression of the Dao of Formation.","Thus without day or night, continuously returning to the source, more than a month passed...","After all this time without rest, through hard effort and day-night calculations, Mo Hua finally returned the source to develop a Formation Flow \"prototype\".","This turned out to be the...","A very peculiar object.","In the jade slip, a small object composed purely of Secondary Thunder Patterns, resembling a matchstick figure, seemed to have come alive."]},{"number":1811,"title":"Chapter 1811 - 903: Thunder Magnetic Miniature","paragraphs":["What... on earth is this?","Mo Hua and the little Thunder Man stared at each other with wide eyes for quite a while.","Mo Hua tentatively said, \"Hey.\"","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature didn’t react, just tilted its head, looking at Mo Hua in confusion.","\"Is this little thing alive?\"","\"Is it living?\"","Mo Hua frowned, released his Divine Sense, and carefully sensed for a moment, only then did he come to realize.","No life...","This little thing just looks lively, but in reality, it is still unconscious, unable to act on its own, nor does it make any reactions.","\"So does it come under my control?\"","Mo Hua moved his thoughts and released his Divine Sense, beginning to control the Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","Soon, a faint connection seemed to extend from the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, merging into Mo Hua’s Divine Thought, as if there was a bond between them of blood and water.","This little figure was personally calculated by Mo Hua using the Back Origin Calculation.","In other words, Mo Hua is its creator.","Their origins are similar.","With a movement of Mo Hua’s Divine Sense, he naturally communicated with this Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature slowly stood up, driven by Mo Hua, moved its ’matchstick man’ like body a few steps to the left, then a few steps to the right, and after a little hop, it even posed with hands on hips, looking up at Mo Hua with quite a spirited demeanor.","\"It can be controlled by me...\"","Mo Hua marveled in amazement.","And then?","This Thunder Magnetic Miniature, created from Secondary Thunder Patterns Back Origin, what specific uses does it have?","Mo Hua, resting his chin, began to make preliminary speculations based on the nature of the Secondary Thunder Patterns and his own understanding of Thunder Magnetic Sensing:","It is formed by the extremely weak Back Origin of Secondary Thunder Patterns, without flesh and blood, formless and intangible, ordinary cultivators cannot see it, and with Thunder Magnetism being obscure, even a formation master with a strong Divine Thought cannot perceive this miniature within their Divine Sense.","Yet it itself is both a Thunder Flow and could be said to be an Original Magnetic Field, a type of Thunder Magnetic energy entity.","Logically, it should be able to infiltrate other Thunder Flows and Magnetic Fields.","In other words, it could infiltrate other Yuan Magnetic Formations, Thunder Magnetic Arrays, and all formation media constructed with the principles of Yuan Magnetic and Thunder Magnetic Arrays.","This Thunder Magnetic Miniature, being a ’collection’ of Secondary Thunder Patterns, adhering to the principle of \"using thunder to change magnetism\", can generate Thunder Flow to affect Magnetic Patterns.","This also means, if done correctly, this Thunder Magnetic Miniature could alter the fixed Magnetic Patterns of underlying Yuan Magnetic formations...","Altering fixed Magnetic Patterns!","Mo Hua’s eyes shone brightly.","No time to lose, he immediately took out a ’discarded’ Letter Token to begin a preliminary attempt.","First, he disassembled the discarded Letter Token, then extracted a magnetic wire, connecting one end to the Letter Token internally, and the other to the Jade Slip where the Thunder Magnetic Miniature is.","This magnetic wire, made of magnetic material, is a common formation media in Yuan Magnetic formations, not cheap, and hard to buy.","The channels to purchase magnetic wire are quite limited.","Of course, Mo Hua came from a poor background, accustomed to ’thriftiness and household management’.","This magnetic wire was not bought by him at all; he took it apart from other Letter Tokens, counts as ’waste utilization’.","With the magnetic wire connected, Mo Hua used his Divine Thought to control the Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","Within the Jade Slip, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, existing in the form of a Thunder Flow resulting from the secondary Thunder Pattern Back Origin, began to move under Mo Hua’s Divine Thought guidance, walking out from the Jade Slip, along the magnetic wire, and into the Letter Token.","Upon entering the Letter Token, surrounded by dense magnetic patterns, the little Thunder Man seemed like a fish entering the sea, at its own home, with its aura becoming much more active.","Mo Hua began to manipulate the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to ’infiltrate’ the Letter Token.","In the Divine Sense perspective, microscopically.","The pale blue, spark-flashing, matchstick man-like Thunder Magnetic Miniature directly merged into the Unfixed Magnetic Patterns.","Then just like spring breeze turning into rain, nourishing things quietly, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature penetrated into the Magnetic Patterns with almost no effort.","Then through the Unfixed Magnetic Patterns, traversing the interspace of Magnetic Patterns, without any knowledge or trace, it infiltrated the at the very bottom, the Fixed Magnetic Patterns.","The whole process was natural, like an antelope hanging its horns, leaving no trace, no evidence behind.","If Mo Hua wasn’t controlling it himself, he almost wouldn’t be aware, hidden amongst the densely packed Magnetic Patterns, lies such a Thunder Magnetic Miniature, almost invisible and imperceptible to a cultivator’s Divine Thought.","Mo Hua was initially shocked, then overjoyed.","He then began the formal attempt to use the ’Thunder Magnetic Miniature’ to incite Secondary Thunder Flow and secretly modify the Fixed Magnetic Patterns.","However, this process was not so smooth.","In Mo Hua’s Divine Thought perspective, he could see the Thunder Magnetic Miniature crawling between the Magnetic Patterns, using its little arms and legs dabbing with Magnetic Ink, smearing and modifying things.","But the miniature’s movements were not very coordinated.","Whatever it smeared didn’t quite go as controlled sometimes.","Mo Hua speculated this was because this ’Thunder Magnetic Miniature’ was still just a ’prototype’ of Back Origin, and not enough ’Secondary Thunder Patterns’ were integrated inside.","It is the source flow of Secondary Thunder Patterns, needing to manifest specific Secondary Thunder Patterns to induce corresponding Magnetic Pattern changes.","Each Secondary Thunder Pattern has a unique form, equivalent to a specific change in original magnetism.","Lacking enough Secondary Thunder Patterns, the ’Thunder Magnetic Miniature’ can only cause limited original magnetic changes, naturally unable to modify the Magnetic Patterns at will.","\"In the future, I need to back-origin more, integrating as many Secondary Thunder Patterns as possible...\" Mo Hua silently thought.","However, the current Letter Token does not involve profound Yuan Magnetic formations.","With the number of Secondary Thunder Patterns back-origin in the Thunder Magnetic Miniature right now, it is barely sufficient."]},{"number":1812,"title":"Chapter 1812 - 903: Thunder Magnetic Miniature (Part 2)","paragraphs":["It just takes some time, a lot of practice, a lot of attempts.","Just like that, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature busily working between the Magnetic Patterns, \"smearing and erasing,\" gradually turned from clumsy to more skillful and lively.","Soon, the Fixed Magnetic Pattern was altered according to Mo Hua’s intent.","Mo Hua then manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to exit the Letter Token along the magnetic wire and returned to his own Returning to the Source Jade Slip.","Afterward, Mo Hua picked up the Letter Token he had \"altered\" through the Thunder Magnetic Miniature and tried inputting a few words.","The Letter Token displayed: \"I am your father.\"","Mo Hua tried several other lines of text, but they all ultimately displayed: \"I am your father.\"","Mo Hua nodded, very satisfied.","This was the result after he altered the underlying Magnetic Patterns; no matter what message was input in the Letter Token, it always displayed four words:","I am your father.","This is definitely very amusing for pranks.","And the most amazing part is that even though this Letter Token had its underlying Magnetic Patterns altered, its exterior remained intact.","If Mo Hua didn’t say anything, almost no one would know that the bottom layer of this Letter Token was altered.","This is quite terrifying.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but smile with squinted eyes.","The experiment with the Letter Token made Mo Hua very satisfied.","The utility of this \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\" is not only hidden but also very powerful.","Then Mo Hua took out another token.","This token, stained with blood and engraved with Monster Patterns, exuded a sense of Evil Qi, was exactly the Demon Sect Token.","The Letter Token was just an experiment, a practice, to avoid any accidents that might waste the token.","The Demon Sect Token was what Mo Hua really wanted to study.","Now that there were no issues with the Letter Token experiment, Mo Hua began working on the Demon Sect Token officially.","Following the same procedure, Mo Hua extracted a magnetic wire, connecting one end to the Returning to the Source Jade Slip and the other to the Demon Sect Token.","Then, Mo Hua used Divine Thought to communicate with the \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature,\" controlling it to run along the magnetic wire into the Demon Sect Token.","Upon entering the Demon Sect Token, Magnetic Patterns densely covered the area.","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature was like soaking in a sea of Magnetic Ink.","This Demon Sect Token, although not as complex as the Taixu Token, had a much more complicated internal structure compared to the average Letter Token, with far more dense Fixed Magnetic Patterns inside.","With Mo Hua’s current Original Magnet accomplishments, it was almost impossible to disassemble the Demon Sect Token and directly crack the Fixed Magnetic Patterns inside the token.","But with the Back Origin Calculation, painstaking efforts, and the creation of a \"prototype\" Secondary Thunder Source Pattern, everything was different.","This \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\" was like Mo Hua’s \"cheat device.\"","It infiltrated the vast sea of Magnetic Patterns without anyone noticing.","It slipped like a fish swimming through water, quickly penetrating the underlying Magnetic Patterns.","Mo Hua also viewed the most underlying Formation Pattern paths of this token without damaging the Demon Sect Token.","On the base Fixed Magnetic Patterns, the Formation Pattern Sequence of this Demon Sect Token and some important identity information were engraved.","However, the core Magnetic Patterns were dim, and Mo Hua couldn’t see clearly.","What does this mean?","No permission?","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and discovered that this Demon Sect Token required \"identity\" authentication permission.","That means Demon Cultivation Disciples and their Demon Sect Tokens are bound together.","Others would not be able to use this Demon Sect Token even if they got it if their identity did not match.","Mo Hua examined the Demon Sect Token further and found that the token exterior was stained with blood, assuming that this blood should be the \"identity\" symbol.","This Demon Sect Token was likely activated with the blood of a Demon Cultivation Disciple.","Without the blood of a Demon Cultivation Disciple, the token could not be used.","But the owner of this token, that is, the Demon Cultivation Disciple, should now be imprisoned in the Taoist Court, with his life or death unknown.","He could hardly go to the Taoist Prison to draw blood from a demon cultivator himself.","What’s more, using blood to activate the token was just his conjecture, and whether there were other conditions was still unknown.","\"If not using blood, are there other means...\"","Mo Hua thought deeply for a moment, then began to decode other underlying Fixed Magnetic Patterns of this token, looking for clues.","After an unknown period, he finally found a usable Magnetic Pattern, decoding it as:","\"Token Permission: Closed.\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment and began to control the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, altering this Magnetic Pattern by changing the word \"Closed\" to \"Open.\"","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature smeared for a while, and the base Magnetic Pattern changed accordingly.","Token Permission: Open.","Then the Demon Sect Token trembled slightly, a flash of light before Mo Hua’s eyes, and as he focused again, all the Formation Patterns lit up, a row of magnetic ink appeared, turning into text, and the entire token was activated.","Mo Hua marveled.","This little Thunder creature is just too handy.","Since the permissions are open and the identity authentication is passed, Mo Hua unreservedly began to \"review\" the messages inside this token.","Firstly, the identity of this token’s owner:","\"Demon Sect Disciple: Chi Fei;","Realm: Foundation Establishment Late Stage Demon Cultivator;","Identity: Ordinary Disciple;","Cultivation Technique: Blood Lotus Skill (Second Level);","Generation: Sixth Generation Fourth Transmission Disciple;","Demon Merit: One Hundred Twenty-Three Points...\"","\"Demon Merit?\" Mo Hua pondered, \"Is this the Demon Sect’s merit points? Just like the Taixu Gate’s merit points?\"","But only one hundred twenty-three points? That’s way too little, what could this even exchange for?","It’s not even a fraction of a fraction of a fraction of my merit points.","Even if the Righteous Dao and the Demon Path had different merit point exchange rates, over a hundred points were still too meager."]},{"number":1813,"title":"Chapter 1813 - 903: Thunder Magnetic Miniature_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua was a bit unimpressed.","However...","When Mo Hua thought about it, he was suddenly startled.","The Demon Sect has merit, doesn’t that confirm...","They truly have a sect treasury? Sect secret vault? Similar \"Merit Scrolls\" that can be exchanged for various cultivation resources and inheritances?","This means... someone has raised a large flock, waiting for me to shear?","The only problem is not knowing whether the inheritances of this Demon Sect are clean, and whether I, as a disciple of the Righteous Dao, can use them...","\"Hopefully this Demon Sect isn’t unreasonable and has some proper things, rather than being all about demon and ghost-related Demon Path inheritances, leaving me with nothing to shear...\"","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","Then he continued to read.","...","Background: Total of twenty-five cultivators slain;","Hosted two blood banquets;","Been besieged by the Taoist Court once;","Passed on demon skills to six individuals, four in Qi Refinement, two in Foundation Establishment;","Donated Qi-refining Realm blood meals totaling six hundred and ten pounds; Donated Foundation Establishment Realm blood meals totaling sixty-seven pounds...","Due to loyalty to the sect, being cruel by nature, indiscriminately killing the innocent, having a heart of darkness, worthy of commendation, they were promoted to official disciple and granted a Sect Token...","A date was signed at the end, approximately a month ago.","Mo Hua shook his head.","Indeed, new disciples are unreliable, losing their Sect Token in just one month.","After that, there was some miscellaneous content, nothing too useful.","After reading, Mo Hua had a basic understanding of the Demon Sect.","But that was all, the core aspects were still missing.","Mo Hua always felt there should be more; logically, this Sect Token should have greater uses.","\"The foundational structure of the Letter Token is the Yuan Magnetic Formation, simple ones can adapt with just two Yuan Magnetic Formations.\"","\"But the Sect Token is different, it’s more complex.\"","\"Its base, even if not a Large Formation, must certainly be a comprehensive, sizable and more advanced Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation.\"","\"All Sect Tokens are linked to this set of Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation.\"","\"Each Sect Token signifies an entry point.\"","\"If I can find the breach, I can connect the token to a deeper layer, to the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation that sustains the operation of the entire Demon Sect.\"","\"Everything I want should be within that Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation.\"","\"But where’s the interface?\"","Mo Hua again thoroughly searched the magnetic patterns inside the Demon Sect Token but couldn’t find the so-called \"interface.\"","\"Nothing?\" Mo Hua frowned.","Shouldn’t be...","Without a base set of Formation eye and Formation Pivot Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation, this Sect Token’s formation can’t operate.","\"Then maybe it’s not absent, just lacks permission...\"","The interface between Single Formation and Compound Formation must exist.","But an ordinary Demon Sect disciple lacks the permission; this interface is likely hidden.","How to reveal the Compound Formation’s interface?","Unlock permission?","But how to unlock this permission?","Mo Hua frowned and pondered for a moment, suddenly recalling the scene when Elder Master Xun unlocked the Taixu Token permission for him.","At that time, Elder Master Xun manually adjusted his Formation Master’s grade to \"Second-grade Junior\" so he could accept second-grade array’s rewards.","Even though he hadn’t undergone assessment nor held the title of a second-grade junior Formation Master.","But within the Yuan Magnetic Formation, the Fixed Magnetic Pattern has the power to \"define.\"","Whatever the pattern writes, that’s what it is.","Even if it writes that he is a Fifth Grade Array Master, within the range limited by the Yuan Magnetic Formation, he indeed possesses Fifth Grade Array Master’s permissions.","\"Then if I designate this ordinary disciple ’Chi Fei’ to be a Demon Sect ’Elder,’ wouldn’t he truly become an Elder and immediately soar?\"","\"An Elder’s permissions should be much greater...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, immediately deciding to try.","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature began to derive Secondary Thunder Pattern, attempting to alter Chi Fei’s identity from \"ordinary disciple\" directly to \"Elder.\"","But it failed.","No matter how the Thunder Magnetic Miniature’s little arms rubbed, the identity column couldn’t be changed to \"Elder.\"","Mo Hua frowned.","\"Is it simply unchangeable... or is the token’s grade too low?\"","A common disciple’s token can’t be changed to \"Elder\" identity?","Mo Hua had to give up and settle for another identity.","There are many types of disciple identities.","This \"Chi Fei\" being a \"ordinary disciple,\" indicates there must be disciples who are not ordinary.","The permissions of these disciples are undoubtedly higher than Chi Fei’s.","Mo Hua started testing one by one:","\"True Disciple...\"","No, it can be modified but the magnetic pattern doesn’t activate.","The Demon Sect doesn’t have a notion of a True Disciple?","Or is it that only this Demon Sect lacks it?","But then, it’s natural; this big demon absorbs medium demon, medium demon absorbs small demon, small demon absorbs shrimps, tier upon tier of blood sucking, akin to a \"pyramid scheme\" structure of demon cultivation, there’s no need for \"True Transmission.\"","Disciples are the bait, moving \"granaries\" and \"blood bags.\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","\"True Transmission doesn’t work, then advanced disciple?\"","\"Still doesn’t work... then elite disciple?\"","\"Still doesn’t work?\"","Mo Hua tried all \"entry disciple,\" \"Tao student disciple,\" \"direct disciple,\" \"personal disciple,\"... all didn’t work.","In the end, Mo Hua was left with no choice; given the nature of the Demon Sect, he made up a term \"Skill Transmission Disciple,\" and the magnetic pattern shimmered, finally activating.","This progressed \"disciple\" title finally allowed him to succeed.","\"Skill Transmission Disciple...\" Mo Hua couldn’t help but grumble, \"Even in death, they don’t forget to pass down those deceitful demon skills...\"","And just as Mo Hua changed Chi Fei’s identity from \"ordinary disciple\" to \"Skill Transmission Disciple,\" the Demon Sect Token transformed.","The Yuan Magnetic Formation Patterns began to vibrate, deep magnetic fog started to dissipate.","Dark patterns began to light up, then converged into an interface.","Within the interface, a vast interconnected and orderly Yuan Magnetic Formation Pivot carried a massive flow of information, like rivers surging continuously.","In an instant, Mo Hua saw countless information about demon cultivators.","Some were cursing, some were raving, some were issuing orders, some were attacking, some were planning, some were exchanging demon skills, some were trading \"blood slaves\"...","Such varied forms, myriad demon cultivators, each distinct.","Mo Hua was shaken within, feeling as if he was witnessing firsthand a hidden, incessantly active Demon Sect...","In a daze, he seemed to understand the marvel of the Thunder Magnetism Formation.","With such a small thing, one can sense the world’s thunder magnetism, glimpse myriad worldly phenomena, strategize and plan, all within one’s grasp."]},{"number":1814,"title":"Chapter 1814 - 904: There’s a Traitor Inside","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s expression was excited, and a dazzling brilliance was revealed in his eyes.","This is the true Thunder Magnetic World!","It is an ocean of original magnet constructed according to the laws of thunder magnetism.","In this Yuan Magnetic Sea, cultivators of various shapes and colors, bizarre consciousnesses, and a plethora of mixed information are presented in the form of original magnetism. Through the conduction of thunder flow, they intertwine, connect, and gather together, creating something magical and mysterious.","Although Mo Hua \"could not see,\" with the help of the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, he personally perceived this magnificent spectacle of thunder magnetism that ordinary cultivators would never have the chance to witness, existing within the microscopic world.","Mo Hua was shocked for quite a while.","Only after a moment did he come back to his senses.","\"Time to get down to business...\"","Mo Hua contemplated for a moment and began manipulating the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to swim in the thunder magnetic flow of the compound Yuan Magnetic Formation at the bottom of the Demon Sect Token, intercepting information streams from the Yuan Magnetic Sea and stealing confidential information.","The authority of a \"Skill Transmission Disciple\" is indeed significant.","And Mo Hua, being such a \"Skill Transmission Disciple,\" was different from others.","He modified the magnetic patterns to \"appoint\" himself authority, and with the form of thunder magnetism, directly infiltrated the underlying Yuan Magnetic Sea, essentially bypassing to the backend and directly starting to cheat.","Whatever an ordinary Demon Sect Skill Transmission Disciple could do, he could also do.","Things that ordinary Demon Sect Disciples could not do, as long as the authority allowed, he could also accomplish.","Theoretically, all the massive and complex information accessible to the Skill Transmission Disciples of the Demon Sect, Mo Hua was qualified to directly \"consult.\"","In front of Mo Hua lay a gigantic \"Yuan Magnetic Library,\" recording a massive amount of chat records of demon cultivators.","In the following days, whenever Mo Hua had free time, he infiltrated the Demon Sect Token through the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, intervening in the underlying \"Yuan Magnetic Sea\" of the Demon Sect, taking advantage of open authority to consult the Demon Sect’s Yuan Magnetic Library and uncover the sect’s secrets.","But strangely, after \"uncovering\" for several days, he still couldn’t find the name of this sect.","It seemed everyone in the Demon Sect kept this a highly guarded secret.","This was exceedingly peculiar.","Besides this, most of the information in this Demon Sect was related to \"blood.\"","In the chats between sect disciples, two out of every three sentences included the word \"blood.\" Even the entire operation of the Demon Sect was closely connected to blood, from top to bottom.","First were the blood slaves.","The Demon Sect bred \"blood slaves,\" with a whole rigorous process of \"selection,\" \"taming,\" \"feeding,\" and strict quality control.","Blood slaves were categorized into three grades: upper, middle, and lower, based on the quality of their Spiritual Root and Blood Qi.","These three categories were just rough classifications. Additionally, there were many peculiar preferences concerning \"blood.\"","For example, men’s blood had heavy Yang Qi; women’s blood had heavy Yin Qi.","The blood of young males and virgins was even purer.","In couples living harmoniously, due to the yin and yang balance, the blood taste tended to be more neutral.","For cultivators with promiscuous sex lives, their yin and yang were chaotic, making their blood turbid, and even if turned into \"blood slaves,\" their quality would be very low, drawing unanimous disdain from these Demon Sect disciples...","Within this Demon Sect, what all demon cultivators dreamed of was apparently a type of blood with \"bloodline power.\"","Some cultivators were of prestigious origin, had great fortune, and had prominent ancestors, with blood of ancient great powers or the blood of ancient divine beasts flowing within them.","Such blood was top-grade and very mystical when used in cultivation.","These cultivators were treasures. Turning them into \"blood slaves\" was of exceptional value.","And if one could develop a cultivator with top-grade bloodline into a top-grade \"blood slave,\" it would be enough to drive all demon cultivators practicing the Blood Path into a frenzy of excitement.","Naturally, such blood slaves would also spark a scramble among all blood cultivators.","Basically, except for the Ancestor of this path, Great Demon Head, or demon cultivation leaders, ordinary demon cultivation disciples could not afford, nor did they have the qualification to raise such \"blood slaves\" with bloodline power...","...","\"Bloodline power...\"","Mo Hua frowned and pondered.","Until now, it seemed like he hadn’t really seen any cultivators with \"bloodline power\"...","Of course, it might be that he had seen but not recognized them.","After all, he previously knew very little about \"bloodlines.\"","If not for infiltrating this Blood-Sucking Demon Sect’s Yuan Magnetic Formation now and uncovering their chats, he would not have known there were so many hidden secrets about cultivators’ \"bloodlines.\"","And \"bloodline power\" being so rare would easily attract the coveting of evil demons, leading to disaster.","Therefore, cultivators with bloodline power naturally had to keep this secret and not let others know...","At this thought, Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","He suddenly remembered, long, long ago, while at the Five Elements Sect, his little senior sister had secretly shared a \"secret\" with him:","The little senior sister said her bloodline was very special, which was why she \"attracted bees and butterflies.\" Although she was female, she easily attracted the admiration of other females.","This secret was personally told by the little senior sister to him, and she only confided in him.","At the time, Mo Hua didn’t think much of it, but now, pondering carefully, he finally understood that the matter of \"bloodlines\" was truly a colossal secret.","If she did not truly trust him, the little senior sister would definitely not have disclosed it.","Mo Hua’s heart felt both sour and somewhat sweet at the moment.","Then, he became a bit worried.","The little senior sister’s bloodline was special, and once discovered, wouldn’t it easily attract the coveting of others?","Especially with sects like this one, relying on blood-sucking for cultivation, and those legendary Devil Ancestors.","However... Mo Hua thought, the little senior sister was different from him. She belonged to the Bai Family, was part of a real great family’s direct lineage and had a mother of the Feather Transformation Realm. No one would dare to target her."]},{"number":1815,"title":"Chapter 1815 - 904: An Inside Man_2","paragraphs":["More so, \"easy to attract a woman’s affection\"...","This ability always felt a bit strange, and it sounded a bit like a useless gimmick. It seemed it wasn’t a particularly remarkable bloodline.","Mo Hua felt a little relieved.","He then continued to study the Demon Sect Token, flipping through the Yuan Magnetic Patterns.","Besides \"blood,\" what these Demon Sect disciples loved to discuss most was the demon skills.","In particular, the cultivation technique they practiced, called \"Blood Lotus Skill.\"","The principle of this technique was quite simple—nothing more than blood sucking.","The difference lay in whose blood was being sucked, how it was being sucked, how to refine it afterwards, and how to suppress one’s bloodthirsty desires to appear like a normal person after refining it...","Mo Hua watched the demon cultivators exchanging messages and discussing the Blood Lotus Skill. After reading through quite a bit, he felt he couldn’t keep reading.","If he continued, he might learn the skill himself.","\"Is there anything else, something more confidential...?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat unsatisfied.","The secrets of this Demon Sect should be more than just this.","He began probing deeper into the Yuan Magnetic Sea but soon encountered a series of \"Magnetic Pattern Locks.\"","These Magnetic Pattern Locks were chains formed by magnetic patterns, used to \"lock\" the patterns, with levels and restricted permissions.","This meant that his custom permissions as a \"Skill Transmission Disciple\" ended here, and he could no longer touch the deeper secrets of the Yuan Magnetism.","Mo Hua was unwilling and tried several more times.","But this time, these \"Magnetic Pattern Locks\" were sealed by \"insulated\" formation patterns, like a solid dam, unable to be infiltrated by the \"Secondary Thunder Flow,\" and naturally, they couldn’t be modified by the Thunder Magnetic Miniatures.","To break through the \"Magnetic Pattern Lock,\" he would either need to steal higher-level \"Elder\" permissions,","or wait until his understanding of thunder magnetism deepened, gaining the ability to break through the \"Magnetic Pattern Lock\" before trying again.","Mo Hua thought about it and decided to temporarily give up.","He would find a way to deal with these magnetic pattern locks later.","Unable to steal secrets above the Elders for now, Mo Hua could only settle for second best, using the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to \"monitor\" the yuan magnetic libraries of these \"Skill Transmission Disciples\" and lower-level Demon Sect members to understand their movements.","It was both a way to gather information and a chance to practice his Thunder Magnetic Array skills and improve his control over the Thunder Magnetic Miniatures.","It was a strategy of gaining multiple benefits from one action.","Thus, over the next few days, Mo Hua monitored whenever he had time, observing a jumble of inheritance points about blood slaves, blood skills, blood sacrifices, blood products, bloodlines, and so on.","A lot of useless knowledge was accumulated.","However, there wasn’t much truly noteworthy.","Until one day, Mo Hua saw a somewhat strange sentence:","\"Hungry for quite a few days, finally can have a full meal?\"","A full meal?","Mo Hua frowned.","Through these days of \"eavesdropping,\" he had gained a certain understanding of the habits of the Demon Sect and the chatting habits among the demon cultivators.","In just an instant, two words surfaced in his mind:","Blood Banquet.","Only by holding a large-scale demon cultivator \"Blood Banquet,\" slaughtering a large number of cultivators, sacrificing countless blood slaves, and extracting rivers of fresh blood for these demon cultivators to feast upon, could they truly fill up.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","Hosting such a cruel Blood Banquet meant causing massive killings.","Even a small-scale Blood Banquet would result in many cultivators dying...","In the eyes of demon cultivators, these people might just be \"blood slaves,\" living \"spirit stones.\"","To the Taoist Court, perhaps they were just cold statistics of deaths at the hands of demon cultivators, but in reality, they were living, breathing individuals.","Mo Hua sighed.","If he hadn’t known, that would be one thing, but now that he knew, he couldn’t sit idly by.","\"Save them if I can...\"","But the problem was, all he had heard was this sparse sentence, \"finally can eat and be full.\"","When, where, who to eat, and which demon cultivators would participate, he knew nothing about any of this information.","Mo Hua pinpointed that particular demon cultivator and looked back over his chat logs, but found no other clues.","Mo Hua also checked other demon cultivators’ chats, but with the dense yuan magnetism and complex information, he couldn’t find anything in a short time, nor were there any clues about a \"Blood Banquet.\"","\"So tight-lipped?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","He was at a loss for a good plan.","Mo Hua considered his options, then took out a Letter Token and sent a message to Gu Changhuai: \"Uncle Gu, are you there?\"","He waited for a long time, but Gu Changhuai didn’t reply.","Mo Hua turned around and sent a message to Xia Canonical Official:","\"Sister Xia, is Uncle Gu there?\"","But still, no reply came.","Mo Hua mused: Uncle Gu not replying could mean he was being stubborn and didn’t want to respond to him.","But Sister Xia not replying would definitely mean something was up.","\"The Taoist Court is on a mission and has no time?\"","This was probably the only explanation.","Mo Hua then left a message: \"Uncle Gu, the Demon Sect might hold a Blood Banquet soon. If the Taoist Court has any leads, they can keep an eye on it...\"","After leaving the message, Mo Hua put away the Letter Token and sighed.","That was about all he could do.","Steal some secrets and report to the Taoist Court.","Afterwards, Mo Hua went about his usual cultivation and attended classes, but even by evening, he remained a bit uneasy, unable to let go of the \"Blood Banquet\" matter.","He always felt like he might be overlooking something.","\"The Demon Sect is going to hold a Blood Banquet...\"","\"Uncle Gu and Sister Xia from the Taoist Court are secretly on a mission...\"","\"Could the Taoist Court’s mission be related to this ’Blood Banquet’?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, thinking it wasn’t without merit.","The Taoist Court had been dealing with these demon cultivators for so long, they must have channels for information."]},{"number":1816,"title":"Chapter 1816 - 904: There Is a Mole (Part 3)","paragraphs":["It’s no wonder they could get the clues to the \"Blood Banquet\".","Mo Hua let out a slight sigh of relief.","\"It’s good that the Taoist Court knows...\"","The Taoist Court might be unreliable, but Uncle Gu and Sister Xia are quite dependable.","Yet after a while, the unease in his heart grew stronger and stronger.","He had cultivated Cause and Effect, and this unease was by no means baseless.","\"What does it mean...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"Are Uncle Gu’s actions not going smoothly? Will they encounter danger? Or... will they ultimately be unable to stop this Blood Banquet, and many people will die?\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows deeply, pondered for a moment, and suddenly his expression changed, as a terrible suspicion welled up in his heart.","He hesitated for a moment, took out the Returning to the Source Jade Slip, and that Demon Sect Token, then manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to infiltrate into the Original Magnet layer of the Demon Sect Token once again.","He found the Demon Cultivation disciple who said \"can have a full meal\", and began to thoroughly re-examine all his recent messages...","The Blood Banquet is not a small matter, requiring a lot of Demon Cultivators and the killing of many cultivators.","Especially with the \"watchful eye\" of the Taoist Court, organizing a Blood Banquet is no simple task.","The Demon Sect is bound to go to great lengths to prepare.","Preparations must involve communication among them.","They could not possibly seal off all information without leaving a whisper.","This group of Demon Cultivators did not know that the internal chat messages of the Demon Sect Token were being \"monitored\" by me, so they couldn’t silence themselves on the matter of the Blood Banquet.","If they did talk about it and I didn’t find out.","That means I must have missed something.","Missed something...","Mo Hua checked through the records of this Demon Cultivation disciple one by one and finally found another strange sentence:","\"In a few days, we can kill the dog...\"","This sentence was unclear in meaning and was mixed in the vast flow of the Original Magnet. It hadn’t caught Mo Hua’s attention before.","But now, it seemed very odd.","Kill the dog...","What dog do Demon Cultivators kill?","Why would killing a dog be mentioned in the Sect Token?","What on earth does this \"dog\" refer to?","After a moment, Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","\"The Taoist Court’s dog...\"","This sentence, he had heard many times; it’s also the expression most commonly used by Demon Cultivators, Evil Cultivators, and many Sin Cultivators who have broken Taoist Law.","\"Dog\" refers to a dog, meaning those cultivators who work for the Taoist Court.","Mo Hua started the search for the term \"kill the dog\" to look through other Demon Cultivators’ conversations.","The number of Secondary Thunder Patterns from the Returning of the Thunder Magnetic Miniature was still insufficient.","After all, Mo Hua was only at Foundation Establishment, and his Divine Sense Calculation Power was somewhat strained in front of this colossal Compound Formation of Original Magnet.","Therefore, the search process was rather slow.","After an unknown amount of time, Mo Hua finally managed to retrieve most of the chat records of Demon Cultivators containing \"kill the dog\".","These records appeared one after another in front of Mo Hua.","The more Mo Hua read, the colder his heart became.","His speculation was finally confirmed:","The Demon Sect’s real target was the Taoist Court; they intended to hold a \"Blood Banquet\" with the Taoist Court’s cultivators!","However...","Would the Taoist Court really fall for it?","Mo Hua flipped through the records again and found a message from ten days earlier:","\"The Elder discovered a ’cat’...\"","\"Damn it, sneaky thing, betraying us from the inside...\"","\"What do we do? Kill it? Skin it, drain its blood, hang it at the door as a warning?\"","\"Kill it...\"","\"Don’t rush, this matter needs the Elder’s decision...\"","...","A day later, there was another message:","\"...the Elder said, killing it would be a waste; use the cat to lure the dog, eat the dog first, then the cat...\"","...","Mo Hua’s heart chilled.","The outline of the matter became clearer.","\"Cat,\" should refer to the \"informant\" of the Taoist Court.","\"Dog,\" refers to the \"dog\" of the Taoist Court.","The Taoist Court must have used some method to plant an \"informant\" within the Demon Sect.","But this informant, for some reason, was discovered by the Demon Sect.","The Demon Sect then took advantage of the situation, using the \"informant\" to set a trap to lure the Taoist Court cultivators.","Mo Hua immediately took out the Letter Token and messaged Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, the informant within the Demon Sect has been exposed.\"","\"Uncle Gu, beware of the Demon Sect’s ambush.\"","\"Uncle Gu...\"","But Gu Changhuai still didn’t reply with any message.","Mo Hua had no choice but to send it to Xia Canonical Official, but similarly, it sank into the sea with no response.","\"Can’t get in touch...\"","Mo Hua frowned deeply.","He could almost be certain that Uncle Gu and the others must have received the \"informant’s\" intelligence, and then went on a mission.","But this \"information\" was false in itself.","\"I hope Uncle Gu and the others can sense it in time...\"","But the more Mo Hua thought about it, the less hopeful he felt.","The \"informant\" lurking in the Demon Sect didn’t know they had been exposed.","The information they obtained was undoubtedly believed to be true.","It’s even highly possible that this message was \"true,\" deliberately released by the Demon Sect as true information, used as \"live bait\" for fishing.","In such circumstances, the Taoist Court certainly wouldn’t suspect.","This \"bait,\" for sure, they would take.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have this intense \"unease.\"","And as the warning sign in his heart grew stronger, Mo Hua could even conclude that the Taoist Court’s cultivators were already stepping into the Demon Sect’s trap.","\"What should I do?\"","Mo Hua wore a grave expression.","Find the Gu Family? It seems useless.","This is a confidential mission of the Taoist Court, and the Gu Family may not know the details.","The Gu Family cultivators who know the details would certainly be executing the mission with Uncle Gu, also treading the \"path to death.\"","Find the Taoist Court? Find Master Xia?","Elder Zheng’s words were still echoing in his ears, and matters of the Thunder Magnetism Formation mustn’t be told to anyone."]},{"number":1817,"title":"Chapter 1817 - 904: There’s a Mole_4","paragraphs":["If I were to seek out the Taoist Court or Master Xia, they would surely ask about the source of my information.","With Uncle Gu, I could muddle through somehow—not because Uncle Gu is easily fooled, but due to our friendship, Uncle Gu trusts me, so he wouldn’t question much.","But Master Xia is different.","If he were to notice anything amiss, it would be a huge problem.","Moreover, there’s simply no time now.","Mo Hua felt increasingly anxious.","Soon, in the Yuan Magnetic Sea of the Demon Sect Token, there was a sudden moment of silence. After a brief moment, it quickly boiled over again.","It seemed that the time for action had arrived, and there was no need to hide anymore.","Orders full of killing intent were sent out one after another. Magnetic Patterns appeared in waves, and densely packed messages were transmitted in an orderly manner.","...","\"Everything is ready...\"","\"The dogs have arrived, they’ve entered the ambush...\"","\"I’ve got people watching ’the Cat.’ If he moves, we’ll kill him immediately.\"","\"How many people?\"","\"The one named Gu, that woman, and a Golden Core from outside Qianxue State.\"","\"The other Foundation Establishment Realm cultivators of the Taoist Court, estimated at a hundred.\"","\"Not enough to eat...\"","\"Almost enough, don’t be greedy.\"","\"Do they have an ambush?\"","\"No...\"","\"The information fed back by their own painstakingly cultivated ’spy,’ surely they would believe it.\"","\"Seal off the retreat...\"","\"Don’t worry, the Leader has spoken, it’s already sealed...\"","\"The lookout is still watching, they’re fast, they’ve entered the city, already reached the East Gate...\"","\"Pull the lookout back, that one named Gu is very vigilant, he might notice.\"","\"Pass it down, that one named Gu must not escape, the Leader specifically wants him dead.\"","\"Order the below to start the massacre and begin the Blood Banquet...\"","\"Once the Blood Banquet begins and the stench of blood spreads, the Taoist Court will catch wind of it and quickly come over. By then, the trap can be closed...\"","\"Understood.\"","...","This was a highly significant operation by the Demon Cultivators.","The planning was very secretive, and the plan very meticulous, involving a large number of demon cultivators, with great strength.","Even within the Demon Sect, it was taboo, not daring to be openly discussed.","Yet, until now, this plan revealed its \"true face.\"","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","It’s over, really out of time...","The event happened suddenly, almost without warning, by the time the Taoist Court truly became aware, it was already too late.","And with the Demon Sect mobilizing a large number of demon cultivators, the Taoist Court simply couldn’t be a match.","Not only might Uncle Gu not escape alive, but even the ordinary Enforcement Leaders of the Taoist Court, along with a large number of cultivators from the Gu Family, would likely perish.","Moreover, not just any death.","It was being made into sacrifices for the Blood Banquet by the demon cultivators, dying tragically drained of blood.","But with things as they were, he had no time to set up an arrangement, nor time to warn anyone, with his capability, he could do nothing.","It seemed he could only watch, as Uncle Gu and the others marched to their deaths.","In the Demon Sect Token, Magnetic Patterns continued to surface one by one.","The encirclement by the Demon Sect also tightened step by step.","The Taoist Court’s cultivators, moving step by step into the ambush, heading towards death...","The faces of Uncle Gu, Sister Xia, along with Gu An, Gu Quan, and other familiar cultivators of the Gu Family, flashed in his mind like a Zouma Lantern.","Mo Hua felt a slight pain in his heart, worried and burning with anxiety, then, in a flash of lightning and fire, he suddenly recalled something.","After a moment’s pause, Mo Hua’s eyes became determined, and he hesitated no more.","His eyes suddenly became deep, golden light surged from their depths, as he pushed his Divine Sense to the limit, using the Heavenly secret Tricky Calculation, aiding it with the Heavenly secret Calculation, with strong Divine Sense Calculation Power, he manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature of Returning to the Source, and in an instant, sent a \"anonymous\" message to all demon cultivators involved in the ambush:","\"There’s a traitor, abort the plan.\""]},{"number":1818,"title":"Chapter 1818 - 905: Who Is It?","paragraphs":["Qian Learning State Boundary, Third Grade Territory, desolate countryside.","A ruin where a \"Blood Banquet\" is about to take place.","All the Demon Cultivators suddenly had their minds go blank.","They stood frozen like statues in the wind, standing there bewildered for a long time.","The plan was ready, the Taoist Court dogs fell into the trap, the ambush circle was closing, everyone was sharpening their knives, bloodthirsty and frenzied, caught unprepared, but suddenly a message came, saying there was a spy, and the plan needed to be halted...","Near the ruins, the densely packed Demon Cultivators couldn’t help but look at each other, and then all eyes turned to the leading Golden Core Demon Heads.","At the forefront of the crowd, several Golden Core Demon Heads, clad in pitch-black Demon Path cloaks, swirling with Demonic Qi around them, their faces obscured by murky Demonic Qi, all frowned simultaneously.","One person spoke hoarsely, \"What’s going on?\"","\"Who has the guts to ’halt the plan’?\"","\"Who sent this message?\"","\"Quickly, go check it out...\"","Another Golden Core Demon Head spoke coldly, \"It’s too late, the Taoist Court is already in the net, the arrow is on the string, there’s no time to check this out now?\"","Someone questioned, \"Could it be... the spy we planted in the Taoist Court...\"","Before he finished speaking, he was scolded by another Demon Head, \"Shut up!\"","Inside the Demon Sect, there are \"spies\" planted by the Taoist Court.","In the Taoist Court, naturally, there are \"spies\" planted by the Demon Sect too.","This matter is very confidential, and the identity of the spies cannot be exposed. Even these Demon Heads, who are Golden Core and hold considerable status, do not know the identity of the \"spy\" hidden in the Taoist Court.","Therefore, whether this \"informant\" message was indeed from the \"spy\" on the Taoist Court side, they were also unclear.","After a moment of silence, someone said:","\"Who sent the message can be investigated later... The question now is, is this message true or false, does our Demon Sect really have a ’spy’?\"","\"Hasn’t the spy already been exposed?\"","\"Is it really that easy for us to expose a spy in the Taoist Court?\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"I mean...\" A tall and thin Golden Core Demon Head glanced at the leader in the Late Golden Core Stage, then slowly said, \"Could the previous ’spy’ have been deliberately exposed by the Taoist Court?\"","\"The Taoist Court specifically exposed this spy to use his life as bait to lure us in. We’re fishing for the Taoist Court, and the Taoist Court, in turn, used this ’spy’ as bait to fish for us...\"","\"You mean... it’s a plot within a plot, a trap within a trap?\"","\"Yes, we set a trap, the Taoist Court fell into it. But this trap was actually set by the Taoist Court, and the ones truly caught in it, were us...\"","\"To hell with all this trap talk, you’re making me dizzy...\"","\"Fool...\"","\"Simply put, we have another spy among us?\"","\"This real spy, hiding in the dark, scheming and deliberately plotting, wants to capture us all in one go. And the ’spy’ we exposed before was actually just a ’scapegoat’, a pawn discarded by the Taoist Court?\"","\"In that case, this ’spy’ probably holds not a small status, possibly even...\"","This statement cut off abruptly.","The Demonic Qi concealed everyone’s faces, but within the Demonic Qi, everyone’s expressions were somewhat subtle.","Someone capable of plotting in the shadows is at least a Golden Core.","This person is also a spy, in other words, this \"spy\" might very well be among those present.","Among those gathered, any Golden Core could be that spy...","The atmosphere suddenly became silent and eerie.","Everyone remained silent, but their minds were racing:","During these days, who is most suspicious, who has slipped up, who is not enthusiastic about killing, who doesn’t relish in blood-sucking, who is not diligent in cultivating Demon Skills, who is most likely to be that... real spy.","Demon Cultivators are inherently vicious and suspicious.","At this moment of sudden trouble, these Golden Core Demon Heads, ruthless in killing, became even more anxious and riddled with suspicion due to the single sentence \"there is a spy, halt the plan\".","After a while, a rough-voiced Golden Core Demon Head said:","\"I think something’s wrong, how can there be so many spies? Maybe someone is acting secretly, trying to sabotage our Demon Sect’s plan.\"","\"This message must be fake.\"","\"That’s right...\"","\"How could there be a spy among us?\"","Other Golden Core Demon Heads also nodded in agreement.","\"But...\" Another Demon Head said in a deep voice, \"If this message is fake, it means someone is using this method to confuse us, intending to stop our plan to hunt the Taoist Court cultivators...\"","\"This means our plan has already been leaked.\"","\"And this plan was only known internally within the Demon Sect, with hardly any whispers outside before.\"","\"Such a thorough plan being exposed, doesn’t it precisely indicate that we indeed have a spy among us?\"","All the Golden Core Demon Heads were stunned.","If this message is true, then they indeed have a spy among them.","Even if this message is false, they still have a \"spy\" among them?","\"No matter how you look at it, it surely means there’s a ’spy’?\"","\"Seems... quite reasonable...\"","\"Hiss...\"","Someone gasped, and then everyone turned to the leading Demon Sect Leader.","In this situation, only the Leader can make a decision.","With a cultivation level in the Late Golden Core Stage, a muscular physique like a small mountain, enveloped in swirling Demonic Qi, the imposing Demon Sect Leader remained unmoved, a fierce look in his eyes, saying nothing.","With the Leader silent, the other Demon Heads dared not say anything more."]},{"number":1819,"title":"Chapter 1819 - 905: Who Is It? (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Just at that moment, the Taoist Court, who had initially fallen into the ambush, began to make some moves.","They quietly regrouped their formations, their hands gripping swords and knives tightly, seeking cover near the city walls, while the leading Golden Core Stewards concealed their auras, spiritual power poised for release.","They were subtly vigilant about something.","These vigilant gestures were fairly subtle; if it had been earlier, when the Demon Cultivators were in a bloodthirsty frenzy and mentally scattered, they might not have noticed.","But now, due to the \"traitor\" incident, they were in a state of suspicion and doubt, making the subtle movements of the Taoist Court very conspicuous.","All the Golden Core Demons’ expressions darkened.","Finally, a slender \"Think Tank\" like Golden Core Demon whispered to the Demon Sect Leader:","\"Big Brother, something’s not right...\"","He pondered for a moment and slowly said, \"The Taoist Court has entered the ambush zone but remains inactive, not taking the bait. Now they’re secretly on guard, something is strange...\"","\"Either they’ve detected something, knowing the current situation is a ’trap’; or there really is something fishy among them, and they themselves are the ’trap’...\"","The Demon Sect Leader’s pupils slightly narrowed.","The Golden Core Demon Cultivator continued, \"If it’s a trap, then it’s not advisable to take risks at this moment...\"","\"The Taoist Court’s dogs have local Great Family support; kill one wave, there’s still another wave.\"","\"Our brothers and the disciples and followers below them were hard to come by, if the casualties are too heavy, developing under the Taoist Court’s watch won’t be easy...\"","The Demon Sect Leader’s scarlet eyes coldly watched the Taoist Court cultivators below. After a moment, his voice was hoarse and terrifying, partly human, partly beast-like:","\"Retreat first...\"","The Demon Sect Leader’s face was pitch black, his whole body surged with Demonic Qi, filled with icy killing intent.","\"Go back and thoroughly investigate who... sent the message.\"","\"Yes!\"","Everyone’s hearts tightened, and they cupped their hands in response.","They knew that Big Brother was truly angry now.","...","In the ruins, there was a scene of desolation.","This was an abandoned family estate, with broken walls everywhere, hence used by the Demon Cultivators as the site for the \"Blood Banquet.\"","Indeed, a small group of Demon Cultivators gathered here to suck blood.","Gu Changhuai, having received a tip-off from an informant, planned to round up this group of Demon Cultivators in one go. But now, he felt his back had turned cold.","He realized he was caught in a trap.","Although it seemed there was nothing around, in the darkness, demonic shadows gathered, as if hidden killing intent was merging into the shadows.","However, when he noticed this, it was already too late.","His people were already surrounded by the layers of the Demon Sect.","Gu Changhuai was unsure of the exact number of Demon Cultivators, but judging from the strong yet covert pressure around, it was certainly not few in number.","He could only order the troops to remain inactive and vigilant, trying to buy some time.","Meanwhile, several Golden Cores were also searching for ways to break through, looking for a chance to escape.","Yet the situation was perilous.","The Demon Sect was ruthless and numerous, prepared for battle, and once combat erupted, it would be a blood-drenched slaughter, with no room for maneuver.","Now, they could only try their best, but Gu Changhuai had no confidence whatsoever.","He dared not think about how many colleagues would die and how many might survive...","Gu Changhuai glanced around, looked at the tense Taoist Court Enforcement Leaders, especially since most were cultivators from the Gu Family, and he felt a sharp pain in his heart.","He then turned his head and looked at the cold but beautiful Xia Canonical Official beside him, feeling complex:","\"The Gu Family cultivators must not die...\"","\"This woman is annoying, but she shouldn’t die here either...\"","In any case, he probably won’t escape.","For some reason, these Demon Cultivators have a deep hatred for him, wishing to kill him whenever they encounter him.","Using himself as \"bait\" might provide a timely opportunity and offer others a chance for survival.","Gu Changhuai remained silent.","A person seeking the Dao should not regret sacrificing themselves.","Many ancestors of the Gu Family fulfilled their duties, falling at the hands of heretical demons countless times.","And this may be his destiny as well.","But... the debt he owes Mo Hua, he fears he won’t be able to repay it in this lifetime.","Repeatedly benefiting from that young man’s help but never aiding him, he really felt sorry for him...","Gu Changhuai sighed slightly.","The serious Xia Canonical Official saw Gu Changhuai sighing, thus turned her head and said in a deep voice:","\"I have a few rare talisman treasures on hand, I’ll lead the way later. You’re injured, follow behind, and we’ll find a way to break through together...\"","Gu Changhuai regarded Xia Canonical Official deeply, saying nothing, only nodded calmly.","His attitude was too calm, with a hint of acceptance of his fate.","Xia Canonical Official found it strange but did not overthink.","Thereafter, Xia Canonical Official took out a precious ice-blue jade talisman, hidden within her sleeve and ready to act.","Another Golden Core Steward transferred here felt his scalp tingle.","He had just arrived at the Qianxue Court Tribunal for his first mission, finding himself in this situation was truly disconcerting.","But as matters stood, there was nothing more to say. If they didn’t fight with all their might, they’d genuinely lose their lives.","He tightened his grip on the pair of large hammers he held.","Gu Changhuai also took out his own Magical Treasure, a radiant Seven-Colored Peacock Feather Treasure Fan, spiritual power secretly flowing...","The remaining cultivators also grasped their spiritual artifacts, their faces pale.","Everyone was ready for a desperate fight.","Yet at that exact moment, the distant demonic qi suddenly churned, like packs of bloodthirsty wolves."]},{"number":1820,"title":"Chapter 1820 - 905: Who Is It? (Part 3)","paragraphs":["But those wolves did not attack; instead, they suppressed their cruel killing intent, gradually moving away as if retreating...","Gu Changhuai and the others were stunned.","The rest looked at each other in dismay.","Yet they still did not dare to act rashly, instead patiently remaining on guard.","However, after thirty minutes, there was not a single trace of presence in the distance, as if all the Demon Cultivators had quietly withdrawn.","The group, who had been prepared for a great battle, couldn’t help but feel a pang of confusion.","\"Why did these Demon Cultivators suddenly retreat?\"","\"What happened?\"","\"Could it be a trap? Do they want us to let our guard down and then strike back when we’re relaxed?\"","The Golden Core Steward, who wielded dual hammers and had been transferred from another state boundary, speculated in a low voice.","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment, then shook his head, \"They have the numbers; if they really wanted to take us down, they would just do it directly—there’s no need for such theatrics.\"","\"Then what are they up to... just toying with us?\"","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official both looked equally perplexed.","After a moment of thought, Gu Changhuai spoke in a low voice:","\"Whatever happened, it’s a good thing for us. Let’s retreat to a safe place before discussing further; we don’t want to linger too long in case those Demon Cultivators return.\"","Summer Canon nodded, then issued orders for the Taoist Court cultivators to retreat.","However, they did not go far, retreating to a small grove twenty miles away, at the city gate, where they confirmed the surroundings were safe before setting up camp for the night.","They stayed there all night.","At dawn the next day, another group of reinforcements arrived to join them.","The two groups merged and returned to the ruins, the site of the Demon Sect’s ambush.","They needed to investigate.","Whether there was indeed a large number of Demon Cultivators lurking the night before, what kind of trap they had set, and why they suddenly withdrew...","The Taoist Court cultivators spread out, searching the entire ruins and the nearby desolate mountain thoroughly.","What they found left everyone in a state of shock.","The mountain ground was littered with Demon Cultivator footprints, with remnants of Demonic Qi, Blood Worm traps, dismantled remains of an Evil Formation, vegetation polluted by Demonic Qi, and gradually rotting away...","As far as the eye could see, the devastation covered the whole mountain range.","Even Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official felt a chill in their hearts.","The number of Demon Cultivators was far greater than they had anticipated, including many Golden Core Realm Demon Heads.","This was not a simple ambush but a large-scale \"siege\" targeting the Taoist Court.","Had they fought last night, it would have been extremely dangerous, and the chances of surviving such a brutal siege by Demon Cultivators were minuscule.","At that moment, everyone felt a strong sense of post-catastrophe fortune, but at the same time developed a stronger sense of doubt.","Why?","Why, having set up an ambush, with everything in place, would they suddenly withdraw?","Demon Cultivators are known to be relentless, and such mercy does not fit their style at all.","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Afterward, everyone searched around once more, but found nothing.","It was as though the Demon Sect had quietly set up the ambush, silently surrounded the Taoist Court cultivators, then just as quietly retreated with no lethal intent.","Came softly, left softly, taking not a single life.","\"Why exactly?\"","The group was puzzled beyond words.","Gu Changhuai couldn’t understand either.","After searching for another two hours, Summer Canon sighed and said, \"It’s getting late, let’s return to the Taoist Court; we can investigate further later.\"","\"Yes.\" Gu Changhuai nodded.","Then everyone began the journey back home.","The journey was bumpy, yet they all returned safely.","Half a day later, they were back at the Qian Learning State Boundary’s Taoist Court.","The mission was over. Though the trip bore no fruit, not losing anyone under such circumstances was a stroke of luck amidst misfortune.","Summer Canon also handed back the sealed storage bags to everyone.","This was the Taoist Court’s rule.","For any major mission, to prevent leaks, all Taoist Court cultivators were forbidden to carry any items other than mission-related Spiritual Artifacts and Pills.","Gu Changhuai and Summer Canon only then retrieved their own storage bags.","Still preoccupied with the Demon Sect matter, their minds were muddled with doubts as they only casually inspected the storage bags.","Until they found the Letter Token inside, and saw the message Mo Hua had sent them yesterday:","\"Uncle Gu, the ’insider’ in the Demon Sect has been exposed.\"","\"Uncle Gu, be wary of the Demon Sect’s ambush...\"","\"Uncle Gu...\"","Gu Changhuai felt his scalp tingle for a moment.","This information was sent by Mo Hua yesterday, and judging by the time, it was right before they fell into the Demon Sect’s ambush.","Which means, Mo Hua knew in advance!","Mo Hua, who was in the Taixu Gate, without leaving the house, knew about the Demon Sect’s large-scale siege plan even earlier than those Department of Ceremonies in the thick of it.","Knew even earlier they were stepping into a fatal killing game.","And he had even warned them in advance, telling them to be careful...","Gu Changhuai’s heart was filled with shock and disbelief.","Mo Hua... how did he know?","Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but look at Summer Canon, finding him also holding a Letter Token, eyes wide with shock, seemingly having seen a similar transmission from Mo Hua, equally shaken.","\"Mo Hua, he...\" Summer Canon murmured, looking incredulous.","\"Mo Hua knows, does that mean...\"","The two of them simultaneously harbored an almost absurd suspicion:"]},{"number":1821,"title":"Chapter 1821 - 905: Who Is It? (Part 4)","paragraphs":["This matter, Mo Hua knew in advance, and sent out a message.","At present, it seems that only Mo Hua knew in advance.","Subsequently, the Demon Sect set up an ambush, surrounded halfway, and then suddenly withdrew...","Could it be...","Is it that Mo Hua did something secretly, causing so many Demon Cultivators to have to cease their plan and retreat reluctantly?","This speculation is too absurd.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official initially just thought it was impossible.","But thinking about Mo Hua’s always unexpected and incredible actions, waves of shock gradually surged in both of their hearts...","...","Within the Taixu Gate.","At this moment, Mo Hua was incredibly busy.","After the message \"there’s a mole\" was sent out, he began to erase Magnetic Patterns overnight, preparing to \"flee\".","Of course, it’s not really \"fleeing\", but rather erasing all traces he left in the Demon Sect’s Yuan Magnetic Formation base to avoid detection by these Demon Cultivators.","First, he restored all the Fixed Magnetic Patterns he had modified through the Thunder Magnetic Miniature during this period.","Afterwards, he decisively blocked the entrance to the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation, cutting off the connection to the Yuan Magnetic Sea.","Then, he changed the identity of the Demon Sect disciple \"Chi Fei\" back to \"ordinary disciple\".","All the permissions he had altered through Magnetic Patterns for him were all blocked.","The Demon Sect Token was also changed to a \"closed\" state by him.","After erasing all traces, Mo Hua retracted the Thunder Magnetic Miniature and threw the Demon Sect Token back into the Storage Ring, acting as if nothing had happened, attending classes, cultivating, and practicing swordsmanship as usual.","As for what happens next, he no longer cared.","But in his heart, there was a bit of anxiety.","What if he got discovered and was sought out by these Demon Cultivators...","Mo Hua was momentarily stunned, suddenly realizing he might be overthinking it.","He is now an honorable disciple of the Taixu Gate, ranked third among the Eight Great Gates, and currently situated in Taixu Mountain.","In Taixu Mountain, there’s the Heaven Void Ancestor overseeing, and the Sect Leader is Feather Transformation.","There are countless Golden Core Realm Elders who are familiar with him.","What is there to fear?","Just a few, no, just a dozen or so Golden Core Demons.","If it were outside, he might still give them some face, try to avoid them.","But this is the Taixu Gate, if they dare to come, even without the Ancestor acting, those Feather Transformation Realm Chief Elders could chop them all down with one sword each.","Mo Hua’s back straightened suddenly; he realized he truly had \"backing\" now.","Thus, two days later, he couldn’t resist the loneliness and quietly accessed the Demon Sect Token again.","Then he discovered he was \"deactivated\".","It seemed the Demon Sect noticed the anomaly and \"deactivated\" all such lost and untraceable Demon Sect Tokens.","Mo Hua’s heart sank.","It’s over, this Token, he wasn’t going to play with it just once and then have it \"deactivated\", was he?","He hadn’t had enough fun yet.","\"I have to think of a solution...\"","The situation was urgent, Mo Hua couldn’t be bothered with too much, so he once again summoned the Returning to the Source Thunder Magnetic Miniature to infiltrate the Demon Sect Token.","He wasn’t afraid of being discovered by Demon Cultivators.","If by chance he was discovered, he would just destroy the Demon Sect Token and throw it off the cliff of Taixu Mountain.","After the Thunder Magnetic Miniature infiltrated the Demon Sect Token, Mo Hua indeed saw the Magnetic Patterns of the Demon Sect Token starting to turn gray, and no information could be transmitted.","The permission status was also changed to \"destroyed\".","This Demon Sect Token seemed to be invalidated.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","This Demon Sect was so petty; saying they would destroy the Demon Sect Token, just like that, couldn’t play the game...","They didn’t want to play, but he hadn’t had enough.","\"What to do?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a while, then based on his Thunder Magnetic experience and the principles of the Thunder Magnetic Array taught by Elder Zheng, he started devising a plan and began attempting.","And after several attempts, Mo Hua gradually had an idea.","The Demon Sect Token was in his hands; the Demon Sect couldn’t \"deactivate\" it starting from this token.","They could only sever the connection from the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation end.","And each Demon Sect Token had a Magnetic Pattern Sequence to identify \"identity\" and connect with the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation.","This principle was the same as the Soul Pivot Ultimate Formation with First Grade Twelve Patterns he had learned before.","The Demon Sect \"destroyed\" the Sequence of his Demon Sect Token, so it became invalidated, even if the permission was changed to \"Skill Transmission Disciple,\" it still couldn’t access the Yuan Magnetic Sea of the Compound Formation.","\"In other words, as long as the Magnetic Pattern Sequence can be altered, it can still be accessed...\"","\"But... where is the Sequence Magnetic Pattern, and how to change it?\"","Mo Hua patiently, focusing all his attention, combed through the Fixed Magnetic Patterns in the Demon Sect Token from beginning to end.","Finally, after combing through it a full five times, Mo Hua found a hidden spot with a complex pattern, unclear meaning, but very intricate special Yuan Magnetic Formation Pattern.","\"Found it!\"","Sequence Magnetic Pattern!","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, and then he immediately started thinking, how does this Magnetic Pattern need to be changed? Into what form?","Sequence Magnetic Patterns themselves have no special meaning, purely for identifying token identity.","Hence, the texture itself would be very complex.","Mo Hua didn’t have other Sequence Magnetic Patterns with Demon Sect permissions to use temporarily.","So he could only try random modifications himself.","See if a blind cat could stumble upon a dead mouse.","Mo Hua, having studied the Spiritual Pivot Formation, knew that Sequential Formation Patterns, for ease of management, were also derived according to a certain pattern.","If he just \"forged\" one, it should be usable.","But this \"forging\" also required effort.","Afterwards, Mo Hua, relying on his profound Formation knowledge and keen Dao intuition, began attempting to forge a new \"Magnetic Pattern\" based on the original sequence.","Each time he forged a Sequence Magnetic Pattern, he attempted to communicate with the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, to see if he could leverage Thunder Magnetic Power to re-open the interface and engage with the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation of the Demon Sect.","In this manner, trying one by one...","Attempting from various angles, directions, structures, trying over fifty pieces, Mo Hua finally succeeded in creating a truly useful \"Sequence Magnetic Pattern\".","Mo Hua used the \"forged\" Sequence Magnetic Pattern to start interfacing with the Yuan Magnetic Formation of the Demon Sect.","In an instant, Yuan Magnetic vibrated, and Secondary Thunder Flow surged.","The gray Magnetic Patterns began lighting up one by one.","A Thunder Magnetic interface opened, with the intricate yet orderly Yuan Magnetic Flow, carrying a vast amount of information, rushing like a river.","A multitude of Demon Cultivator information appeared in Mo Hua’s mind once again.","Seeing the familiar scene before his eyes, Mo Hua couldn’t help but have his eyes light up.","\"Success!\"","\"I’m back again!\"","Even under \"deactivation\", he managed to break through multiple obstacles, infiltrating this Yuan Magnetic Sea once more with his wit and wisdom.","\"This Token can still be played with...\"","Mo Hua felt anticipation in his heart.","Meanwhile, staring at the myriad of complex Yuan Magnetic Flow before him, a thought couldn’t help but surface in his mind:","If in secret, leveraging the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, mastering the Yuan Magnetic Formation, it seems like the Golden Core game isn’t one he can’t play..."]},{"number":1822,"title":"Chapter 1822 - 906: The Mastermind","paragraphs":["Just as Mo Hua forged the magnetic pattern sequence, unbeknownst to anyone, and once again infiltrated the bottom layer of the Demon Sect’s original magnetic compound formation.","Demon Sect, secret chamber.","Before the enormous Blood Pool.","Two Golden Core Demons were having a secret conversation.","One, draped in a black robe, with a thin figure and eyes gleaming with a sharp light, had a Third Grade Four Symbols \"Dog Pattern\" tattooed on his right arm. He reported respectfully to the Demon Sect Leader sitting above, whose form was massive like a Demon Mountain:","\"Big Brother, I’ve thoroughly investigated it...\"","\"The person who sent the message, I don’t know what means they used, erased the magnetic patterns, obscured the name, and left no trace afterward.\"","\"But since he was able to send the message, he must have had a Demon Sect Token in his possession.\"","\"The tokens of the Demon Sect are all confidential, and the original magnetic formations are all closed off. Outsiders can’t possibly have them.\"","\"But some time ago, we were chased by the Taoist Court, and lost some personnel, and a few Sect Tokens were also lost.\"","\"These Sect Tokens must have fallen into the hands of the Taoist Court or others.\"","\"Therefore, I ordered an inventory of Sect Tokens to destroy all the lost tokens.\"","\"Repairing the barn after the sheep were lost, though we haven’t found the person sending the message yet, this hidden danger should be eliminated. It’s just...\"","The Golden Core Demon with the Dog Pattern frowned and said: \"This matter is probably not that simple...\"","The Demon Sect Leader’s scarlet eyes gave him an indifferent glance, gesturing for him to continue.","The Dog Pattern Demon lowered his voice:","\"The lost tokens were mostly for ordinary disciples, at most up to the level of Skill Transmission or Blood Relatives. Logically, such tokens are quite low-end and far from being able to steal the Demon Sect’s secrets and anonymously transmit messages...\"","\"Therefore, it can be inferred that this person sending messages must be lurking within our Demon Sect. Even if not a Golden Core, they are at least at the Foundation Establishment Peak, and hold a significant position, highly valued...\"","\"And this person is very likely the true internal spy that the Taoist Court planted within our Demon Sect!\"","The Dog Pattern Demon pondered for a moment and continued:","\"A few days ago during the encirclement, I also checked afterward, and the Taoist Court didn’t set up an ambush. They just fell into a trap.\"","\"If we had made a move at that time, we could have swallowed all those Taoist Court dogs!\"","\"The ’internal spy’ must have learned of this information, but learned it too late, couldn’t inform in time, which is why he took the risk of exposing his identity, repealed that self-exposing message to all the demon cultivators involved.\"","\"Otherwise, during the Blood Banquet a few days ago, none of the Taoist Court’s cultivators would have survived!\"","The Demon Sect Leader’s eyes showed anger, and with a furious slap, the stone table beside was smashed to pieces.","The Dog Pattern Demon felt a chill in his heart, pondered for a moment, and then continued: \"But speaking back, this is also a good thing...\"","The Demon Sect Leader turned his head to look at him.","The Dog Pattern Demon’s eyes gleamed and he continued, \"If not for this, we wouldn’t have known that there was still such a ’internal spy’ hidden so deeply within the Demon Sect, incredibly unbelievable!\"","\"He saved the Taoist Court dogs, but also exposed himself!\"","The Demon Sect Leader’s eyes narrowed, his voice murky like a monster beast:","\"Do not publicize this matter, investigate secretly. If I find out who this internal spy is, I will tear him to pieces and devour him whole.\"","\"Yes.\" The Dog Pattern Demon bowed respectfully.","As the Demon Sect Leader was about to say more, his expression suddenly changed, demonic energy surged around him, and his aura became violent, accompanied by the faint roar of beasts around, as if they were ready to devour people.","The Dog Pattern Golden Core Demon immediately showed fear and respectfully bowed:","\"Big Brother, I won’t disturb you...\"","The Demon Sect Leader struggled against the bloodthirsty urge, emitting a low growl from his throat, unable to speak human words.","The Dog Pattern Demon no longer hesitated, and immediately retreated, sealing the door tightly.","Afterward, the stone chamber was empty, and the Demon Sect Leader finally couldn’t hold back anymore. His pitch-black demon robe shredded piece by piece, revealing his deformed and twisted flesh.","He walked step by step into the Blood Pool, like a blood and flesh demon.","The dark red blood soaked his entire body.","His flesh seemed to come alive, wriggling irregularly, greedily absorbing the blood in the pool.","As he absorbed more blood, a dark blue pattern gradually emerged on his back.","The pattern was like a long serpent, covered with scale armor, claws like an eagle, with distinct antlered horns, majestic to the extreme.","This is a dragon.","Four Symbols Blood-Colored Azure Dragon.","And this Green Dragon Four Symbols Formation, soaked with blood, tattooed on the Demon Sect Leader’s back, as if merged with his flesh, constantly strengthening the Demon Sect Leader’s flesh, filling his meridians and bones with terrifying power...","...","Taixu Gate.","In the following days, Mo Hua continued as usual, infiltrating the Demon Sect Token and extracting intelligence whenever he had the chance, using Thunder Magnetic Miniatures.","He has now developed a way to forge magnetic pattern sequences, infiltrating the bottom layer of the Demon Sect’s original magnetic system by using a \"resurrected\" identity through the Demon Sect Token, like a nonexistent \"ghost\", floating in the sea of information of the Demon Sect.","As he becomes more proficient with the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, his understanding of the principles of thunder magnetism deepens, and his comprehension of the original magnetism becomes more thorough.","In the Yuan Magnetic Sea, he operates more and more effortlessly.","The intelligence he spies on becomes greater.","Any useful intelligence he extracts, Mo Hua notes down separately, compiling them on a Jade Slip.","Know yourself and your enemy, and you will not be defeated in a hundred battles.","These pieces of intelligence are the \"bargaining chips\" for his layout."]},{"number":1823,"title":"Chapter 1823 - 906: The Manipulator (Part 2)","paragraphs":["But just having information is not enough.","Setting up a plan like this can’t only rely on information; someone has to push it forward and implement it, otherwise it’s purely \"talking on paper\".","But he was sitting on Taixu Mountain, usually very busy, completely unable to extricate himself, and unable to take action personally.","Even if he personally took action, he was a Foundation Establishment, unable to do anything against a Golden Core.","\"No ’pawns’...\"","Mo Hua muttered with a frown.","He had been pondering this matter for several days.","Until this day during the rest period, Mo Hua was fiddling with the Thunder Magnetic Miniature when the Letter Token trembled slightly, bringing a message.","The message was from Gu Changhuai, saying he wanted to invite him to a delicious meal.","Mo Hua was a bit surprised and, after thinking for a moment, gladly accepted the invitation.","If you’re not enthusiastic about eating, there’s definitely something wrong with your brain.","And since Uncle Gu was inviting, it must be a big meal.","Mo Hua replied: \"Okay!\"","He fiddled with the Thunder Magnetic Miniature again that morning, studied the Formation for a while, and as it was nearing noon, Mo Hua got a little hungry, packed up his things, and got up to head to Tai Xu City.","Gu Changhuai, knowing that Mo Hua needed to cultivate, didn’t make him travel far, and chose the largest Food Building nearby in Tai Xu City for the banquet.","The name of the Food Building was Tai Xu Restaurant.","The restaurant was grand and magnificent, with an ancient and elegant style and was skilled in various ancient dishes.","Gu Changhuai, being wealthy and generous, ordered a whole table full of dishes.","When Mo Hua arrived, he found that Canonical Official Xia was also there.","He looked at Canonical Official Xia, then at Gu Changhuai, and asked in confusion: \"Uncle Gu, Sister Xia, are you inviting me together? Is there a happy event?\"","Canonical Official Xia paused.","Gu Changhuai grumbled, \"What are you thinking? Just eat.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded.","During the meal, Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia barely touched their chopsticks, most of the time just watching Mo Hua eat.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, was not shy and enjoyed the meal heartily.","The food at Taixu Sect was also good, but it was mainly for disciples and not overly extravagant.","You get what you pay for with Spirit Stones, so it definitely wasn’t as good as specialized Food Buildings.","What’s more, someone else was treating him, so Mo Hua found the food especially delicious.","After eating for a while, with his cheeks puffed out, Mo Hua suddenly remembered something and asked Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, is there something you need me for since you’re inviting me to this meal?\"","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, not knowing how to start, while Canonical Official Xia hesitated briefly before asking:","\"Mo Hua, was the message from the Letter Token sent by you?\"","She didn’t specify what message, but everyone understood.","Mo Hua candidly replied, \"I sent it.\"","Canonical Official Xia and Gu Changhuai were taken aback.","A moment later, Canonical Official Xia frowned and asked, \"How did you know about the Demon Sect...?\"","Mo Hua remained candid, \"I can’t say.\"","\"Then when the Demon Sect retreated later...\"","Mo Hua still didn’t say, just shook his head.","Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia couldn’t help but exchange a glance.","Mo Hua didn’t say it, but they had some idea in their hearts, yet they still found it quite incredible.","They couldn’t figure out how Mo Hua knew the Demon Sect’s plan.","Nor how he managed to confuse and \"command\" the Demon Sect, resolving this killing game...","But since Mo Hua didn’t mention certain secrets, they indeed couldn’t push too hard.","In any case, Mo Hua could be said to have saved their lives.","Canonical Official Xia raised her glass, her appearance dignified and graceful, and solemnly said, \"For such a great favor that goes beyond words, Mo Hua, I toast to you.\"","Gu Changhuai said nothing, silently raising his glass as well.","Some things he didn’t say out loud but would remember silently in his heart.","Mo Hua laughed, \"We’re all familiar with each other, no need to be formal.\"","However, he still raised his glass, clinking it with Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia, acknowledging the sentiment.","Mo Hua wasn’t a pretentious person; having done a good deed and being appreciated by others made him happy.","After drinking, Mo Hua pondered for a moment, had a thought, and quietly said, \"Uncle Gu, Sister Xia, do you want to deal with that Demon Sect?\"","Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia were taken aback by his words.","Canonical Official Xia nodded, \"Naturally, it’s the Taoist Court’s duty to eradicate those Demon Cultivators completely!\"","\"That’s good...\" Mo Hua whispered, \"We’re all familiar with each other, so I won’t hide it from you; I indeed have a way and channels to obtain information on the Demon Sect. I can’t reveal the source, but it’s likely credible...\"","After all, he really obtained the information from within the Demon Sect.","He knew more than most Demon Sect disciples.","Mo Hua \"persuaded,\" \"Sister Xia, if you and Uncle Gu can keep it secret and not let my identity slip, I’ll provide you the information, so you can eradicate the Demon Sect and get rid of the Demon Cultivators, eliminating harm for Qianxue State Boundary.\"","Canonical Official Xia was a bit tempted but puzzled, so she asked Mo Hua, \"But if you do this, what will you gain?\"","Mo Hua righteously replied:","\"Heretical Demon, everyone should punish them!\"","\"I am a disciple of Taixu Sect, a descendant of the prestigious Eight Great Gates, and should uphold the Sect’s teachings, exuding righteousness, eradicating demons to protect the Dao, without seeking anything in return!\"","Canonical Official Xia was taken aback by Mo Hua’s aura of righteousness.","She hadn’t expected Mo Hua, with his clean and gentle appearance, to have such firm bones, magnanimity, and hatred for evil.","Truly, one should not judge a book by its cover...","Only Gu Changhuai sighed silently on the side.","Influenced by Mo Hua, Canonical Official Xia resolutely said:","\"Alright, you provide the information, we’ll deal with the Demon Cultivators, and we’ll definitely eradicate the Demon Sect that harms people with blood-sucking practices!\"","Mo Hua couldn’t help but nod.","He then remembered something again, pretending to be in a difficult position, and said: \"But, there’s a problem...\""]},{"number":1824,"title":"Chapter 1824 - 906: Manipulator_3","paragraphs":["Xia Canonical Official asked: \"What’s the issue?\"","Mo Hua replied: \"Sister Xia, do you remember last time, when the Demon Cultivator self-destructed his Golden Core and Uncle Gu was severely injured?\"","Xia Canonical Official nodded.","\"Uncle Gu’s physical injury wasn’t the deadliest part. The most lethal was the ’Evil Spirit’ parasitizing the bodies of those Demon Cultivators.\"","\"Evil Spirit...\"","Xia Canonical Official’s expression turned serious.","The Xia family resides in Taoist State, with a profound family heritage. There are records of ’Evil Spirits’, but records are just records after all.","In Taoist State, especially within the Great Families, Evil Spirits rarely appear.","The children of these noble families, having grown up under the protection of their families, seldom encounter such sinister matters.","She still has little experience with issues concerning Evil Spirits.","In fact, it’s not only Xia Canonical Official; Gu Changhuai is the same.","Previously, the Qianxue State Boundary was peaceful. The Evil Spirits were hidden but rarely caused disturbances.","It’s only recently, with the Evil God’s conspiracy looming, Demon Monsters are stirring, coupled with Mo Hua’s troublemaking, that abnormalities started to occur frequently.","Gu Changhuai might not have believed before, but after experiencing firsthand the feeling of an Evil Spirit infiltrating his mind, he couldn’t help but believe.","\"What should be done about the Evil Spirit?\" Xia Canonical Official asked Mo Hua.","She knew it was Mo Hua who helped resolve the incident when Gu Changhuai encountered the Evil Spirit.","On the surface, Mo Hua seems like a mere Sect Disciple in the Foundation Establishment Realm, his cultivation not very high, but his Tao Cultivation skills, especially in Formation and other mysterious matters, are unfathomable.","Mo Hua pretended to ponder for a while, then said: \"I thought of a method we might try...\"","\"Once these Golden Core Demon Cultivators are caught, they must be immediately killed. Otherwise, if they release the Evil Spirits to pollute others’ Divine Sense, it will be a big problem.\"","\"But you can’t kill them carelessly... because once the Golden Core Demon Cultivator dies, the Evil Spirit, losing its parasitic flesh, will leave the body to seek new flesh to parasitize. If other cultivators get ensnared, they will become ’puppets’ of the Evil Spirit, just like Uncle Gu last time.\"","Upon hearing this, Gu Changhuai’s eyelid twitched involuntarily, clearly not wanting to recall the incident.","Xia Canonical Official was also inwardly alarmed.","\"Then...\"","Mo Hua took out an ancient, slightly yellowed map and solemnly said:","\"This map is a Divine Treasure gifted by a senior, capable of sealing Evil Spirits.\"","\"When encountering a Golden Core Demon Cultivator, first catch them off guard and sever their limbs so they can’t resist, then cover their head with this map, especially encapsulating their Sea of Consciousness, before killing them.\"","\"In this way, when the Golden Core Demon Cultivator dies, the Evil Spirit exiting the body will enter this map and get sealed inside it.\"","\"However, this map itself is quite sinister, so it must not be opened recklessly, nor viewed with the naked eye...\"","For what’s inside this map is even more terrifying than an ’Evil Spirit’.","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","This map was acquired by him in Li State’s South Yue City during the Corpse King’s chaos, obtained from Zhang Quan of the corpse-refining family.","It’s a Contemplation Map, an ancestral chart of the Zhang family, serving as a \"Corpse Evil Spirit\" chart for their ancestors.","Later, the Zhang family ancestors were all consumed by Mo Hua, who then used this map to store the Five Elements Source Pattern of the Five Elements Sect.","Thus, the karmic implications of this map are significant.","Mo Hua didn’t want to use it unless absolutely necessary.","But he had no choice; he realized that the only thing he could use to \"temporarily store\" the Divine Remains was this map.","Without risking, one cannot capture the wolf; at present, the affairs of the Demon Sect are of greater importance.","Xia Canonical Official received the map solemnly. As she rubbed her fingers over it, she could sense its age and the ancient aura faintly emanating from the map, making her heart sink slightly, realizing this map was extraordinary.","And the fact that Mo Huacan lend them this map shows his upright nature, his unwavering sense of justice in eradicating demons and upholding the Way.","Xia Canonical Official asked again: \"After sealing the Evil Spirit with this map, then what?\"","\"Afterwards, just return the map to me.\" Mo Hua said.","\"Give it to you...\" Xia Canonical Official frowned, concerned, \"Isn’t it dangerous to give it back to you with the Evil Spirit sealed inside?\"","\"It’s fine, I can eat it...\"","Xia Canonical Official froze, \"Eat?\"","\"I mean,\" Mo Hua said solemnly, \"I... will eventually be able to deal with them.\"","Xia Canonical Official looked skeptically at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua said: \"I have the Ancestor on Taixu Mountain protecting me. As long as I burn incense and bathe, set up an altar, I can ’purify’ the Evil Spirits. No problem...\"","Xia Canonical Official nodded.","The name of the Ancestor on Taixu Mountain is too well-known, so she had no doubts about him.","Thus, everything was agreed upon.","Mo Hua would provide intelligence, the Taoist Court would take action, kill the Golden Core Demon Head, seal the Evil Spirit, and then hand over the sealed Evil Spirit map to him.","Everything was clearly arranged.","Before parting, Mo Hua emphasized again:","\"Uncle Gu, Sister Xia, you must keep this confidential, never mention me.\"","\"Also, the matter of this map must remain confidential, don’t let anyone know, and never, ever open it to look...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was serious.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official also understood the gravity of the situation, nodding solemnly.","...","After eating and drinking to their fill, and finishing their discussion.","Upon returning to Taixu Gate, Mo Hua started identifying \"targets.\"","He needed a \"fall guy\" to test the feasibility of his plan, to see if the process could be smoothly executed.","Mo Hua lay low in the Yuan Magnetic Sea of the Demon Sect, \"listening to the wind\", eavesdropping for intelligence.","Two days later, he finally found a clue.","A Golden Core Demon at the early stage, ranked seventh among the Golden Cores in the Demon Sect, his real name unknown, commonly referred to as \"He Laoqi\" according to his ranking.","This He Laoqi is lustful, his cultivation technique primarily focuses on Blood Skill, with a dual cultivation of Replenishing from others.","Moreover, his conduct is highly immoral, liking to accept married men as disciples, teaching them the Blood Lotus Skill, then taking advantage of their wives, sucking their blood, and sometimes even sharing the bed with them, practicing Replenishing from others, while drinking blood.","His preference is somewhat incomprehensible.","But this hobby of his not only makes him easier to track but also easier to eliminate.","Mo Hua gathered information about this \"He Laoqi,\" tracing his daily whereabouts. Because He Laoqi had a rather abnormal reputation within the Demon Sect’s Golden Cores, many talked about him, and related information was abundant and detailed, making it easy to compile without much difficulty.","Mo Hua compiled this information on \"He Laoqi,\" gathered intelligence about his daily movements, and reported it all back to the Taoist Court using the Letter Token.","Afterward, he returned to Taixu Gate, attending classes, resuming cultivation, practicing Sword, and thus remained vigilant.","Meanwhile, plans to hunt and kill the Golden Core Demon ’He Laoqi’ were already in motion.","The Taoist Court allocated personnel, set up the trap, ready to strike.","Apart from Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, almost no one knew about these events, sitting alone in the mountains, cultivating and attending classes."]},{"number":1825,"title":"Chapter 1825 - 907: Elder Crane Seven","paragraphs":["At dusk, the sun set in the west.","In the Third-Grade Half Peak City, a residential area for cultivators.","The cultivators of the Taoist Court had long set up the Formation, arranged traps, and ambushed the surroundings.","Gu Changhuai sat in a tall pavilion nearby, his gaze like a torch, observing every movement of all cultivators on the entire street.","Beside him, Xia Canonical Official was equally vigilant in expression.","In addition, there was also a Golden Core Steward transferred from a third-grade Immortal City near the Qian Learning State Boundary.","This Steward was named Fan Jin, a burly man with a face full of stubble, skilled in using a pair of fine iron hammers, and was a body cultivator with vigorous Blood Qi.","He was also the Golden Core Steward who had previously, along with Gu Changhuai, fallen into the ambush set by the Demon Sect, but managed to escape thanks to Mo Hua’s interference.","The view from the tall pavilion was wide, the three of them watched for a long time, but no one came.","Fan Jin then said in a low voice, \"Is the information reliable?\"","Gu Changhuai stroked the Letter Token beside his hand.","On the Letter Token, there was very detailed intelligence given to him by Mo Hua.","Gu Changhuai nodded and said, \"Around 7:15 PM, He Laoqi will disguise himself as a doctor, walk along South Street, make a loop, and at 7:45 PM, reach the northernmost part, entering the third house from right to left, which has a red banner hanging at the door.\"","\"After He Laoqi enters the house, he will first replenish from others, then suck blood, and finally transmit skills...\"","This was confidential information given by Mo Hua, previously only known to Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, and not disclosed to outsiders.","Fan Jin, as an externally transferred Steward, had just learned of it.","He was momentarily stunned and asked in confusion:","\"Is this information so detailed? Is it real? Even the exact hours and minutes are pinpointed, could it be that a fortune teller calculated it?\"","Gu Changhuai was silent.","He also felt that Mo Hua now was not much different from a \"fortune teller.\"","\"By the way,\" Gu Changhuai remembered Mo Hua’s warning, and said, \"That He Laoqi is full of Demon Skills, somewhat difficult to deal with, and there’s something sinister about him, he cannot be left alive, nor can he be simply killed, at that time, we’ll trouble Steward Fan to suppress him up close and cripple his limbs.\"","Among the three of them, only Fan Jin was purely a body cultivator, so this task could only be entrusted to him.","Fan Jin said, \"Rest assured, I know, I will definitely do my best in such matters.\"","Gu Changhuai nodded.","Fan Jin glanced at Gu Changhuai, somewhat hesitant to speak.","Gu Changhuai, sharp-minded, sensed he had something to say, and said, \"Steward Fan, feel free to speak.\"","Fan Jin glanced again at Xia Canonical Official, hesitated for a moment, but ultimately couldn’t hold back, saying softly:","\"Supervisor Gu, I just want to ask, if we successfully eradicate the Demon Sect this time, and I make some contributions, can I be transferred from the Solitary Mountain City’s Taoist Court to the Qian Learning State Boundary?\"","Gu Changhuai was taken aback, then slightly frowned.","\"If not the Qian Learning State Boundary, any other third-grade state boundary will do...\" Fan Jin said.","Gu Changhuai asked, \"You don’t want to stay in Solitary Mountain City?\"","Nonsense, who would want to stay in a godforsaken place like that...","Fan Jin thought to himself, then sighed:","\"Logically speaking, as a Steward of the Taoist Court, serving the Taoist Court is the same everywhere, but for me, the situation is indeed special.\"","\"Solitary Mountain City is desolate, with few people, I have lofty ambitions, but no outlet to realize them. Thinking of striving to make further progress, there’s just no way.\"","\"Now, with the eradication of the Demon Sect, the Qian Learning State Boundary is short of staff, just right for them to transfer me over, it would also be giving me a chance, I ought to devote myself wholly.\"","\"It’s just that... I have no family background, no connections, no network, and in the Taoist Court, I have no one who can speak for me, I don’t understand the rules inside, and I don’t even know what kind of contributions to make in order to get promoted... no, not promoted, even just transferred.\"","Fan Jin smiled bitterly.","His words were somewhat utilitarian, but still considered honest.","Gu Changhuai didn’t mind either.","Though he was a bit aloof and indifferent, he was not an unreasonable person and knew that for a Steward without power or influence, promotion was extremely difficult.","Within the rules, it’s only human nature to seek a future for oneself.","Gu Changhuai pondered, \"The Taoist Court does indeed have such precedents, but this kind of promotion requires operations from various sides and also involves some interpersonal relationships, which can’t be relied on as a reference.\"","\"But, though promotion is not easy, if you only want a transfer, it shouldn’t be difficult. If you make contributions this time, you can apply upward, and it will be discussed by the Deputy Court Leader and the Court Leader...\"","\"It’s just that, given the redundancy and complexity of the personnel in the Taoist Court, whether it will ultimately happen is uncertain, but generally, this is indeed a way...\"","\"Having an opportunity is good, having an opportunity is good...\" Fan Jin nodded repeatedly, cupped his hands and said, \"Thank you Supervisor Gu for the advice.\"","Gu Changhuai also cupped his hands and said, \"Steward Fan is too polite.\"","Fan Jin slightly breathed a sigh of relief, feeling a bit lighter at heart.","Throughout, Xia Canonical Official paid no attention to their conversation, remaining silent and fully focused on the street.","Fan Jin was also tactful, didn’t speak further, and patiently watched the street corner’s movement with them, but his heart was fluctuating.","\"It’s good to be transferred from Solitary Mountain City...\"","\"Solitary Mountain City, I can’t stay there any longer...\"","Fan Jin’s gaze faintly carried a hint of fear.","After that, the group said no more, concentrating on the surveillance.","As the sun gradually set, at 7:15 PM, there indeed appeared a cultivator disguised as a \"doctor\" at the street corner.","He was tall and thin, with a head full of white hair, wearing a conical hat covering his face and carrying several gourds containing Pills.","Then, as Mo Hua had said, he walked through South Street, made a loop, and at 7:45 PM, reached the northern side and entered the house with the red banner hanging at the door...","Just as Gu Changhuai had described, down to the exact time points."]},{"number":1826,"title":"Chapter 1826 - 907: He Laoqi_2","paragraphs":["Fan Jin looked at He Laoqi, then turned around to look at Gu Changhuai, and couldn’t help but say:","\"Exactly what level of mole have you planted inside the Demon Sect? Could it be a Demon Sect Elder? This intelligence is simply divine...\"","Even Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were somewhat stunned at this moment.","It’s actually true down to the smallest detail...","At the same time, they were also puzzled in their hearts, wondering how Mo Hua managed to obtain this intelligence...","If it weren’t for their considerable understanding of Mo Hua, they would suspect Mo Hua was an Elder inside this Demon Sect?","But right now, there’s no time to think about such things.","Gu Changhuai saw He Laoqi enter the house with the red banner hanging, his face serious, and said solemnly: \"Start closing the net.\"","Fan Jin also put his thoughts away, his eyes becoming sharp.","The opportunity was rare, he must perform well.","The surrounding Enforcement Leaders began to hold their blades in vigilance, quietly closing in from all sides towards the house with the red banner.","They were no match for Golden Core Demon Cultivators, but they formed formations among themselves to block the paths to prevent this Demon Head from escaping.","The Formation Patterns also started activating one by one, the traps long prepared.","Gu Changhuai and the other two formed a triangular formation, surrounding the house where the Demon Head was, but they did not rush to take action.","Because Mo Hua had said that this Demon Cultivator’s cultivation technique has a flaw. When performing the technique, Blood Qi reverses to the Qu Chi, Inner Acupoint, causing the Qi Sea to ache, requiring the replenishing from others and the union of Yin and Yang to relieve the pain.","At this time, if his Blood Qi is reversing, his strength will also be greatly diminished.","Gu Changhuai silently counted the hours in his heart, estimating that He Laoqi was in the process of replenishing from others, burning with desire, unable to help himself, then suddenly shot out, breaking the door and rushing in.","The room was small, with three people in total.","A man, a woman, and He Laoqi.","The man and woman were a couple, furthermore, they were disciples taken in by He Laoqi.","Now the man was outside guarding the door, the woman and He Laoqi enjoying themselves inside the room.","The man used his wife as a bargaining chip to curry favor with He Laoqi, the Golden Core, in hopes of reducing the tribute of vital blood to leave more for his own cultivation.","The woman also wished to cling to He Laoqi, the Golden Core Elder of the Demon Sect, and was thus willing to pay with her flesh.","Once one cultivates demonic arts, human nature gradually erodes, and the propriety and sense of shame are lost; anything done is not surprising.","Gu Changhuai and the others were not surprised but still felt nauseated.","He Laoqi was naked, writhing like a fleshy worm, and upon seeing Gu Changhuai and the others, he was shocked, hurriedly grabbing a robe to wrap himself and attempted to escape.","But it was too late.","Gu Changhuai had already drawn a feather fan, condensed a cyan Wind Blade, transforming into a stream of light, heading straight for He Laoqi’s neck.","He Laoqi had no way to avoid it, so he could only pull the woman in his arms over to use as a shield.","The woman was draped over He Laoqi, still in lust, not realizing what had happened, and was beheaded by a strike of Gu Changhuai’s Wind Blade.","Blood rained down for a moment, splattering the room.","The Wind Blade, having beheaded the woman, continued forward, slicing towards He Laoqi’s neck, but it was momentarily delayed by the flesh, slowing by a breath.","He Laoqi got the chance and shifted his body. The Wind Blade grazed his throat, heading towards his shoulder, gouging out a large piece of flesh.","He Laoqi cried out in pain, cursing, \"You motherf*cker...\"","Before he finished cursing, a cold glint arrived once more.","Xia Canonical Official held a short sword, condensation of icy aura, looked at He Laoqi as if looking at a pile of rotten flesh, and thus did not hold back in the slightest.","The icy short sword went straight for He Laoqi’s heart meridian.","He Laoqi was startled and hurried to circulate Blood Qi, but he hadn’t completed the replenishing, and the flaw in his cultivation technique hadn’t been resolved, so he couldn’t condense the protective blood-colored gang qi. Even with all his might, he only managed to form a thin Blood Shield at his heart meridian.","The icy blue sword light pierced through the Blood Shield instantly, the Sword Qi permeated into his heart, freezing his blood.","Fortunately, He Laoqi’s life was robust; the Sword Qi veered slightly, not truly disabling his heart meridian, but it was enough to freeze his flesh and halt him temporarily.","This series of changes transpired as a clash between the Golden Core Realm, occurring as quickly as lightning.","When the Foundation Establishment Realm man in the room came to his senses, he found his Golden Core \"master\" severely wounded, the room filled with bloodstains, and his wife, naked, already beheaded.","\"Yanzi!\"","The man was heartbroken, his eyes blood-red, shouted hoarsely: \"You killed my Dao partner, I’ll make you pay in blood...\"","Before he finished speaking, he was kicked by Fan Jin, crashing into the wall, breaking several ribs, and collapsed, unconscious.","Fan Jin kicked the man away without a hint of hesitation, and then picked up two large hammers, aiming to smash He Laoqi’s head.","He Laoqi hung on by a thread, not daring to hold back any longer, monster patterns appeared on his body, in the form of a blood-colored crane.","As the Monster Pattern emerged, the Blood Crane let out a cry, Demonic Qi surged.","He Laoqi, by leveraging the power of the Monster Pattern, finally managed to suppress the icy aura inside his body, then with a White Crane Spread its Wings, leapt, breaking through the rooftop, and escaping the three people’s encirclement.","The Crane Pattern lightened his body, allowing him to step on grass as if flying, leaving no trace in snow.","A Golden Core cannot fly, but with the Blood Crane Monster Pattern on him, He Laoqi’s figure could leap several feet into the air, far surpassing regular Golden Core cultivators.","But as soon as he rose above the rooftop, surrounding Formation Patterns flickered, a Golden Light net fell, enveloping him completely.","He Laoqi’s claws transformed into Blood Blades, shredding the net.","But in that brief effort, Gu Changhuai and the other two had already closed in again, giving him no chance to breathe, employing various methods to besiege He Laoqi.","Fan Jin charged at the forefront, wielding a pair of iron hammers with a fierce wind sound, due to his ambition for merit, he went all out without a trace of slackness."]},{"number":1827,"title":"Chapter 1827 - 907: He Laoqi_3","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai condensed a Wind Blade to suppress, and Xia Canonical Official feigned an attack with an Ice Sword, waiting for the right moment to strike.","He Laoqi revealed all his trump cards, Evil Talisman, Magical Treasures, without holding back in the slightest.","However, with Gu Changhuai’s trio of Golden Cores working together, laying a trap in advance and attacking him when he was unprepared, He Laoqi was calculated against severely and couldn’t defend himself at all.","At this moment, he finally understood and said with hatred:","\"Who leaked information to you?\"","His whereabouts, cultivation techniques, and various methods were all thoroughly figured out, targeted perfectly.","Today, even with all his scheming, there’s only a \"death\" awaiting him.","\"Tell me, let me die with peace.\" He Laoqi said.","At such a time, there was naturally no need for nonsense.","Gu Changhuai and the others ignored him and struck even harder, with hammers falling heavily, Wind Blades ceaselessly, and cold light glistening.","In less than thirty rounds, He Laoqi was gravely injured and unable to hold on.","Knowing his doom was sealed with no chance of survival, he displayed a ferocious expression, biting his tongue with his teeth, spurting a mouthful of fresh blood, urging the Evil Thoughts of the Divine Lord, intending to give up his life and become a puppet, perishing together with Gu Changhuai and the others.","But this move of his was also anticipated by Mo Hua.","Gu Changhuai took out a Golden Bell Rune, crushed it, and urged the sound of Goldstone to stun people’s senses.","For a brief moment, He Laoqi was in a daze.","Fan Jin seized the opportunity, flashed forward, approached He Laoqi, and executed the Bone Splitting Hammer, a hammer from below upward, sending him flying into the air, and another hammer from above downward, smashing him back to the ground.","He Laoqi’s whole body had fractures, internal organs ruptured, spitting fresh blood.","His eyes were wide open in rage, \"You... deserve to die!\"","But his throat was sealed by a sword from Xia Canonical Official, the ice Qi locked his throat, unable to utter a sound.","\"Disable his limbs!\" Gu Changhuai commanded.","Fan Jin did not hesitate, swung up a pair of large hammers, and shattered He Laoqi’s limbs, rendering him unable to move.","Gu Changhuai seized the opportunity to take out the treasure map given by Mo Hua, unfolding it quickly and covering He Laoqi’s head.","Then he activated Spiritual Power, turning it into a blade, shredding He Laoqi’s heart and veins to pieces.","He Laoqi died instantly.","After his death, as his vitality faded, the Evil Qi on his body grew more intense.","The deceased He Laoqi, like a Walking Corpse, kept struggling. But with his limbs disabled, only his head kept twitching.","It was as if something terrifying within his now-dead flesh was gradually awakening, leaving his physical form, seeking another host to parasitize.","Gu Changhuai frowned, his expression serious.","Xia Canonical Official and Fan Jin also appeared tense.","Fortunately, after a moment, He Laoqi became completely still, without any movement.","The eerie fluctuation on his body, which was unnerving, only lasted for a moment before disappearing completely into the treasure map given by Mo Hua.","Everyone let out a sigh of relief.","Fan Jin looked at the dead He Laoqi and then at the map, recalling the strange phenomenon earlier, he asked with lingering fear:","\"Supervisor Gu, this map...\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, then said slowly: \"This is a treasure map given by an ’expert,’ used to seal evil spirits.\"","Expert...","Upon hearing this, Fan Jin immediately felt great admiration.","He himself was somewhat confused about this matter, but Gu Changhuai came from a prestigious family and was a Supervisor of the Taoist Court in Qianxue State Boundary, with high vision and wide knowledge. Since he called them ’experts,’ it must be true.","\"Indeed, Qianxue State Boundary is a place with countless talents...\"","Fan Jin sighed in his heart.","Gu Changhuai waited for a while longer, confirming that He Laoqi was completely gone without any abnormality before carefully sealing the treasure map again.","He was quick in putting away the map, remembering Mo Hua’s instructions, he never glanced at the map, and didn’t allow others to see it, to avoid causing trouble.","He Laoqi was killed, and the map was stored away.","This task was thus declared complete.","Though the methods were somewhat complicated, due to the highly accurate intelligence, the process went much more smoothly than anticipated, and many backup plans were not even used.","The Taoist Court members felt a weight lifted off their shoulders.","Next came some follow-up matters.","The following day, Gu Changhuai specially went to Taixu Gate to return the map sealing the evil spirits to Mo Hua.","\"Everything went smoothly.\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"That’s good.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, after some internal struggle, he ultimately whispered a phrase:","\"Thank you.\"","He wanted to express gratitude but found it hard due to his personality, finally forcing himself to say it in an awkward manner, which Mo Hua found rather amusing.","Mo Hua smiled and said, \"No need to thank me!\"","The Taoist Court has its own matters to attend to, and Gu Changhuai didn’t have time to linger. After handing the map to Mo Hua, he left.","Mo Hua held the Five Elements Map, unable to resist licking his lips.","He thought for a moment and decided not to return to the Mountain Gate but instead headed to a small hill outside Taixu Mountain.","The hill was secluded, shrouded in mist, and undisturbed by others.","Mo Hua set up a simple Formation and then opened the Five Elements Map.","As soon as the map was opened, a cold, sinister Evil Qi surfaced, seemingly fearful, hurriedly escaping. In an instant, it locked onto the Sea of Consciousness of the only living person nearby and without hesitation, burrowed into it.","Mo Hua was \"possessed\" by Evil.","Amidst the mist-shrouded peaks, Mo Hua’s face turned slightly pale, and he then closed his eyes.","In his Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua’s Incarnation of Divine Sense opened its eyes.","As soon as he opened his eyes, he saw the unwelcome \"guest\" within his Sea of Consciousness.","Goat horns, a bull’s body, an ugly face, standing on two legs, surrounded by surging Evil Qi, its form terrifying.","A Peak of Second Grade Divine Remains.","This Divine Remains, resembling a \"Bull Demon,\" saw Mo Hua and frowned, his voice hoarse: \"How is it a little kid...\"","The strange map just now housed an ancient monster. Out of fear, it hurriedly fled from the map, rushing without direction, unexpectedly penetrating into the Sea of Consciousness of a small kid.","It was a Peak of Second Grade, a remnant soul of the Great Evil God. The Blood Qi and Divine Thought of a typical Foundation Building Cultivator were unable to nourish it adequately.","Moreover, a mere Foundation Establishment little kid was far from enough to \"feed\" it.","However, as the saying goes, \"When in Rome, do as the Romans do.\"","For now, it would reside in this physical body for a while, consume everything, and then seek another flesh to parasitize.","Moreover...","The Goat Horn Bull Demon looked around, sniffing, eyes lighting up with excitement.","This little kid’s Divine Sense was incredibly dense...","So dense that it hardly seemed like the Divine Sense of someone in the Foundation Establishment Realm, even less like a human’s Divine Sense...","The Goat Horn Bull Demon suddenly hesitated upon this thought.","Not like... a human’s Divine Sense?","It slowly turned its head, stared at Mo Hua, and then its deep brown menacing pupils suddenly narrowed.","Mo Hua was also looking at the Goat Horn Bull Demon, curiously asking:","\"Let me ask you a question... Are all of you Divine Remains only Second Grade?\"","All of you, these \"Divine Remains,\" only \"Second Grade\"...","The Bull Demon hesitated, anger rising within: \"Such arrogance for a little kid, such bold words! Do you know the greatness of my status?\"","Mo Hua impatiently said: \"I ask, you answer.\"","The Goat Horn Bull Demon sneered, \"You damned brat, dare to question me? Surely, you are oblivious to death...\"","It hadn’t finished speaking before it suddenly felt the world spinning.","Once it regained its senses, it realized its perspective was skewed, its face pressed against the ground, with a familiar bull-bodied demon standing before it, entirely black and monstrous, but it lacked a head.","The pupils of the Goat Horn Demon trembled violently.","This headless demon... is me?","At the same moment, it felt someone stepping on its head.","\"Since you refuse to answer my question, you are useless to me.\"","Mo Hua stepped hard on the bull’s head, a clear sound invoking. In his hand, he wielded a Sever Gold Sword, its blade sharp, cleaving heads without blood.","The Goat Horn Demon looked horrified.","Only now did it understand that the ancient being within the map was a monster.","The little kid before it was similarly a \"monster.\"","It escaped the wolf’s den only to fall into the tiger’s mouth.","\"You little brat, dare you...\"","\"Of course, I do!\"","Mo Hua, having lost his patience, crushed its head with his foot, stomped it into a puddle of black water, shrouded in Evil Fog.","Afterward, he swung out several golden sword lights, cutting the headless body of the Goat Horn Bull Demon into pieces, then revealed a Fire Formation, burning it all, refining the Evil Thoughts, consuming them directly.","The time was still early; the Taoist Stele remained in repose, so there was no Heavenly Tribulation to \"disinfect,\" making the elimination of Evil Thoughts incomplete.","Thus, he merely performed simple incineration to store all the Evil Thoughts.","When night arrives, he will use the Heavenly Tribulation to erase the Evil God’s will, leaving pure Divine Thought, and even purer Divine Marrow.","With that, he will have Divine Marrow to consume again.","Mo Hua feeling elated, carefully stowed the Five Elements Map, then followed the mountain path, briskly heading towards the Taixu Mountain Gate.","When night falls, he will feast well once more.","And his cultivation, along with the Godslaying Sword, will advance further..."]},{"number":1828,"title":"Chapter 1828 - 908: Mutual Fishing","paragraphs":["Disciple’s Residence, 1 p.m.","Deep night.","Mo Hua meditated on the bed, his Divine Sense delving into the Sea of Consciousness, summoning the Taoist Stele, using the Robbery Thunder on the stele to obliterate the will of the Evil God within the Divine Remains, refining a precious Divine Marrow like flowing gold.","None of the Divine Marrow was left as Mo Hua completely absorbed it all.","The Divine Marrow deepened Mo Hua’s Divine Sense Sublimation.","His Divine Sense further condensed, yet the \"Divinity\" within the Divine Marrow also consumed the \"humanity\" within his Taoist Heart.","Mo Hua held steadfast to his original intentions, while absorbing Divinity, preserved humanity, and melded the Divinity with humanity to soften the drawbacks of devouring the \"Divine Marrow\".","This was an \"insight\" he previously realized, concerning the Divine Way and the Human Dao.","Now, he wondered if it was the transmission from \"Patriarch Dugu\", practicing Supreme Emotion Cutting, severing emotions without losing sentiment, cutting the ego while preserving the true self, severing desires without extinguishing humanity, instead deepening his understanding of the Divine-Human Dao.","Perhaps due to practicing \"Emotion Cutting\", a new Law was introduced into his Divine Thought, and Mo Hua’s absorption of Divine Marrow improved, as the repulsion of Divinity against humanity diminished.","After entirely absorbing the Divine Marrow, the gold on Mo Hua’s Divine Thought became purer.","The wounds on his Divine Sense healed significantly.","The fusion of Tai Xu Sword Intent and Divine Soul deepened.","His Divine Sense Sublimation advanced further.","The bottleneck in his Sea of Consciousness, caused by the spiritual power mutating due to the practice of Heaven Yan Jue, intertwined with the golden Divine Thought to form a Mystery Formation, showed signs of loosening.","Mo Hua nodded with satisfaction.","Divine Marrow is indeed good stuff; as long as he consumes more, all current bottlenecks and obstacles can be solved effortlessly.","The recent hunt for Elder He also proved his plan feasible.","Even though his cultivation was insufficient for him to venture out, he could use the Thunder Magnetism Formation to eavesdrop on intelligence, strategize layouts, and then use the hands of the Taoist Court to hunt down the Golden Core Realm Demon Heads, acquiring the necessary Divine Marrow for himself.","It’s akin to \"playing chess\".","He is the \"chess player,\" and others are the \"pieces.\"","He strategizes, and the Taoist Court \"works.\"","Though calling them \"pieces\" might be excessive.","His relationship with Uncle Gu and the others, in essence, remains mutually beneficial.","In this chess game, he gains Divine Marrow while Uncle Gu and the others obtain merits.","Besides, the Demon Cultivators also got a chance to \"turn over a new leaf,\" and the Evil God’s remains got \"purified,\" so, in summary, everyone has a bright future ahead, one can say it’s a win-win for all.","A \"win-win\" chess game naturally calls for more play.","Mo Hua then continued to monitor the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation of the Demon Sect.","With the death of He Lao Qi, it should theoretically cause some commotion within the Demon Sect.","As anticipated by Mo Hua, in the days following He Lao Qi’s death, the Yuan Magnetic fluctuations were unusually frequent within the Demon Sect, low-level disciples were restless, and discussions were abundant:","...","\"Elder He is actually dead!\"","\"...killed by the Taoist Court!\"","\"How could this be?\"","\"Elder He’s cultivation wasn’t weak, not to mention his ’Crane’ moniker, his body adorned with Monster Patterns, also in crane shape, light as a crane, moving like flying, ordinary Golden Core Cultivators would find it difficult to catch him, let alone kill him...\"","\"It is said that someone leaked information, revealing Elder He’s whereabouts and the flaws in his cultivation technique.\"","\"His abilities targeted so perfectly, naturally led only to ’death’.\"","\"Indeed... once exposed, with the power and methods of the Taoist Court, it’s certainly a death with no survival...\"","\"Those Taoist Court dogs, floating through life daily, but once serious, they are quite troublesome.\"","\"It is said that the person in charge is that cold-faced Supervisor Gu Changhuai.\"","\"That Gu, truly deserves death, sooner or later, to be ground into powder!\"","\"Grinding into powder won’t do, live-skinned and devoured alive is better!\"","...","Mo Hua shook his head.","As a Taoist Court Supervisor, naturally remembered with hatred, it truly puts Uncle Gu in a difficult position.","And truthfully, Uncle Gu is inadvertently taking the blame on his behalf.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but sigh, then continued watching to see if his actions utilizing the Sect Token’s Yuan Magnetic Order would spark any suspicion.","...","\"But come to think of it, Elder He’s death can’t be blamed on others...\"","\"A blade looms over affairs of lust.\"","\"Even a rabbit does not eat the grass near its burrow, yet as an Elder, he took pleasure in the wives of others and only assaulted the partners of disciples...\"","\"Though I am also a Demon Cultivator, already shameless and have done many evil deeds, it still feels somewhat shameless...\"","\"Indeed...\"","\"Blinded by lust, he deserves death.\"","\"Cautious words, this is an Elder, daring to show disrespect...\"","\"But he’s already dead.\"","\"A dead Elder is still an Elder.\"","\"It’s fine to chat idly in the Demon Sect Token, no one sees it unless you report to the Elder...\"","\"We both have leverage against each other through years of acquaintance, so I wouldn’t expose your secret over a trifling matter...\"","\"Then what to fear?\"","...","Seeing this, Mo Hua was somewhat surprised.","Do these Demon Cultivators not know that their conversations could be \"monitored\"?","Is it because they don’t understand the Yuan Magnetic Formation and are unaware of the intricacies within?","Or has the Demon Sect never mentioned it to them?","Or perhaps the Demon Sect itself lacks the means to monitor Yuan Magnetic information?","Mo Hua stroked his chin.","\"I must find a way to figure this out...\"","According to Elder Zheng, if within the Demon Sect, there are only \"application-level\" Yuan Magnetic Formation Masters without more advanced Thunder Magnetic Array Masters, he can operate without restraint and pursue his endeavors boldly."]},{"number":1829,"title":"Chapter 1829 - 908: Mutual Fishing_2","paragraphs":["Tao cultivation knowledge is power.","If you have an absolute advantage in the core mastery of the Formation, you can \"do as you please.\"","Mo Hua eavesdropped on the conversations of other Demon Cultivation Disciples and got a general understanding.","Most Demon Cultivators really know nothing about the Yuan Magnetic Formation, let alone the deeper Thunder Magnetism Formation.","They believe that He Laoqi’s death was due to an insider leaking secrets, thus they are suspicious of each other, hearts full of fear and unrest.","\"No one suspects me,\" Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly, \"then...\"","\"Try killing two more!\"","After that, Mo Hua continued monitoring and searching for clues, and he finally found two Golden Core Demon Cultivators.","Digging for information from within is still quite easy.","Unless the Demon Cultivators do nothing, they will surely reveal their true colors.","These two Golden Cores, one ranked tenth, the other sixth, are referred to as \"Elder Xie\" and \"Elder Zhu,\" respectively.","Elder Zhu is nothing special, but this \"Elder Xie\" has a deadly poison, and like He Laoqi, also bears a Monster Pattern.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel puzzled.","\"The Monster Pattern... why does it resemble the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons so much...\"","\"Could it be that some of the Golden Core Elders in the Demon Sect, are actually Monster cultivators who formed Golden Cores in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons and then ’smuggled’ out over the past few hundred years?\"","The more Mo Hua thought about it, the more plausible it seemed.","However, whether they originated from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons or the Demon Sect, those who should die must die, and Mo Hua didn’t care much.","He gathered the information on \"Elder Xie\" and \"Elder Zhu,\" and then passed them to Gu Changhuai.","Then Mo Hua acted as a \"hands-off manager.\"","After all, he only provided intelligence and a few suggestions, the specifics of how to kill were up to the Taoist Court.","If they managed to kill, he’d get the Divine Marrow.","If they couldn’t, there was nothing he could do.","Fortunately, things went relatively smoothly afterward.","The extermination of the Demon Sect was led by the Taoist Court, and the Qianxue Court Tribunal dared not slack off.","And Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were themselves highly cultivated, borne of family heritage, experienced, and both \"workaholics,\" chasing Demon Cultivators tirelessly.","Adding to them an \"eagerly progressing\" Fan Jin.","Half a month later, those two Golden Core Demons were successively captured, besieged by the Taoist Court, severely injured, and finally executed on the spot by Gu Changhuai using the Five Elements Map.","Sitting comfortably, Mo Hua thus \"effortlessly\" harvested two more Divine Remains.","The Taoist Court’s plan went well.","But the Demon Sect, as a result, was in an uproar.","In just over a month, three Golden Core Elders died!","Three Golden Core Elders!","For the Demon Sect, this was undoubtedly an enormous loss that severely dampened the morale and vitality of the sect.","The key issue was, they still didn’t understand how these three Golden Core Elders died.","The Demon Sect always operated in secrecy; how was it possible for three Golden Core Realm Great Demon cultivators to have their traces precisely located by the Taoist Court, caught slipping, and surrounded and killed without being noticed?","All considered, only the term \"insider\" came to mind.","So within the Demon Sect, unexpectedly but not surprisingly, they began a \"major purge.\"","The Demon Sect started thoroughly investigating from within to find out who betrayed the Sect, leaked information, and caused the deaths of the three Elders.","As long as thorough investigation was conducted, strictly speaking, no one could be \"innocent.\"","Regardless of what the crime was.","Several Demon Cultivation Disciples were interrogated under severe torture, subjected to harsh punishment, even dismembered, cut by sword and blade.","Even among the Golden Core Realm Demon Elders, one died in this purge.","It seemed he was involved in an affair with the top-grade \"concubine\" reared by another highly respected Golden Core Demon, secretly indulging in blood-sucking. When discovered, he couldn’t defend himself and happened to be framed further by others. Knowing he was in the wrong, he attempted to forcibly flee but was directly killed by the furious Demon Head.","For a while, the Demon Sect was in a state of alarm, everyone terrified.","This development shocked Mo Hua greatly.","He himself hadn’t thought that the human heart could be so easily manipulated...","It even made him feel as if he, like his Uncle, was \"toying with\" the human heart.","Of course, he felt he didn’t really do much.","The Demon Sect was suspicious by nature, which could be considered their own doing.","Moreover, these Demon Cultivators had practiced Demon Skills, carrying human lives on their backs; their deaths were not deserving of sympathy.","Mo Hua was happy to watch the drama unfold.","But after observing for a few days, he suddenly noticed something was wrong.","The entire Demon Sect seemed to have suddenly \"quieted down.\"","Messages among Demon Cultivators also became scarce, even when there were conversations, they were brief and often used \"jargon,\" which seemed very difficult to understand.","Mo Hua frowned.","\"Could it be that they’ve... noticed there’s an issue with the Yuan Magnetic Formation of the Demon Sect Token?\"","For some time afterwards, it remained so, with Demon Cultivators rarely using the Demon Sect Token for communication.","Even when they did, what was said was very cryptic.","Some statements were full of errors, which Mo Hua could see at a glance were fabricated. Clearly, they were intentionally spread to deceive \"outsiders.\"","But while they could fool \"outsiders,\" they couldn’t fool Mo Hua.","Mo Hua had overheard too much information; regarding internal matters of the Demon Sect, he was now possibly more \"knowledgeable\" than most Demon Cultivation Disciples.","However, the Demon Sect was too cautious, and for now, he couldn’t get any useful information.","\"It’s a bit troublesome...\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, decided to stabilize things first, avoid the limelight temporarily, and quietly observe the changes for a while before acting.","He took out the Letter Token and sent a message to Gu Changhuai: \"Uncle Gu, the situation has changed, the Demon Sect is too cautious, and it’s temporarily difficult to obtain intelligence.\""]},{"number":1830,"title":"Chapter 1830 - 908: Mutual Fishing (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai: \"Alright, be careful.\"","In Gu Changhuai’s heart, intelligence was never more important than Mo Hua’s safety.","However, he didn’t study formations and didn’t understand the subtleties within, nor did he know that these so-called \"hard-won\" pieces of intelligence were actually Mo Hua sitting at the mountain gate, fiddling with the token every day, without any real danger.","After that, Mo Hua temporarily put the Demon Sect Token aside.","As the magnetic patterns from the Demon Sect’s chatting decreased and became harder to distinguish, he didn’t need to constantly monitor it; just glancing at it occasionally was enough.","He now had more important tasks to do.","Decipher the Mystery Formation, break the bottleneck!","After consuming three \"Divine Remains\" consecutively, Mo Hua realized that the realm of his Divine Sense transformation was barely able to support him in deciphering formations.","He didn’t know if he could solve it completely, but a journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step; even solving part of it would be beneficial.","In this way, his cultivation wouldn’t be at a standstill.","As long as he started deciphering formations and breaking through the bottleneck, he would be gradually moving towards the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Mo Hua sighed.","With only Foundation Building Middle Stage cultivation, being called \"Junior Brother\" by a group of Foundation Establishment Late Stage junior brothers every day was very pressuring.","No one could understand his kind of pain; only someone who had personally been a \"Junior Brother\" could truly experience it.","\"The sooner I break through, the sooner I reach the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.\"","Mo Hua thought with determination.","After that, apart from daily classes, cultivation, and sword practice, he spent most of his time deciphering the Divine Thought Puzzle Array and breaking through the bottleneck of the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","This process was somewhat complicated, but from a formation level, it wasn’t particularly difficult.","After all, with his current formation standards, especially his deep expertise in second-grade arrays, he was well above others even in the genius-filled Qian Learning State Boundary.","In the following days, Mo Hua calmly deciphered formations.","In half a month, he had solved a third, but the further he went, the slower the progress became, and the more laborious he found it.","Mo Hua knew this was due to insufficient Divine Sense transformation.","Mo Hua paused for a moment in silence, then opened the Demon Sect Token again, pondering whether to kill a few Golden Cores and consume a few Divine Remains to enhance his transformation realm.","By his estimation, two more would suffice.","Killing two more Golden Core Demon Cultivators, consuming the Divine Remains they carried, and refining the Divine Marrow should be enough for him to break through to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","\"But the previous ruckus was too big; the Demon Sect is already on alert. Not sure if the heat has died down...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and thought, \"Let’s give it a try.\"","He manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to dive into the Demon Sect Token to observe the situation.","Indeed, after more than half a month, it seemed that the heat had passed a bit, and everything seemed to be getting better.","There were also demon cultivators starting to chat through the Demon Sect Token, although the frequency wasn’t high, it was much better than during the tense period before.","Moreover, their conversation content didn’t have any taboos.","Mo Hua was slightly delighted.","The opportunity had come.","He then skillfully manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, weaving through the information-rich Yuan Magnetic Sea at the base of the Demon Sect Token, stealing magnetic patterns, decoding information, and observing to decide which Golden Core he could target for the Divine Marrow...","After two days of searching, Mo Hua finally identified a candidate through the magnetic pattern information:","This was an elder marked with a Dog Pattern.","Within the Demon Sect, he was addressed as \"Elder Dog,\" and although his cultivation didn’t seem particularly strong, he was a trusted aide of the Demon Sect leader, skilled in making strategies, pushing forth many matters from the shadows.","\"Dog Patterned Demon Head...\"","\"Doghead Think Tank?\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself.","He then continued to manipulate the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to steal magnetic patterns, trying to find more clues about this \"Doghead Think Tank.\"","But as he searched and searched, Mo Hua suddenly paused, frowning.","Something’s not right...","The Doghead Think Tank, known for its strategic skills... how could such a character be easily exposed?","Moreover, the Demon Sect had just undergone a \"great purge,\" and even if the heat had died down after just over half a month, it couldn’t be that someone would dare to casually discuss Golden Core Elders and provide such obvious clues.","There’s something fishy...","Mo Hua became alert.","He thought for a moment, letting the Thunder Magnetic Miniature hide within the Yuan Magnetic Sea, then focused himself on perceiving the subtle Thunder Magnetic flows among the Yuan Magnetic Patterns.","Initially, things seemed calm and unpredictable; Mo Hua patiently continued to sense.","Focusing intently for nearly two hours, Mo Hua finally detected an unusual \"Thunder Magnetic\" flow among the magnetic patterns.","With his Divine Sense transformation and expertise in Calculation and Tricky Calculation, also having used Back Origin Calculation to trace out a prototype of a Thunder Magnetic Source Pattern, specifically that Thunder Magnetic Miniature,","this gave his perception of Thunder Magnets a sensitivity beyond an ordinary Formation Master.","This unusual \"Thunder Magnetic\" flow wasn’t originally present in the Demon Sect Token.","If something unexpected occurs, there must be a demon involved.","Mo Hua could almost conclude:","\"Someone is using me as bait, trying to fish me out!\"","The supposed lull was just a façade; perhaps the Demon Sect had even realized that there was a problem with the underlying formation of their Demon Sect Token.","Yet, the Demon Sect Token was of great importance, and they couldn’t just stop using it. Therefore, they probably invited a Formation Master to investigate the issue within the Yuan Magnetic Array.","And this person, able to induce such deep Thunder Magnetic changes, must be a highly skilled \"Thunder Magnetic Array Master.\"","A master!","Mo Hua felt a slight chill in his heart.","He then inspected his Thunder Magnetic Miniature and discovered that his self-derived \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\" unknowingly had picked up some foreign \"Secondary Thunder Patterns.\"","These Secondary Thunder Patterns weren’t originally part of his Back Origin formation process.","They were collected when encountering those strange Thunder Magents in the Magnetic Sea.","This was a kind of \"mark,\" or it could be said to be a type of \"virus.\"","Someone wanted to force his Thunder Magnetic Miniature to \"show itself,\" or perhaps, intended to use some Thunder Magnetic means to \"eradicate\" it...","Mo Hua’s gaze hardened, and he immediately manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to leave the Yuan Magnetic Sea, closing the interface, erasing the serial magnetic patterns in the Demon Sect Token, severing its connection to the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation, and isolating all Thunder Magnetic flows, finally exhaling in relief.","Afterward, Mo Hua took out a clean Jade Slip, placing the Thunder Magnetic Miniature inside, examining its \"Secondary Thunder Patterns\" one by one.","The strange Thunder Magnetic Patterns were directly wiped out.","The vague Secondary Thunder Patterns were re-originated.","Thus, resetting the Secondary Thunder Patterns of the Thunder Magnetic Miniature from start to finish, thoroughly \"cleaning\" them, confirming it was now \"spotless\" and \"clean,\" only then did he feel completely at ease.","Subsequently, Mo Hua’s expression became serious.","He realized that he might have unknowingly stepped into another realm:","The realm of Thunder Magnetic Array Masters’ confrontation.","Experts in thunder magnets among formation masters, manipulating formations and controlling thunder magnets, interfering with each other, and engaging in attack and defense, clashing within the minuscule magnetic patterns, embarking on battles of Thunder Magnetic invasion and counter-invasion..."]},{"number":1831,"title":"Chapter 1831 - 909: Unadorned Thunder Magnetism Battle","paragraphs":["The Battle of Thunder Magnetism!","This is a clash between Formation Master experts!","Mo Hua’s expression was solemn, his fighting spirit gradually soaring, but after pondering for a moment, he realized a serious problem:","He didn’t know what to do in a Thunder Magnetism confrontation...","He had never formally learned Thunder Magnetism formations, nor had he ever faced off against another Thunder Magnetism Formation Master, lacking any relevant experience and not knowing how to counter the enemy or conduct attacks and defenses between Thunder Magnetism.","Mo Hua thought about reinserting the Thunder Magnetic Miniature into the bottom layer of the Original Magnet Compound Formation.","But on second thought, he hesitated.","Even if he put it back in, what good would it do?","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature could only eavesdrop on information and alter some magnetic patterns; it had no real offensive or defensive capabilities and would instead be targeted by enemy \"Thunder Magnetism,\" getting contaminated and resulting in more harm than good.","As for the opposing Thunder Magnetism Formation Master, whoever they were, wherever they were, what means they were using, what they aimed to achieve with these Thunder Magnetisms, and how they would target him, Mo Hua had no clue.","Some knowledge may not be hard to learn.","But if you don’t know it, you simply don’t know it, no matter how hard you rack your brains.","This is the \"barrier\" between different fields of Tao Cultivation knowledge.","Currently, between Mo Hua and this Thunder Magnetism expert, there was just such a \"barrier.\"","The opponent was clearly a seasoned Thunder Magnetism Formation Master, proficient in Thunder Magnetism formations, with comprehensive experience and insights into Thunder Magnetism inspection, selection, attacks, and defenses.","These were all things Mo Hua did not possess.","As long as he \"maintained\" the Demon Sect’s foundational Original Magnet formation, Mo Hua would likely not have any more opportunities to slip in again to eavesdrop on information or steal permissions in the future.","Even if he managed to sneak in, he would have to act like \"a rat crossing the street,\" treading on thin ice, and if not careful, once detected by him, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature could be in danger.","\"The problem is quite serious...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","He thought about it and realized this was beyond his capability to resolve.","When in doubt, one must ask.","And amongst the people he knew, there were more skilled experts.","So a few days later, he once again met with Elder Zheng at a teahouse in Tai Xu City to discuss formation knowledge over tea.","\"Thunder Magnetism attack and defense?\"","Listening to Mo Hua’s question, Elder Zheng was somewhat surprised as he sipped his tea.","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I was idle and pondered the principles of Original Magnet and Thunder Magnetism, and suddenly thought of this question...\"","\"Original Magnet is a surface application, Thunder Magnetism is a deep principle, using Thunder Magnetism, one can generate, transmit, and alter magnetic patterns. So if two Formation Masters are both proficient in Thunder Magnetism principles, does that mean they can both alter magnetic patterns in the same Original Magnet formation, contest permissions, and engage in attack and defense?\"","Idle...","Elder Zheng couldn’t help but ask, \"Don’t you have other formation studies?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I’ve learned almost all the Second Grade, so I’m just looking for something I haven’t studied...\"","Elder Zheng was stunned, then nodded helplessly.","If another disciple had said this, he would certainly think they were aiming too high.","But when Mo Hua said it, he only felt that Mo Hua was seeking truth realistically, and also had ambition.","Since every other formation topic had already been discussed, talking about some Thunder Magnetism knowledge to broaden Mo Hua’s understanding ahead of time wouldn’t be bad.","Elder Zheng took a sip of tea and then said to Mo Hua:","\"So-called Thunder Magnetism attack and defense have specific formation regulations...\"","\"The terms Thunder and Magnetism are actually one and the same. Where there’s Thunder, there’s Magnetism, and vice versa. One can use Thunder Flow to influence magnetic patterns, and conversely, use magnetic patterns to generate specific Thunder Flows.\"","\"The Thunder Magnetic Array is thus conceived from Magnetism creating Thunder.\"","\"This ’Thunder’ is the traces left by the Secondary Thunder Flow, which is then known as the Secondary Thunder Pattern.\"","\"A Formation Master skilled in Thunder Magnetism forms various Thunder Flows via the Thunder Magnetic Array, using these Thunder Flows for magnetic pattern theft, alteration, attack, defense, inspection, and screening, etc...\"","\"Thunder Magnetic Array Masters rely on formations as the foundation, divine sense as the base, computational power as the core, Secondary Thunder Patterns as the blade, with the Original Magnet Array as the battleground, engaging in combat.\"","\"The essence of this confrontation is essentially a battle of formation attainment, Thunder Magnetism comprehension, divine sense depth, divine sense calculation power, and each other’s mental strategy.\"","\"This is a war waged microcosmically within Thunder Magnetism, unseen like smoke from gunfire...\"","Mo Hua suddenly became enlightened, a trace of shock in his heart.","Elder Zheng said: \"But such contention must remain obscured, as I told you before...\"","\"Anything involving Thunder Magnetism necessarily involves secrecy, and all conflicts can only occur within Thunder Magnetism; once exposed, it’s easy to invite disaster that leads to death.\"","\"I’m telling you these things in hopes that you’ll progress in formations. If you invite calamity upon yourself for learning Thunder Magnetism formations in the future, it would be my fault.\"","Elder Zheng, eager to preserve talents, remarked appreciatively.","Mo Hua earnestly nodded, \"Elder Zheng, rest assured, I will surely bear this in mind.\"","Elder Zheng slightly nodded, \"That’s good.\"","Afterward, they talked for a while longer, and Mo Hua asked for clarification on the parts he didn’t understand.","Elder Zheng explained bit by bit, in great detail.","So it went, until evening, with Mo Hua, full of new insights, gratefully bidding farewell to Elder Zheng.","Upon returning to the Taixu Gate, Mo Hua, following his usual practice, transcribed the insights Elder Zheng had imparted regarding the Thunder Magnetism formations onto a Jade Slip, then earnestly read and carefully contemplated them.","Elder Zheng, truly well-educated with profound expertise, was a Fourth-grade Array Master skilled in Thunder Skill, and his guidance was thorough and insightful.","Mo Hua learned much again.","He also realized the similarities and differences between ordinary Thunder Magnetism Formation Masters and himself.","Ordinary Thunder Magnetism Formation Masters usually master a complete system of Thunder Magnetism formations, using formations to invoke changes in Thunder Magnetism to control Secondary Thunder Patterns to achieve altering magnetic patterns or using Original Magnet for attack and defense effects."]},{"number":1832,"title":"Chapter 1832 - 909: Simple Thunder Magnetism Battle_2","paragraphs":["But I am different.","I currently don’t know the Thunder Magnetism Formation.","The way I alter the Original Magnet is not through the Thunder Magnetism Formation, but by bypassing the formation and directly returning to the source of the more fundamental Secondary Thunder Pattern, reverting the Secondary Thunder Pattern to the form of a \"Source Pattern\" of the Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","Others use the Thunder Magnetism Formation, I use the Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","The Thunder Magnetism Formation is strong in its inherited standards, comprehensive system, and diverse functions, being a complete and mature formation system.","In comparison, the strongest aspect of my Thunder Magnetic Miniature lies in its use of \"Back Origin Calculation,\" \"Formation Flow,\" and \"Source Pattern,\" a set of theories regarding the origin stream of formations that the Five Elements Sect does not pass on and even labels as \"forbidden.\"","From the formation principle level, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, or rather the \"Secondary Thunder Source Pattern,\" is evidently more advanced.","But the problem is that my cultivation level is too low.","The Five Elements Sect exhausted the entire Sect’s power to return to the Five Elements Source Pattern.","However, I am alone, with limited Divine Sense and computational power, insufficient experience, short time, shallow research, and fewer returned formation patterns.","This \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\" is currently only a prototype with relatively simple functions. Although the future is promising, at this stage, it cannot compete with the orthodoxly inherited Thunder Magnetic Array Masters.","In this confrontation of thunder and magnetism, it seems I stand no chance...","Moreover, since the opponent is proficient in the Thunder Magnetism Formation, even if it’s a Second Grade Thunder Magnetism Array, they would need at least Golden Core cultivation.","A Golden Core Cultivator, with at least twenty patterns of Divine Sense, possesses stronger Divine Sense than I do.","He knows Thunder Magnetism Formation, I do not.","I have the Thunder Magnetic Miniature but cannot attack or defend.","Furthermore, the confrontation between thunder and magnetism also involves the application of the Thunder Magnetism Array, requiring the accumulation of formation experience, which in itself is profound.","And these are my disadvantages.","Mo Hua sighed after much contemplation.","He had to admit, he indeed was not as skilled as others.","In this thunder and magnetism war, normally, he would not be able to win at all...","Mo Hua felt a bit distressed.","The breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage was just two Divine Remains away, and even the day to complete the Godslaying Sword was not far...","At this moment, this Thunder Magnetic Array Master just happened to be in his way, leaving him helpless.","\"I need to think of a way...\"","But no matter how he thought about it, with his current thunder magnetism level, he was still no match for this Thunder Magnetism Array Master.","Mo Hua racked his brains for a long time and finally came up with a method:","Take out this Thunder Magnetic Array Master!","If he couldn’t win over him in the Thunder Magnetism Formation, then he’d kill him in reality.","If a problem can’t be solved, then solve the person causing the problem!","Find a way, use thunder magnetism tracing and positioning, find the position of this Thunder Magnetic Array Master, then call Uncle Gu and Sister Xia, and take him down together.","In high-level thunder magnetism battles, often the most straightforward means suffice.","Two tigers cannot share one mountain.","A single Original Magnet Compound Formation cannot accommodate two Thunder Magnetic Array Masters.","With him around, I can’t play at all.","This Thunder Magnetic Array Master must die.","Moreover, he works for the Demon Sect, deserving ten thousand deaths.","The problem, however, is that Thunder Magnetism tracing and Original Magnet positioning are also quite high-level formation knowledge...","So, Mo Hua specially consulted Elder Zheng.","Elder Zheng answered all his questions.","Mo Hua also took the opportunity to subtly verify his guess about the Thunder Magnetic Array Master, and upon receiving a positive response, he returned satisfied.","After returning to the Sect, Mo Hua meticulously considered his plan from start to finish:","Firstly, was the problem of Original Magnet positioning.","The Demon Sect Token carried by the Demon Cultivators often changes its location, making it possible but difficult to locate.","Moreover, locating the Demon Sect Token requires operating from the central formation pivot of the Original Magnet Compound Formation.","The Original Magnet Compound Formation pertains to the core of the entire Demon Sect, very hidden, and its position will not easily be revealed.","Mo Hua currently does not have the capability to steal the core authority and locate the central formation pivot of the Original Magnet.","Therefore, the Demon Sect Token and the lower-level Original Magnet Compound Formation cannot be located for now.","But the position of the opposing Thunder Magnetic Array Master can be traced.","Mo Hua asked Elder Zheng and learned that the construction of a Thunder Magnetism Formation has a set of complex procedures.","The whole set of formation media, formation patterns, formation pivot, formation eye... The cost is high, and the structure is precise, integrated with each other. Once set up, unless it’s to completely transfer, it won’t be relocated easily.","This means that the Thunder Magnetic Array Master, along with all his \"thunder magnetism\" family assets, is currently situated in the Qian Learning State Boundary or a small nearby domain, in some hidden place.","According to another point said by Elder Zheng: Thunder Magnetic Array Masters are not to be disclosed.","Therefore, Mo Hua could also deduce that this Thunder Magnetic Array Master is single-handedly, isolated from others.","Even the Righteous Sect harbors a certain dread towards Thunder Magnetic Array Masters, not to mention the naturally suspicious and murderous Demon Sect.","In the Demon Sect, this Thunder Magnetic Array Master would certainly not easily expose himself.","He most likely won’t have too much contact with Demon Cultivators, and they may not have even seen each other much, keeping only necessary contact methods.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, nodding his head, believing that his guess should be correct.","Then he began, according to Elder Zheng’s method, to use Thunder Flow tracing to perform \"Original Magnet\" positioning.","He first took out the map of the Qianxue State Boundary and its surroundings, then marked his position on the map.","After that, he began to orientate.","He infiltrated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature into the Demon Sect Token, perceiving the direction of the peculiar Thunder Magnetism flow.","Thunder Magnetism is also a kind of worldly energy. Since it circulates in the world, scattered among all things, it cannot be without direction."]},{"number":1833,"title":"Chapter 1833 - 909: Simple Thunder Magnetism Battle_3","paragraphs":["Orienteering is something that can be both difficult and simple to explain.","For someone like Mo Hua, who can control the Thunder Magnetic Miniature and sense the flow of Thunder Magnetism, it isn’t hard.","If not, then it becomes very difficult.","Because the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation is still under the \"surveillance\" of the other side, Mo Hua is extremely cautious in manipulating the Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","He hides the Thunder Magnetic Miniature in the Magnetic Pattern Sea, revealing it only once every quarter-hour to sense before immediately hiding it again.","Spending more than half a day on this, Mo Hua roughly pinpointed a southeastern direction on the map.","But that direction was still too vague, and he needed to leave the sect for on-site investigation, then further confirm the location from multiple angles.","Mo Hua originally planned to go after the monthly rest period, but considering the urgency, he requested two days off.","Now, reaching the late stage of Foundation Establishment is more important.","Missing a day or two of Foundation Establishment Late Stage coursework won’t be a problem.","The request didn’t bother Elder Master Xun; Elder Song agreed directly, and even thoughtfully asked if two days were enough or if he needed an elder to accompany him.","Mo Hua said it was unnecessary.","However, he later found out there was still a Golden Core Elder stealthily following him, likely ordered by the sect to protect him secretly.","Mo Hua was somewhat touched, so he didn’t expose the elder, allowing him to follow quietly.","He himself left the Qianxue state boundary, and after climbing over mountains, he stopped at a location, took out his token, used the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to sense the flow of Thunder Magnetism, determine the orientation, and made some marks on the map.","For two days straight, without sleeping day or night, Mo Hua traveled all over the southeast, northwest, finally circling a desolate mountain.","This is a Nameless Mountain.","There were no cultivators nearby, and it was very barren, overgrown with vegetation.","Mo Hua hid himself again, found several spots, sensed the flow of Thunder Magnetism, and pinpointed a location in the mountain, finally settling on a hilltop.","Near the hilltop were countless Yuan Magnetic Formations that were hard for ordinary people to detect.","It was evident that hidden within the hilltop was a formation master skilled in Yuan Magnetic Formations.","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, but without alarming anyone, he immediately returned to the sect.","After returning to the sect, he sent the location to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, southeast of the Qianxue state boundary, north of Solitary Mountain City, there’s a Nameless Mountain here harboring a Golden Core Formation Master of the Demon Sect.\"","\"This person is extremely crucial and must be killed.\"","Once the opposing formation master was killed, no one would be in his way anymore...","Mo Hua thought to himself silently.","Gu Changhuai replied: \"Okay.\"","Having been through several previous hunts of Demon Sect Golden Core cultivators, Gu Changhuai now trusted Mo Hua’s intelligence implicitly and responded simply and directly.","Mo Hua also shared some nearby precautions with Gu Changhuai.","Especially concerning the Yuan Magnetic Formations.","\"This person is adept at Yuan Magnetism, and the area is filled with Yuan Magnetic Formations. Any sign of disturbance might be detected, so extreme caution is necessary.\"","\"At that time, I will use some means to attract the formation master’s attention, allowing you to seize the opportunity for a quick strike.\"","\"Moreover, you can kill the person, but try to leave some formations and formation media, if possible, as I could make use of them...\"","...","Mo Hua gave a long list of instructions.","Gu Changhuai noted them all down, then hesitated: \"Everything else is fine, but regarding the formations and formation media, if they have connections to the Demon Sect, the Taoist Court might confiscate them for public use.\"","\"Can’t keep them?\"","\"It’s hard to explain...\"","\"Isn’t this matter under you and Sister Xia’s responsibility? Who else do you need to explain to?\"","Gu Changhuai paused for a moment, then sighed: \"Alright, I’ll see what I can do...\"","\"Hmm hmm.\"","Afterward, the Taoist Court began preparations, and a few days later, preparations were complete, and they started the operation, coincidentally during the monthly rest.","Mo Hua initially didn’t want to go, but after some thought, he couldn’t help but be attached to that set of Thunder Magnetic Formations and formation media which, though not his yet, could very likely be his soon.","Mo Hua decided to go personally.","This time he did not hide or cover up and directly asked Elder Xun Ziyou to accompany him, saying the Taoist Court had a task, and he needed assistance as he was going out.","Elder Xun Ziyou worried about Mo Hua’s safety, thus understandably ended up as his \"bodyguard\" once more.","On the day of the operation, the weather was fair and sunny.","The group arrived at the Nameless Mountain, and the Taoist Court lay in ambush nearby, awaiting Mo Hua’s command.","Mo Hua found a picturesque spot from a distance, took out the Demon Sect Token, accessed the Returning to the Source Jade Slip, manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, infiltrating the bottom layer of the Demon Sect’s Yuan Magnetic Formation.","This time he boldly infiltrated with no concealment.","And in the instant he exposed the Thunder Magnetic Miniature in the Yuan Magnetic Sea.","Inside the Nameless Mountain.","In a dim stony chamber.","A black-clad formation master with sparse hair, narrow eyes, and a sinister face suddenly opened his eyes wide and spoke in a venomous tone:","\"Damn it, finally caught it showing its hand!\"","\"That bastard, he really knows how to hide!\"","For all these days, he watched the Thunder Magnetic Formation day and night, wanting to unearth this troublesome \"calamity.\"","But this time, the trajectory of the thunder flow was very peculiar.","Unlike anything he’d encountered before, and wickedly cunning, it would pop up, and before he could catch a trace, it would shrink back again.","The fifty thousand spirit stone deal couldn’t be botched.","Even though he was employed by the Demon Sect, those of them who roam in the gray areas would do anything for spirit stones.","\"Damn pest, now that you’ve shown your hand, where do you think you can hide?\"","The black-clad formation master quickly focused all his senses, directing his attention to the highly sophisticated Thunder Magnetic Array Plate made of Yuan Magnetic Jade, and began tracing to capture that anomalous secondary thunder flow within the Demon Sect Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation.","But no matter how hard he tried, he still couldn’t grasp it.","This secondary thunder flow seemed to possess \"life\" of its own, moving with incredible agility, flitting through the Magnetic Sea, darting around like an elusive eel, making it difficult to catch.","Occasionally, it would stop, cause trouble, and smear some patterns, as if provocative.","The black-clad formation master felt a surge of anger.","\"Humiliate me? Damn it!\"","Most formation masters are proud, and the more capable they are, the more this is true; they cannot stand such \"mockery\" at the level of formations.","The black-clad formation master no longer held back, pouring all his divine sense and attention into the Yuan Magnetic Sea.","The formation patterns on the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate shimmered with blue light, as bright as they could be.","With the black-clad formation master going all out, he finally captured that secondary thunder flow.","Gradually, an image of the \"culprit\" lurking at the bottom layer of the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation, altering magnetic patterns, and causing trouble emerged on the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate.","A... tiny being formed purely by Thunder Magnetism...","A human figure?","A human figure?!","\"What... is this?!\"","The black-clad formation master was stunned for a moment, pupils suddenly contracting, and he said in a trembling voice of disbelief:","\"It’s not secondary thunder patterns, but a human figure?!\"","\"Why would there be such a thing at the bottom of a Yuan Magnetic layer?!\"","\"What kind of Thunder Magnetism Formation could give birth to this seemingly life-like, self-moving thunder magnetism ’human figure’?!\"","The black-clad formation master felt a chill in his heart, and suddenly realized something.","Legacy!!","This must be a supreme Thunder Magnetism Legacy!","It might even lead to creating divine sense and crafting life through formations!","\"I must get it! By any means necessary, even death can’t stop me!\"","The black-clad formation master’s eyes flashed red immediately."]},{"number":1834,"title":"Chapter 1834 - 910: An Unworthy Victory","paragraphs":["No one understands better than him the preciousness of Lei Ci inheritance.","He naturally knows too, the comprehension of Formation, the derivation of Divine Sense, the creation of life, even if it’s just a \"prototype,\" even if it’s just an empty shell, what it ultimately signifies.","The black-clothed Formation Master’s entire being was burning with a fiery desire.","\"I must get it, I must definitely get it...\"","This thought instantly occupied all of his mind.","He suppressed his excited heart, with trembling hands, playing with the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, pushing the Thunder Magnetic Power to the extreme, sensing the aura of the \"Thunder Magnetic Shadow,\" and then locating it on the Map of the Qian Learning State Boundary, attempting to trace the source of this aura, to find out who exactly is controlling this Thunder Magnetic Shadow.","This Thunder Magnetic Shadow contains supreme Formation Dao, extremely mysterious, yet quite raw and immature, clearly just recently born.","The person controlling this Thunder Magnetic Shadow must also be a \"novice\" just entering the Thunder Magnetic Dao.","Otherwise, he definitely wouldn’t have, with such crude methods, foolishly exposed this Thunder Magnetic creation.","The black-clothed Formation Master could instantly deduce.","This foolish Formation Master, who had \"struck gold,\" obtained some top-grade Thunder Magnetic inheritance by sheer luck and, without mastering it, showed it off.","Truly oblivious to the danger! Not even understanding the principle of coveting treasures.","Fortunately, he encountered me...","As long as I locate him through the Original Magnet sensing, kill him, and seize his inheritance.","Then this incredibly mysterious Thunder Magnetic Shadow will be mine!","This is my greatest opportunity in life.","This opportunity is so great, it even far surpasses the time years ago when my master valued me and guided me to step into the gateway of this Thunder Magnetic Array Path.","The black-clothed Formation Master was overjoyed in his heart.","He continued to focus entirely, tinkering with the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate in front of him, with Thunder Patterns constantly moving, Original Magnets continuously aligning, finally, bit by bit, consolidating the position of the Original Magnet...","After an unknown amount of time, the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate lit up, Original Magnets consolidated into a point.","The black-clothed Formation Master’s body trembled, a look of ecstatic joy on his face:","\"Caught it!\"","He immediately focused his eyes to look, but as he did, his expression froze, his brows gradually furrowed.","\"Wrong location?\"","\"Why is the position identified... myself?\"","The black-clothed Formation Master checked the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, his Divine Thought moved slightly, replaying the events in his mind.","\"The array plate has no problem, Thunder Magnetic is stable, positioning is not off...","The black-clothed Formation Master murmured, suddenly dumbfounded, his pupils gradually expanding, a surge of terror rushed over him.","\"It’s me... who was calculated against...\"","It wasn’t me capturing someone else, but someone was fishing for me!","At this moment, a thunderous sound rose, and the stone wall collapsed.","A brilliant Wind Blade directly pierced through the air, hitting the black-clothed Formation Master’s chest before he could react.","In the meantime, a cold gleam flashed by, the sword tip pierced through his shoulder.","A brawny man wielding double hammers also charged in, swinging the two hammers towards his head.","In addition, there were two Golden Core Cultivators, assisting on the side.","A total of five Golden Core Stewards!","The black-clothed Formation Master spat out a mouthful of fresh blood, his face turning ashen instantly.","Only then did he realize, in this Thunder Magnetic contention, he was facing a \"ruthless and unscrupulous\" despicable person!","He used that profoundly mysterious Thunder Magnetic Miniature to lure me, baiting me into the trap, concentrating my entire mind on that Thunder Magnetic Shadow, thereby neglecting the surrounding environment, and unaware, was directly ambushed and trapped in the stone chamber.","\"Damn, got caught in the gutter! Who the hell set me up? Even found as many as five Golden Cores?\"","\"How can there be such shameless people in this world?\"","The black-clothed Formation Master cursed inwardly.","But at this moment, he could only rage impotently.","In battle between Formation Masters, strength lies in calculating without the other’s knowledge, setting formations for ambush, luring them into the trap, using the power of formations to render the others helpless.","But if the Formation Master was calculated against, and someone got close, that most likely spells \"death.\"","Moreover, those besieging him now were five composed and experienced Golden Core Stewards.","The black-clothed Formation Master was filled with hatred.","But Gu Changhuai and the others didn’t give him a chance to react, directly urging their Magical Treasures and Spells to launch an attack.","The black-clothed Formation Master could only exhaust his full strength, activating his Magical Treasures, while relying on the remaining formations to delay time.","But in the face of a beating by five Golden Core Cultivators, these methods were nothing more than desperately clinging to life...","...","In the distance, Mo Hua was watching the spectacle.","This is a Third-Grade State Boundary, where Golden Cores act with full force, not only unleashing Third-grade Golden Core-level Spiritual Power, crystalline like crystals, but also activating their own Magical Treasures, with every move more powerful, the range wider, and the momentum greater.","Mo Hua hadn’t watched much of such Golden Core battles before, so he wanted to observe closely, to learn and study.","After all, after breaking through the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, he could look forward to the Golden Core.","To see in advance, to experience, to understand, is also a good thing.","Elder Xun Ziyou stood within three feet of Mo Hua, acting as a \"bodyguard,\" to prevent any accidents and to protect the \"treasure\" of the Taixu Gate from being harmed by anyone, or any Spiritual Artifact or Spell.","Now he was already certain.","Mo Hua’s life is even more precious than that of himself, a Golden Core Elder.","The Ancestor would rather have him lose an arm than let Mo Hua lose a hair.","Even now, he himself felt this way.","And with Elder Xun Ziyou as a bodyguard, Mo Hua watched the scene more at ease."]},{"number":1835,"title":"Chapter 1835 - 910: An Unfair Victory (Part 2)","paragraphs":["He didn’t look for long.","The Golden Core Stewards from the Taoist Court, among them Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official from Great Families, five against one, already set a scene of dominance.","Coupled with Mo Hua’s detailed intelligence, and to ensure safety beforehand, they used the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to attract the Formation Master’s attention, leaving him with no time to care for other things.","Under such an advantageous condition, in just over ten rounds, the black-clad Formation Master was defeated.","The Steward with the massive hammer disabled his four limbs, Gu Changhuai used the Five Elements Map to cover his face, and Xia Canonical Official pierced his heart with one sword, ending his life.","That black-clad Formation Master died in utter humiliation.","Even in death, he never saw Mo Hua’s face, nor did he know who it was that trapped him to death.","Of course, if he knew it was a small Foundation Establishment disciple who trapped him, he might have died from anger had he not been killed.","The black-clad Formation Master died, but Mo Hua was not yet satisfied.","After half an hour, confirming that the Formation Master was truly dead and there were no other demon cultivator accomplices nearby, he stepped forward.","The black-clad Formation Master died a miserable death, his limbs were destroyed, his chest pierced, and he was frozen stiff, his eyes wide open as if he died with everlasting regret.","Yet, there was no sign of the Divine Remains parasitizing him, which was somewhat unfortunate.","Previously, Mo Hua had hesitated over whether to kill him.","But considering it, he still felt that a dead opponent was the best kind of opponent, otherwise, he would have to engage in mind games with him.","Mind games are indeed exhausting, and he currently did not have the time for that.","Mo Hua nodded.","No matter what, this Thunder Magnetic Array Master is now dead.","As a half-step \"Thunder Magnetic Array Master,\" his first encounter on Thunder Magnetism was a victory, and it was a \"victory\" against a Golden Core!","Although it was somewhat a victory without virtue, a victory without virtue is still a victory.","This was something his father, Mo Shan, a seasoned Monster Hunter, had taught him since childhood.","Mo Hua always remembered it.","On the other side, the Taoist Court was searching and dealing with the aftermath.","After a while, Gu Changhuai came over and said to Mo Hua:","\"I just verified, this person’s appearance is not on the Taoist Court’s wanted list.\"","\"He must have either altered his appearance or hidden himself well.\"","Mo Hua looked down at the Formation Master’s face:","The face was sinister, looking aloof and unfriendly, and very unfamiliar, importantly, his hair was very sparse.","\"I wonder if all Thunder Magnetic Array Masters lose their hair...\" Mo Hua muttered in his heart, then asked, \"Is he a member of the Demon Sect?\"","Gu Changhuai replied: \"The cultivation technique he practiced is legitimate, but his spiritual power is somewhat tainted, clearly having learned some unconventional things halfway through.\"","\"In his storage bag, there are some materials for an evil formation.\"","\"Even if he’s not from the Demon Sect, there must be ties.\"","\"And several of his jade slips include records of past associations with demon cultivators and evil cultivators, likely employing his formation mastery to be hired by the Demon Sect, conducting unlawful acts for rewards.\"","\"Now that he’s dead, he’s rid of a major threat as well.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Then the Taoist Court continued clearing nearby stone chambers, confiscating items, and about two hours later, finished the aftermath.","This left only one final matter: the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate and some Thunder Magnetic Arrays.","These were what Mo Hua \"pointedly\" wanted.","Gu Changhuai was prepared to hand these things over to Mo Hua.","Canon Official Xia, who was quite familiar with Mo Hua, treated him as one of the \"group,\" knowing the intelligence on the Demon Sect was all provided by Mo Hua; thus, taking some array plates and diagrams as a reward seemed only fair, so he said nothing.","The brawny Steward adept with twin hammers, Fan Jin, was an external appointee, also hoped for pointers from Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, so he, too, turned a blind eye.","However, the other two Stewards had significant comments.","They also hailed from great families within the Qianxue state boundary, one from the Xiao family.","As Stewards, should they wish to advance further, they would inevitably face competition with Gu Changhuai, hence they would not hold back when issues arise.","One of them spoke:","\"These array plates and formations are the illicit goods of this Demon Sect Formation Master and should rightfully be confiscated. Is Supervisor Gu’s move not somewhat against regulations?\"","Gu Changhuai fell silent.","Because it indeed was against regulations...","Just as he was pondering what to say, Mo Hua briskly said to Xun Ziyou:","\"Elder Xun, this thief stole things from our Taixu Sect, should we not take them back?\"","Xun Ziyou was stunned.","Things from our Taixu Sect?","Mo Hua discreetly nudged Xun Ziyou with his elbow.","Xun Ziyou immediately realized, \"Oh, yes, things from our Taixu Sect...\"","His gaze deepened, the sword intent of the Golden Core Realm formidable, and his presence suddenly profound, solemnly saying:","\"This thief is brazen beyond measure, daring to steal our Taixu Sect’s array legacy, truly deserving death. The things he stole, naturally, should be taken back.\"","The other two Stewards were taken aback at his words.","\"Elder Xun, are your words true?\"","Xun Ziyou’s face turned slightly cold: \"Otherwise, if it weren’t for the Taixu Sect’s legacy here, would I, an elder of the Eight Great Gates, have the leisure to come to this remote wilderness to watch you capture demon cultivators?\"","\"This...\"","The two Stewards hesitated.","In such words...seemingly also true.","Apprehending demon cultivators was the responsibility of the Taoist Court, and if it weren’t related to the Taixu Sect, he, a busy True Transmission Elder, certainly wouldn’t have the leisure to meddle in such affairs.","However, it all felt somewhat incongruous to them at the moment.","Xun Ziyou’s countenance grew entirely cold, \"How, does your Taoist Court intend to detain the legacy of our Taixu Sect?\"","The other two Golden Core Stewards, upon hearing this, felt a tremor in their hearts, quickly cupping their hands:","\"Elder Xun, please forgive us, that was not our intention...\""]},{"number":1836,"title":"Chapter 1836 - 910: An Unfair Victory (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Taixu Gate ranks among the Eight Great Gates.","Naturally, they dared not withhold the inheritance of Taixu Gate, nor dared they offend the Late Golden Core Stage Sword Cultivation Elder of Taixu Gate.","Moreover, the present Taixu Gate, after the Three Sects Unification, is different in both influence and prestige compared to before.","Gu Changhuai cupped his hands at this moment and said, \"The Taoist Court must follow the procedures, please forgive me, Elder Xun.\"","\"However, these things... are originally the inheritance of Taixu Gate, it is only right for the Elder to take them back.\"","The other two Supervisors, seeing Gu Changhuai say this, also remained silent.","Elder Xun glanced at Mo Hua, and Mo Hua nodded slightly.","Only then did Elder Xun nod and say, \"That’s good, then I’ll trouble you Supervisors.\"","He thought for a moment and added, \"The only things stolen from my Taixu Gate are these formation media, the rest are this thief’s ’stolen goods’, which should naturally be handed over to the Taoist Court...\"","Among these stolen goods, there were also quite a few spirit stones and spiritual objects. This was, in fact, the \"bonus\" of the Taoist Court’s execution of tasks, an extra benefit.","Even without coveting the \"bonus\", converting it into \"merit points\" would also be a considerable gain.","Leaving a margin, this principle, Elder Xun naturally understood.","Upon hearing this, the hearts of the other two Supervisors were indeed slightly comforted.","A little benefit was enough; as for the formations and the array plates, they didn’t quite understand, seeing them seemed all the same, so since they belonged to Taixu Gate, it’s only proper to let them take them.","Thus, a complete set of Thunder Magnetic Array Plates, along with several sets of Thunder Magnetism Formation, were openly moved back to Taixu Gate by Mo Hua under the pretext of \"sect lost items\".","\"I need to inform the Ancestor about this.\" Xun Ziyou said, \"Involving the Taoist Court, using the sect’s name, it needs to be reported.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Indeed, this matter had to be told to Elder Master Xun.","So Xun Ziyou took these plates and diagrams and went with Mo Hua to see Elder Master Xun.","Even Elder Master Xun was very surprised to see these things, \"Where did you get these fine items from?\"","Xun Ziyou was taken aback.","These were merely some Second and Third Grade formations and array plates, he thought Mo Hua was just obtaining them for personal interest, but he didn’t expect that even the Ancestor of the Heaven Void would call them \"fine items\"?","Seeing Xun Ziyou’s bewildered face, Elder Master Xun explained, \"These are...\" As soon as he started, he realized this disciple was a formation blind, and explaining was a waste of time, like playing the lute to a cow, so he waved his hand, \"Go busy yourself.\"","\"Ancestor this...\" Xun Ziyou smiled wryly.","\"I understand, I know of it, you did well in this matter.\" Elder Master Xun said.","Xun Ziyou was rarely praised by the Ancestor, feeling a bit flattered, knowingly said, \"Then I won’t disturb the Ancestor anymore.\"","And then he took his leave.","After Xun Ziyou left, Elder Master Xun glanced at Mo Hua, frowned, and asked, \"Where did you get these things from?\"","Mo Hua succinctly picked some things he could say and said them.","After all, he spoke rather cryptically and evasively, listening was one thing, but trusting was another, and Elder Master Xun was used to it.","Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment, \"It’s best you don’t learn this thing.\"","Mo Hua honestly said, \"Elder, I have nothing to learn in formations...\"","Elder Master Xun was momentarily \"stumped\", and even felt a little ashamed.","No formations to learn...","Mo Hua, a disciple in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, in the esteemed Taixu Gate, complained about having nothing to learn in formations...","\"Sigh...\" Elder Master Xun sighed, waving his hand, \"Forget it, learn if you want...\"","This child was very curious, and if he truly wanted to learn, even Elder Master Xun couldn’t stop him.","\"But you must understand, what the Thunder Magnetism Formation truly signifies, once learned, you must absolutely not let others know, or it might bring lethal consequences.\"","\"The cause and effect on you are already significant, and learning the Thunder Magnetism Formation might lead to countless people wanting to harm you in the future.\"","Elder Master Xun said with a solemn expression.","Mo Hua nodded, seriously saying, \"Elder, I understand.\"","His inheritance was already greater than the Thunder Magnetism Formation, and he could not reveal it.","Even his uncle’s \"Heavenly Secret Tricky Calculation\", \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart\", he has secretly learned a little.","Thunder Magnetism Formation is actually nothing, too many lice, and it doesn’t itch.","Elder Master Xun finally nodded.","\"About these Formation Diagrams and Array Plates...\" Mo Hua asked softly.","Elder Master Xun flicked his sleeve, wiping away some Cause and Effect from the Thunder Magnetic Array Diagram and Array Plate, saying:","\"You’ve said it yourself; this is the legacy of my Taixu Gate. Take them, study well, just make sure no one else finds out.\"","Mo Hua replied joyfully, \"Yes!\"","With Elder Master Xun’s backing, Mo Hua confidently and boldly moved all these Thunder Magnetic Array Plates, along with a series of intricate Formation media, to the Disciple’s Residence.","Additionally, there was a storage bag full of Formation Diagrams.","After returning to the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua began to inventory the gains from this trip.","First, this Thunder Magnetic Array Plate.","With jade as its base, bordered in red gold, and etched with silver patterns, it was covered with Magnetic Patterns and linked to various intricate structures, the kind of Formation media Mo Hua had never seen before, clearly very expensive.","Additionally, there were as many as four Thunder Magnetic Array Diagrams.","Including the \"Thunder Magnetic Introduction Array Map,\" \"Thunder Magnetic Introduction Map,\" \"Thunder Magnetic Annotation Map,\" and \"Thunder Magnetic Defense and Attack Initial Resolution Map.\"","However, many of these diagrams were incomplete, as if that black-robed Formation Master tried to destroy them before dying but didn’t finish the job.","Mo Hua turned to see that the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate also showed some deformities.","It seemed that the Formation Master wanted to destroy this Plate as well before dying but couldn’t bring himself to do it.","This Array Plate was truly the lifelong effort of the Thunder Magnetic Array Master. He couldn’t bear to destroy it even in death, ultimately leaving it to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua glanced again at the Array Plate, flipped through the Formation Diagrams, and then discovered a problem.","These Formation Diagrams were all Third Grade, unlearnable for him.","The Array Plate was also of Third Grade, equally unusable for him.","But the strange part was that the Thunder Magnetic Formation crafted with the Array Plate as media contained both Second and Third Grades together, somewhat incongruous.","Overall, it was Third Grade, but the Formation eye and Core Array Pivot were Second Grade.","Just like...","Formation \"Frequency Reduction\"?","Mo Hua was a bit perplexed, only able to speculate that a Formation Master at the Golden Core Realm found learning Third Grade Thunder Magnetic Arrays too challenging, thus downgrading the formation patterns, using a Second Grade Formation eye and Array Pivot to activate a Third Grade Formation.","\"Is such a method possible?\" Mo Hua frowned, \"How can one balance the structure of Second and Third Grades, resolve Spiritual Power conflicts, harmonize Pattern contradictions, and organize the direction of the Array Pivot?\"","Unable to understand, Mo Hua decided to find someone to consult when he had time.","In his own view, such \"Frequency Reduction\" in formations seemed rather \"useless,\" yet he felt intuitively that this knowledge would surely prove immensely useful in the future.","Of course, for now, it’s still quite useless.","Below the Golden Core, he couldn’t depict Third Grade patterns, nor learn Third Grade formations.","Even reducing a Third Grade, mixed with a Second Grade Array Pivot, was still beyond him.","Therefore, although the gains this trip were immense, the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate and Diagrams, this entire legacy, were extremely rare, yet currently not very practical.","The only practical item was a Token.","The Token was not part of the Array Plate and Diagrams, and by rights, didn’t belong to the stolen \"legacy\" of the Taixu Gate; it ought to be submitted to the Taoist Court.","It was secretly slipped into the storage bag by Uncle Gu.","Gu Changhuai was very familiar with Mo Hua and knew he always liked collecting Tokens, also aware that he could \"decipher\" Letter Tokens to steal intelligence.","Thus at that time, Mo Hua had only stared at the Token for a moment, when Gu Changhuai understood instantly, discreetly hiding the Token in his sleeve, then slipping it into the storage bag along with the Formation Diagrams, handing it to Mo Hua.","\"Uncle Gu is truly a Great Good Person!\"","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","Then he picked up the Token, examined it carefully, with his gaze growing increasingly bright.","This Token was stained with pitch-black blood, engraved with a ferocious demonic image, complex in patterns, similar to a previous Demon Sect Token but clearly of a higher level.","If Mo Hua guessed correctly, this Token should be a Demon Sect’s \"Guest Elder Token,\" issued to \"Guest Elders,\" possessing true \"Elder\" level authority of a Token!","\"At last...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly.","Previously, he had killed several Demon Sect Elders, but none had dropped an Elder’s Token. Now, finally, he had managed to obtain one!"]},{"number":1837,"title":"Chapter 1837 - 911: Impersonation","paragraphs":["Mo Hua couldn’t wait and began to study the Token.","Before that, he took some time to reset his \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\".","He completely cleaned off the Secondary Thunder Patterns left by the black-robed Formation Master from the Thunder Magnetic Miniature.","After ensuring the Thunder Magnetic Miniature was \"spotless\", Mo Hua felt at ease.","Then he repeated the same trick, attempting to connect the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to the black-robed Formation Master’s \"Guest Elder Token\".","To Mo Hua’s surprise, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature infiltrated the Guest Elder Token with almost no effort.","This Guest Elder Token was \"Open Source\".","Even all its permissions were open.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and then roughly understood.","Strictly speaking, this black-robed Formation Master was not a Cultivator of the Demon Sect.","In the Demon Sect, after the \"traitor\" incident, there was panic, and some suspected that there were underlying issues with their Demon Sect Tokens, thus they specifically hired this black-robed Formation Master to solve the problems with the Demon Sect Tokens.","Since they needed to check the Demon Sect Token, they naturally had to give this Formation Master an \"interface\".","And this \"Guest Elder Token\" was used to provide this black-robed Formation Master access to the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation of the Demon Sect through the Token interface, to investigate Thunder Magnetic anomalies — namely, his own \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\".","And this black-robed Formation Master, being in the same \"trade\" as him, naturally liked to give himself \"permissions\" just like Mo Hua did.","Before he died, he didn’t have time to destroy the Token, which left all the \"doors\" wide open for Mo Hua.","Mo Hua felt a bit regretful.","If he had known this Formation Master was so \"considerate\", he would have let him die with some understanding.","Being beaten to death in such a muddled manner, he must have been somewhat discontented even after death.","Mo Hua sighed, and then began to carefully study the \"inheritance\" left by this Formation Master.","But after studying for a while, he frowned.","The \"doors\" of these permissions were somewhat special, having specific Thunder Magnetic Patterns on them, and many patterns were of the Third Grade, far beyond his formation capability. Even a few Second Grade ones were very difficult.","Presumably, this was part of the black-robed Formation Master’s own Thunder Magnetic legacy, which Mo Hua couldn’t quite understand.","\"Looks like it’s going to take some time to slowly figure it out...\"","Mo Hua silently thought, and then focused his attention, preparing to study the Guest Elder Token properly, when suddenly the Magnetic Patterns trembled.","A string of text was transmitted over.","Mo Hua was taken aback.","\"Someone is messaging me?\"","\"No, that’s not right, it’s for the dead black-robed Formation Master... It’s from the Demon Sect?\"","Mo Hua was slightly surprised and immediately looked at the string of text:","\"Mr. Yuan, excuse my boldness, how goes the investigation?\"","Mr. Yuan?","Mo Hua was startled, \"This title sounds so familiar.\"","He recalled that back in the Bi Mountain Demon Cavern, the lair of the Fire Buddha, there was a Formation Master proficient in Yuan Magnetic Formation, also surnamed \"Yuan\", whom the Fire Buddha called \"Master Yuan\".","\"All surnamed ’Yuan’, could they be of the same family? Or from the same sect, sharing the same legacy?\"","Mo Hua mused to himself.","Speaking of which, that \"Master Yuan\" was also secretly tracked down by him, and then had Uncle Gu along with Gu An and Gu Quan directly \"rudely\" beat him to death...","Both died in almost the same way...","While Mo Hua was deep in thought, another message came through the Guest Elder Token:","\"Mr. Yuan?\"","It seemed that Mo Hua’s lack of response aroused some suspicion.","Mo Hua was a bit apprehensive but hadn’t thought of how to reply, so he sent a \"versatile\" response for the moment:","\"Busy.\"","Sure enough, the other party replied: \"It was imprudent of me, I’ll bother Mr. Yuan later...\"","Little did they know, the current \"Mr. Yuan\" was no longer the original \"Mr. Yuan\".","The current \"Mr. Yuan\" was actually \"Mr. Mo\".","Mo Hua coolly replied: \"Hmm.\"","After that, the other side didn’t send any more letters.","Mo Hua, taking advantage of his free time, breathed a slight sigh of relief, then began to contemplate:","\"I need to find a way to cover it up, can’t let the Demon Sect find out that ’Mr. Yuan’ is already dead...\"","\"And, the whole investigation of the Thunder Magnetic Formation also needs to be glossed over.\"","After all, now that \"Mr. Yuan\" is already dead, there’s no one who can investigate him.","Moreover, \"Mr. Yuan’s\" Guest Elder Token is now in Mo Hua’s hands.","How could he possibly investigate himself?","Mo Hua sent a message:","\"The Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation has been thoroughly investigated, the underlying Magnetic Patterns are intact, and the sensation of Thunder Magnetism has no problems...\"","Mo Hua was about to send it out when he paused and shook his head, erasing the statement.","\"That won’t do... It’s too obvious.\"","Putting himself in their shoes, the Demon Sect must suspect something to have invited Mr. Yuan.","And Mr. Yuan certainly noticed something, which is why he spent so much time investigating.","If I simply say \"no problem\" so easily, not only would it arouse the Demon Sect’s suspicion, but it would also make \"Mr. Yuan\" seem incompetent, unable to find the problem.","\"I can’t say it like that...\"","Mo Hua deliberated for a moment, then replied afresh:","\"Was busy just now...\"","\"According to my investigation today, there is a very peculiar ’Secondary Thunder Flow’ hidden in the Yuan Magnetic Sea, bizarre yet cautious. It occasionally surfaces but quickly hides again. I’ve found some clues, but I’ll need more time to investigate further...\"","Mo Hua spoke very \"professionally\".","These matters are something only a Thunder Magnetic Array Master could understand, and most of what he said was based on facts.","There’s no need to hide what’s obvious.","Shortly after the message was sent, a response arrived from the other side:","\"Truly worthy of being ’Mr. Yuan’, I must rely on you, sir, to pay more attention to this matter. Once it is accomplished, our sect will have generous gifts to present.\""]},{"number":1838,"title":"Chapter 1838 - 911: Roleplay (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua continued with a cold \"Hm\".","But at the same time, he was thinking, with the methods of this Demon Sect, after the deed is done, will they really offer a \"generous gift\"?","Could it be, they might also find a way to drag this \"Mr. Yuan\" out?","Either kill him to silence him, eat his flesh and drink his blood; or force Mr. Yuan into slavery, making him draw formations for the Demon Sect for a lifetime.","In comparison, I am still quite \"kind\", at least giving Mr. Yan a quick end.","Mo Hua sighed and remarked:","\"Thus, a Formation Master must walk the righteous path and must never join forces with Demon Cultivators, otherwise, one slip, and there’s no turning back.\"","Mo Hua took this as a caution in his heart.","After that, there were no more messages from the Demon Sect, Mo Hua managed to muddle through.","But before then, he needed to be a bit cautious...","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then sent a transmission to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, the matter of the black-robed Formation Master being killed by the Taoist Court’s officials must be kept confidential, don’t let it leak out now.\"","As it stands, the Demon Sect and this black-robed Formation Master are in one-on-one contact.","The black-robed Formation Master hid himself deeply, as long as I don’t speak, and the Taoist Court doesn’t leak, no one should know he’s already dead.","Gu Changhuai replied: \"Alright, I know.\"","Mo Hua felt quite reassured with Uncle Gu handling things.","Afterward, things became much easier to handle.","Now, with both the problem and solution tokens in hand, I can \"play a duet with myself\", and the Demon Sect will be none the wiser, making actions much more convenient.","Mo Hua began considering the next step of the plan.","First and foremost, continue killing Demon Cultivators.","Just a few more, a couple of Golden Core Demons, and I can break through to the late stage of Foundation Establishment.","But with the bloodthirsty Demon Sect now vigilant, the Sect’s Disciple Token can no longer obtain more secrets.","The only means left is the Guest Order.","Even though the permissions for the Guest Order are many, I still haven’t figured out a lot of them.","Moreover, there’s one major problem, the \"target\" is too obvious.","With hundreds or thousands of Disciple Tokens, doing some small actions isn’t easy to notice.","But the Guest Order at the elder level is very rare, any small move is likely to be discovered.","Not to mention this one in the hands of the Thunder Magnetic Array Master, surely the Demon Sect will guard it strictly.","Thus, this Guest Order isn’t quite as usable, too many restrictions at this stage.","\"If permissions can’t be stolen, then... could only play ’role-playing’?\"","Mo Hua mused.","\"Posing as ’Mr. Yuan’, causing trouble secretly, and finding a chance to eliminate a couple of Golden Core Demons, and then it would be a great achievement.\"","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","Since it’s \"role-playing\", the first principle is to make others believe.","Let the Demon Sect believe I am truly \"Mr. Yuan\", working for them, so I can pull some tricks behind the scenes without being suspected.","Otherwise, without trust, if accusations fly, the first to be doubted would certainly be me.","\"Gaining trust from the Demon Sect...\"","This matter is a bit challenging, it might even require cooperation from the Taoist Court, especially from Uncle Gu’s side.","Mo Hua thought about it for two days, formulating a rough plan in his heart.","Then he sent a transmission to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, the Demon Sect is now vigilant, it’s hard to get information, I need you guys to cooperate first, put on a few plays, to gain the trust of the Demon Sect.\"","\"Put on a play?\" Gu Changhuai was startled.","Mo Hua explained simply.","Gu Changhuai was taken aback for a moment, then sighed, \"Alright.\"","Afterward, as per routine, Mo Hua utilized the Guest Order, and also the Disciple Token, working both angles to steal the Demon Sect’s messages.","Of course, information on elders is scarce now, mostly about ordinary disciples, engaged in \"blood feasts\", \"Skill Transmission\" news.","The Demon Sect is bloodthirsty, they cultivate by sucking the blood of cultivators, if they go a while without drinking blood, they become agitated and may even deviate, losing their senses.","And the Demon Sect’s \"blood sucking\" comes from the top down.","The Golden Core Elders above can maintain their cultivation technique by absorbing the disciples’ blood.","The lower disciples, having no lower disciples to suck, can only go outside to kill and suck blood.","Being caught by the Taoist Court is death, without blood, deviation is also death.","Thus, when the heat is on, the Demon Sect elders can temporarily lie low to avoid the heat.","But once the bloodthirsty desire of the ordinary disciples below erupts, they cannot restrain it.","They will still kill and suck blood frequently, or hold \"blood feasts\" of a certain scale.","Mo Hua found a slightly larger scale \"blood feast\", then leaked the information to the Taoist Court, letting Uncle Gu lead the operation to surround and suppress these Demon Sect disciples.","After that, he sent a transmission to the Demon Sect’s \"Elder You\".","This Elder You was the one who previously sent a transmission, rather, it was to the already dead \"Mr. Yuan\", asking about the Thunder Magnetism inspection progress, a Demon Sect elder.","Mo Hua later verified that this \"Elder You\" bore the Four Symbols Dog Pattern, exactly the \"Dog-Head Think Tank\" he had found out before.","His cultivation doesn’t seem particularly strong, but he is a trusted aide of the Demon Sect leader, adept at scheming, many things are propelled secretly by him.","Within the Demon Sect, he is called \"Elder Dog\" due to the dog pattern, but he seems to have the surname \"You\".","Even within the Demon Sect, only a handful at the high echelon know this surname.","Mo Hua transmitted: \"Elder You, it’s found out, there’s an issue with the Original Magnet.\"","Elder You quickly replied: \"Thank you, sir. What seems to be the problem?\"","Mo Hua said: \"At the bottom layer of the Compound Formation of the Original Magnet, there is an obscure flow of Thunder Magnetism, it seems to be stealing information, and then transmitting it outward.\""]},{"number":1839,"title":"Chapter 1839 - 911: Roleplaying (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Elder You: \"Could you, sir, please explain in more detail?\"","Mo Hua: \"In other words, someone is stealing the Sect’s internal secrets and then secretly transmitting them out using a special Thunder Magnetism method.\"","\"Those outside receive this Thunder Magnetism fluctuation, which will then regenerate into Magnetic Patterns based on the Thunder Magnetism, manifesting as text, thereby learning the Sect’s internal secrets.\"","Elder You nodded slightly.","This basically matched his previous suspicions.","The \"mole\" within the Demon Sect was not using ordinary means to contact the Taoist Court but was using a highly advanced Thunder Magnetism technique to leak the Demon Sect’s intelligence to the Taoist Court.","But being naturally suspicious, he still didn’t fully believe: \"Mr. Yuan, do you know who exactly is leaking the information?\"","When he said this, he was wholly unaware that he was talking to the \"leaker.\"","Mo Hua: \"There are too few clues to determine yet; it needs to be verified step by step. All I could find now is a segment of the Magnetic Pattern he leaked.\"","\"Magnetic Patterns?\" Elder You said.","Mo Hua sent a segment of the Magnetic Pattern to Elder You.","Elder You glanced at it and after a moment, leisurely said: \"Mr. Yuan, I... can’t understand it...\"","Mo Hua could discern from this that Elder You was neither a Yuan Magnetic Formation Master nor a Thunder Magnetic Array Master.","He may have come into contact with this type of Formation Master and has some understanding of the related Thunder Magnetism principles.","But he had not studied it personally or drawn it himself, knowing the \"how\" but not the \"why,\" making him a semi-\"layman,\" or you might say an impractical ’Cloud Array Master.’","Mo Hua roughly gauged his level and sent him some \"Fixed Magnetic Pattern Annotations.\"","\"These are Magnetic Pattern Annotations, Elder You can reference them and decode it yourself. I still have to monitor the Yuan Magnetic Compound Formation and cannot divide my attention.\"","Mo Hua showed an appearance of being very busy.","He dumped all the Magnetic Patterns and annotations on Elder You, letting him decode them himself.","The answers one finds themselves are more easily believed.","\"Alright...\" Elder You had no choice but to try to decode the \"Magnetic Patterns\" himself.","As he wasn’t a Yuan Magnetic Formation Master, decoding it was laborious, as the seemingly similar but subtly different Magnetic Patterns were densely packed, leaving him dazzled and his scalp tingling.","\"Formation Masters are indeed a group of twisted geniuses...\"","Elder You thought silently.","Determined, he eventually managed to painstakingly decode the segment of Magnetic Patterns given to him by Mo Hua, one by one.","The decoded Magnetic Patterns translated into text, providing intelligence on a Blood Banquet event.","Elder You’s heart raced.","Indeed!","There really was someone secretly leaking the Sect’s activities.","Elder You frowned and sent the text to Mo Hua, asking:","\"Mr. Yuan, have I decoded this segment of Magnetic Patterns correctly?\"","Mo Hua, somewhat impatient: \"Didn’t I give you both the Magnetic Patterns and annotations? Whatever you decode is what it is.\"","Elder You: \"Then this leaker has divulged intelligence on a Blood Banquet that our Demon Sect was planning to the Taoist Court...\"","\"Oh.\"","Mo Hua displayed an indifferent demeanor.","Realizing this, Elder You didn’t press further.","The problem had been identified and the Magnetic Patterns found; what needed to be done was already done by this \"Mr. Yuan,\" and the subsequent matters naturally didn’t concern him.","Formation Masters have solitary temperaments.","Moreover, it is normal for such a capable Formation Master to be aloof and cold.","Elder You began to arrange plans according to his wishes.","What followed was simple.","This intelligence was first leaked by Mo Hua to the Taoist Court, prompting them to use it to hunt down the Demon Cultivators.","Then, Mo Hua secretly informed the Demon Sect of it, allowing them to guard against the Taoist Court’s assault.","Thus, both sides ended up merely having a simple face-off.","The Taoist Court discovered tracks but ended up empty-handed.","The Demon Sect received the news and evaded the assault.","Nothing happened on either side, but both confirmed the accuracy of the intelligence.","Gu Changhuai was very angry, ordering the Demon Sect’s Blood Banquet gathering point to be burned to the ground.","Of course, his \"anger\" was feigned.","Mo Hua had already shared the plan with him, making him one of the few informed persons.","Expressing anger was purely to make the Demon Sect believe that the Taoist Court was genuinely unaware and that the escape of the Demon Sect disciples was entirely unexpected to the Court.","The escaped Demon Sect disciples reported the situation to Elder You.","Elder You couldn’t help but nod.","Since the Demon Sect’s \"mole\" incident, this was the first time they had thwarted the Taoist Court’s plan.","The Original Magnetism’s Dao was indeed profound, and his efforts in deciphering that segment of \"Magnetic Patterns\" weren’t wasted.","This \"Mr. Yuan\" certainly had true skills.","\"After this affair, I must find a way to retain this Mr. Yuan for my use...\"","Elder You was eager with admiration and thought to himself.","Afterwards, Elder You became increasingly courteous to the imposter \"Mr. Yuan,\" who was Mo Hua.","Mo Hua also devotedly \"served\" the Demon Sect.","He knew that trust isn’t built in a day; it requires multiple \"collaborations\" to establish a strong bond.","Through multiple practices, he had to continuously fortify and deepen Elder You’s recognition of the Demon Sect \"mole.\"","Mo Hua repeated his old trick, intercepting some \"Mole\" stolen Magnetic Patterns—these Magnetic Patterns had been pre-emptively revealed to the Taoist Court by this \"mole\" of his.","Mo Hua then sent these Magnetic Patterns, along with their annotations, to Elder You, letting him ponder and decode them himself, enhancing his sense of involvement.","Bit by bit, Mo Hua planted a seed in Elder You’s heart:","These Magnetic Patterns, though given by \"Mr. Yuan,\" were \"decoded\" through Elder You’s effort by referencing the annotations, using his own diligence.","It was he himself, through his own efforts, who obtained this intelligence.","What he truly believed in wasn’t others, but himself."]},{"number":1840,"title":"Chapter 1840 - 912: Toying With Them","paragraphs":["In the subsequent operations targeting the Demon Sect, as expected, the Taoist Court came up empty-handed, resulting in nothing but \"impotent rage.\"","Playing the Taoist Court like a puppet on a string, watching Gu Changhuai \"frustrated and exasperated,\" deepened Elder You’s perception in his heart:","There is indeed an insider within the Demon Sect, leaking information to the Taoist Court.","\"Mr. Yuan\" was indeed helping them intercept the Magnetic Patterns and protect the secrets.","And the Magnetic Patterns provided by Mr. Yuan were all genuine.","The intelligence I decrypted was also undoubtedly true.","Elder You became increasingly trusting of \"Mr. Yuan,\" for his desire to keep \"Mr. Yuan\" permanently within the Demon Sect grew stronger, making his attitude even more amiable.","Mo Hua knew as well; the timing was just about right.","His \"role-playing\" was very successful, perhaps even more so than the original \"Mr. Yuan.\"","The deceased \"Mr. Yuan\" probably wasn’t as trusted or likable as he was.","He could now proceed to the next step of his plan:","This time, he planned to use a borrowed knife to kill, taking down two Golden Core Demons in one swift move, and then refine enough Divine Marrow to break through to Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Which two to kill, that was a matter of strategy.","Mo Hua began to scout suitable candidates within the Demon Sect, but after much deliberation, he found none truly fitting.","The easy-to-kill Golden Core Demons had already been taken care of by him and died at the hands of the Taoist Court.","Now, the remaining Golden Cores were well-hidden, highly experienced, or had survived many bloody trials, their positions as elders unshakeable.","These people are Demon Cultivators, ruthless in their killings, their minds chaotic, and who knew what history they had with each other, or what was hidden in their hearts.","The waters were deep here.","Mo Hua did not believe that just by eavesdropping on such a short period of information, he could untangle the complex interpersonal relationships within the Demon Sect.","Recklessly framing someone could easily backfire.","Therefore, after a deep contemplation, Mo Hua decided to let \"Elder You\" choose for himself.","Since any choice he made could lead to pitfalls, why not throw the dilemma directly at \"Elder You.\"","Let Elder You choose his own \"favorite\" insider.","\"Only guide him, but not make decisions for him, since no matter which demon dies, it’s all the same to me, Divine Remains all taste the same, I’m not a picky eater.\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then began to transmit a message to Elder You:","\"I’ve sifted through hundreds of inquiries during these days and finally found some clues...\"","\"The Thunder Magnetism at the base of the Original Magnet Compound Formation comes from a rare set of Thunder Magnetic Array Plates.\"","\"These Thunder Magnetic Array Plates are deeply hidden and not easily detected, but driving them requires a certain foundational understanding of formations.\"","\"The fluctuations of the Thunder Magnetic Array Plates also approximately concentrate around midnight.\"","Mo Hua provided some \"clues.\"","As expected, Elder You valued them greatly.","Following these clues, he pondered for a while before saying:","\"Mr. Yuan implies that the sect’s ’insider’ is a Formation Master or at least someone with a certain proficiency in formations.\"","\"Around midnight each day, he secretly steals our sect’s secrets and then transmits these secrets to the Taoist Court through Thunder Magnetism?\"","Mo Hua ambiguously said: \"It’s possible...\"","\"But...\" Elder You frowned, \"Within the current elders of the Demon Sect, no one is proficient in formations...\"","Mo Hua faltered, a bit speechless.","A Formation Master is usually crucial and is easier to kill.","That’s why he gave such a \"hint,\" leading Elder You in the direction of a Formation Master.","But among so many elders in the Demon Sect, not one is a Formation Master?","Are they not at all ambitious? Can learning formations really be so deadly?","Mo Hua muttered in his heart, then sighed and transmitted a message: \"I may have speculated wrongly.\"","Elder You was silent for a moment, but then said: \"Not necessarily...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback.","Elder You himself began to suspect:","\"Isn’t it possible that someone is proficient in formations but hides it to avoid suspicion?\"","Mo Hua: \"It’s not impossible...\"","\"But who might this person be?\" Elder You asked.","Mo Hua: \"This is an internal matter of your Demon Sect, I’m not quite sure about it...\"","He distanced himself quite clearly.","Elder You pondered for a moment, then confirmed:","\"Does the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate absolutely require a cultivator proficient in formations to operate? Could an ordinary cultivator, with practice, also control the array plate?\"","Mo Hua deliberated and said: \"The Thunder Magnetic Array Plate is quite special, complex, and precise. Without some foundational knowledge in formations, it’s indecipherable. Plus, the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate is easily damaged. If this person is lurking inside the Demon Sect without any formation knowledge, they wouldn’t be able to fix it if it breaks.\"","Mo Hua stated this with apparent seriousness.","Elder You agreed profoundly, \"Mr. Yuan’s words are very true...\"","The direction towards a Formation Master was indeed worth investigating.","Then, he was somewhat puzzled, \"Moreover... around midnight, the elders of the Demon Sect often gather to feed on fresh blood and exchange experiences. They shouldn’t have the leisure to use Thunder Magnetism for leaking secrets...\"","Mo Hua frowned.","He had concocted a random hour out of thin air, and who would have thought that the Demon Sect elders would choose that exact time to gather.","Are all demon cultivators night owls?","At this point, he couldn’t change his tune, so he resolutely said: \"I only look at the formations, and the Thunder Magnetic Patterns display just like this; about other situations, I am not aware...\"","Elder You held his doubts, but after a brief reflection, felt it was reasonable.","Mr. Yuan is a Formation Master, naturally speaking according to the laws of formations; if it is, it is; if it isn’t, it isn’t.","Other matters are beyond his consideration.","Elder You contemplated, \"Precisely because around midnight, the elders are all in gathering, leaking secrets during this time wouldn’t raise suspicion, and the method would be more concealed...\""]},{"number":1841,"title":"Chapter 1841 - 912: Toying With Them","paragraphs":["He just explained it away.","Mo Hua: \"Makes sense...\"","Elder You’s eyes narrowed, and he nodded, \"I will look into this matter, thank you, Mr. Yuan.\"","Mo Hua replied: \"Just fulfilling a duty, Elder You, you are too kind.\"","After that, the two had nothing more to say.","In an unknown, bloody stone chamber.","Elder You put away the Elder’s Token used for sending transmissions, drank a glass of Blood Wine, and began to ponder the clues given by Mo Hua.","After a moment of consideration, a thought suddenly came to him:","\"Could this Mr. Yuan be deceiving me?\"","Elder You deliberated for a bit, unable to stop himself from questioning, \"What exactly did Mr. Yuan deceive me about?\"","There is definitely a traitor in the Demon Sect.","The traitor knowing formations also seems reasonable.","From the beginning to the end, this Mr. Yuan didn’t seem too interested in the internal affairs of the Demon Sect.","He was employed by me to work for the Demon Sect.","Everything he said was based on the Thunder Magnetism Formation, never concealing anything, but also never elaborating.","Moreover, the information he provided did indeed repeatedly help the Sect out of crises, breaking the encirclement of the Taoist Court.","Elder You reviewed it again, nodded slightly, and dismissed his concerns.","\"Since the information is credible, it can be followed to investigate...\"","\"Formation...\"","\"Among the Demon Sect Elders, who secretly learned formations? Who has the ability with formations but keeps it hidden, doing unspeakable deeds...\"","Elder You’s gaze was piercing, calculating one by one.","\"First of all, Big Brother cannot be the traitor.\"","\"Second Brother, the most experienced, he has no reason to betray the Sect. After all, this Sect was put together temporarily for the grand plan, to nurture blood slaves, and formed a prototype of the Demon Gate, to be discarded once used. Why would Second Brother betray...\"","\"I am Lao San, I’m definitely fine...\"","\"Lao Si, an executioner, bloodthirsty, used to hunt down traitors. Usually kept locked up with chains, not allowed outside. In his mind, apart from ’kill’, there’s nothing else. To make him remember formation patterns is really difficult for him.\"","\"Lao Wu and Lao Liu just came out of that valley, still avoiding the limelight, they are not without suspicion...\"","\"Lao Qi, lustful, is already dead.\"","\"Lao Ba, thoughtful, loyal, the plans of the Demon Sect generally pass through him, and he has worked hard for years, without merit, but with effort...\"","\"Lao Jiu, greedy eater, not very scheming...\"","\"Lao Shi, dead.\"","\"Eleven, dead.\"","\"Shier, dead...\"","...","Elder You went over it in his mind, unable to figure out who secretly learned formation techniques.","The brothers are all killers, drinking blood, each more fearsome than the other.","But when it comes to learning formations... who has the brains for it?","But Mr. Yuan’s words can’t be wrong, the signs of the Thunder Magnetism can’t be wrong either.","\"Investigate, just investigate, someone will definitely slip up...\"","Elder You’s expression was cold.","As for how the Demon Sect investigated afterward, Mo Hua did not know.","A few days later, Elder You sent a transmission to Mo Hua:","\"Mr. Yuan, I have found some clues, currently Lao Wu, Lao Liu, Lao Ba, and Lao Jiu are all suspects...\"","Mo Hua said indifferently: \"Oh.\"","Elder You: \"I would like to ask you, sir, to deliberate on this for me.\"","Mo Hua was slightly shocked at heart, such a \"life or death question,\" of course, he wouldn’t answer, he only said: \"I am just a Formation Master.\"","Elder You quickly explained: \"Mr. Yuan, you misunderstand, I wasn’t testing you, but rather hoping you might have insights, who among them seems most like a Formation Master.\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and then said: \"Alright...\"","Elder You said: \"Among these individuals, Lao Jiu is gluttonous, often locking himself in his room, doing who knows what, and after coming out, he has a big meal, otherwise, he would be overly exhausted...\"","\"Lao Ba is the most thoughtful, always responsible for the plans of the Demon Sect, and he acts very cautiously.\"","\"Lao Wu and Lao Liu, they recently escaped from... that place...\"","\"That place?\"","\"This location is secret and not suitable to be disclosed.\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly but didn’t ask more, only replying with an \"Mmm.\"","Elder You said: \"After they escaped, according to custom, they joined our Demon Sect, temporarily taking shelter, so there’s also a possibility that they are not on our side.\"","\"Lao Wu is short and skinny, not tall, Lao Liu is tall, with deep eyes, as calm as a mountain...\"","...","Elder You explained the situation of these individuals to Mo Hua one by one, and then asked: \"Mr. Yuan, who do you think among them is most likely the Formation Master?\"","Mo Hua was momentarily conflicted.","Because he thought that all four of them surprisingly had \"Formation Master\" traits.","One is gluttonous, one is scheming, one is short in stature, one has deep eyes...","This made it a bit difficult for him to decide.","Mo Hua casually picked one, \"Lao Ba, deep-minded, thoughtful, seems like it.\"","Elder You shook his head, \"Lao Ba has been in the sect for many years, working hard for the Sect, wholeheartedly, without any disloyalty.\"","\"Then Lao Jiu? Formation Masters deplete Divine Sense tremendously, sometimes requiring them to eat more.\"","\"Lao Jiu is broad and plump, may not have the scheming mind, and may not be willing to put in the hard work to learn formations.\"","\"What about Lao Wu? Not tall, so his Sea of Consciousness would be more condensed...\"","\"Is there such a saying?\"","\"There should be...\"","\"But he doesn’t seem like it either.\"","\"Then it’s Lao Liu.\"","\"Lao Liu, he has Monster Qi, Monster cultivators generally can’t learn formations...\"","...","And so, Mo Hua, the \"traitor,\" earnestly discussed with the Demon Sect’s elder, who the Demon Sect’s real traitor was.","But after guessing and guessing, everything was vetoed by Elder You.","Mo Hua then had no other choice.","Because he was making things up to begin with, among these people, it’s possible none of them are Formation Masters."]},{"number":1842,"title":"Chapter 1842 - 912: Toying With Them","paragraphs":["Mo Hua then spoke frankly: \"Is it possible that among these people, no one knows about Formations?\"","Unexpectedly, Elder You shook his head and said: \"No, among them, there is definitely someone who carries the foundation of Formations. I can be sure of it!\"","What more could Mo Hua say...","You made the deduction yourself.","\"After talking with Mr. Yuan, I have a rough idea. Allow me to investigate further.\" Elder You said.","\"Yes, then Elder You, please go investigate. I still need to continue screening the Yuan Magnetic Formation.\"","Mo Hua said, appearing to still be quite busy.","\"Thank you, Mr. Yuan.\" Elder You said and then went on to investigate, not disturbing Mo Hua further.","Mo Hua, however, wasn’t very optimistic.","Investigating like this seems to be a dead end...","Should I give another hint, let Elder You investigate in other directions?","What hint would be good?","Mo Hua pondered for several days. Just when he was about to change direction, and \"guide\" Elder You from another angle.","Elder You sought him out first:","\"Mr. Yuan, just as you predicted, among the Elders of the Demon Sect, there truly is one who knows Formations.\"","Mo Hua was surprised: \"There really is?\"","\"Isn’t it what you said?\"","\"Well... I only made a conjecture based on the principles of the Thunder Magnetic Array. I wasn’t entirely certain.\"","Mo Hua stated neutrally and objectively.","Elder You: \"As expected from Mr. Yuan, meticulous in action and thorough in thought.\"","Mo Hua curiously asked: \"Who knows Formations?\"","Elder You’s gaze slightly darkened, \"Lao Ba.\"","Mo Hua: \"Oh...\"","Elder You said: \"I had people investigate, and only then discovered that over these years, Lao Ba, despite appearing to plan and advise for the Sect earnestly, has embezzled a lot of Blood Pills under the table, taken many kickbacks, and privately maintained quite a few blood slaves.\"","\"He hid these things very well.\"","\"He learned Formations just to hide his ’assets’ well.\"","\"Coveting the sect’s benefits for personal gain, truly deserving death!\"","\"Now, fearing exposure and execution by Big Brother, he cooperates with the Taoist Court, hoping to find a chance at survival...\"","Mo Hua was momentarily shocked.","Elder You actually found it out...","Indeed, even an egg without any visible cracks, if flies hover over it long enough, eventually they will find a crack.","Not to mention a Demon Sect with actions already suspect.","What he didn’t expect was that the Demon Sect would have \"corruption\" as well...","Indeed, where there are people, there is corruption, and Demon Cultivators are no exception.","\"So that’s how it is...\" Mo Hua said blandly.","He remembered his role as just a Formation Master, detached from the situation.","\"What do you plan to do with this Eighth Elder?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Betraying the Sect, the crime is unforgivable!\"","\"The Sect will administer the extreme penalty on him!\"","Elder You’s gaze was filled with killing intent, \"He has no idea for what grand vision the Demon Sect was really established.\"","Grand vision?","Mo Hua’s pupils slightly contracted.","The Demon Sect has an even bigger scheme.","Could this scheme be... the resurrection of the Great Wilderness Evil God?","But how is the resurrection of the Evil God related to these actions of the Demon Sect? Does their blood-sucking and Blood Banquets help in the resurrection of the Great Wilderness Evil God?","\"Am I... missing something?\" Mo Hua frowned.","\"Forget it, whatever it is, we’ll talk about it later. Eating the Divine Remains is more urgent now.\"","But when he thought of this, Mo Hua suddenly paused, realizing a critical problem.","If this Eighth Elder is executed by the Demon Sect, won’t the Divine Remains on him become inaccessible to me?","Wouldn’t all my efforts be in vain then?","No way!","Mo Hua hesitated for a moment then said: \"Elder You, deciding the life and death of an Elder like this, isn’t it... a bit too rash?\"","Elder You frowned in confusion, \"Mr. Yuan, what do you mean?\"","Mo Hua said: \"Currently, the evidence is insufficient, and this ’Eighth Elder’ may not necessarily be the real ’inner ghost’. We mustn’t rush to judgment and sentence him to death just because he knows Formations.\"","Elder You said: \"It doesn’t matter, even if he’s not the inner ghost, his embezzlement alone is enough to warrant a death sentence.\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","You’ll execute him and I’ll end up starving.","\"No...\" Mo Hua contemplated for a while, then continued: \"It’s not that simple. If you kill the Eighth Elder now, it will be impossible to determine whether he is truly the ’inner ghost’...\"","\"If he is, then naturally everything is settled, case closed.\"","\"But if he’s not, then it means the real inner ghost is still lurking within, potentially leaking secrets to the Taoist Court in the future.\"","Upon hearing this, Elder You couldn’t help but acknowledge:","\"Mr. Yuan is truly thorough in his considerations.\"","Rooting out the inner ghost is of utmost importance.","He almost made a critical error due to a moment of impulsivity.","Elder You said: \"I will immediately capture Lao Ba, subject him to the Blood Punishment, and rigorously interrogate him to uncover his secrets and see whether he is indeed the inner ghost collaborating with the Taoist Court.\"","Mo Hua quickly said: \"No!\"","Elder You was taken aback and frowned, \"Mr. Yuan, what is the issue?\"","\"Even if you torture him, it’s useless...\"","No one knew better than Mo Hua that this Eighth Elder wasn’t the inner ghost; he was \"wrongfully accused\".","Letting the Demon Sect torture him would ruin everything.","Mo Hua said: \"Golden Core Realm Demon Cultivators have steadfast minds, and even under severe torture, it may yield no results. Moreover, if he ’confesses under duress’, it might give rise to erroneous conclusions, mingling the truth and allowing the real inner ghost to fish in troubled waters...\"","Elder You became more impressed with Mo Hua: \"Mr. Yuan, you are indeed a masterful Formation Master, your thoughts are comprehensive. So about this matter...\"","Mo Hua suggested: \"Perhaps we could set up a scheme to test this Eighth Elder and see if he tries to contact the Taoist Court.\"","\"What kind of scheme?\" Elder You asked.","\"I’m just a Formation Master.\" Mo Hua said, \"I’m not well-versed in setting up schemes.\""]},{"number":1843,"title":"Chapter 1843 - 912: Toying With Them","paragraphs":["He threw this question to Elder You again.","Elder You furrowed his eyebrows, pondered for a moment, and slowly said:","\"Then...send Lao Ba out to execute the Sect’s mission, and afterward, leak this intelligence to the Taoist Court to see if the Taoist Court will be ruthless enough to kill Lao Ba?\"","\"If the Taoist Court takes lethal action, it means Lao Ba is not the mole. And if he dies at the hands of the Taoist Court, we won’t have to do it ourselves, and it maintains our brotherhood, giving him a dignified end. I won’t pursue past matters.\"","\"Conversely, if the Taoist Court spares his life...then it shows that Lao Ba indeed has a problem, and he truly is the ’mole’!\"","Mo Hua nodded.","This Elder You, truly has a style of his own, playing the trick of killing with a borrowed knife very skillfully.","Mo Hua said, \"I don’t quite understand this matter, so I’ll leave it to Elder You. But if the Eighth Elder is indeed the mole, then my task is also completed, and I want my reward.\"","He maintained an attitude of business as usual.","\"Of course, Mr. Yuan has helped us greatly, we certainly won’t shortchange the gentleman...\"","In the bloody stone chamber, Elder You displayed a playful smile.","\"Then thank you, Elder You.\"","In the elegant Disciple’s Residence of Taixu Gate, the corners of Mo Hua’s mouth curved into a slight smile.","...","Thereafter, all plans were arranged by Elder You.","Amidst the Taoist Court’s relentless crackdown on the Demon Sect, a sudden and inexplicable mission was assigned to the Eighth Elder within the Demon Sect.","Strictly speaking, this task wasn’t solely for the Eighth Elder, but since the order was issued from above, he couldn’t refuse.","Moreover, Elder You’s investigation was extremely covert.","The Eighth Elder had no awareness that his actions had already been exposed.","Then, under the meticulous design of Mo Hua and Elder You, he naturally walked right into the Taoist Court’s ambush.","Seeing the heavy forces of the Taoist Court, the Eighth Elder felt a chill in his heart as he prepared for a desperate fight.","But what he didn’t expect was that the usually relentless Taoist Court oddly showed mercy.","Gu Changhuai and others only symbolically exchanged a few moves with him and did not go for the kill.","The Eighth Elder easily escaped the encirclement of the Taoist Court, momentarily feeling like he was in a dream and found it somewhat hard to believe.","Just as he was feeling fortunate for having escaped unscathed, the Elder’s Token vibrated.","Someone \"anonymously\" sent him a message:","\"Your deeds have been exposed, Elder You has set a trap to kill you, flee quickly.\"","Attached was a string of evidence of him embezzling Blood Pills, hoarding blood slaves, and taking kickbacks.","Each of these crimes was punishable by death within the Demon Sect.","The Eighth Elder’s face turned deathly pale in an instant.","Meanwhile, just after sending the anonymous message to the Eighth Elder, Mo Hua turned and sent another message to Elder You:","\"There have been changes, I’m monitoring the Eighth Elder’s Elder’s Token...\"","\"Just now, someone suddenly sent the Eighth Elder a message, informing him that things have been exposed and telling him to flee.\"","\"You must quickly dispatch a Golden Core Elder to hunt him down and silence him, or else the consequences will be endless...\"","After sending the message, Mo Hua silently counted in his heart.","One Eighth Elder on the run.","Then a Golden Core Demon hunting the Eighth Elder.","In this way, adding up to two Golden Cores is just enough for me to break through the realm.","Of course, he didn’t mind if Elder You sent more Golden Core Demons to hunt down the Eighth Elder.","However many come, he will \"consume\" that many...","Mo Hua squinted his eyes, a little smile playing at the corners of his mouth."]},{"number":1844,"title":"Chapter 1844 - 913: A Small Smiling Face","paragraphs":["Demon Sect.","In front of the Blood Pool.","A group of Demon Sect Elders were present, draped in black robes. Some resembled humans, some appeared as beasts, with fangs and blood-red pupils, all bearing bizarre and grotesque appearances.","The atmosphere was eerie and oppressive at this moment.","\"Lao Ba ran away?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Why did he run?\"","\"What a stupid question, if he didn’t run, he’d be dead.\"","\"But how did he know to run, who tipped him off?\"","Elder You, with dog patterns carved on his body, said indifferently: \"According to Mr. Yuan, it was an ’anonymous’ person who tipped off Lao Ba.\"","\"Mr. Yuan...\"","\"Another anonymous person, who is this person really?\"","\"So, besides Lao Ba, there’s another ’internal spy’ in our Demon Sect tipping someone off?\"","\"Not necessarily...\"","...","As everyone conversed, a chubby elder spoke up:","\"In the end, is this Mr. Yuan truly trustworthy?\"","The group of Golden Core Demons all looked towards Elder You.","Elder You glanced at the chubby elder, \"Half a month ago, when Taoist Court besieged us, it was Mr. Yuan’s intercepted information that saved hundreds of your disciples and followers. Otherwise, you wouldn’t even have blood food right now.\"","The chubby elder fell silent.","He was like ’someone holding the breadbasket,’ not to be offended.","A thin and short elder asked: \"What is Mr. Yuan’s proficiency in formations?\"","Elder You responded solemnly, \"Extremely profound.\"","The short elder nodded, \"He’s a talent, should be retained for our Demon Sect’s use. What does he fancy? Human blood? Human flesh? Spirit Stones, treasures, or women?\"","Elder You replied calmly: \"That’s not your concern.\"","The short elder’s gaze turned cold, with a displeased look.","\"We’ll discuss Mr. Yuan later,\" an elderly elder from above said, his blood-tinged eyes scanning everyone, \"...first deal with Lao Ba.\"","There was a moment of silence, then someone asked: \"So it’s confirmed that Lao Ba is the internal spy?\"","\"The Taoist Court surrounded him but spared his life. If he’s not an internal spy, who is?\"","\"If he’s the internal spy of the Taoist Court, why didn’t he just defect to them when the Demon Sect was exposed?\"","\"That’s true too...\"","\"What do you mean? This question is simple. The Taoist Court bribed Lao Ba to leak intelligence, now that he’s exposed, he’s useless. The Taoist Court dogs would rather skin him, break his bones, and extract some secrets from his mouth.\"","\"Thus, defecting to the Demon Sect means death, defecting to the Taoist Court is also death, his only choice was to flee.\"","\"So, we need to catch him before the Taoist Court does, can’t let him fall into their hands.\"","\"Who will go kill him?\"","At this question, everyone subdued their breath and fell silent.","Fighting among fellow members, coupled with the risk of being detected by the Taoist Court, was not something anyone wanted to do.","\"Let Lao Si go then.\"","\"Elder Xue?\"","\"Indeed, Lao Si has been locked up for a year, he hasn’t had a kill in a long time, letting him kill Lao Ba is just right. He’s simple-minded, as long as there’s someone to kill, he’s fine.\"","Elder You frowned, \"Lao Si isn’t easily mobilized, if he kills too much, the thing residing in him...\"","Elder You paused, not daring to say those two words, instead saying, \"If the killings are too heavy, his evil thoughts will grow boundlessly, and once they exceed the limit, the flesh body of a Golden Core won’t be able to bear it. If he goes berserk, we followers of the Divine Lord would all die by the Divine Lord’s hand.\"","Everyone’s expressions changed at these words.","At the standoff, the usually silent leader of the Demon Sect, sitting at the head, suddenly spoke:","\"Let Lao Si go.\"","His voice was dull and hoarse, exuding unquestionable authority.","Elder You didn’t understand, but it was the leader’s command, so he said: \"Yes, I’ll arrange to release Lao Si.\"","The decision was made just like that, but someone was puzzled, \"Lao Ba’s whereabouts are unknown, how do we chase him?\"","Elder You said: \"Mr. Yuan is skilled in the Yuan Magnetic Formation, he has ways to track Lao Ba.\"","\"Again with this Mr. Yuan?\"","Everyone frowned.","The elderly Second Elder in the upper seat then confirmed with Elder You: \"Lao San, is this Mr. Yuan really trustworthy?\"","Elder You contemplated for a moment before saying slowly: \"This person is a perfect ’tool.’\"","The Second Elder understood and nodded: \"Good.\"","...","After the meeting ended and departing the Blood Pool, Elder You sent a transmission to Mo Hua:","\"Mr. Yuan, the sect will send Lao Si to kill Lao Ba, please guide him.\"","Mo Hua hesitated: \"This task is not easy to handle...\"","\"Then Mr....\"","Mo Hua: \"Needs more money.\"","Elder You paused, then said: \"Three hundred thousand Spirit Stones.\"","Mo Hua responded readily: \"Deal!\"","Elder You transmitted a piece of Magnetic Pattern to Mo Hua, \"Lao Si loves killing, and has an unstable mind, but he can still understand the Demon Sect Token.\"","\"When Mr. Yuan locates Lao Ba, pass it to Lao Si for him to chase and kill.\"","\"As for how to locate, how to use this Magnetic Pattern, Mr. Yuan is an ’expert,’ I suppose I don’t need to say more...\"","Actually, Mo Hua didn’t quite know either.","He had used Thunder Magnetic Flow for locating, but to use the relationship between the Demon Sect Token and the Original Magnetic Compound Formation for positioning, he hadn’t tried yet.","But at such times, he couldn’t show hesitation, Mo Hua said confidently: \"Of course.\"","\"Thank you, Mr. Yuan.\"","\"Rest assured, Elder You, the Eighth Elder won’t escape.\"","Then Elder You transmitted a piece of Magnetic Pattern to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua spent some time studying this Magnetic Pattern, and discovered that within it was an Original Magnet Sequence, and it was an elder-level sequence.","Using this Original Magnet Sequence, one could utilize the formation pivot of the Original Magnetic Compound Formation to locate the corresponding Sect Token’s position."]},{"number":1845,"title":"Chapter 1845 - 913: Little Smiling Face (Part 2)","paragraphs":["This isn’t too difficult.","Mo Hua was thrown into this situation suddenly, but after pondering for a bit, he roughly understood it.","Moreover now, the entire Yuan Magnetic Sea of the Demon Sect is under his control.","He is both the thief and the gatekeeper.","He \"abuses his authority for personal gain,\" with hardly any scruples, so researching things became much convenient.","After comprehending the principles, Mo Hua began to officially manipulate the \"pursuit trap\" concerning the Taoist Court, the Demon Sect, and the two Golden Core Demons.","...","Gubei Mountain.","The Eighth Elder, who had just escaped from the Taoist Court’s grasp, was hiding in a secluded forest, his heart in turmoil.","He didn’t understand how things had suddenly spiraled to this point.","Not long ago, he was a Golden Core Elder of the Demon Sect, enjoying the blood of his blood slaves, revered by disciples, able to summon wind and rain, basking in much prestige.","But in the blink of an eye, he became a stray dog.","The Taoist Court wanted to capture him.","The Demon Sect wanted to kill him.","This change was too fast, too fast for anyone to react.","This made him vaguely feel as if someone had been plotting against him all along.","And just at this moment, the Elder’s Token quivered, and a message came:","\"Taoist Court’s people are to your southwest, they will find you in about an hour. You must flee north.\"","\"The Demon Sect wants to kill you too; Elder Xue has already been released...\"","Upon hearing the name \"Elder Xue\", the Eighth Elder’s face turned pale as he gritted his teeth and used the Demon Sect Token to question:","\"Who exactly are you?\"","Anonymous person: \"I am the person helping you.\"","\"Why are you helping me?\"","\"You don’t need to know.\"","The Eighth Elder sneered, \"Do you think I will easily believe your words? How do I know you’re not deceiving me?\"","\"You have no choice but to believe me; this is your last straw to clutch at. If you don’t grasp it, you face only death. Either die at the hands of the Taoist Court or at Elder Xue’s hands.\"","The Eighth Elder’s mind was racing, \"No, the Taoist Court won’t kill me, they just...\"","\"I tricked them...\" Mo Hua said, \"I deceived them into believing you had secrets of the Demon Sect, so they didn’t kill you. But now they’ve found out that the Demon Sect abandoned you, you’re surely doomed.\"","\"Impossible, I don’t believe it! This is all one-sided from you!\"","\"Then let’s make a bet.\"","\"What bet?\"","\"Bet on whether the Taoist Court will find you in half an hour and whether they will do as I say and kill you.\"","The Eighth Elder trembled, questioning:","\"Who exactly are you? How do you know so much?\"","\"Why does the Taoist Court listen to you?\"","\"How are you also so knowledgeable about the Demon Sect’s movements?\"","\"Who on earth are you?!\"","But the Elder’s Token remained silent; these messages vanished like a stone sinking into the sea, without any response.","The other side did not answer him.","What to do?","The Eighth Elder was torn internally.","Flee directly? But where to flee?","Returning to the Demon Sect was impossible.","Over years, his greedy embezzling had been exposed. Going back was no different from walking into a trap.","Escape in the direction this anonymous person instructed?","What if it’s a trap?","\"Or... verify it first? See if this anonymous person’s words are true, whether the Taoist Court is really pursuing me?\"","The Eighth Elder thought for a moment and decided to take a gamble.","He took out a blood and flesh puppet, draped his Demon Sect Taoist Robe over it, and then used Earth Escape to hide himself far away.","About half an hour later, figures appeared in the distance. Sure enough, cultivators from the Taoist Court came.","The one leading them was Gu Changhuai.","As soon as he saw the puppet, without saying a word, he conjured a Wind Blade, slicing the puppet in two, flesh and blood flying.","Gu Changhuai approached to check, frowning: \"Fake?\"","He then looked around and commanded loudly: \"Search the surroundings, find the Demon Sect’s Eighth Elder, and kill him on the spot.\"","An Enforcement Leader stepped forward and whispered: \"Supervisor, should we really kill him?\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was cold, \"He’s useless now, why keep him alive?\"","These words, although distant, still reached the Eighth Elder’s ears intermittently, making his heart sink.","\"That anonymous person is completely correct!\"","At that moment, the Elder’s Token quivered again, another anonymous message came:","\"Run, they have already discovered you.\"","The Eighth Elder felt a chill in his heart. Sweeping with his Divine Sense, he realized that his hiding place had long been detected by these Taoist Court cultivators.","They pretended to search, but were in fact aimlessly \"encircling\" him.","\"Good show, Gu Changhuai, you’re truly cunning and shameless, pretending so perfectly!\"","The Eighth Elder hesitated no longer, immediately transforming into escape light, turning into a ball of Blood Qi, and fled northwards.","Gu Changhuai silently watched this escape light, and after a moment, ordered: \"Chase, but don’t pursue too tightly.\"","\"Yes!\"","...","The mountain winds roared, vegetation and shadows rapidly slipped by, intermingled with the stench of monster beasts’ rotting flesh in the mountain air.","The Eighth Elder was anxious, desperately fleeing.","At this moment, he could confirm that the words of the anonymous person were not false.","Though he didn’t know the person’s name or identity, it seemed they genuinely wanted to help him.","If not for their misleading of the Taoist Court, informing him of his embezzlement exposure, he would have been dead without a burial place.","Thereafter, Mo Hua truly guided him accurately, leading him to evade several blockades by the Taoist Court, charging all the way towards the northwest.","The Eighth Elder felt slightly relieved.","Unknown to him, in the direction he was racing towards, Elder Xue, clad in blood-soaked robes and exuding malevolence like an executioner, was also charging towards him under Mo Hua’s guidance."]},{"number":1846,"title":"Chapter 1846 - 913: Little Smiling Face (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The fleeing Eighth Elder, and the vengeful Elder Xue, under the orchestration of Mo Hua, were recklessly rushing towards each other.","Finally, under Mo Hua’s \"manipulation\", a few hours later, the Eighth Elder, who had been hurriedly traveling, was now less than ten miles away from Elder Xue.","Mo Hua pretended to be unaware and sent a transmission: \"Not good, Elder Xue has caught up to you.\"","The Eighth Elder, who had thought everything was smooth sailing, felt as if he had fallen into an icy abyss.","\"How is it possible? How could he catch up with me?!\"","Because I’m leading him to you...","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","But the truth was too cruel, and Mo Hua couldn’t bear to say it out loud.","\"It’s too late, quickly, go to the left!\" Mo Hua instructed the Eighth Elder on the path.","The Eighth Elder gritted his teeth; he had no choice but to run to the left.","He didn’t want to encounter the \"Evil Star\" like the Fourth Elder.","After running for a while, Mo Hua again said: \"There are Taoist Court Officials ahead, turn right!\"","The Eighth Elder had no choice but to turn right again. After running for a bit, Mo Hua said: \"Elder Xue is less than five miles away, go left again.\"","Startled, the Eighth Elder turned left again.","Then Mo Hua directed him left and right, causing the Eighth Elder to run in circles. During this time, Gu Changhuai had already ordered the Taoist Court cultivators to lay a trap at the location designated by Mo Hua.","The Eighth Elder was step by step approaching a dead end.","Even the Eighth Elder realized something was amiss.","He was circling without escaping the mountains, and the more he fled, the more perilous it became. When he looked up, he found that unknowingly, he had been led to the base of a cliff.","Three sides were sheer rock walls, even birds couldn’t pass, and there was no escape from this dangerous terrain.","Where is this?","The Eighth Elder felt a chill in his heart and, with trembling hands, took out the Elder’s Token and sent a message to Mo Hua: \"Which way should I go?\"","Mo Hua: \"You guess.\"","The Eighth Elder was furious.","Guess your stupid head!","\"Hurry up! Tell me, which way should I go?!\" the Eighth Elder demanded angrily.","\"Left.\"","\"The left is a rock wall!\"","\"Then right.\"","\"All three sides are mountains!\"","\"That can’t be right, how could it be mountains...\"","The trust that the Eighth Elder had gradually built for \"Mo Hua\" bit by bit was crumbling.","A terrifying suspicion arose in his heart.","\"Have you been... deceiving me all along? Are you... ’playing’ with me?!\"","After sending this message, the Demon Sect Token fell silent for a long time without a reply, and the Eighth Elder’s heart was growing colder by the minute.","An unknown amount of time passed before the Demon Sect Token suddenly trembled.","The Eighth Elder quickly checked it, and a message came through the token, but it contained no words, only a...","A small smiley face drawn with Magnetic Ink.","This simple smiley face was pure and cute, yet exuded a sinister and eerie aura.","The Eighth Elder turned pale, his knees weak.","\"It’s over...\"","He turned to run, but upon doing so, he found a figure clad in blood-stained robes, emitting a menacing aura, like an \"executioner\" — Elder Xue, was already standing behind him unbeknownst to him.","Elder Xue slowly drew his Blood Blade, his throat moving as he said:","\"Traitor...\"","The Eighth Elder offered no explanation.","In front of the deranged Elder Xue, words were futile.","He tore open his arm, extracting a piece of stark white, blood-dripping bone spike — his Demon Path own Magical Treasure.","At this point, a fight to the death was inevitable.","The Eighth Elder and Elder Xue, with one word dispute, were engaged in a battle, Demonic Qi surged, Blood Blade and bone spike clashed, locked in an equal struggle for a brief moment.","But the Eighth Elder was no match for the bloodthirsty Elder Xue; after a few dozen rounds, he was falling behind.","As he tangled with Elder Xue, he picked up a Blood Talisman, placed it in his mouth, and upon expelling it, it transformed into a Blood Curse Skull, which bit down on Elder Xue, limiting his actions.","With this opportunity, the Eighth Elder desperately tried to escape.","But he hadn’t made it several feet before facing a wall of shadows, an array of Taoist Court Golden Core Stewards, and Foundation Establishment Late Stage Enforcement Leaders formed a human barricade, surrounding him completely.","The leader, elegant and handsome with an indifferent face, was none other than Gu Changhuai.","The Eighth Elder was filled with despair.","He understood now, from the beginning, this was a trap.","From beginning to end, he had been manipulated by others at their whim.","And even now, he didn’t know who had been toying with him.","In his final moments, the only thing etched in his memory was that simple yet eerie, small smiley face drawn with Magnetic Ink...","...","Far away, over a thousand miles at Taixu Mountain.","Mo Hua put away the Guest Elder Token.","He had done everything he could, and the follow-up of eliminating the Eighth Elder and Elder Xue from the Demon Sect would be handled by Uncle Gu.","Two Golden Core Demons, their cultivation was too high for him to handle at the moment, he could only hide behind the scenes and play small tricks at most.","\"I hope everything goes smoothly, and Uncle Gu can kill those two Golden Core Demons and then send my ’package’ over.\"","\"I hope Uncle Gu and the others remain safe.\"","\"With so many people from the Taoist Court in pursuit, Uncle Gu should not die...\"","Mo Hua was a bit worried but could only wait quietly for the outcome.","This process was unexpectedly lengthy.","Was the Eighth Elder too cunning and escaped, or was Elder Xue too powerful and hard to kill...","After a half-day of anxious waiting, Gu Changhuai finally sent a transmission:","\"Both are dead, it went relatively smoothly.\"","Only then did Mo Hua breathe a sigh of relief.","\"In two days, I’ll give you the map,\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"Okay.\"","\"I have more work to deal with afterward...\"","\"Alright, Uncle Gu, familiar with the process of the Taoist Court. You go on with your work.\"","After finishing the conversation with Gu Changhuai, Mo Hua thought for a moment and then took out the Guest Elder Token, sending a transmission to Elder You of the Demon Sect as \"Mr. Yuan\":","\"Elder Xue fulfilled his duty and killed the Eighth Elder.\"","\"But the Taoist Court was too despicable, with their overwhelming numbers, Elder Xue couldn’t survive either...\"","The other side was silent for a moment before replying:","\"I understand, thank you, Mr. Yuan.\"","Although losing two Golden Core Elders, Elder You’s tone seemed somewhat calm.","Mo Hua found it puzzling.","However, it might also be that Elder You was deep in scheming, revealing no emotions of joy or anger.","To solidify his \"character,\" Mo Hua added:","\"I’ve done what I needed to do, don’t forget about the reward, Elder You.\"","Elder You: \"Don’t worry, Mr. Yuan.\"","The conversation ended there.","Mo Hua put the matter aside for the moment and focused on waiting for his \"package.\"","Two days later, Gu Changhuai came to the Taixu Gate and personally handed over the Five Elements Map sealed with \"Evil Spirits\" to Mo Hua.","\"Killing two demons, sealing twice, not sure if there would be any issue.\"","\"There should be none...\"","\"You know what you’re doing, the Taoist Court has matters to attend to, I’ll not delay further,\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"Alright.\"","Mo Hua waved goodbye to Gu Changhuai, then, holding the Five Elements Map, as before, went to a secluded hill near Taixu Mountain, with anticipation in his heart.","Two Divine Remains!","Just eat them, refine them, and his Divine Sense Sublimation would advance enough, and the bottleneck of Heaven Yan Jue would be broken.","Foundation Establishment Late Stage, within reach."]},{"number":1847,"title":"Chapter 1847 - 914: Slash!","paragraphs":["\"Finally, I can break through the Foundation Establishment Late Stage!\"","Mo Hua was overjoyed.","Outside Taixu Mountain, on a remote mountain peak.","As usual, Mo Hua laid out the meditation cushion, set up the Formation, prepared thoroughly, and then sat on the cushion to open the Five Elements Map.","The moment the Five Elements Map unfolded, in just the blink of an eye, a very fierce Evil Qi surged into Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness like a river.","Mo Hua didn’t even have time to react, his face turned pale, he lowered his head, and fainted.","In the Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua opened his eyes.","In front of him, there was a Divine Remains.","The Divine Remains was thinner compared to before, not as strong and ferocious.","And it had its back to Mo Hua, its shoulders moved, as if chewing something.","\"Only one? Shouldn’t there be two?\" Mo Hua frowned, pondered for a moment, and then shook his head, \"Forget it, one is enough, I’ll just eat it first.\"","The Divine Remains in front, just kill it with one sword.","Mo Hua didn’t want to waste time, clenched his hand, conjured a Sword of Divine Thought, and with a flicker, approached the Divine Remains, slashing at its head with the sword.","The Divine Remains seemed to sense something, hesitated for a moment, but didn’t have time to turn around.","This sword, full of Divine Thought, and sharp Sword Qi, slashed towards the top of its head.","Strong waves of Divine Thought spread, the surroundings trembled for a moment.","But the next moment, Mo Hua’s expression changed slightly.","The Sword of Divine Thought, which had always been invincible, was grasped by a claw, as if trapped in Mountain Stone, unable to advance any further.","At the same time, a powerful aura spread from the Divine Remains.","Mo Hua’s pupils narrowed, retracted the Sword of Divine Thought, and backed away.","The Divine Remains slowly stood up, turned its head to look at Mo Hua.","It had long, sharp horns, a skull-like face, scarlet eyes revealing madness but steady killing intent, its body humanoid, slender yet containing great power.","On its body, filthy black water and foul-smelling blood water mingled together, emitting a terrifying stench.","And these black water and blood water deeply penetrated its bones, forming an \"armor\" as real as substance.","\"Third Grade...\"","Mo Hua’s heart jumped, his expression serious.","The Divine Remains turned, facing Mo Hua, its powerful aura fully emanating.","At this moment, Mo Hua also saw, at the corner of the Divine Remains’ mouth, there was black blood, between its teeth, Divine Thought formed \"flesh\", and on the ground, there were \"bone fragments\" chewed up...","There were indeed two Divine Remains.","The other one was eaten by it.","Mo Hua said lightly: \"You even eat your kin?\"","The scarlet gaze of the Divine Remains calmly looked at Mo Hua, its voice hoarse and hollow, revealing murderous intent yet unnaturally calm:","\"Among the Divine Remains, there are no kin, it’s a matter of life and death. Those who survive are the ’gods’.","\"And the Divine Remains are inherently one, it is me, and I am it, whether it eats me or I eat it, ultimately it’s the same.\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","He felt this sentence contained a vast amount of information, implicitly revealing the ecology of the Divine Remains and the internal competition and cruelty among the Evil Gods.","The Divine Remains chewed a few more times, swallowed the last bit of remains clean, and then looked at Mo Hua, coldly said:","\"So, it’s you, hunting ’me’?\"","These words carried a trace of killing intent.","Mo Hua’s gaze darkened, just about to speak, but saw the Divine Remains in front of him suddenly disappear, his heart couldn’t help but tense.","The next moment, a claw suddenly appeared in front of him.","Mo Hua raised his fist, colliding with it, and felt as if he had punched a Stone, a strong shock force came.","Mo Hua’s white fist developed cracks.","His body was also blasted several feet away, and only with difficulty did he barely manage to stand firm.","\"So fast! So strong!\"","Mo Hua’s heart tightened, \"And the refinement of Divine Thought is far above my own!\"","\"This is... a Third Grade Divine Remains...\"","After blasting Mo Hua away with a punch, the lean, elegant yet sinister and murderous form of the Divine Remains was revealed, a playful expression appeared on its White Bone face.","\"With the posture of a Divine Fetus, divinity inherently present, no wonder... clearly just Second Grade, yet able to effortlessly hunt ’Divine Remains’.","\"But that’s surely not all...\"","After speaking, the Divine Remains disappeared again.","At the moment it disappeared, Mo Hua instinctively felt a warning, his fingers swiftly pointed to the ground, Divine Thought formed a Pattern, creating a Golden Bell Array out of thin air.","As soon as the Formation was created, the Golden Bell shrouded, suddenly a Blood Claw tore through, shattering the Golden Bell to pieces.","With this moment of opportunity, Mo Hua also retreated, very narrowly dodging the Divine Remains’ Blood Claw.","\"Divine Skills? No, could it be... Formation?\"","The voice of the Divine Remains carried a hint of surprise, but its offensive didn’t stop, once again transforming into a Blood Shadow, closing in.","Mo Hua, while using the Water Passing Step to dodge, simultaneously mobilized Divine Thought, and with a point of his finger, a Water Prison was generated out of nowhere, six water-colored chains binding the Divine Remains within.","\"Spell? Not bad...\"","The Divine Remains struggled, breaking the chains, escaping the Water Prison Technique, and with a reverse grip, conjured a black-red Blood Blade, slashing fiercely toward Mo Hua.","Mo Hua gritted his teeth, clenching his white hand.","A Sword Array birthed Sword Patterns, Sword Patterns birthed Sword Bone, forming a brilliant Sever Gold Sword, forcefully clashing with the Divine Remains’ Blood Blade.","In an instant, Divine Thought collided face-to-face, gold and blood colors erupted.","When the waves settled, the Divine Remains took a step back.","Mo Hua stepped back seven steps.","With great difficulty, he barely steadied himself, his hand tingled, his heart trembled.","\"A Third Grade Divine Remains, so powerful...\"","Moreover, this should only be a Third Rank Early Stage Divine Remains, its Divine Thought Power, compared to the Second Grade Divine Remains, even those at the Peak of Second Grade, isn’t even on the same level."]},{"number":1848,"title":"Chapter 1848 - 914: Slash! (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Since they met, Mo Hua has been suppressed without much chance to fight back.","Within just a mere ten rounds, the Divine Remains had forced Mo Hua to reveal all his techniques.","\"Formation, Spell, Swordsmanship...\"","The Divine Remains murmured, somewhat surprised, yet somewhat understanding, \"Perhaps this is the advantage of using a human as an ’embryo’.\"","\"Divinity is born from the Dao, strong but finite, humans live by understanding the Dao, weak yet endless...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback by these words, his pupils contracted slightly:","\"You are not an ordinary ’Divine Remains’? What exactly are you?\"","\"I should be asking you this...\" The Divine Remains’ eyes glowed red as it coldly stated, \"What exactly are you?\"","\"You’re neither human nor deity, yet both human and deity, claimed to be an ’embryo’, but the origin is unseen...\"","The Divine Remains waved its arm, the Blood Blade slashed a streak of blood light towards Mo Hua, \"...I’ve lived so long, yet never encountered such an unfathomable existence like you.\"","Mo Hua used the Sever Gold Sword to block the blade light, yet the force of it still pushed him back four or five steps.","The Divine Thought Power of a Third Grade Divine Remains was formidable and exceptional.","Mo Hua’s arm began to ache, his Divine Thought form had a few more cracks.","Since his cultivation reached Foundation Establishment and his Divine Sense transformed, this was the strongest \"Divine Thought Object\" he had encountered thus far. Merely from the thickness and oppression of the Divine Thought, it even surpassed the newly born Evil Embryo.","Mo Hua’s mind turned, then he honestly said, \"I’ll let you out, let’s cease fighting.\"","He felt that he might not be able to defeat this Third Grade Divine Remains.","Even if he could win, it would be a pyrrhic victory. There was no need to fight to the death while the secret of his Sea of Consciousness remained hidden.","He gave it this opportunity, granting it a path to survival.","\"Let’s part on good terms.\" Mo Hua thickened his skin to say.","The expressionless face of the Divine Remains displayed a complicated look, \"Indeed, your humanity is abundant, full of cunning and deceit.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat displeased.","The Divine Remains raised the Blood Blade, blood qi surged, the souls on the blade snarled ferociously, and the fusion of black and red on its White Bone became deeper.","It harbored genuine killing intent.","The Divine Remains had previously held back, only after forcing out Mo Hua’s techniques did it show its true power...","Mo Hua’s heart tightened slightly, but in the blink of an eye, a scarlet blood light slashed toward his face with unmatched speed.","This strike was faster, fiercer.","Mo Hua frowned, having to hastily meet it with his sword in defense once more.","But this time, the blood light was so condensed it seemed tangible, with anguished spirits howling above it. When it struck Mo Hua’s Sever Gold Sword, the blood qi, like toxic water, eroded the Gold-Cutting Sword after only a moment of confrontation.","The gold sword dissolved, Mo Hua’s expression changed, he could only retreat, yet before he moved far, a flash of blood shadow behind him, the Divine Remains appeared at his back.","Its sharp White Bone claws tore into Mo Hua’s back.","Evil Thoughts turned into blood water, seeping into his back, leaving a \"bloody\" wound.","Mo Hua felt the pain, retaliating with a reflexive slash of one sword, but it was easily blocked by the Divine Remains’ sharp claws.","Mo Hua’s old strength was exhausted, new strength ungenerated, he immediately turned serious, realizing this was unfavorable, but it was too late.","After blocking Mo Hua’s sword, the Divine Remains extended its White Bone claw, reversing its grip on Mo Hua’s longsword, giving it a twist.","The Sever Gold Sword, already polluted with blood water and corroded, shattered completely.","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought ached, abandoning the sword in an attempt to escape, but the Third Grade Divine Remains was faster, claw turning into a fist, carrying blood light, it punched towards Mo Hua’s head.","At the critical moment, Mo Hua could only use Water Passing Step to barely avoid his head being hit, but the punch was so fast, his shoulder was inevitably struck, his whole person was sent flying like a \"small sandbag\", crashing to the ground, tumbling several times before stopping.","Within his Divine Thought, immense pain spread.","Mo Hua gritted his teeth, enduring the pain, still managing to stand up.","His back was marked with bloody streaks, the Sword of Divine Thought broken, with several bruises on his arms, he was panting and appeared extremely battered.","This was the first time he’d been so embarrassed after his success in the Divine Way.","Even in the past, when he was merely a minor Qi Refining Cultivator, encountering the Little Green-faced Ghost without any knowledge, he was never in such a predicament as now.","Mo Hua’s expression gradually grew cold.","The Divine Remains sent Mo Hua flying with a punch but did not pursue, instead, it looked down at its own sharp claw.","On its White Bone claw, there were tiny scars.","These wounds were left from being hurt by the sword edge when it twisted the Sword of Divine Thought apart, very minor, but with a faint irritating pain.","This was the Sword Dao of humans, forsaking all else, solely for killing...","The Divine Remains said, \"Indeed, the spell points of human cultivators are intriguing... able to use Second Grade Divine Thought to harm my Third Grade Divine Body.\"","\"But, your Dao is still too weak...\"","The Divine Remains raised its head, its crimson and hollow eyes looked indifferently at Mo Hua.","\"Using such small tactics, killing a few low-grade Divine Remains, does it make you very pleased? Is that enough to satisfy you?\"","\"Perhaps you have had deep chances and gained much inheritance, but your ’Dao’ is jumbled and chaotic.\"","\"Your use of Divine Thought Skill is clumsy and forceful.\"","\"You fundamentally don’t understand what constitutes true ’Dao Hua’.\"","The Divine Remains raised the Blood Blade, pointing straight at Mo Hua, \"If this is all you have, you shall die here today. Your entire foundation of Divine Thought, and the rich Divine Embryo will become my nourishment, paving the way for my godhood...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was indifferent, saying nothing, yet he re-manifested a Sword of Divine Thought.","This sword was no longer golden, but pale yellow, the Sword Qi extended, thick and serene, unhurried, appearing incomparably profound."]},{"number":1849,"title":"Chapter 1849 - 914: Sever! (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Taia Mountain Opening Sword.","The Sword Forms are like earth, nurturing all creatures, endlessly thriving.","The Divine Remains turned its crimson eyes, transforming into blood, instantly disappearing, and in a split second, approached Mo Hua with a blood blade carrying an incomparably sharp killing intent, slashing straight towards Mo Hua’s head.","But this slash was blocked.","The Taia Mountain Opening Sword, with its solid Sword Form, blocked this fierce blood blade from the Divine Remains.","The blood blade did not advance an inch further.","Mo Hua did not step back either.","In fact, they both showed a \"balance of power\" stance.","The hollow eyes of the Divine Remains flickered with a hint of light, \"Blood belongs to water, earth overcomes water, and also...\"","It looked towards the body of Mo Hua, where the flowing golden \"liquid\" surged within his limbs and bones.","\"Using the power of Divine Marrow to bridge the gap between Second Grade and Third Grade Divine Thought...\"","The voice of the Divine Remains was hoarse, \"Not bad...\"","Mo Hua scoffed coldly, swinging his sword to disperse the blood blade of the Divine Remains, then he activated the Divine Marrow, unleashing the power of Divine Thought, infusing it into the Mountain Opening Sword in his hand.","The Mountain Opening Sword brimmed with a majestic Sword Dao aura.","Mo Hua wielded the Taia Mountain Opening Sword, twirling the sword blade, and began to engage in a fierce battle with the Divine Remains.","Man and Divine Remains, fighting closely, exchanging sword and blade, move by move, blood-red blade light intersecting with mountain-opening Sword Qi.","The surroundings were silent but oppressive, filled with killing intent.","The blade of the Divine Remains was swift and ruthless; Mo Hua’s sword was heavy and steady.","In just the blink of an eye, the swords and blades clashed tens of times, leaving blood marks on Mo Hua’s body and sword marks on the white bones of the Divine Remains.","The offense and defense quickly alternated, the sword and blade collided rapidly, no words were exchanged, only the bare and bloody combat.","For a moment, it was an equal encounter.","Stimulated, the Divine Remains unleashed its killing intent, fighting more enthusiastically, its whole body’s Blood Qi surged, its breath turned frenzied, and its blade grew faster and fiercer, the blood-colored blade light impenetrably dense. In its mind, there was almost only the word \"kill\".","Mo Hua also felt enormous pressure.","In such a rapid close-quarters fight, he had hardly any leisure to condense spells, manifest formations, or devise strategies.","All he could do was fight.","What he could rely on was only the \"sword\" in his hand.","What he could use were only the sword moves.","And they were not advanced swordsmanship, only the basic sword moves taught by Patriarch Dugu from the Sword Tomb in the back mountain.","In the truly brutal and severe close-quarter fights, all flashy moves were burdensome, all redundant skills useless.","Everything returned to simplicity, only the most basic moves mattered: slash, chop, stab, kill.","Mo Hua had weak Sword Dao basics, so he practiced the basics quite a lot instead.","He completed all the Sword Dao homework assigned by Patriarch Dugu in the back mountain meticulously.","Perhaps these sword moves were not powerful for Mo Hua in real situations.","But now, in the clash of Divine Thoughts, they were of great use.","Mo Hua integrated all these basic sword moves into an almost \"instinctive\" killing spree, focusing solely on delivering the fastest, fiercest, and most potent strike at the Divine Remains in front.","As the battle waged on and the fight reached its peak, Mo Hua’s expression turned cold, reflecting a hint of bloodthirst, his gaze also revealing a touch of madness.","He seemed to forget everything, forgot his spells, formations, himself, and even the sword in his hand.","He forgot whether it was him fighting or the sword fighting.","The sword in his hand seemed to become a part of his body.","He was the sword, the sword was him.","At this moment, Mo Hua vaguely understood what \"Sword Dao\" really was, what \"Man Sword Unity\" truly meant.","The Divine Remains fighting Mo Hua became more and more shocked.","If it estimated correctly, this Divine Fetus kid was originally relying on spells, movement techniques, and formations, all his previous fights full of cunning and craftiness.","But under intense combat pressure and after a prolonged close-quarter battle with it, it seemed to provoke some ruthless nature within this Divine Fetus kid, allowing him to realize something.","His sword grew faster, fiercer, advancing relentlessly, fighting till death, like a bloodthirsty \"little madman\".","And within his sword, the essence of \"Sword Dao\" grew stronger, the Sword Qi became sharper.","Its blood blade could gradually no longer suppress his sword light.","\"Deities wield the Dao, cultivators comprehend the Dao.\"","\"But this is not the way to ’comprehend’, his comprehension is too outrageous...\"","The Divine Remains’ gaze grew somewhat grave.","Yet as Mo Hua’s Sword Intent intensified, its blade momentum began to wane.","Still, the Divine Remains remained unmoved, continuing the fierce battle with Mo Hua.","After a while of fierce fighting, Mo Hua suddenly struck a blow that shook off the Divine Remains, halting his sword, making no further moves.","He appeared puzzled, then gradually realized, speaking to the Divine Remains: \"Are you wearing me down?\"","The Divine Remains responded indifferently: \"The battle of Divine Thoughts is inherently a war of attrition.\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua shook his head, \"You are wearing down my physical body.\"","Having fought till now, he suddenly noticed his physical body’s Blood Qi weakened slightly, only then realizing the burden that Divine Sense places on the physical body.","He was only at Foundation Building Cultivation level.","This Third Grade Divine Remains possessed ’Golden Core’ stage Divine Thought, invading his Sea of Consciousness beyond his physical body’s limits.","The Divine Remains was an external evil, not his own Divine Thought, thus exerting great pressure on his Sea of Consciousness.","Moreover, just now it had thrown its full strength, clashing with him for such a long time.","The fluctuations of Third Grade Divine Thought continuously assaulted his Sea of Consciousness, naturally impacting his physical body as well—at least impacting his mind."]},{"number":1850,"title":"Chapter 1850 - 914: Slay! (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua understood the purpose of this Divine Remains:","If it could kill him, then it would.","If it couldn’t kill him, it would exhaust him, drain his flesh and blood, shatter his Sea of Consciousness, and ruin his physical body.","That would be equivalent to death for him.","And if he couldn’t quickly destroy it, the one to die in the end would still be \"himself.\"","The Divine Remains looked at Mo Hua and said openly, \"You truly are clever.\"","But Mo Hua was not happy at all.","He knew that if he didn’t come up with a plan to swiftly slaughter this \"Divine Remains,\" once his body was destroyed, he would be unable to cultivate the Dao anymore.","Moreover, he could not afford to wear himself out.","To battle this Third Grade Divine Remains, he had been continuously depleting his \"Divine Marrow.\" The Divine Marrow was precious and hard to obtain; he simply couldn’t afford to exhaust it.","By now, he was close to being \"spent exhaustively in both oil and lamp.\"","Mo Hua looked up at the Divine Remains and said openly, \"You are strong, but now I’m going to slay you, you’re going to die.\"","The empty eyes of the Divine Remains slightly trembled, then it chuckled softly:","\"With your Dao, you still can’t slay me. Your Dao is too mixed...\"","\"Though mixed, it is plentiful,\" Mo Hua said.","He then dispersed the Taia Mountain Opening Sword in his hand, his hands forming an imaginary grip, raised above his head. In the depths of his eyes, golden light flowed, and his entire aura suddenly transformed, like a mountain or an abyss, like a saint who shows compassion to all living beings, yet like a deity who shows indifference to all life.","At the same time, countless Divine Thoughts transformed into flowing light, congregating between the imaginary grips of Mo Hua’s hands.","First was the Formation, then the Formation circulated, manifesting a Sword Array, ultimately condensing into various Sword Forms.","The first was the relentless, unceasing, yet ever-forward Taia Mountain Opening Sword.","Following it was the sharp-edged, golden-glow blazing Sever Gold Sword.","The icy and eerie Gui Water Sword...","The raging Li Fire Sword...","...","One formation after another, condensed into a Sword Array, transformed into Sword Forms, overlapped in Mo Hua’s hands, converging into the embryonic form of an \"Godslaying Sword,\" its light dazzling, extremely sharp, instilling a vague dread.","This \"Godslaying Sword,\" because it incorporated numerous \"Transforming Sword Skills,\" boasted a mottled luster and circulating Laws, longer and wider than his previous Sword of Divine Thought.","The Divine Remains watched in stunned disbelief.","It never expected that such a \"hodgepodge\" Divine Thought Sword Skill would exist in this world.","Moreover, Mo Hua was right, \"though mixed, it is plentiful...\"","The Formation Dao, Five Elements Dao, Sword Dao contained within were so numerous it was inconceivable, numbing its scalp...","No matter its power, this must not be allowed to manifest.","While Mo Hua was condensing Qi and gathering strength, the Blood Qi surrounding the Divine Remains surged, transforming into a blood light, charging straight at Mo Hua, the Blood Blade in its hand aiming for Mo Hua’s forehead.","But just as it reached halfway, Mo Hua’s pupils glinted, sinister prison-like sword light formed a Sword Dao prison, directly suppressing the Divine Remains.","The sword pierced through the shoulder blades, and the prison suppressed the Seven Souls.","Soul-Shocking Sword!","At this point, Mo Hua paid no heed to taboos, directly using the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill he had originally \"sealed.\"","The Divine Remains was instantly intimidated into immobility, its mind filled with fear.","It calculated that within five breaths, it could break this Divine Thought Technique, but this time was enough for the Divine Fetus boy in front of it to successfully condense his unknown Sword Form.","\"Then Dao against Dao, let’s see who lives and who dies...\"","The Divine Remains’ killing intent was resolute, scarlet eyes seeping blood.","Not just its eyes, its entire body was drenched in blood, becoming blood-soaked, powerful and terrifying.","An aura of \"Dao\" emanated from it, infused with slaughter, cruelty, obliteration, murder, a deathly stillness, and the meaning of \"blood.\"","The blood surrounding the Divine Remains gathered upward, forming a bright scarlet blade above its head, a \"Blood-Slaughter Blade\" that claimed innumerable lives and devoured endless blood.","After the Blood Blade condensed, its powerful Divine Thought Aura spread out, its bloody yet pure Law of Dao above Mo Hua’s hodgepodge \"Godslaying Sword.\"","The Divine Remains’ eyes revealed cruelty.","\"This Divine Fetus boy is certain to die today.\"","And at this moment, Mo Hua’s gaze deepened, his expression solemn, finally beginning to condense the final \"Sword Intent.\"","This was what he practiced diligently day and night, severing his Life Soul, merging it with his Divine Soul through the wounds of Divine Thought, the Tai Xu Sword Flow.","It’s the ancient Sword Dao Origin of the Taixu Gate, painstakingly researched and condensed by generations of predecessors!","\"...What is this?!\"","Perceiving this aura, the Divine Remains found it hard to believe.","The Tai Xu Sword Intent, ancient and long-lasting, was powerful and unfathomable.","The Sword Dao Origin merged into it, finally granting Mo Hua’s \"Godslaying Sword\" its embryonic form.","Mo Hua’s hands were gathered above his head, and the Sword of Divine Thought within his hands, its aura surged, the sword doubled in width, its ancient and profound Tai Xu Sword Intent flowing like the dawn of the world, a vast starry sky.","In the shocked and incredulous gaze of the blood-path \"Divine Remains,\" the powerful Tai Xu Divine Thought Sword slashed down forcefully.","Mo Hua shouted crisply:","\"Slay!!\""]},{"number":1851,"title":"Chapter 1851 - 915: Corruption","paragraphs":["Ancient and mysterious, with the Five Elements flowing and formations unified, the Taixu God-Slaying Sword burst forth with light, like a celestial river turned upside down, suddenly cleaving down.","The Blood Blade, condensed from the blood of the Divine Remains, shattered inch by inch at the moment of clash. The path of blood—massacre, ruthlessness, slaughter, desolation, and dehumanization—was strangled by Mo Hua’s Sword Dao, and finally crushed directly by the ancient and vast Tai Xu Sword Intent.","In the end, the Blood Blade collapsed.","The majestic God-Slaying Sword broke the Blood Blade, swept away the blood sea, and with supreme momentum, struck the Divine Remains.","The Third Grade Divine Remains, with Divine Thoughts condensed as reality, and black-red blood as if an indestructible armor.","Yet in front of this \"God-Slaying Sword,\" which combined the Mountain Opening Sword Formation, Gold-Cutting Sword Formation, Gui Water Sword Formation, Li Fire Sword Formation, and the ancient Tai Xu Sword Intent, it was still vulnerable.","The dazzling edge of the God-Slaying Sword only paused for a moment before breaking the blood armor of the Divine Remains, shattering its shoulder bone, cleaving into its body, and then all the way down, completely cutting the Divine Remains in two, severing its Dao, and slaying its origin.","The Divine Body was shattered, the blood stopped flowing, and the origin was cut off.","At the wound, the Sword Intent lingered, continuously slicing, preventing the recovery of injuries and extinguishing all vitality.","The shocked expression of the Divine Remains still remained on its face; a moment later, it slowly turned its head, looking at Mo Hua who was holding the God-Slaying Great Sword with both hands, with a gaze full of fear.","\"What a powerful sword...\"","Gradually, the expression of the Divine Remains became calm and indifferent.","Its body was gradually dissipating, its will slowly obliterating, but its tone was very flat.","\"You won...\"","\"Your Dao Hua is a mess, your Sword Dao is chaotic... but I must admit, it is indeed very strong.\"","\"But the Dao is boundless, the further you go, the purer and more refined it must be. Being so rough, you won’t get far.\"","The blood-colored Divine Remains looked deeply at Mo Hua one last time.","\"This time, I lost. I hope next time, I can meet you again...\"","\"If you don’t die, that is, if...\"","\"You are still yourself.\"","Having said that, the Divine Remains turned to dust, completely obliterated, leaving only a mass of black-red smoke, like sand and gravel, in place.","Mo Hua frowned.","\"It lost this time, and yet it talks about meeting me again next time... isn’t this thing dead? How can it meet me if it’s dead?\"","\"Moreover... wasn’t it the Divine Remains of the Great Wilderness Evil God? Why is it so different from other Divine Remains?\"","\"Is it because it’s Third Grade, or is there another reason?\"","\"This Divine Remains is rather strange...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, and suddenly a sharp pain in the Sea of Consciousness made his heart shudder:","\"Oh no, I’ve overexerted myself...\"","As the Divine Remains of a Third Grade external evil, it placed too much burden on his Sea of Consciousness and body, causing his Blood Qi to shrink, and his Sea of Consciousness to start aching.","Furthermore, the Divine Marrow was exhausted...","Mo Hua felt bitter inside, muttering:","\"This battle was truly a bitter victory, utterly exhausted, all my trump cards were used, my family’s wealth spent, but at least I killed a Third Grade Divine Remains, which should be able to return some cost. Hopefully, this Third Grade Divine Remains won’t disappoint me...\"","Mo Hua weakly stood up and approached the mass of Third Grade black smoke, reaching out his palm to manifest a formation and first simply refine it, but as he extended his hand, Mo Hua saw that his palm was pitch black.","Mo Hua was stunned.","\"When did I get wounded?\"","\"Or was I polluted by this Divine Remains?\"","Looking down, he discovered that not just his palm, but his entire arm, shoulder, chest, and practically half of his body, as if stained with sewage, were all pitch black.","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted.","At the same time, a sharp, sinister, and piercing laugh resounded.","Evil Embryo!","Mo Hua’s expression changed, and he immediately wanted to lay down a Divine Formation to completely seal his Divine Soul, but it was too late.","The black water gushed from within his Divine Body, polluting his limbs and bones, even his face was stained with black spots.","\"I clearly laid a formation, how did you come out?\" Mo Hua exclaimed in shock.","The black water of the Evil Embryo covered Mo Hua’s face, using Mo Hua’s tongue, it mocked with a sharp and eerie voice:","\"Why... do you think that with your trivial skill in Divine Formations, you could seal me?\"","\"I have been dormant for a long time; do you think I would do nothing, waiting for you to seal me and kill me?\"","\"I have waited a long time, just for now...\"","Mo Hua’s heart sank, trying to summon the Taoist Stele, but there was no movement in the Sea of Consciousness.","He then remembered, it was not 1 p.m., the Taoist Stele would not appear.","The Evil Embryo sneered coldly, \"Don’t waste your efforts, I am hidden within your Divine Soul, and know everything about you intimately.\"","\"It’s not 1 p.m., your Taoist Stele will not appear.\"","\"Your Divine Thought is strong, but it’s not as strong as the Third Grade Divine Remains. Forcing a confrontation would consume the Divine Marrow.\"","\"If you’re unlucky, you’ll die at the hands of the Divine Remains.\"","\"Even if you defeat the Divine Remains, you must use all your strength, exhaust all your trump cards, and for a period, be at the end of your rope...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"So this Third Grade Divine Remains was actually summoned by you? You’ve been lying in wait for so long, just for now?\"","After Mo Hua finished speaking, his face turned black and gloomy, transforming into the appearance of the \"Evil Embryo,\" which mocked:","\"Indeed, you are smart, only realizing it now.\"","Mo Hua coldly said, \"Don’t forget, you can’t erode my Taoist Heart. Facing me head-on, even if I’m exhausted now, you are still no match for me.\"","\"I just need to hold on for a few hours until 1 p.m., when the Taoist Stele guards the Sea of Consciousness, and you’ll still have to be a ’turtle hiding in its shell’.\"","\"Give it time, and I will surely slay you!\"","Even in a disadvantageous situation, Mo Hua’s words made the Evil Embryo shiver with fear."]},{"number":1852,"title":"Chapter 1852 - 915: Corruption, Part 2","paragraphs":["It had long been overshadowed by Formation, only daring to emerge when Mo Hua was locked in a life-and-death struggle with a formidable enemy and was utterly exhausted.","But it also knew this was the only chance.","Black blood surged around Mo Hua.","\"These days, I’ve been thinking, how can I possibly defeat you, how to kill you, how to consume you...\"","\"My sealed memories are awakening bit by bit, but within these memories, there’s no method to kill you.\"","\"Ancient existences dwell within your Sea of Consciousness, and you’re shrouded in secrets. Your Divine Sense is too strong, and your spell points are endless.\"","\"Therefore, I realized...\"","The Evil Embryo smiled darkly, \"I can’t defeat you, only you can defeat yourself, only you can kill yourself...\"","Mo Hua was startled, feeling something was amiss.","Then the Evil Qi suddenly appeared, and the black blood on his body seeped in like worms, penetrating the subtle tentacles, seeping into his Divine Thought incarnation, continuously absorbing, copying, assimilating, as if to divide him.","Mo Hua struggled, but it was to no avail.","After an unknown amount of time, the black blood had completely enveloped Mo Hua, like an embryo, which eventually trembled, hatched, shed its skin, and transformed into another figure.","And the Evil Embryo merged with this figure, standing opposite Mo Hua.","Mo Hua slowly raised his head, his expression shocked.","Standing opposite was another \"Mo Hua.\"","A \"Black Mo Hua\" of the same size, stature, and appearance, but drenched in black blood, exuding sinister evil, eerie and terrifying.","At that moment, \"Black Mo Hua\" grinned, revealing ghastly white teeth:","\"This is my ultimate origin Divine Skill: Embryonic Transformation.\"","Its voice was identical to Mo Hua’s, but in its clearness, there was a hint of cunning and malice.","\"I used your Divine Soul as the lure and my Divine Way as the ’womb’ to hatch another you.\"","\"I can’t corrupt you, nor can I make you become me.\"","\"In that case, I shall become you.\"","\"Thus, as long as I kill you and consume you, we’ll be indistinguishable, you in me, and I in you, merging into the final Divine Fetus, ultimately becoming one.\"","Mo Hua’s face was somewhat unsightly.","He pointed with his conjoined fingers, conjuring a raging fireball, launching it straight at the \"Black Mo Hua\" formed by the Evil Embryo.","Simultaneously, \"Black Mo Hua\" also pointed, emitting a jet black fireball that roared out, colliding with Mo Hua’s red fireball.","The blaze erupted, Divine Thoughts exploded, and the fireballs dispersed, but the black fireball carrying Evil Qi was evidently superior.","Mo Hua clenched his palm into a fist, with a grasp he conjured a Water Prison to bind \"Black Mo Hua.\"","The black water flashed, and Black Mo Hua used the Water Passing Step, escaping from the Water Prison Technique, and after steadying himself, he casually grabbed, conjuring a Black Water Prison Skill that suddenly descended upon Mo Hua.","Mo Hua also used the Water Passing Step to dodge, then his eyes deepened, and with a thought, he manifested the Golden Lock Formation, trapping \"Black Mo Hua\" completely from all directions.","Golden Formation Patterns transformed into chains, binding \"Black Mo Hua’s\" body.","But \"Black Mo Hua\" suddenly smirked viciously, and with a wave of his left hand, removed all the Golden Lock Formation Patterns surrounding him.","With a concentration of his right hand, he manifested the Black Leaving Fire Sword, casually slashing to break apart the entire Golden Lock Formation, causing it to collapse and completely disperse.","Mo Hua’s expression was exceedingly grave.","\"Black Mo Hua\" looked at him, grinning, the smile both innocent and wicked, \"I told you, I hatched as you, I am you, and I know all the moves you do.\"","Mo Hua was momentarily speechless.","After this exchange, he personally experienced just how troublesome \"himself\" truly was.","Moreover, it was more than just that.","Now, he was long exhausted.","While in front of him, this blackened self had just been hatched by the Evil Embryo, still in a \"peak\" state, fighting on like this was simply not feasible.","Mo Hua sighed, \"Though from the same source, why must we fight so harshly? Since you are me, why don’t we shake hands and make peace? Why must it come to life and death?\"","\"Black Mo Hua\" sneered at this:","\"I’ve said, I am you, you can deceive others, but don’t deceive ’yourself’.\"","Mo Hua sneered.","\"Black Mo Hua\" pointed a finger, sending a black fireball blasting towards Mo Hua, then clenched his palm, once more manifesting the Black Leaving Fire Sword, performing the Water Passing Step, flickering a few times, closing in on Mo Hua, the sword tip aiming straight for Mo Hua’s heart.","Mo Hua used the Water Passing Step to evade the black fireball, grabbed with his reverse hand, manifesting the Taia Mountain Opening Sword, twirling it into a flourish, deflecting the Black Leaving Fire Sword that thrusted towards his chest, then engaged in close combat with his \"blackened\" self.","However, following a battle with the Third Grade Divine Remains, Mo Hua’s Divine Thought was overly depleted, he was simply not a match for \"Black Mo Hua,\" whether in spells, formations, or swordsmanship, he fell behind in every aspect.","\"Black Mo Hua’s\" maneuvers grew increasingly fierce and ruthless.","Mo Hua’s breath increasingly weakened, his wounds multiplying, injuries worsening.","But nevertheless, Mo Hua still persevered arduously.","Yet his perseverance obviously had its limits.","After an unknown duration of battle, Mo Hua finally reached the brink of exhaustion, his Divine Thought unable to withstand further, he stumbled, revealing a flaw.","The ever-dominating \"Black Mo Hua\" showed a ghastly grin, left hand closing in space, Evil Thoughts surged, manifesting the Separation Mountain Cremation Formation, trapping Mo Hua within it.","Then it conjured the Black Water Sword with its right hand, fiercely flinging it, the sinister Evil Qi-stained Black Water Sword flew through the air, aiming straight for Mo Hua’s heart."]},{"number":1853,"title":"Chapter 1853 - 915: Corruption (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The Black Mountain shook, turning into a cage, evil flames surging, and malevolent thoughts flowing, engulfing Mo Hua entirely.","The insidious Black Water Sword also pierced through the spot where Mo Hua stood, the sword light shattered, wantonly slaughtering.","The pitch-black evil thoughts, mingled with flames, spread out all around.","But when the smoke cleared, within the Formation, there was no silhouette of Mo Hua.","\"Black Mo Hua\" lifted his eyes and saw at the edge of the Formation, Mo Hua, covered in dim golden light, leaning on his Mountain Opening Sword, panting heavily.","Evidently, he had used some means unknown to escape the killing trap of the Formation and Swordsmanship that had consumed a great deal of evil thoughts.","\"Consider yourself lucky... but looking like a ’drowning dog’, you won’t last much longer...\"","\"Black Mo Hua\" sneered and without further words, manifested the pitch-black Mountain Opening Sword again, attacking Mo Hua.","The already exhausted Mo Hua could only grit his teeth and continue to battle his blackened self.","They fought for a while, and finally, Mo Hua was again overwhelmed and showed a flaw.","\"Black Mo Hua\" continued the assault, employing both Formation and Swordsmanship, aiming to take Mo Hua’s life.","A tremendous divine thought fluctuation came, but when the smoke settled, Mo Hua had once again survived by the skin of his teeth.","\"Black Mo Hua\" was furious and attacked Mo Hua again.","Mo Hua barely held on, but several times it seemed he was about to fall, yet he just wouldn’t.","\"Black Mo Hua\" finally realized something was amiss, and furiously shouted:","\"You’ve not exhausted your Divine Marrow at all! You still have Divine Marrow left?\"","Mo Hua shook his head: \"No.\"","Black Mo Hua’s eyelid twitched, pointing at him: \"Still denying, what’s that at the corner of your mouth? Isn’t it the Divine Marrow you just sneakily consumed?\"","Mo Hua wiped the corner of his mouth, \"You saw wrong, that’s the blood I spat out.\"","Black Mo Hua was so angry he almost spat blood, \"You really are... despicable and deceitful.\"","Mo Hua no longer put on an act, boldly declaring:","\"I’m a poor kid, whether Spirit Stone or Divine Marrow, I’m used to saving some for emergencies, to avoid panic from running out.\"","Mo Hua looked towards \"Black Mo Hua,\" \"Didn’t you say you are me? Then this habit, you should understand.\"","\"Black Mo Hua\" was silent.","Mo Hua curiously said, \"You don’t understand? Oh, right...\"","He suddenly realized something, confirming his suspicion, \"You say you’re me, but you’re ultimately from the Great Wilderness Evil Fetus, a faulty embryo, unknown to the struggles of lower-level cultivators, you are not truly me.\"","\"Black Mo Hua\" turned sullen, looking very displeased.","It suddenly realized it underestimated this half-human, half-god brat, he was really too difficult to kill...","Even harder to kill than ordinary deities.","But no matter how tough, limits must exist.","\"Your Divine Marrow must be running low,\" Black Mo Hua’s sinister eyes fixed on Mo Hua, \"I don’t believe after battling the Third Grade Divine Remains, you’d have much Divine Marrow left, you won’t hold out much longer.\"","Mo Hua nodded, admitting, \"Indeed, not much left, can’t hold on much longer, so...\"","\"I shall also slay you!\" Mo Hua said in a deep voice.","Black Mo Hua’s pupils shrank.","Mo Hua placed his hands in a virtual grip, raised them above his head, determination of facing death resolutely on his face:","\"I admit, you have indeed driven me to a desperate situation...\"","\"I am indeed calculated by you, at this moment, I’m at my weakest, my Divine Marrow indeed exhausted.\"","\"If this drags on, I have no chance at victory, thus, I can only fight to the death.\"","\"This final sword, I shall decide life and death with you!\"","\"If I win, I remain myself.\"","\"If I lose, then you become me.\"","\"Do you dare to risk your life with me, for this final sword duel?\"","Mo Hua’s gaze was condescending, looking at his blackened self as if facing an ant.","Black Mo Hua felt a flash of anger.","Dare or dare not?","It sneered, \"Don’t forget, I was ’born’ from you, using you as a mold, I know all your moves. You think a duel with the Godslaying Sword can kill me?\"","Mo Hua responded: \"How would I know without trying?\"","Black Mo Hua’s expression remained indifferent.","It had no intention to duel.","More than anyone, it knew how crafty and troublesome the true \"Mo Hua\" was, how full of deceit he was.","He wanted to duel swords with himself, there must be a problem hidden there.","\"Black Mo Hua\" stood motionless, and then it noticed, Mo Hua, while speaking of \"dueling swords,\" actually stood with hands raised above his head, making no movement, not condensing any Sword Qi, even his gaze flickered with unease.","\"Black Mo Hua\" instantly understood.","He was bluffing!","He is me, and I am him.","He knows I am suspicious by nature, hence he bluffs, pretending to fight a desperate battle, but in reality, trying to instill fear, making me hesitant to truly engage in a life-death duel with the ’Godslaying Sword’.","He is stalling for time!","Stalling until 1 p.m when the Taoist Stele appears, protecting his Sea of Consciousness, leaving me helpless against him.","Neither spells, formations, nor ordinary ’Transforming Sword Skill’ could end him.","The only way to kill him, is with the final form of the Taixu Divine Thought Sword - the \"Godslaying Sword.\"","\"Black Mo Hua’s\" pupils quivered, his mind spun rapidly:","\"It’s not that he wants to duel swords with me, rather I should duel with him!\"","\"Before the Taoist Stele appears, duel with this sword, slay him, that is my only chance to replace ’Mo Hua’.\"","\"Mo Hua also understood this point, so he struck first, pretending to fight with me, instilling dread in my heart, stopping me from truly daring to fight a death duel with ’Godslaying Sword’.","\"As long as I hesitate, afraid to kill him truly once and for all, when 1 p.m arrives, all efforts and plans will be for naught...\"","The \"Black Mo Hua,\" of the same origin as Mo Hua, instantly grasped Mo Hua’s thoughts.","After which, it ceased hesitating, raising virtual hands high, a formation of pitch-black evil swords condensed one by one into the Sword of Divine Thought, merging in its hands, with a formidable aura.","The swords he knows, I also know. The Dao he understands, I do too.","His divine thought is damaged, severely drained, his Divine Marrow nearly exhausted. Yet my evil thoughts remain abundant.","This sword duel of life and death, the advantage is mine!","Black Mo Hua, with a resolute gaze, looked at Mo Hua, a voice tinged with wildness and ruthlessness:","\"Fine, life or death duel! Let’s see, who will become ’Mo Hua’!\""]},{"number":1854,"title":"Chapter 1854 - 916: Worse Than Hell","paragraphs":["The voice of the Black Mo Hua was wild and fierce.","The real Mo Hua, however, turned pale, his gaze flustered.","He seemed to have just wanted to bluff against this \"darkened\" version of himself, but unexpectedly, things did not go as he envisioned, and \"Black Mo Hua\" was truly fighting to the death with him.","Mo Hua turned to escape, but being \"of the same origin,\" such a trick naturally couldn’t elude \"Black Mo Hua’s\" eyes.","Its eyes black as ink, demonic qi surged, and the Evil Sword shuttled back and forth, weaving an entire Taoist Prison, directly suppressing Mo Hua from afar.","Evil Embryo Soul-Shocking Sword!","\"Trying to run? Too late.\" Black Mo Hua sneered.","Mo Hua had used the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill to suppress the Third Grade Divine Remains, forcing it to duel with him in swordplay. Now, this move was being used by Black Mo Hua against him.","Mo Hua tried a few times but couldn’t break free and finally sighed, resigning himself to fate as he raised his hands above his head.","Forced by circumstances, he had to decide life and death in a battle against this dark version of \"himself.\"","Mo Hua’s expression turned grave, and between his hands, a Sword Array arose, the sword shape refined, the Five Elements flowing and integrating into a sharp Divine Thought Long Sword.","This was precisely the \"Godslaying Sword\" he had used just moments ago to cut down the Third Grade Divine Remains.","Yet opposite him, the Godslaying Sword in \"Black Mo Hua’s\" hand was identical to his, except, bolstered by Evil Qi, its aura was even more formidable.","Mo Hua gritted his teeth, continuing to fuse the ancient and profound Tai Xu Sword Intent.","\"Black Mo Hua\" sneered back, identically merging the Tai Xu Sword Intent between its hands.","On the blackened Godslaying Sword, killing intent surged suddenly, with wraiths flying about, its power now on another level.","The two Godslaying Swords faced each other across the void.","One dark, one righteous, one strong, one weak.","Mo Hua was at a disadvantage, his expression growing more tense.","\"Black Mo Hua\" watched Mo Hua, relishing the panic, haste, and despair on Mo Hua’s face.","But it didn’t enjoy it for long; the \"despair\" on Mo Hua’s face vanished completely, replaced by a cunning smile.","This smile...","The Evil Embryo was stunned, its expression gradually changing, a chill rising to its heart as its pupils widened.","\"You... why are you smiling?\"","Black Mo Hua’s voice carried an unaccountable unease.","\"Actually,\" Mo Hua, no longer in disarray, smiled even more brightly, \"I, like you, have been waiting for this moment... for a long time.\"","\"When the Taoist Stele was present, you dared not emerge.\"","\"Only when I was down to my last breath fighting a strong enemy, could you gamble it all to fight me to the death.\"","\"So what?\" Black Mo Hua exclaimed, not even aware of the tremor in its own voice, \"I am you, you are me. I know you inside out. At this point, what tricks do you have that could possibly kill me?\"","As Black Mo Hua finished speaking, its pupils involuntarily contracted.","Then it watched in wide-eyed shock as Mo Hua’s aura began to change.","\"This one sword, I’ve saved just for you. I couldn’t bear to use it on anyone else...\"","A chill of deathly stillness, emptiness filled the air.","At the same time, Mo Hua’s expression turned solemn as he began to unleash the true, Final Form of the \"Godslaying Sword.\"","He first severed his own ego, then severed his lust.","His visage turned indifferent, loveless, void, ethereal, as if devoid of human joys and sorrows, leaving only the detached emotionlessness of the heavenly.","Supreme Emotion-Cutting Dao.","This Dao fused into the Sword Dao, and the Godslaying Sword in Mo Hua’s hand soared further, intertwining with the deep, void blackness akin to a star-filled sky, within the originally ancient and vast Tai Xu Sword Dao origin, forging into a lustrous, yet chaos-like obscure, true \"Godslaying Giant Sword.\"","This \"Godslaying Giant Sword,\" several times larger than Mo Hua himself, was lifted as if it were a sword holding up the sky, black and white interwoven, wrapped in golden aura around.","In that moment, Mo Hua’s mortal frame seemed like a deity or demon from the heavens.","\"Heavenly... Heavenly Demon Slash?!\"","Black Mo Hua stared in disbelief, eyes filled with shock, as it screamed:","\"How could you walk the Heavenly Demon Path?!\"","\"How did you even learn the Heavenly Demon Slash? What kind of monster are you?!\"","Holding the Heavenly Demon Godslaying Giant Sword, Mo Hua, like an unfeeling god or demon, looked coldly at this dark evil embryo birthed from his Divine Soul.","The Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword was meant to sever the lesser self.","The Supreme Emotion-Cutting Dao was meant to cut off evil desires.","Today, he intended to cut down this \"Evil Self,\" accomplish the Emotion-Cutting Dao, and forge the unrivaled Godslaying Sword!","Marked as a straw dog of the Great Dao, the \"Evil Embryo\" of the Sword Dao sacrifice felt a sudden, fierce forewarning of life and death.","\"This damned little brat, he deceived even ’me,’ calculating everything to set this perfect trap.\"","\"He planned it all...\"","\"What a devilishly intelligent monster this is!\"","\"No, I can’t let him slash free...\"","\"Black Mo Hua\" gritted its teeth, pouring all its Evil Power into the blackened Godslaying Sword, then struck first with a sudden cry.","\"Kill him, and I become ’Mo Hua’!\"","But by now, it was too late.","Using his own Sword Array as a foundation, integrating the Tai Xu Sword Intent, and embodying the Heavenly Demon Slash Love Path, the \"Godslaying Giant Sword\" had already been fully unleashed.","Black Mo Hua’s sword struck first.","But Mo Hua’s giant sword, though launched later, arrived sooner.","In that instant, it was as if the heavens collapsed, mountains fractured, the overwhelming Sword Intent, surging Sword Qi, and the complex, indescribable ancient Sword Dao, Heavenly Demon Love Path, fully fused into one, pouring down like a long rainbow across the sun.","Just this one sword, swept away everything.","The blackened Godslaying Sword of \"Black Mo Hua\" was instantly shattered inch by inch by Mo Hua’s mightier Godslaying Sword, turning into Divine Thought dust."]},{"number":1855,"title":"Chapter 1855 - 916: More Hellish Than Hell (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Then the sword light spread like a river breaking its banks, continuing to surge downward. The vast and unmatched Sword Qi slashed towards the body of the black \"Mo Hua\".","The black \"Mo Hua\" widened its pupils, its face full of shock. It wanted to resist, to struggle, but it was like a mantis trying to stop a cart, completely powerless. Eventually, it was engulfed by the Sword Qi, utterly submerged in the Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword’s torrent-like sword light...","Transform the formation into a sword, merge with the Tai Xu Sword Dao, comprehend the emotion-slashing of the Heavenly Demon, slay the evil self, and forge the true God-Slaying Sword Style!","With the swing of this sword, finally, the ultimate sword form of the Taixu Divine Thought Sword Transformation True Jue, the God-Slaying Sword, was mastered!","Mo Hua held the massive God-Slaying Sword, feeling as if man and sword, and the Dao, had become one, and that in this world, nothing could not be slain!","Humans could be slain, emotions could be slain, desires could be slain.","Ghosts could be slain, demons could be slain, devils could be slain.","Even deities, could also be slain!","At the moment of achieving the God-Slaying Sword Dao.","Taixu Gate, Sword Tomb at the back mountain.","Broken swords hummed and echoed, the Sword Intent of dead Sword Cultivators transformed into white smoke, rising steadily, merging with the clouds and mist in the mountains.","Patriarch Dugu, who was resting his mind with closed eyes, suddenly opened them, his expression shook.","An anomaly appeared again in the Sword Tomb.","Broken swords sounded alone in the tomb, Sword Qi transformed into white smoke. And unlike before, this time it was more obvious, and the momentum was even greater.","This is a sign of the revival of the Sword Dao at Taixu Gate.","If it were before, Patriarch Dugu might feel gratified and delighted, but now, along with his shock, there is a mix of unrest and fear in his heart.","Others may not see it or hear it, but he can.","He saw clearly that within the Sword Tomb, not only did white smoke arise, but also the phantasmal and eerie images of nine heavens demons that ordinary people could not see.","At this moment, the Heavenly Demons danced chaotically, and the demonic sound filled the ears.","These Heavenly Demons were celebrating, in ecstasy, making terrifying and unpleasant yet seductive cries that enrapture the human heart.","Someone has learned their Dao.","Someone has bridged a path to the Dao, becoming their \"anchor point\" in this world, becoming another Demon God’s embryo in which the Heavenly Demons manifest on this earthly realm.","The innocent face of Mo Hua floated in Patriarch Dugu’s mind.","He seemed to have instantly aged dozens of years, his silhouette bleak, exuding melancholy.","\"Such a good child...\"","\"It’s all too late now, there’s no turning back...\"","\"Blessings and misfortunes are intertwined, in the end, it’s my fault...\"","...","In the Sea of Consciousness.","The aftermath of the God-Slaying Sword dissipated.","Mo Hua watched the scene before him and frowned.","The black \"Mo Hua\" was slain, its Divine Thought shattered, and its origin severed, yet it did not die. Its origin seemed to possess extraordinary vitality.","But after being slain, the evil embryo lost its human form, leaving only a mass of black mist, throbbing like a heart, as if a real \"embryo\".","It was still trying to repair its injuries.","But the Tai Xu Sword Intent, holding a long-standing legacy, was too sharp, causing severe injuries.","Moreover, the Supreme Emotion Cutting, slashing desire and self, also slashed the resolve of Divine Thought. The slain evil embryo harbored a death wish, clearly wanting to live but lacking the \"will to survive\".","Because the desire to live had been slashed away.","The evil embryo squirmed, continuously trying to heal wounds that were beyond repair.","Even the conflicting wills of \"wanting to live\" and \"not wanting to live\" continued to intertwine.","Mo Hua did not want to delay any longer.","He was truly \"exhausted\" now.","No matter how strong or cautious he was, no matter how many plans he had, after consecutively slaying a Third Grade Divine Remains and an evil embryo, he had reached his limit.","Mo Hua sighed helplessly, \"Having to slay a Third Grade Divine Remains, and an Evil God’s embryo, and slay them consecutively...\"","\"I wonder which Foundation Building Cultivator, has to endure such suffering?\"","The pressure he bore at his age was indeed too great.","But fortunately, it was done.","Mo Hua used the last bit of his Divine Thought to manifest a Divine Tao Array, transforming it into Divine Thought chains, completely sealing the \"evil embryo\" within.","The dwindling evil embryo had no ability to resist.","Mo Hua sat cross-legged in place, waiting a bit, until 1 p.m, when the Taoist Stele emerged, then he lifted the evil embryo and walked towards the Taoist Stele.","On the Taoist Stele, the Robbery Thunder was glaringly red, like a heavenly fire-forged execution blade.","Sensing the aura of annihilation on the Robbery Thunder, the once weak and dying evil embryo, akin to a \"tumor of evil thoughts\", immediately struggled in fear, shrieking:","\"Little devil, bastard, how dare you...\"","\"I told you, I dare!\" Mo Hua said.","The evil embryo struggled for a moment before suddenly falling silent.","Mo Hua paused for a moment, unable to help but ask, \"You’re not begging for mercy anymore?\"","The evil embryo’s voice became sharper, yet childish, exuding an eerie indifference, \"Kill me then.\"","Its fleshy tumor trembled, opening a slit, like a terrifying large eye, staring intently at Mo Hua, as if trying to forever remember Mo Hua’s appearance.","\"Kill me, and I will become one with you.\"","\"In this life and forever, you cannot shed the ’brand’ of the Master of the Great Wilderness, even to the ends of the earth, the believers of the Divine Lord will relentlessly hunt you, viewing your flesh and Divine Soul as the finest offering to the Master of the Great Wilderness...\"","\"You think I’m scared?\" Mo Hua was not afraid at all, even somewhat eager for it.","Yet he was still a bit confused, \"If I kill it, it becomes one with me?\", \"Cannot shed the ’brand’ of the Master of the Great Wilderness?\"","What do these mean?","Mo Hua’s curiosity was piqued, he almost wanted to ask, but he ultimately held back.","Your downfall comes from talking too much.","He might not be a \"villain\", but in front of the evil embryo, it’s best to be cautious, seize the moment when it’s weak, take its life, without giving it a chance to recover, otherwise, hesitation would only harm himself."]},{"number":1856,"title":"Chapter 1856 - 916: More Hellish Than Hell (Part 3)","paragraphs":["After all, even if I ask, the Evil Embryo, facing death, definitely wouldn’t speak.","Mo Hua no longer hesitated, using the Divine Lock to bind the Evil Embryo, throwing it into the Taoist Stele.","The silent, terrifying robbery thunder, containing the supreme Heavenly Dao Laws, like a scarlet \"branding iron,\" annihilated everything about the Evil Embryo, obliterating its every origin, its every will...","The Evil Embryo said nothing, its eyes split wide open with a ghastly glare, staring fixedly at Mo Hua, until its soul was completely extinguished, without ever averting its gaze.","\"A defeated foe, still so arrogant?\"","Mo Hua also stared back at it confidently.","Until this evil and bizarre Evil God’s Embryo completely dispersed, leaving behind supremely pure, rich as spring water Divine Marrow.","Only then did Mo Hua breathe a sigh of relief, feeling overjoyed.","This great worry at heart was finally completely eradicated!","His Divine Soul was finally entirely liberated.","From now on, he would no longer fear contamination by the Evil God, and was no longer afraid this Evil Embryo might unexpectedly emerge to give a sinister laugh.","And also...","A great deal of Divine Marrow!","More than all the Divine Marrow he had devoured before combined, gushing like a spring, and even purer than before.","Mo Hua extended his finger, dipped and licked once, as if tasting liquefied sunshine, his whole body feeling at ease.","He couldn’t resist taking a few more sips, smiling contentedly, just about to indulge when suddenly he remembered something.","\"It’s 1 p.m now, and I’m still outside the Mountain Gate, not back at the Sect.\"","\"Moreover, after two consecutive life-or-death battles, the pressure on the Sea of Consciousness is too great, causing Blood Qi to wither.\"","\"If the physical body is gone, no matter how strong the Divine Thought, it’s useless. I can’t just not be a person and become a ghost or an Evil God, can I?\"","\"And frankly, becoming a ghost is not that simple. After a person dies, to transform into a ghost requires all kinds of conditions like natural disasters, human grievances, etc. It’s not something you can cultivate just because you want to.\"","\"As for becoming an Evil God, that’s even more out of the question, who knows how much killing would be required...\"","\"Let’s first see to the physical body...\"","Mo Hua quickly withdrew from the Sea of Consciousness, tracing his Divine Sense back to his physical body.","But just as the Divine Sense was traced back, he felt pain all over his limbs and bones, with Blood Qi not flowing smoothly, his meridians somewhat withered, unable to move at all, and his eyes couldn’t open.","It’s over!","Mo Hua’s heart sank.","This was late at night, still in the remote Outer Mountain, sparsely populated.","If the physical body encountered any danger, it would be a big problem.","Mo Hua’s heart shivered, then quickly calmed down, strongly willing himself to open his eyes.","But his eyelids felt as if they were filled with mud and sand, weighing a thousand pounds, completely unable to open.","Mo Hua did not give up, kept trying, and after an unknown length of time, he finally endured the intense pain and slowly opened his eyes.","The sight that met his eyes was a gentle face, and a pair of soft eyes.","This is...","\"Elder Murong?\"","Mo Hua felt surprised in his heart, then heard Elder Murong’s voice, warm as a spring breeze, saying to someone beside, \"Ancestor, this child is awake.\"","\"Hmm.\" Elder Master Xun’s aged voice sounded at the side, \"He can be given the pills now.\"","Before Mo Hua could react, he felt a pair of elegant, cool fingers with a faint herbal taste, picking up a few pills, and placing them into his mouth.","Before he could taste anything, the pills slid down his throat, into his stomach, turning into warm medicinal power, merging into his limbs, replenishing his Blood Qi.","Afterward, Elder Murong fed him some bitter Spiritual Liquid.","Then fed him some unknown pills.","Mo Hua indeed felt much more spirited, his limbs able to move, his throat much clearer, able to speak, though his voice was still somewhat hoarse:","\"Thank you, Elder Murong...\"","Elder Murong with her slender fingers, gently stroked Mo Hua’s forehead, smiling warmly:","\"Everything’s fine. You fainted silently in the Outer Mountain, your Blood Qi was too depleted for it to be dangerous, fortunately, the gentleman noticed early, had you brought back, and sent you here...\"","Mo Hua tried to express some gratitude but was stopped by Elder Murong, \"You haven’t recovered yet, speak less.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","\"I won’t disturb your rest.\" Elder Murong checked Mo Hua’s injuries, lightly rose, gracefully bowed to Elder Master Xun, then quietly retreated.","Only then did Elder Master Xun walk to Mo Hua’s bedside, looking at him worriedly.","\"Sorry for causing you trouble.\"","Although Elder Murong advised him not to speak, Mo Hua still rasped a thank you.","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"It’s good if you’re alright.\"","He gave Mo Hua another deep look, as the scenes of blood, black mist, evil thoughts, and even sword intent that had just appeared on Mo Hua’s face flashed through his mind, and he frowned.","\"Did you... encounter an evil spirit?\"","Mo Hua obediently nodded, \"Encountered... a little.\"","\"How is it now?\"","\"Resolved...\"","Elder Master Xun glanced at Mo Hua’s eyes, seeing that although he appeared weak, his gaze was clear and bright, and a divine presence emanated from within, he slightly relaxed, \"Are there any aftereffects?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","\"Hmm, that’s good...\" said Elder Master Xun, then stood up to leave, \"Take a good rest, and discuss anything once you are well.\"","Mo Hua’s throat hurt too much to speak, so he just earnestly nodded.","Elder Master Xun’s profound gaze assessed Mo Hua from head to toe, confirming that the \"precious disciple\" of Taixu Gate was indeed free of serious issues before he slowly turned to leave.","Yet, upon leaving the Pill Room, Elder Master Xun’s expression instantly darkened.","\"In this Taixu Mountain, why would one inexplicably attract an evil spirit?\"","\"Moreover, the black mist is so thick, almost a fundamental source of evil, this is quite extraordinary...\"","\"And... sword intent?\"","Elder Master Xun was puzzled.","Mo Hua is not a Sword Cultivator, so how could there be such intense sword intent emanating from him?","Moreover, this sword intent is complex and obscure, hiding something strange within that even made this ancestor feel faintly uneasy.","Where did he learn it?","Who taught him?","...","Elder Master Xun paused to contemplate, his thoughts tumultuous as waves, with a heaviness between his brows like a mountain. After a moment, he sighed deeply.","\"This child... really knows how to entangle with karma.\"","\"I wonder if my Taixu Gate can truly suppress it...\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, slowly stepping away, and in just a few steps, his figure completely disappeared, leaving the Pill Room.","Inside the Pill Room, Mo Hua still felt somewhat weak, his eyelids heavy like lead. After a while, he could no longer resist and fell into a deep sleep.","As Mo Hua slept, he was completely unaware that the vital energy around him was undergoing changes.","The heavenly secret flowed slowly, and karmic chains appeared, using Mo Hua’s presence as the \"foundation,\" threading through his past and reaching into his future.","This existence within the heavenly secret, tracing back to the past, anchoring the present, and leading to the future, was the karmic chain that constituted his life chart.","Mo Hua slept, but his life chart trembled.","A mass of pitch-black mist, filled with an intensely resentful hatred after being slain, as substantial as reality, crawled into his life chart along the karmic chain.","Afterward, this black mist throbbed like a heart, incubating like an embryo, eventually transforming into the form it once had:","A sinister, pitch-black, terrifyingly corrupted, young \"Mo Hua.\"","With a cry terrifying enough to frighten Ghost God.","\"Dark Mo Hua\" opened its eyes.","Its pupils were pitch black, carrying pure malice, surveying its surroundings.","A fierce ghost, with a form seemingly there yet elusive.","Ferocious zombies covering the mountains.","And a Corpse King, with a copper head and iron bones, blood-red eyes raging, terrifyingly majestic, exuding a breath of karmic mutation.","Like an Evil Baby, Dark Mo Hua cried again.","This cry carried immense intimidation, whistling through with an ominous wind.","The ghostly woman remained silent, the mountain-blanketing zombies were frozen with fear, only the Corpse King revealed its ferocious fangs with bloodshot eyes.","But the Evil Baby made no other moves, just slowly closed its eyes and went back to sleep, while beneath it, thick black water seeped out, like evil amniotic fluid, devouring the karma, feeding itself, growing bit by bit.","Though just an Evil Baby, the evil Qi it emitted was enough to contend with the Blood Qi of the Corpse King commanding the zombies. The black mist and Blood Qi intertwined, covering the sky and blotting out the sun.","Beneath the spread of evil Qi and Blood Qi, the fierce ghost lurked, the Corpse King entrenched, and the Evil Baby slumbered.","The scene within Mo Hua’s karmic life chart was more hellish than Hell itself.","Yet, at this moment, under the concealment of the Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock, people in the world had no chance to witness this terrifying purgatorial scene."]},{"number":1857,"title":"Chapter 1857 - 917: Breakthrough","paragraphs":["Mo Hua slept well.","Usually, he never slept, dedicating almost all his time, day and night, to cultivation and drawing formations.","Especially after 1 p.m., with the presence of the Taoist Stele, he would practice the formation many, many times each night.","But at this moment, having gone through several intense battles, coupled with the super rank divine sense battle, the pressure on his sea of consciousness, and the depletion of his physical body, Mo Hua really couldn’t hold on any longer, so he forgot everything and took a solid sleep.","When he woke up, dawn had already broken.","Bright sunlight shone into the room.","Mo Hua slowly opened his eyes, his mind a bit blank, staring dazedly at the sunlight outside the window.","\"Awake?\" A gentle voice sounded.","Mo Hua turned his head and saw Elder Murong, with fair complexion and a graceful dignity tinged with a gentle smile, looking at him warmly.","\"Hello, Elder Murong...\" Mo Hua said softly.","His voice was still a bit hoarse.","\"Don’t speak,\" Elder Murong said, \"time for your medicine.\"","Elder Murong stood up, took out a few pills, and held them to Mo Hua’s lips.","Mo Hua couldn’t move, so he could only open his mouth and accept Elder Murong’s \"feeding.\"","After feeding the pills, Elder Murong placed a hand on Mo Hua’s pulse, pondered for a moment, then said softly:","\"Alright, rest well. In two or three days, you’ll be able to return to classes.\"","\"Than...\"","Mo Hua only managed to say one word of thanks before his throat ached and he couldn’t speak anymore.","Elder Murong chuckled softly, \"Rest well,\" and then left.","Mo Hua lay alone on the bed, staring at the cloud patterns of the Eight Trigrams Furnace on the ceiling, dazed and lost in thought for a long time before he suddenly snapped back to reality.","\"The body truly is a vessel for divine thoughts.\"","With a strong body, the spirit is well, and divine sense is abundant;","In contrast, now his body’s blood and qi are depleted, making it difficult to concentrate divine sense, and his spirit is somewhat scattered.","Fortunately, Elder Master Xun saved him, and with the beautiful, kind-hearted, and highly skilled in alchemy Elder Murong making pills for him, there’s no major problem with his physical injuries.","\"But next time, I must be more cautious and thorough.\"","\"Also, it would be great if my body could be stronger...\"","Mo Hua thought to himself silently.","Soon, a wave of fatigue and drowsiness washed over him, and Mo Hua, feeling sleepy, slowly closed his eyes again.","As his divine thought weakened, slowly drifting into sleep, he did not notice the anomaly in his cause and effect, nor did he know that an evil, pitch-black, terrifying, darkened, young \"Mo Hua\" was also slumbering within his life chart...","...","At Taixu Sect, behind the mountain.","Elder Master Xun ascended the stairs, passing through multiple seals, heading toward the Sword Tomb.","He was very concerned about the matter of \"sword intent.\"","Logically, with Mo Hua’s swordsmanship attainment, he shouldn’t be able to condense \"sword intent,\" yet on him, there undoubtedly was a manifestation of advanced \"sword intent,\" which is something a Foundation Establishment cultivator couldn’t possibly develop, completely defying norms.","The first person Elder Master Xun thought of was his elder brother.","To impart such sophisticated swordsmanship and profound sword intent to a Foundation Establishment disciple, in the entire Taixu Mountain, probably only the one who once dominated Qian State with a single sword, overwhelmed peers, slew countless demons, and terrorized countless evils—Patriarch Dugu of Taixu Mountain.","But absolutely not!","No matter how much he respected this elder brother, he absolutely could not allow him to teach Mo Hua sword cultivation.","Elder Master Xun was very clear that his elder brother’s end with this swordsmanship and its destined legacy had only one conclusion, which was...","\"Taixu Divine Thought Sword True Jue\"!","This sword technique is now a forbidden technique of Taixu.","Once learned, it would lead into the abyss from which there is no return in this life.","Mo Hua has a broader Dao of formations and should not, out of curiosity, step onto such a path, filled with demons everywhere, severe terrors looming, and dangers without life.","With a heavy heart, Elder Master Xun entered the Sword Tomb.","Inside the Sword Tomb, broken swords stood all around. Patriarch Dugu, as usual, sat with eyes closed and aura concealed, in a withered stance.","\"Elder brother...\" Elder Master Xun began.","But Patriarch Dugu did not respond or react in any way, sitting among the ruins, like a deathly white mountain stone, desolate and silent.","\"...Elder brother?\"","Elder Master Xun’s brows furrowed slightly, sensing something amiss.","He gradually slowed his steps, his cloudy eyes revealing a trace of sharpness, watching Patriarch Dugu with vigilance.","Patriarch Dugu’s face twitched slightly, then slowly opened his eyes.","His expression was indifferent, but his gaze was strange, with the whites of his eyes being black, and the pupils being white, constant changes of light and darkness.","Elder Master Xun’s expression changed drastically.","\"Elder brother, you!\"","Within Patriarch Dugu’s sea of consciousness, it seemed there was also a battle with demonic entities; his facial features gradually became pale, melted and twisted, and with his remaining willpower, he spoke to Elder Master Xun, one word at a time:","\"Leave quickly...\"","\"Seal the Sword Tomb...\"","\"And, save...\"","He didn’t manage to say the name, or perhaps those existences did not allow him to reveal this name.","Amidst the endless, wildly flying demonic disturbances, Patriarch Dugu’s facial features completely dissolved, becoming a \"faceless person.\"","Elder Master Xun’s pupils trembled violently, and then without any hesitation, he reached into the void, tore open a crack, took out a compass, and infused it with divine sense and spiritual power.","On the compass, formation patterns emerged, spreading like a spider web in all directions.","In the Sword Tomb, the densely packed sealing formations also activated at this moment.","The aura of Taixu and Eryi circulated, and layers of golden doors of seals surrounded the entire Sword Tomb, sealing it completely."]},{"number":1858,"title":"Chapter 1858 - 917: Breakthrough (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Above the entire Sword Tomb, a fifth-grade Sealing Formation was unexpectedly constructed.","This Formation sealed the Sword Tomb, sealing everything within it and cutting off all auras to prevent them from spreading outside.","But at this moment, the Sword Intent around Patriarch Dugu was fiercely icy, causing the Formation Patterns of the formation to teeter precariously.","Elder Master Xun’s heart sank as he crushed a Jade Slip and said, \"Murong Junior Brother, there is a change in the Forbidden Land, come help me.\"","The Jade Slip pierced the void, and in just a moment, a five-colored fissure appeared in the space.","\"I am busy with closed-door cultivation, don’t bother me unless it’s... \"","A tall, handsome elder with a child’s face and white hair walked out of the void fissure, and before he could finish speaking, he saw the strange appearance of Patriarch Dugu and the precarious Sealing Formation, causing his pupils to tremble and he gasped in surprise.","\"Senior Brother he... \"","\"No time for words, act quickly.\"","The child-faced, white-haired Murong Ancestor immediately assumed a solemn expression, forming a seal with his hands, and summoned a Taixu Seal, transforming it into four Azure Dragons to suppress the eerie Heavenly Demon presence around the Sword Tomb.","Taking this opportunity, Elder Master Xun activated every layer of the Sword Tomb’s seal, then reinforced them heavily...","Layer after layer of Sealing Patterns transformed into chains of the void, sealing the Sword Tomb completely, leaving no gaps.","Also completely suppressing Patriarch Dugu within.","This Sealing Formation was left by the experts of the Taixu Gate ancestors, and when fully activated, it was enough to seal any Divine Thought, Spiritual Power, or flesh existence under the fifth grade.","Only at this moment did Elder Master Xun and Murong Ancestor slightly relax.","\"What’s wrong with Senior Brother?\" Murong Ancestor asked.","Elder Master Xun’s expression was heavy, and he shook his head, \"I cannot say for sure, but Senior Brother’s state is very off, I fear ’those things’ sealed inside are trying to find a way out...\"","Murong Ancestor’s expression changed drastically upon hearing this, \"Then does that mean Senior Brother is...\"","Elder Master Xun said solemnly, \"His mind is still present, but I don’t know how much it’s been ’tainted’, for now, we can only seal it...\"","\"Then...\"","\"Senior Brother has a Sword Dao that connects to the heavens, perhaps he might have a way himself, we can’t actually help much...\"","Elder Master Xun sighed helplessly.","Murong Ancestor looked up at the Sealing Formation and then at the obscure figure of Patriarch Dugu within the formation, his expression a little melancholic, he sighed deeply:","\"Back during the Heavenly Demon catastrophe, it lasted a long time, with terrible casualties. In the end, it was Senior Brother who severed his Dao path, using himself as a prison to guard the gates, bringing peace to the future of the Taixu Gate.\"","\"He gave up his supreme talent, gave up boundless prospects, gave up great glory, changing from the renowned number one Sword in Qian State to a living tomb. Silently, he guarded this Forbidden Land for years, now aged, undistinguishable between human and demon, not knowing if he will have a good end...\"","Murong Ancestor felt deeply desolate.","Elder Master Xun also felt a pang of bitterness, but still said, \"This path was chosen by Senior Brother himself, he knows these things better than us.\"","\"I know.\" Murong Ancestor sighed, then softly asked, \"What do we do now?\"","Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment, \"With our combined strength, we will completely seal this back mountain, locking even the void, allowing no person or being to enter or leave. After a period of time, we will see what happens...\"","Murong Ancestor contemplated, \"If things become untenable...\"","\"If things become untenable,\" Elder Master Xun’s brows furrowed into a Sichuan character, he sighed, \"I will think of a way.\"","He did not say what way, nor did Murong Ancestor inquire further, he just nodded:","\"That’s all we can do...\"","After that, both fell silent, each burdened with heavy thoughts.","The bright sunlight that shone into the back mountain seemed to be veiled in shadow, exuding a cold and heavy chill.","Murong Ancestor gazed afar, taking in the entire Taixu Mountain, he sighed softly:","\"Even though the Three Sects have unified, yet these upheavals have arisen, I fear the future of our Taoist inheritance of the Taixu Gate is uncertain...\"","Elder Master Xun thought for a moment, his eyes filled with troublesome thoughts, slowly shook his head and said, \"It’s not just Taixu Gate’s future that is uncertain, it’s the entire world, all the beings in this boundless expanse are uncertain of their future...\"","Murong Ancestor was startled, \"Isn’t this a bit over the top...\"","Elder Master Xun’s expression was indifferent, pondering for a moment, he finally voiced his concerns:","\"The great calamity to the world is indeed terrifying, but it is not the most terrifying.\"","\"What is most terrifying is the decline of the human heart.\"","\"The calamities of the past were certainly perilous, but there were still great cultivators like Senior Brother with immense cultivation, immense perseverance, and a grand vision, who gave up fame, gave up honor and disgrace, and gave up themselves to shoulder the burden for the myriad beings, to resist this great tribulation.\"","\"But now?\"","\"Now the Sects of the world are led by profit. The disciples under them mostly carry out selfish deeds under a facade of righteousness. If people do not cultivate their hearts, if hearts do not seek the Dao, selfish and self-serving, once a real tribulation is encountered, what kind of situation would it be?\"","Seemingly visualizing that scene, Elder Master Xun’s expression turned extremely severe, his voice bore a chilling coldness.","\"I have a premonition that under the decay of the human heart, the next great tribulation might be this Nine State’s... Death Tribulation.\"","These words were so shocking that even Murong Ancestor felt startled.","Murong Ancestor said in a deep voice, \"The Nine State is unified, the Taoist Court is mighty, even if there is some decline, it shouldn’t be to this extent...\"","But these words didn’t sound like they were addressed to Elder Master Xun, rather, they seemed to be spoken to reassure himself.","Elder Master Xun remained silent for a moment, then looked into the distance.","\"Let us hope so...\"","...","Everything in the back mountain was securely sealed by the formation, unknown to outsiders.","Time flowed quietly.","Three days later, Mo Hua had almost fully recovered.","He could continue to attend classes, cultivate, and draw formations again."]},{"number":1859,"title":"Chapter 1859 - 917: Breakthrough (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Of course, most importantly, with a Third Grade Divine Remains and the ’legacy’ of an Evil Embryo, he can continue refining the Divine Marrow, devour Divine Thoughts, and unravel the Mystery Formation.","Thus, after another half month, at 1 a.m., Mo Hua sat in meditation at the Disciple’s Residence, his Divine Sense sinking into the Sea of Consciousness, as always working on unraveling the Mystery Formation.","But today, something was different.","Because today, he could finally finish unraveling the Mystery Formation. This also meant that the bottleneck at the late stage of the Foundation Establishment with the Heaven Yan Jue would be broken through tonight.","He was about to reach the late stage of Foundation Establishment!","Suppressing the excitement in his heart, Mo Hua began to solve the last Mystery Formation with trembling hands.","As his fingers traced, the golden Patterns of Divine Thought threaded through the Mystery Formation, forming Formation Patterns to unravel it, deconstructing, collapsing, and dissipating little by little...","Finally, with the last stroke drawn, the last golden Pattern settled, and the ’mystery formation’ that was the bottleneck of the Heaven Yan Jue transformed into golden threads, completely dissipating.","At that moment, Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness became suddenly clear.","The Qi Sea was no longer suppressed by the bottleneck.","Spiritual Power circulated on its own, forming a cycle, and flowed into Mo Hua’s Qi Sea.","The meridians throughout his body also felt a tinge of ’thirst’.","Mo Hua immediately opened his eyes, took out the Spirit Stones he had prepared, crushed them all, and inhaled them through breathing techniques. They circulated through the cycle, got refined one by one, and settled into the Qi Sea.","Mo Hua felt his Spiritual Power increase again, a feeling he had missed for a long time.","His Sea of Consciousness was gradually expanding, and the level of his Divine Sense was continuously rising...","He didn’t know how long it took, but finally, as the Qi Sea filled up, the Sea of Consciousness brightened, and the meridians stabilized, the Spiritual Power Cycle was completed.","Mo Hua opened his eyes, with a peculiar glow in them, and his aura had increased significantly.","Late Stage of Foundation Establishment!","He finally broke through!","The entire breakthrough process was rather smooth.","But the prerequisite for this smoothness was all the effort and arrangements he had made previously, along with enduring hard battles, first killing the Divine Corpse, then slaying the Evil Embryo, which allowed for such a smooth breakthrough.","\"Tao cultivation is really not easy...\"","Mo Hua sighed with emotion.","Fortunately, Heaven did not disappoint those who worked hard; he has finally become a late-stage Foundation Establishment cultivator.","In front of a group of Junior Brothers, he can finally stand tall.","Mo Hua introspected himself and examined his current strength status:","His physical body had become slightly stronger—though it didn’t really make a difference.","His Spiritual Power felt a bit more substantial—however, compared to his fellow disciples who frequently had Top-Grade, Superior-Grade Spiritual Roots, and Cultivation Techniques, the gap was still quite large.","The only thing that remained outstanding was his Divine Sense, which, as always, was far ahead.","The peak of the Nineteen Patterns...","Because he had devoured the immense Divine Thought of the Third Grade Divine Remains and Evil Embryo remnants, coupled with the enhancement afforded by the breakthrough to late stage Foundation Establishment, Mo Hua’s Divine Sense took a big step forward above its previous limit.","Now his Divine Sense was approaching the twenty Patterns limit infinitely.","Mo Hua even felt that given another opportunity, he could surpass this boundary and genuinely possess a Divine Sense at the Twenty Patterns Realm.","Late Stage Foundation Establishment... Divine Sense Core Formation.","Mo Hua was momentarily stunned.","He hadn’t expected that the day of Divine Sense Core Formation would be so near, almost seeming unreal.","Back in the Qi-refining Realm, when building the Divine Sense Foundation, he had expended tremendous effort, meticulously painting Formations day by day, and grinding away slowly.","But looking back, it could be due to the reason that Qianxue State Boundary hosted a Great Wilderness Evil God.","The Great Wilderness Evil God was so resource-rich, he indulged excessively and almost unconsciously approached Divine Sense Core Formation.","And not only that.","Mo Hua’s Divine Sense delved into the Sea of Consciousness, lowering his gaze towards his Divine Thought incarnation.","After refining a Third Grade Divine Corpse and a Second Grade Evil Embryo successively, and devouring a large amount of Divine Marrow, his Divine Thought had now turned into an almost pure golden color.","Almost pure gold, yet there were still traces of impurities.","This hue was already terrifying; at least Mo Hua hadn’t seen such pure ’golden’ on any deity-like existence he had encountered.","Even Lord Yellow Mountain didn’t have it.","As for the Little Silver Fish, it was just silver.","Regarding gold above this, Mo Hua had only heard Lord Yellow Mountain talk about it, having no substantial concept about it himself.","\"Next step, is it to remove impurities and refine my Divine Thought into pure gold?\"","\"And then what?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat clueless.","And thinking about Divine Marrow, Mo Hua recalled the words spoken to him not long ago by that Third Grade Blood-Colored Divine Corpse.","That Divine Corpse said he was clueless about ’Dao Hua’, said his ’Dao’ was in shambles...","Mo Hua felt a bit unhappy, but upon careful reflection, he believed that the Third Grade Divine Corpse was probably telling the truth.","His understanding of ’Divine Sense Sublimation’ indeed needed deepening, the strength of Divine Sense required more honing, and his whole inheritance needed gradual mastery.","That Divine Corpse did want to kill him, but it also reminded him.","The key is... why did it remind him, why tell him such things?","Wasn’t it the Divine Corpse of the Master of the Great Wilderness?","Mo Hua recalled the bits and pieces of interacting with that Blood-Colored Divine Corpse, and suddenly discovered a problem:","\"Blood...\"","Other Divine Corpses, although cruel, bloodthirsty, and life-devouring, possessing Blood Shadows, did not, like this Divine Corpse, possess such a heavy ’blood’ base color, even having its life’s Divine Skill as a ’Blood Slaughter Blade’ condensed from the Tao of blood.","\"Its Dao involves blood...\"","\"This doesn’t seem to be the ’Dao’ of the Great Wilderness Evil God?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","Things seemed to be getting more complicated...","But regarding Evil Gods, the paths of deities, Dao Laws, and similar things, he did not know much yet and hadn’t encountered many.","Thinking about these now wouldn’t help much either.","\"I’ll think about it later...\"","\"At least I’ve reached the late stage of Foundation Establishment now...\"","Satisfied, Mo Hua put aside other thoughts and rested peacefully once more."]},{"number":1860,"title":"Chapter 1860 - 918: Own Magical Treasure","paragraphs":["Next day, after attending a cultivation class, Mo Hua’s breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage quickly spread throughout the Sect, instantly causing a small \"stir\".","The renowned Formation first of the Taixu Gate, the Array Leader, the Junior Brother of thousands of disciples, can finally, like his Junior Brothers, breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","This Junior Brother, who was exceptionally \"bailed\" to the Foundation Establishment Late Year, no longer has to worry about being \"held back.\"","The entire Taixu Gate breathed a sigh of relief.","The Sect Elders encountered along the way all smiled and nodded at Mo Hua, congratulating him.","Some of his Junior Brothers even specifically arranged a banquet in the dining hall, inviting Mo Hua to a big meal, with each giving a small gift to express their feelings.","\"Congratulations to Junior Brother for successfully reaching the Foundation Establishment Late Stage!\"","Cheng Mo raised his cup and celebrated with the other fellow disciples.","Mo Hua was somewhat touched but also thought they were being a bit exaggerated.","It’s just Foundation Establishment Late Stage...","Mo Hua had some doubts in his heart and asked Cheng Mo, \"Did you celebrate like this when you reached the Foundation Establishment Late Stage?\"","Cheng Mo shook his head, \"No.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"No?\"","\"Hmm,\" Cheng Mo said, \"When we breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, it was ordinary, not worth mentioning. But Junior Brother, you are different from us; your breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage was incredibly difficult and laborious, so it’s worth celebrating specially.\"","Were it not for knowing that Cheng Mo is straightforward and speaks bluntly, Mo Hua would have thought this guy was mocking him.","The people beside also nodded in agreement at this time:","\"It’s not easy for Junior Brother to breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, it deserves celebration.\"","\"...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was subtle, finally letting out a sigh.","Originally a joyful event, but with everyone’s congratulations, Mo Hua still felt somewhat \"discriminated against.\"","But anyway, this was all out of the Junior Brothers’ good intentions, so even with mixed feelings, he accepted it calmly.","In the following days, people familiar with Mo Hua, like Wenren Wan, Elder Gu Hong of the Gu family, Gu Changhuai, Xia Canonical Official of the Xia family, also sent gifts to Mo Hua.","Wenren Wan even specifically prepared a banquet and invited Mo Hua for a grand meal.","Not wanting to delay Mo Hua’s cultivation, it was not ostentatious, just prepared a few of Mo Hua’s favorite dishes at a restaurant in Tai Xu City.","Mo Hua ate happily.","After such a lively few days, Mo Hua’s heart began to settle down.","Having reached the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, it’s time to consider matters for this stage.","Cultivation is like this, one obstacle after another, once this one is crossed, countless others await in the future.","One shouldn’t grow arrogant due to temporary achievements.","Nor should one become anxious or slack due to the distant goal.","Steadily and surely, step by step, walk the path under your feet well.","Day after day, engage in solid cultivation, and bit by bit, gather insights to ultimately achieve water droplets wearing through stone to forge the Great Dao of becoming an Immortal.","Seemingly monotonous, seemingly prolonged, but this is the true \"shortcut.\"","Only with a Taoist Heart as firm as a rock, with great perseverance, enduring great hardships, overcoming numerous obstacles, can one finally reach the end, obtaining the Dao and becoming Immortal.","Mo Hua calmed his mind, as usual, diligently cultivating, practicing the sword, studying formations.","But a few days later, he suddenly remembered something:","\"Why doesn’t Patriarch Dugu open the door to grab me for sword practice?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","Previously he exerted great effort, slaying the Divine Remains, severing the Evil Embryo.","Afterward, with physical injuries depleting him, he was unconscious and was cared for a few days by Elder Murong.","Once the injuries healed, he focused on refining the Divine Marrow, absorbing the Divine Thought, unraveling the Mystery Formation, breaking through bottlenecks, busy and preoccupied.","When he snapped back to awareness, he suddenly realized the seven days had passed, yet Patriarch Dugu still hadn’t looked for him.","\"Did the Ancestor forget about this?\"","The Ancestor was already very old, unknown how many years he had lived, so occasionally having a poor memory and forgetting things was also quite normal.","Mo Hua waited patiently.","But after waiting several more days, already over two \"seven-day periods,\" there was still no movement in the Disciple’s Residence.","No rift in the void, no pair of withered hands, nothing at all.","\"Ancestor...doesn’t want to teach me anymore? Or did something happen to him?\" Mo Hua slightly furrowed his brows.","He extended his finger, making a few gestures in the air.","What a pity.","He had just established his Foundation, couldn’t tear open a rift in the void.","He also couldn’t make it to the Inner Mountain, couldn’t meet Patriarch Dugu, and had no way of asking what exactly happened.","This left Mo Hua worried.","He felt the Ancestor had bestowed upon him the grace of \"imparting the Dao and teaching,\" and now with the Ancestor’s situation uncertain, he should do something for him.","Therefore, during the day, Mo Hua took advantage while everyone was not paying attention, and sneakily made his way to the Inner Mountain.","But since the Inner Mountain is a Forbidden Land, of course, it wouldn’t let him sneak in.","He hadn’t even reached the Inner Mountain when he was caught by an Inner Mountain Elder.","Logically, Outer Disciples sneaking into the Inner Mountain should be punished, but Mo Hua’s situation was special, who didn’t know about the \"Ancestor’s own grandson\" legend attached to him, not to mention his status as the Array Leader, so the Inner Mountain Elder turned a blind eye.","\"The Inner Mountain can’t be intruded upon recklessly, better head back, I’ll pretend I didn’t see this, or else I can’t explain it...\" The Inner Mountain Elder was quite cordial.","\"Mmm, mmm, I was just lost.\" Mo Hua said.","Coming up with excuses was second nature to him.","After leaving the Inner Mountain Elder’s sight, Mo Hua wandered nearby again, but couldn’t find any path leading to the Inner Mountain.","No matter how familiar he is with the Taixu Gate, it is still limited to the Outer Mountain and Outer Gate.","The Inner Mountain housing the Inner Gate and the rarely visited Inner Mountain were never within his \"exploration\" scope."]},{"number":1861,"title":"Chapter 1861 - 918: Own Magical Treasure_2","paragraphs":["After circling around a few times without any gain, Mo Hua had no choice but to go back.","If he kept circling, and was caught by the Inner Mountain Elders again, he would truly find it hard to explain.","The Elders aren’t fools; they might turn a blind eye once, but to overstep the bounds would indeed be offensive.","Mo Hua sighed, turned to leave, and after a few steps, couldn’t help but look back.","The ancient and vast Taixu Mountain lay like an Azure Dragon, hibernating in the Qian Learning State Boundary.","The Outer Mountain stretched out like a dragon’s tail, but the back mountain was the true source of the mountain range, the real \"dragon head\".","Except this dragon head soared into the clouds, hidden in deep fog, looking mysterious and enigmatic, the high altitude especially cold.","Divine Sense perceived nothing at all, not even an inference of cause and effect could reach there.","Mo Hua had no idea where the Sword Tomb was, nor where Patriarch Dugu might be guarding.","He had a faint feeling in his heart, as if some Formation had isolated everything, forbidding outsiders from peeking, holding the most secret things in the depths of the clouds, on the ethereal mountain peak.","\"The Taixu Gate may still have many secrets hidden...\"","Even, lurking with great dangers...","One needed a sufficiently high Realm to come into contact with them.","Mo Hua stood still, gazing deeply at the back mountain, not knowing how long had passed before he silently turned around, leaving along the Green Stone Mountain Path.","...","Inside the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua sat alone.","Patriarch Dugu was unresponsive now, and no one was there to privately teach him the Sword Dao anymore.","A sense of loss, coupled with worry, filled Mo Hua’s heart.","But the back mountain was a Forbidden Land, and except for tearing open the void, he had no way to enter it.","Even now it seemed the back mountain may already be sealed off, its space locked tight, so even if he really could tear open the void, probably he still couldn’t get in.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"I hope the Patriarch, with his blessed fortune, will be safe and that one day I might see him again...\"","Mo Hua silently wished in his heart.","Then he could only temporarily set this matter aside and begin to focus again on his own Cultivation.","After all, the first priority of a Cultivator is Cultivation.","As long as a Cultivator is alive, they must cultivate.","A Cultivator who doesn’t cultivate is worse than death.","\"I’m already in the Foundation Establishment Late Stage now, and the next step is the Golden Core...\"","\"But I recently just broke through, and my Cultivation is not mature enough yet; there is still a considerable distance to a true Golden Core.\"","\"Moreover, forming a Golden Core is not that simple...\"","Mo Hua considered this and realized that in order to form a Core, there were many things that needed doing.","He was walking the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, forging a Divine Thought Dao Foundation, so before his Cultivation could break through to the Golden Core, his Divine Sense must form a Core first, reaching Twenty Patterns.","Thus, once the Cultivation breaks through to the Golden Core, the Divine Sense will further multiply, even undergo a Quality Change.","Before officially forming a Core, the stronger the Divine Sense, the better.","Above Twenty Patterns, each additional pattern deepens the foundation of his Divine Thought by a fraction.","And now his Divine Sense was only a hair’s breadth from the twenty-patter Golden Core.","But this hair’s breadth seemed not something that could be achieved simply by training, or consuming Evil Spirits, but required some chance, or a Sudden Enlightenment, or consuming something special.","But specifically how to accomplish this, without opportunity, Mo Hua wasn’t quite sure.","Divine Sense Core Formation requires an opportunity.","On the other hand, another issue stood urgently before him, pressing to the point that he had to consider it now:","\"Magical Treasure!\"","Essential for breaking through to the Golden Core, bound to a Golden Core Cultivator’s life and spirit, determining to a certain extent the combat power of a Golden Core Realm Cultivator— one’s own Magical Treasure!","Previously, the matter of his own Magical Treasure could still be delayed, but now Mo Hua was already in the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, and the next step involved Core Formation, truly leaving no room for further delay.","If he didn’t come up with a solution, to delay any longer might mean never forming a Core in his lifetime.","But the problem was that it wasn’t as if Mo Hua actually wanted to delay, he simply had no means to.","Thinking over and over, he couldn’t figure out what he should choose as his \"own Magical Treasure.\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then immersed his Divine Sense into his Sea of Consciousness, approaching the Taoist Stele, harboring the slightest hope, and asked softly:","\"Would you be willing to be my ’own Magical Treasure’?\"","The Taoist Stele didn’t even bother to acknowledge him.","Mo Hua then glanced furtively at that \"Robbery Thunder\" on the Taoist Stele, and before he could speak, immediately dismissed this presumptuous thought.","Using Robbery Thunder as a Magical Treasure, he feared he would be struck into ashes before even forming his Core.","Besides, the Robbery Thunder isn’t a Spiritual Artifact and cannot be used as a Magical Treasure.","Withdrawing from his Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua retrieved the Taixu Bamboo Sword given to him by Patriarch Dugu.","This Bamboo Sword looked ordinary, but contains the Ancient Sword Intent of the Taixu Gate, the heart and soul of the successive generations of Taixu Gate Gentlemen, forged into the source of Sword Dao.","\"Use this Bamboo Sword as my own Magical Treasure?\"","Mo Hua thought it over again, then shook his head.","\"This was a gift... no, it was ’loaned’ to me by Patriarch Dugu...\"","In it lies the pinnacle Sword Stream of the Taixu Gate, how could he rightfully refine it into his own Magical Treasure?","Moreover, he wasn’t a pure Sword Cultivator to begin with.","In the Divine Thought World, he relied on Divine Thought into Sword and Divine Thought Taoism; the Swordsmanship could engage in close quarters or long-range combat, perhaps invincibly strong.","But in the real world, his authentic Sword Cultivator techniques were very weak.","Though he had a knack for \"Sword Control,\" this Sword Control would blow up a Spirit Sword every time he used it.","He couldn’t very well blow up his own Magical Treasure...","\"No... the Sword won’t do, then...\"","Mo Hua rummaged through his Storage Bag and took out a Copper Coin."]},{"number":1862,"title":"Chapter 1862 - 918: Own Magical Treasure_3","paragraphs":["This is the Copper Coin that Master gave him. Before entering the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, he used it to divine fortune and misfortune.","\"Copper Coin magical treasure?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then shook his head, \"It can’t kill or defend, it can only divine, like a fortune teller, how does this look like a proper thing...\"","It can’t be that other Golden Core cultivators fight with sword and magical treasures.","And he would fight by taking out his own Life Copper Coin and divining first...","\"If you divined, it should be done in secret, not blatantly, using this as a magical treasure...\"","Mo Hua rummaged through the storage bag, there were some spiritual artifacts and treasures, but none seemed suitable, no matter how he chose.","He had no choice but to seek further advice.","After all, he entered the Qian Learning State Boundary to seek the Tao and knowledge. If he knew everything, he wouldn’t have joined the Sect.","Mo Hua first asked around his fellow junior brothers.","But he found out that these junior brothers had their cultivation techniques, Tao techniques, spiritual artifacts, and even the quality of their Golden Core pre-arranged by their family, elders, and parents long ago.","The road was already paved for them.","They had nothing to worry about, just follow the path step by step.","Mo Hua was a Loose Cultivator; not to mention Golden Core, reaching Foundation Establishment had been a luxury.","The experiences of these \"family\" origin junior brothers couldn’t be referenced at all.","Mo Hua then sought advice from the instructor elder.","The instructor elder, who imparted knowledge for many years, had profound Tao knowledge and gave Mo Hua a lot of suggestions.","Mo Hua’s status was special, and he was likeable in his dealings with people.","The instructors and elders in the sect, both publicly and privately, gave him genuine and sincere advice, fearing he would suffer in the matter of his Life Magical Treasure.","Some elders even brought out some private inheritance spell points with reluctance.","But there were too many suggestions, and Mo Hua was overwhelmed with choices.","Moreover, these suggestions were based on deep family heritage and abundant cultivation resource inheritance, which required time, spiritual objects, and even more Spirit Stones.","The final power of the Life Magical Treasure would be equivalent to that of an ordinary family’s direct lineage disciple at best.","Of course, this was already remarkable.","After all, Mo Hua’s starting point was too low, and being able to temporarily cram and forge a magical treasure equivalent to a family’s direct lineage disciple is already a testament to the profoundness of Taixu Gate’s tradition.","Logically, a Life Magical Treasure of a family’s direct lineage level should be considered a \"luxury\" for Mo Hua.","As a Loose Cultivator, being able to cross so many cultivation barriers and forge a superior Life Magical Treasure like a family’s direct lineage is already like \"ascending to the heavens in one step.\"","Greed is not a virtue, and one shouldn’t ask for too much.","But the issue is, the cost for forging such a \"Life Magical Treasure\" is just too high.","Moreover, because he is cramming at the last minute, having reached the Foundation Establishment Late Stage before starting to nurture a Life Magical Treasure, missing the long process of \"nurturing,\" the consumption for forging is even greater.","If he stays at Taixu Gate, that would be fine.","Relying on the sect, backed by the ancestors, steadily using time and resources to nurture the \"Life Magical Treasure.\"","But Mo Hua knew his situation.","He couldn’t stay at Taixu Gate indefinitely.","His cultivation at Taixu Gate was for knowledge and the Tao, to compensate for his Loose Cultivator origin, the lack of cultivation insights, networks, and complete Tao inheritance shortcomings.","He couldn’t stay here forever; he had more important things to do.","And there was the Master to save.","Sooner or later, and perhaps not long from now, he would leave Taixu Gate.","Once he leaves Taixu Gate, alone in the Nine State, with storms everywhere and dangers lurking, there won’t be a stable environment or ample resources to nurture his Life Magical Treasure.","Furthermore, these family-inherited Life Magical Treasures were prepared for geniuses with Top-Grade, even Superior-Grade Spiritual Roots and didn’t quite fit Mo Hua’s foundation, cultivation, or methods.","Mo Hua, helpless, finally went to consult Elder Master Xun.","Elder Master Xun was sitting in the Elder’s Residence, with the Heavenly Mechanism Disk in front of him, seemingly occupied with something, and hadn’t closed his eyes for days. But he pondered seriously the question Mo Hua asked and then slowly said:","\"I’ve thought about this problem too, but I haven’t found a good solution, so I haven’t brought it up with you.\"","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua with some regret, saying:","\"To be honest, you’ve already missed the best age for nurturing a Life Magical Treasure, and at this time, no matter your choice, it might not meet your expectations...\"","\"I understand,\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"Then what do you want to ask?\"","Mo Hua sought advice, saying: \"Elder Master, what direction should I choose for my Life Magical Treasure? Should it be attack-oriented like sword and saber magical treasures, or defense-oriented like the Golden Bell Shield, Iron Cloth? Or perhaps concealment, investigation, and escape-oriented magical treasures?\"","Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment and said:","\"You are a Formation Master, and as long as you know formations, everything is interconnected. You shouldn’t align with a single-function type of magical treasure, especially kill-type like sword magical treasures.\"","\"Life Magical Treasure binds with a cultivator’s life; when one is damaged, so is the other. Your physical body is already frail, cultivating sword magical treasures and contesting brute force is unwise. If it is damaged, the rebound would also be severe.\"","\"A few Formation Masters do nurture magical treasures like Array Plates or Formation Pens, which increase formation-drawing speed or enhance formation quality.\"","\"But such magical treasures are niche, with little enhancement. Your formation foundation is already profound, and you draw quickly. This enhancement is dispensable to you.\"","Elder Master Xun stated slowly, \"So... instead of using magical treasures for killing or enhancing formations, it’s better to use them to supplement...\"","\"Supplement?\" Mo Hua was startled.","\"Yes, the Life Magical Treasure is one with your life; use it to make up for your inadequacies.\" Elder Master Xun nodded.","\"What should I supplement?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Your biggest problem...\" Elder Master Xun pondered, \"is a weak physical body and thin spiritual power.\"","\"So the first choice is a magical treasure that supplements spiritual power.\"","\"The second choice is one that strengthens the physical body.\"","\"If it comes to it, do what most Formation Masters do: cultivate a concealment, escape technique, survival, or escape-type magical treasure.\"","Mo Hua contemplated, \"Supplements spiritual power, strengthens the physical body, escape...\"","Elder Master Xun nodded slightly, \"But what exactly to forge is for you to decide; I cannot easily make that choice for you.\"","He didn’t fully understand the path of Mo Hua’s lineage, especially when it involved that person and that sect, so he feared his well-meaning advice might send Mo Hua down the wrong path, hence he could only suggest options.","Specifically, it still depends on Mo Hua to choose based on his own knowledge, whether visible to people or not.","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua silently, then warmly encouraged: \"Cultivate diligently; the path of cultivation is full of obstacles, take it step by step.\"","\"Hmm!\" Mo Hua nodded.","After bidding farewell to Elder Master Xun, Mo Hua returned to his Disciple’s Residence.","With Elder Master Xun’s advice in mind, Mo Hua delved into some classics such as \"From Life Magical Treasure to Golden Core,\" \"Cultivation Techniques and You,\" and \"Forming Your Destined Magical Treasure\"... and so on.","But the more he read, the more dazzled and indecisive he felt.","\"What should I choose for my Life Magical Treasure?\" Mo Hua couldn’t help but worry:"]},{"number":1863,"title":"Chapter 1863 - 919: Copper Skin Iron Bone","paragraphs":["Mo Hua spread out several Tao Cultivation Canons related to own Magical Treasure, researching as he found a blank Jade Slip to meticulously sort through from the beginning:","The so-called own Magical Treasure refers to a treasure that is cultivated with the life of the Cultivator and is closely related to the inheritance of Taoist Skill.","Only by forging an own Magical Treasure can one form a Core.","After forming a Core, driving the own Magical Treasure can also unleash greater power than ordinary Spiritual Artifacts.","Each Cultivator’s own Magical Treasure is unique and exclusive, and only they themselves can use it.","Moreover, not only at the Golden Core Realm, but in Feather Transformation, and even in future Heaven Void, the own Magical Treasure will grow stronger as the Cultivator’s cultivation improves.","This treasure will accompany the Cultivator for a very long time.","Therefore, choosing a compatible own Magical Treasure is extremely important.","It’s even more accurate to say that it becomes a part of the Cultivator’s physical body than just being a treasure.","In the orthodox Tao cultivation inheritance, the Golden Core Realm’s own Magical Treasure is still separate from the Cultivator, the Cultivator is the Cultivator, the Treasure is the Treasure.","But once one reaches Feather Transformation, the Treasure can begin to be absorbed into the body, thereby truly achieving the unity of man and treasure.","Of course, there are also those at the Golden Core Realm who have already integrated the Treasure into themselves.","Take for example the Fire Buddha, who placed two Fire-series Magic Treasure Embryos in his chest to replace his heart and sought the basis for Core Formation through this.","But this method is considered a \"Forbidden Technique,\" and in some sense, the Fire Buddha was forced into it.","Mo Hua remembers this grievance: The Fire Buddha was rampant back in the day and was nearly slain by Uncle Gu, with his heart’s meridians damaged and life hanging by a thread. This forced him to take a desperate gamble by using such an extreme \"Core Formation\" method, nurturing those two \"Flaming Hearts\" as his own Magical Treasure.","It was a last resort, and if not so, he might not have dared to play like this.","After all, tampering with one’s own heart and embedding a Treasure is life-threatening if not done carefully.","\"Embedding a treasure to replace the heart...\"","Mo Hua shook his head; it’s too extreme, too frightening, not something he could handle...","He lowered his head and continued flipping through the canons.","According to Elder Master Xun’s guidance, the first choice for his own Magical Treasure should be a treasure that can replenish \"Spiritual Power.\"","Spiritual Power is fundamental to a Cultivator.","All powerful Taoist Skills, without exception, require the consumption of vast amounts of Spiritual Power.","In a situation where cultivation hasn’t reached a crushing level, tactics are not devious enough, and considerations are not thorough enough, a direct confrontation between Cultivators is generally about contesting Spiritual Power.","Whoever has more Spiritual Power, whoever can withstand the consumption, and whoever can fight till the end will win and survive the deadly battle.","Especially for Spiritual Cultivators, the quantity of Spiritual Power is crucial.","Mo Hua’s low Spiritual Power has always been one of his biggest weaknesses, second only to his physical body.","Therefore, being able to use own Magical Treasure to make up for Spiritual Power is the optimal choice.","\"Spiritual Power type treasures...\"","Mo Hua leafed through the canons and finally found a few treasures with long-standing legacies and stable inheritance in the Cultivation World’s \"Comprehensive Guide to Cultivator’s Treasures\":","\"Jade Spirit Gourd, White Jade Pure Bottle, Spiritual Box, Spirit Gathering Hairpin...\"","Artifacts like gourds, bottles, and boxes, once refined, can store one’s own Spiritual Power.","Since they are own Magical Treasures, cultivated with one’s life, they store one’s own Spiritual Power, making them instantly usable for immediate Spiritual Power replenishment without the need to spend time refining like Spirit Stones or Spirit Gathering Pills, essentially serving as an external \"Qi Sea.\"","In a life-and-death battle where every moment counts, this bears significant meaning.","This is precisely why this kind of treasure has an extremely scarce inheritance, with the methods often hidden within Great Sects or Great Families.","Moreover, the cost is exceptionally high, much more expensive than a typical family disciple’s treasure.","Only the true heirlooms of sects’ Direct Lineage and the Heavenly Pride of fifth-grade or higher family Direct Lineage are qualified to cultivate this kind of treasure.","Besides, the biggest issue, like other top-grade treasures, is the need for early nurturing.","In fact, it’s even more extreme, requiring nurturing starting from the age of three.","Because this type of Spirit Gathering Treasure is equivalent to another \"Qi Sea,\" the compatibility between the treasure and the Cultivator requires more stringent criteria.","If not nurtured from a young age, the higher rejection ratio between the treasure and the Cultivator makes successful nurturing difficult.","Even if nurturing is successful, the quality will not be high, and the stored Spiritual Power Cycle will be greatly discounted.","This is the biggest crux of the issue.","Mo Hua has long missed the nurturing timing, even more so than with other treasures.","Three years old...","Unless born with a silver spoon, with elders in the Feather Transformation or Heaven Void stage, who would think to nurture such a thing from the age of three to prepare for Core Formation...","It’s simply too extravagant.","If still forced to nurture, one would have no choice but to accept insufficient nurturing ’Fire Control,’ high rejection with oneself, sparse Spiritual Power storage, and various other unforeseen side effects.","Without a Vajra, do not take on porcelain work.","Without this fate, one is simply unworthy of nurturing this kind of treasure.","Mo Hua shook his head and continued to flip through the pages.","Spiritual Power type is not feasible, so let’s look at the physical body type.","Physical body type treasures have two directions: one is for protecting the body, and the other is for strengthening the physical body.","The ones that protect the body are treasures generally nurtured by Body Cultivators, such as Armor, Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror, Golden Bell Shield, Iron Cloth Shirt, and so on.","These are all advanced versions of \"Spiritual Artifacts\" that can allow Body Cultivators to protect their bodies or safeguard crucial life points.","This way, Body Cultivators can fight more valiantly in close combat.","Of course, if one were to nurture such a treasure, it wouldn’t be for slaughtering but purely for \"preserving life.\"","Consider it a last-resort measure.","In situations of stealthy attacks, in the nick of time, when life hangs by a thread, or in an inescapable killing game, it can block a fatal blow at a critical moment, barely clinging to life."]},{"number":1864,"title":"Chapter 1864 - 919: Copper Skin Iron Bone (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Of course, in such a situation, the Magical Treasure would most likely be destroyed after taking the hit.","But having a destroyed Magical Treasure is always better than losing one’s life.","Another direction is the enhancement of the body through Magical Treasures, as the name suggests, they can directly enhance a cultivator’s physical body.","This is Mo Hua’s major shortcoming.","But upon examining it, these types of Magical Treasures are similarly high-end and extremely secretive as Tao cultivation inheritances, far out of reach for the average cultivator.","The unified name for body-enhancing Magical Treasures is \"Copper Skin Iron Bone.\"","It is a high-end, sophisticated, and unusual \"Magical Treasure\" inheritance that entails not only Artifact Refining but also Alchemy and some Formation functions.","\"Copper Skin Iron Bone\" is divided into two types: external skin planting and inner bone implant.","In the cultivator’s skin, certain liquid metals and irons can be implanted to cover the skin, forming \"Copper Skin\" or \"Scale Armor,\" rendering the cultivator impervious to blades or spears.","Within the bones of the cultivator, certain special gold and jade materials can be implanted to strengthen the bones, similarly enhancing the cultivator’s physique to an unparalleled level.","Magical Treasures implanted into skin and bones are collectively referred to as \"Copper Skin Iron Bone.\"","Of course, this is just a general term; in practice, there will be gold, silver, copper, iron, wood, stone, white jade, etc., for different skins and various bones.","These kinds of Magical Treasures have special forms, materials, and inheritance, and even their nurturing or refining methods are distinct, representing top-tier family inheritances.","\"Copper Skin Iron Bone...\"","Mo Hua was somewhat tempted.","Integrating into the skin and bones, they are hidden and convenient, providing all-around enhancement to the body.","Moreover, it sounds very impressive.","The main point is, there is no prerequisite for prior \"nurturing,\" and it seems that before Core Formation, it is enough to implant the Magical Treasure into Copper Skin or Iron Bone, which is quite attractive to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua temporarily jotted down these types of Magical Treasures and then continued to look further.","Finally, the Concealment and Escape type of Magical Treasures.","Most Formation Masters, along with many Artifact Refiners and Alchemists who are not adept at combat, use these types of Magical Treasures as their own items.","This is also a conventional choice.","After all, the pursuit of Tao cultivation is long life.","Since one seeks long life, naturally, they want to \"preserve life.\" If one dies and becomes a short-lived ghost, what is the point of seeking longevity?","But Mo Hua is different from ordinary Formation Masters; he himself is highly skilled in spells, especially proficient in Concealment Technique and movement technique, so such Magical Treasures are \"icing on the cake\" for him, but they cannot cause a quality change.","Thus, the priority for choosing such Magical Treasures is relatively low.","However, since it is a conventional choice, it implies it is commonplace and popular. It also means that the usage is widespread, reliable, and versatile; it might not be superior to others, but neither would it be inferior to most.","Practical is the best, and there is no need to always \"seek novelty.\"","...","Mo Hua spent some more time skimming through the Encyclopedia of Cultivators’ Magical Treasures and other such classics, conducting a detailed comparison, and roughly determined his choice:","Copper Skin Iron Bone!","His own Magical Treasure would be implanted into \"Copper Skin Iron Bone\"!","Using Copper Skin Iron Bone to strengthen the body!","After all, his physical body is truly too weak. And since childhood, he has had a dream of Body Cultivation, imagining that one day, he could subdue people with his \"fists,\" or, like Junior Brother, wield a long spear, charging in and out of an army of thousands.","Of course, it seems impossible for now, but he can try a little harder.","With Copper Skin Iron Bone as the Magical Treasure, whether taking hits, fleeing, engaging in close combat, or dodging, it all becomes easier, and even ambush attacks would be more forceful.","However, trying to make this a Magical Treasure would likely be very difficult.","Mo Hua could only strive, but the result of the effort would depend on destiny.","After all, not everything in the world can go according to his wishes.","To cope with uncertainties, Mo Hua also selected a few backups.","One is the armor-type Magical Treasure for preserving life, Goldstone Armor, which might save his life at a critical moment.","The next is the Concealment Robe for hiding, and the Thousand Miles Divine Travel Boots for fleeing.","Mo Hua prefers the Thousand Miles Divine Travel Boots, being extremely fast.","After doing something bad, he could run away swiftly, and no one would catch him.","As for the Spiritual Power type of Magical Treasures, they seem quite appealing...","Once nurturing a \"Spiritual Jade Gourd,\" it’s equivalent to having a second Qi Sea, and he might not find it too strenuous to wield Superior Daoist Magic.","But these types of Magical Treasures are \"unattainable,\" and he can only look at them.","...","After thinking it through, the first thing Mo Hua did was go to Elder Master Xun to seek his opinion.","Elder Master Xun was somewhat surprised but nodded after considering it for a moment.","The physical body is Mo Hua’s biggest shortcoming.","To make up for this weakness, addressing the vulnerabilities in the body is indeed reasonable.","Moreover, once Copper Skin Iron Bone is implanted, it improves offense, defense, and preservation of life; the only issue is...","\"Our Taixu Gate lacks such inheritance,\" said Elder Master Xun.","Mo Hua was stunned, \"Not even in the Inner Gate?\"","Elder Master Xun replied, \"It’s not that there is none, but they are scarce, and not quite suitable for your use.\"","\"Our Taixu Gate, after all, is fundamentally a Sword Dao Sect, renowned by our ancestors for Swordsmanship, yet some Swordsmanship is not convenient to pass on, thus, it gradually became more ’Median,’ teaching a bit of Swordsmanship, Spells, Martial Arts, and so on.\"","\"Other Magical Treasure inheritances are fine, but ’Copper Skin Iron Bone’ is too special. This requires directly implanting certain gold and stone materials into a cultivator’s body, which needs ancestral inheritance along with experience and techniques accumulated over generations of cultivators, to form a stable inheritance.\"","\"Only then can it be foolproof, otherwise, the implanted golden jade materials can easily cause problems.\""]},{"number":1865,"title":"Chapter 1865 - 919: Copper Skin Iron Bone (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment and said, \"I do have a few of these types of legacies, obtained by chance in earlier years, but they are all the ’Copper Skin Iron Bone’ type, too low-end and crude. The materials are also cheap, not quite suitable for you.\"","\"Moreover, there’s a crucial point...\"","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua, \"Copper Skin Iron Bone places a heavy load on the body, it’s always practiced by true Body Cultivators. If you forcibly implant it, your small body may not withstand it...\"","\"Is there one with a lighter load?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"There are...\" Elder Master Xun replied, \"But such legacies are already rare, and to also require a light load on the body is even more difficult to find.\"","Even someone like him, the Heaven Void Ancestor, found it difficult.","A legacy is the foundation of Tao cultivation and the foundation of sects and families.","In the Cultivation World, barriers to legacies among various forces are extremely strict. Stealing someone else’s legacy is akin to a father’s death or a wife’s abduction.","Although Taixu Gate is a Great Sect, it hasn’t reached the point where it has everything it wants, especially such stringent conditions requiring a light load and wide applicability for ’Copper Skin Iron Bone’ type top-tier legacies.","Mo Hua sighed, his expression a bit dejected.","Elder Master Xun saw this and felt a bit guilty.","Being of Loose Cultivator origin, he’d had a harder path than others. If his magical treasure is subpar, it becomes increasingly difficult to compete as he progresses.","Within Taixu Gate, anyone’s magical treasure can be overlooked, except for Mo Hua’s, which cannot. The best and most suitable is necessary.","Elder Master Xun pondered, \"I’ll think of a way, ask some of my old acquaintances, see if they have anything suitable. If they do, I’ll exchange for one.\"","Mo Hua was startled, touched, and softly said, \"The cost must be high...\"","\"No matter,\" Elder Master Xun assured him, \"Winning the title of Array Leader and securing Taixu Gate’s ranking is something you deserve.\"","Mo Hua still felt a bit guilty.","Elder Master Xun suggested, \"If needed, we’ll deduct some merit points from you, consider it as if you spent merit points to buy the legacy.\"","Hearing this, Elder Master Xun suddenly thought that this idea was pretty good.","Mo Hua’s merit points have become too \"inflated,\" and it can’t continue; merely capping them without displaying isn’t a solution. It’s necessary to think of a way to make him spend some merit points.","Mo Hua also felt relieved.","As long as it nurtures his own Magical Treasure and enables Core Formation, spending some merit points didn’t matter, such priorities were clear to him.","The purpose of merit points is exactly for this.","\"Thank you, Elder Master!\" Mo Hua expressed his gratitude.","Elder Master Xun nodded, after thinking, he said, \"I can only try to find it for you, but whether it’s found, and how long it may take, are uncertain. It’s best to prepare mentally and leave some alternative routes...\"","\"Understood,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Disciple understands.\"","...","Afterward, Elder Master Xun sought a method to forge Mo Hua’s own Magical Treasure.","But such matters have no certainty, nor is it known when accurate information will arrive.","Additionally, even if such methods truly exist, they also bring along many other issues...","Mo Hua researched and found that implanting Copper Skin Iron Bone is just a specific technique of artifact refinement into the body. True power often requires compatibility with other cultivation techniques, totems, or martial dao.","Having the implantation method doesn’t necessarily mean the matching Taoist skill is available, or even if it is, it may not suit him.","Mo Hua felt a bit helpless.","The more advanced the legacy, often the more complex and profound it is.","The requirements on various qualifications often become more stringent.","Once over the main threshold, many smaller ones often follow inside.","Mo Hua sighed.","However, since the direction was set, there’s no need for second-guessing, just persist on this path.","In the ensuing period, Mo Hua’s focus was on researching how to utilize the \"Copper Skin Iron Bone\" method to construct his own Magical Treasure.","He organized various difficult problems, proactively considered them, prepared ahead of time, striving for thorough planning.","Preparedness leads to success, unpreparedness to failure.","Several days later, while Mo Hua was at the Disciple’s Residence, contemplating matters related to his own Magical Treasure, suddenly his token trembled, and a message arrived.","It was the Guest Elder token of the Demon Sect.","Mo Hua smacked his forehead, remembering he’d forgotten about the Demon Sect.","The main reason was, having already slain quite a few Golden Core Demons, eaten enough Divine Remains, temporarily it held no \"utilization value.\"","Moreover, he had more serious matters, namely the preparation for the \"own Magical Treasure\" before Core Formation, so he hadn’t paid attention to his \"Guest Elder token\" for several days.","Mo Hua picked up the Guest Elder token and checked the messages inside.","As expected, they were sent by Elder You.","And there were multiple messages, unaware when they were sent:","\"Mr. Yuan, Lao Ba is dead, I wonder if there are any other spies within our Demon Sect?\"","\"...Mr. Yuan?\"","\"Mr. Yuan? Has something happened?\"","\"Why not reply? Is there dissatisfaction towards our sect?\"","\"Mr. Yuan... please respond if you see the message.\"","...","Mo Hua touched his chin.","Oops, seems I’ve been exposed, unsure if it can be covered up, if Elder You will suspect me...","\"Maybe... it’s time to stop playing with them?\"","Mo Hua mulled it over.","Having killed Golden Cores, eaten Divine Remains, slayed Evil Embryos, breaking through bottlenecks, Divine Marrow near Pure Gold...","His objectives were nearly achieved.","On the Demon Sect side, it indeed seemed unnecessary to waste time further entangling with them.","Originally, for a small Foundation Building Cultivator like him, continually dealing with these vicious Golden Core Demons was somewhat inappropriate and extremely perilous.","It’s time to quit while ahead, withdraw as soon as possible.","The task to eradicate the Demon Sect could be left to the Taoist Court, he just needed to occasionally \"monitor\" the progress, ensuring Uncle Gu doesn’t get killed.","Nurturing his own Magical Treasure was now the true priority, it could not be delayed.","However, before this, after all the effort, the final bit of \"wool\" must still be gathered...","Mo Hua contemplated, then sent a message to Elder You:","\"I have been targeted by the Taoist Court’s dogs...\"","Soon, Elder You sent a message back, \"Is that so?\"","\"Is the gentleman presently safe?\"","Mo Hua didn’t reply immediately, pretending to be under investigation by the Taoist Court, treated it with great caution, and deliberately left Elder You hanging for half a day, then replied:","\"Your actions are too exposed, involving me!\"","Mo Hua took the initiative, placing the blame on Elder You.","\"My whereabouts have been exposed...\"","\"Taoist Court has experts tracing me using Thunder Magnetism, I fear leaving any traces, only resorting to partial concealment.\"","\"If found and surrounded by the Taoist Court, certain death awaits!\"","Mo Hua didn’t lie, as the real \"Mr. Yuan\" died in this exact way.","Elder You, upon hearing this, was startled and apologized:","\"Our lack of caution implicated you, sir. So now you...\"","Mo Hua did not answer him, again left Elder You hanging for a while, then said:","\"The situation is dire, I need to avoid attention for a while. Before that...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly, sending a message, \"I want my reward... eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones!\""]},{"number":1866,"title":"Chapter 1866 - 920: One-Stop Service","paragraphs":["Eighty-thousand Spirit Stones!","Even for Golden Core, it’s not a small amount.","Golden Core Realm Cultivators have many ways to earn Spirit Stones, but their consumption is equally high. Many Golden Core Cultivators might be worth millions or even tens of millions.","But that includes all Tao Cultivation assets like caves, magical treasures, spiritual artifacts, pills, etc. Eighty-thousand Spirit Stones in ready-to-flow currency, they might not be able to take out.","Let alone Mo Hua at the Foundation Establishment level.","From childhood to now, he has never \"earned\" or even seen such a large amount of Spirit Stones.","Although strictly speaking, this remuneration should be Mr. Yuan’s.","But Mr. Yuan is no longer here; the subsequent \"tasks\" were handled by himself, so it’s only reasonable for him to take this amount of Spirit Stones.","There’s no news from the Guest Elder opposite.","Elder You remained silent.","Mo Hua patiently waited with an expressionless face, but he couldn’t help feeling a bit uneasy.","This Elder You won’t renege, right?","The dignified Demon Sect wouldn’t be so stingy as to dock my eighty-thousand Spirit Stones, right...","Just as Mo Hua was feeling uneasy, Elder You straightforwardly sent a transmission: \"No problem, this is the reward Mr. Yuan deserves.\"","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief.","Elder You: \"How should I give the Spirit Stones to you?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, \"It’s quite tense now, and other methods are inconvenient. Please trouble Elder You to put the Spirit Stones in a Storage Box, bury them on the southern slope fifty miles south of the Gubei Mountain, and erect a wordless tablet above it. I will figure out a way to retrieve them...\"","Elder You paused for a moment: \"Mr. Yuan’s conduct is indeed thoughtful.\"","Mo Hua sent a transmission: \"Please make sure, Elder You does not renege.\"","Elder You: \"Naturally.\"","\"Then it’s settled.\"","\"Agreed.\"","After the discussion, the chat ended, and Mo Hua put away the Guest Elder order, feeling quite pleasant.","Eighty-thousand Spirit Stones, soon to be in my pocket!","Striking a fortune!","Though there was some element of deceit, it wasn’t much; just a tad, and anyway, it was capturing demons to aid the Dao, a justified and righteous thing.","But after being happy for a moment, Mo Hua’s heart felt a bit puzzled:","\"Spirit Stones from demon cultivators who slaughter like maniacs, are they this easy to earn?\"","\"Would Elder You plot against me?\"","He thought if he were \"Elder You\", undoubtedly, he would plot against himself, by no means easily hand over eighty-thousand Spirit Stones.","This transaction isn’t that simple.","But the fat meat at the mouth, not taking a bite, how to know if it’s a trap or fat meat?","Eighty-thousand Spirit Stones, such a huge amount, even if it’s bait, it’s worth biting the hook.","\"The question is, how to take it?\"","If Elder You really plans an ambush, intending to put him in a bind, then once he shows his face, he’ll be in danger.","After thinking back and forth, Mo Hua found a way.","He went to find Elder Xun Ziyou and whispered: \"Elder, can you do me a favor?\"","\"Alright.\" Elder Xun Ziyou readily agreed, \"What’s the favor?\"","\"Help me retrieve something,\" Mo Hua said, \"There’s an empty mound on the slope fifty miles south of Gubei Mountain, with a wordless tablet on it. Dig up the tablet, and buried underneath is a box. Elder Xun, you bring the box to me.\"","Elder Xun Ziyou paused for a while, \"Empty mound, wordless tablet, box?\"","What is this all about...","Elder Xun Ziyou looked at Mo Hua skeptically, \"What are you scheming now?\"","Mo Hua said: \"I’m earning some extra money.\"","\"Extra money?\" Elder Xun Ziyou became interested, \"How much can you earn?\"","\"It’s hard to say yet, depends on whether the opposite side deceives me,\" Mo Hua lowered his voice and said to Elder Xun Ziyou: \"If I earn it, I’ll give you a share.\"","Elder Xun Ziyou was a bit amused.","A share.","You, a Foundation Establishment disciple, how much can you earn? At most, a few ten thousand. After splitting, who knows what’s left.","\"You keep it.\" Elder Xun Ziyou casually said, \"I’m an Elder, how could I want your Spirit Stones?\"","If the Ancestor finds out, he’d definitely flay me.","\"In a few days, I’ll help you get it.\" Elder Xun Ziyou said.","\"Okay, okay, thank you Elder Xun!\" Mo Hua smiled.","Then, he warned again: \"But you should be cautious, there might be an ambush, or they might follow you with ill intentions.\"","Elder Xun Ziyou raised his eyelid, \"An ambush?\"","Mo Hua nodded, then sighed: \"These days, earning Spirit Stones is actually very difficult, any lucrative matter is accompanied by risks.\"","That’s why he asked Elder Xun, who was at the late Golden Core stage, to run this errand.","In the Third-Grade State Boundary, even if a Golden Core Demon sets an ambush, with Elder Xun’s cultivation, there shouldn’t be much trouble.","As the saying goes, it’s good to find shade under the big trees.","Now being at the Taixu Gate, leaning against so many big trees, some risks don’t even need to be borne himself.","\"Need to kill anyone?\" Elder Xun Ziyou asked, \"If any unsighted knaves appear, I can cut them down for you with One Sword.\"","\"No need, no need.\" Mo Hua shook his head repeatedly.","Killing would expose Elder Xun’s swordsmanship and instead draw suspicion from the Demon Sect, making it harder for him to blend in later.","\"Just quietly bring the box to me, try not to expose your identity, and avoid any confrontation, stealthily, just like...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, \"Just like when you quietly followed me back then.\"","Elder Xun Ziyou: \"...\"","That unsightly \"bodyguard\" history, he didn’t want to mention at all.","Mo Hua then went through several precautions, leaving this matter to Elder Xun Ziyou.","Days later, after unknown experiences, a slightly dusty Elder Xun Ziyou handed a redwood box to Mo Hua.","\"There indeed was an ambush, two Golden Core, dressed in black, faces covered, their bodies reeked with sinister Blood Qi, seemingly Demon Cultivators, they followed me all the way.\"","\"I initially wanted to kill them, but held back, just circled around the mountains a few times to lose them.\""]},{"number":1867,"title":"Chapter 1867 - 920: Dragon Service_2","paragraphs":["\"Here’s the box you wanted, buried in the void tomb. I brought it back for you.\"","Mo Hua looked at the box; seeing that the seal on the outside was intact and clearly never opened, he checked again to ensure there were no other issues before finally opening it.","Elder Xun Ziyou did not leave and kept watching as Mo Hua opened the box.","He wasn’t curious about what was inside the box but was afraid that there might be traps inside that could harm Mo Hua.","This box was brought into the Taixu Gate by him, and if there was anything suspicious inside that harmed Mo Hua, the blame would fall entirely on him.","Mo Hua did not keep it from Elder Xun either.","In doing things, one must uphold righteousness.","Elder Xun took the risk to retrieve the box for him, so naturally, he couldn’t let him suffer losses.","If there’s a benefit, think of others, a mutually beneficial approach assures that people will be willing to help you in the future, widening your path.","So Mo Hua, in front of Elder Xun, dismantled the seal Formation on the box and opened the mahogany box lid, only to see a pile of dark, broken stones inside.","Elder Xun picked up a stone and looked at it, then turned to Mo Hua and said:","\"Your business is quite... distinctive. I wonder if these broken stones can earn you ten Spirit Stones.\"","Mo Hua’s face darkened instantly.","Good old Elder You!","That damned old man, not giving any Spirit Stones, using a pile of broken stones to fool him!","Mo Hua sighed, \"Misjudged, the human heart is truly treacherous, unable to withstand even a little trust.\"","Elder Xun’s expression was subtle; he thought to himself that this child was not lacking in his own cunning plans either.","\"What was originally supposed to be in this box?\" Elder Xun asked curiously.","\"Spirit Stones,\" Mo Hua replied.","\"Spirit Stones?\"","\"Yes, eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones.\"","Elder Xun was stunned, \"How much? Eight hundred thousand?\"","Mo Hua nodded.","\"Did you go robbing?\" Elder Xun couldn’t help but ask.","\"No, I earned it through my own Formation skills, hard-earned money,\" Mo Hua said with a serious face.","Elder Xun’s mouth twitched.","What sort of hard-earned money can make eight hundred thousand at once?","\"And now? Can you get it back?\" Elder Xun asked.","Mo Hua sighed, \"I’ll think of a way...\"","\"If you need anything, find me, don’t take risks alone,\" said Elder Xun.","\"Yes, yes,\" Mo Hua agreed wholeheartedly.","After sending off Elder Xun, Mo Hua returned to the Disciple’s Residence and coldly sent a message to Elder You:","\"Elder You, what a scheme.\"","That old man, as expected, was plotting against him.","Elder You pretended not to know: \"Mr. Yuan, what do you mean by this?\"","Mo Hua sneered, \"Let’s not play games. If Mr. Yuan won’t give Spirit Stones, fine, but why send someone to tail me? Do you really think I’m easy to bully?\"","Elder You’s tone softened a bit: \"I ask Mr. Yuan to forgive me. My actions were to invite Mr. Yuan for a conversation to discuss major matters. Great deeds ignore trifles; if there was any offense, please be magnanimous, sir.\"","Mo Hua coldly laughed, \"Do you really not know the rules of our field, Elder You?\"","Elder You was silent for a moment, then asked Mo Hua: \"Mr. Yuan, those who achieve great things, can they care about their own safety?\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Seekers of the Dao have great ambitions; would they care about their own safety? Those with grand plans have a vast perspective; would they worry about temporary losses? Mr. Yuan, if you have the ambition of a great seabird, why fuss over temporary disputes?\"","\"Do you think it’s my first day in this line of work?\"","\"Mr. Yuan...\"","\"Are you going to give me the Spirit Stones or not?\"","\"Mr. Yuan, I cannot believe that your vision is so small, that these mere eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones would matter to you,\" said Elder You. \"As long as you join us, you will not only have Spirit Stones, but whatever you desire.\"","Mo Hua didn’t believe it, \"Elder You, I’m not underestimating you, but you’re just a Golden Core Elder of the Demon Sect, aren’t you? Can you really promise such big words?\"","Mr. You chuckled lightly, \"What is the Demon Sect? Mr. Yuan, as long as you join us in our grand plan, your future will be limitless. Our plan needs top-notch Formation experts like you.\"","Mo Hua frowned.","What is the Demon Sect?","This Mr. You has quite the big talk?","And it seems he’s often a \"spokesperson\"? This speech is so well-rehearsed...","\"What can you offer me?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"What do you want?\"","\"I want women,\" Mo Hua said absurdly.","\"Any Spiritual Root, any aptitude, any age of the woman, you may choose at will, even women from some family bloodlines, are available for you to enjoy...\"","Mo Hua cursed silently in his heart.","Reluctant to part with even eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones, yet embellishing the promise so beautifully...","But he had to consider matters of Core Formation; where would he have the leisure to bicker with Elder You? Originally, he wanted the Spirit Stones to make a final profit. Why would he believe their empty promises and waste any more time?","\"I don’t believe you,\" Mo Hua said, \"unless you show me your sincerity.\"","\"Mr. Yuan, what kind of sincerity do you want?\"","\"Give me my eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones.\"","Mr. You’s forehead twitched slightly, and the conversation came full circle.","Once these eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones are given, debts are cleared. This Mr. Yuan would surely disappear immediately, making it as difficult as climbing to heaven to find him again.","They would also lose an extremely rare Thunder Magnetic Array Master.","\"Mr. Yuan, try thinking on a grander scale...\"","Mo Hua ignored him.","These days, those who don’t give Spirit Stones and only talk about vision are all cheats.","But Mr. You was unwilling to let Mo Hua go. He thought for a moment, then said:","\"How about this, extend the contract, please continue to work for our Demon Sect for another three years, and upon completion, I will give you a total of one million eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones as reward. What do you think?\"","Mo Hua was stunned, and after a moment, he spat in his heart.","One million eight hundred thousand...","Not even giving eight hundred thousand, yet promising one million eight hundred thousand."]},{"number":1868,"title":"Chapter 1868 - 920: A Dragon Tattoo_3","paragraphs":["\"Really?\"","Mr. You said solemnly: \"Really, I would never speak falsely!\"","Mo Hua hesitated for a moment and finally seemed resigned to compromise: \"Fine, this is my last bit of trust, please, Mr. You, do not break your word again.\"","Mr. You: \"Of course, You certainly keeps his word.\"","The conversation ended, and both parties reached an agreement.","Mo Hua severed the Original Magnet sensing, set down the Guest Elder token, and felt a surge of anger:","\"Well, you dog-headed think tank, you even dare to withhold my Spirit Stones.\"","He would believe in a million and eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones only if it were a ghost.","\"Dare to owe me money, you just wait...\" Mo Hua thought silently to himself.","He originally planned to stop while ahead and not get entangled with this Demon Sect, but now without any reason, he’s been owed eight hundred thousand... no, now it’s a million and eight hundred thousand in debt, and it’s considered \"bad debt,\" how could he possibly swallow this?","A dignified Uncle never owed him so much as a bowl of noodles.","A mere Demon Sect, and it wants to owe him a million and eight hundred thousand Spirit Stones?","Mo Hua spent a bit of time planning in his heart, and by nighttime, he went to the Disciple’s Residence, took out the Returning to the Source Jade Slip, connected it to the Guest Elder token, and used the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to infiltrate the Demon Sect’s lower-level Original Magnet Compound Formation.","He planned to dig out more permissions, deeper.","The permissions of the Guest Elder token are at the \"quasi-Elder\" level, above all disciples, just a bit lower than that of official Elders.","Precisely because of this, the lock on permissions is even more stringent.","Moreover, this Guest Elder token was previously \"cracked\" by the deceased Mr. Yuan with an exclusive Thunder Magnetism heritage, overlaying the inherent Magnetic Patterns, also involving Second Grade and Third Grade mixed, akin to the \"frequency reduction\" principles of formations.","Mo Hua couldn’t figure it out in a short time, so he temporarily set it aside.","But now, this Demon Sect’s dog-headed think tank dared to deduct his Spirit Stones, so in anger, Mo Hua picked up the Guest Elder token again, planning to spend more time to do something big.","First, he still had to find a way to infiltrate.","Mo Hua released his Divine Sense, sensing the Original Magnet structure at the bottom of the Guest Elder token.","The Original Magnet formation of \"quasi-Elder\" level, with mixed Second and Third Grade Magnetic Patterns, intertwined, as if cast from gold and iron, built into a city wall, sealing all the lower-level permissions inside.","The city wall composed of these Magnetic Patterns is solid as gold soup and impregnable.","Especially the Third Grade Magnetic Patterns within, which were simply not breachable with Mo Hua’s Second Grade Thunder Magnetism proficiency.","But Mo Hua’s Thunder Magnetic Flow is unique.","His \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\" is a prototype of the Thunder Magnetic Array, although currently still quite immature, it does not conform to formation shapes, able to freely roam in the Magnetic Sea, modify Magnetic Patterns, far more skillful than the means of ordinary Thunder Magnetic Array Masters.","So Mo Hua manipulated the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, on a higher-level, on the Elder-above Magnetic Patterns \"city wall\", one Magnetic Pattern at a time, attempting to infiltrate.","No matter how perfect the mix of Third Grade and Second Grade, there will always be gaps.","Once the gap is found, trying to \"undermine\", he could infiltrate deeper into the Original Magnet, steal deeper secrets.","This is actually cheating.","Other Formation Masters can only generate Thunder Magnetism through fixed formations to affect Magnetic Patterns.","But Mo Hua basically anthropomorphized Thunder Magnetism, able to move freely and modify Magnetic Patterns.","However, this is also a very cumbersome method.","It requires a lot of time, trying pattern by pattern.","Mo Hua’s time is very precious, before he didn’t want to waste it like this, but now that he has been tricked by Elder You, he decided to deeply undermine the corners of the Demon Sect.","In the following days, all of Mo Hua’s spare time was spent on this matter.","His control over the Thunder Magnetic Miniature became increasingly proficient, and his understanding of Thunder Magnetism became even more profound.","After relentless effort, Mo Hua finally pried open a few cracks in the solid-as-gold-soup Magnetic Patterns city wall.","The cracks signified a blank in permissions.","Mo Hua, attempting to use the Thunder Magnetic Miniature to crawl through the cracks into a deeper region of the Original Magnet, failed.","The Original Magnet is sealed and exclusive.","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature’s grade was too low, its Returning to the Source degree not deep enough, repelled by the Original Magnet, simply unable to penetrate.","Mo Hua could only settle for second best, intercepting Magnetic Patterns from the cracks.","After intercepting the Magnetic Patterns, Mo Hua noted them down, then compared and annotated them one by one for \"decoding\".","These Magnetic Patterns were more complex and highly encrypted.","But Mo Hua had a deep mastery of Original Magnet, not like Elder You, who only knew half-baked things, so unlocking them wasn’t difficult.","One by one, the complex and obscure Magnetic Patterns were decoded by Mo Hua into text and recorded on paper.","These seemed to be \"encrypted\" conversations between some Elders within the Demon Sect, because they were intercepted Magnetic Pattern fragments, the text was intermittent and the timing somewhat scrambled:","\"Hindered and slow, I don’t know when it will end...\"","\"Soon...\"","\"I don’t understand why bother with this ’Demon Sect’? It’s superfluous...\"","\"Without this Demon Sect, how will we develop followers? Do you expect us to set it up ourselves?\"","\"Teaching the Dao requires inheritance, and the blood skill inheritance is most suitable. It’s easy to learn and spread.\"","\"Mr. Tu actually managed to find this inheritance...\"","\"This is the Blood Refining Sect’s inheritance. Don’t spread it around, or you’ll easily attract cause and effect.\"","\"Blood Refining Sect...\"","\"If I remember correctly, doesn’t the origin of the Blood Refining Sect trace back to that ’Taoist’?\"","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart upon seeing this.","Taoist?","Again, a Taoist... Is it Uncle?","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then shook his head, \"No, Uncle’s Daoist name is ’Guile’, unrelated to blood, and he wouldn’t spread this kind of Dao. In other words, if Uncle truly came to teach the Dao, few in the current Demon Sect would remain sane.\"","\"Then could it be...\"","Three words floated in Mo Hua’s mind, but he didn’t speak them out loud.","At the same time, the Third Grade divine remains of the person on the bloody path, whom he killed, also appeared in his mind.","Along with the Blood Refining Sect, those three words also felt very familiar, as if he had encountered them before.","In the midst of it all, something seemed to connect...","Mo Hua frowned and continued to decipher the magnetic patterns:","\"If it is... that Taoist, isn’t this matter somewhat peculiar?\"","\"The Taoist’s schemes are definitely extraordinary.\"","\"Stop talking, don’t forget what path that Taoist took. Once entangled, neither you nor I can expect a good end...\"","\"Wasn’t he in slumber?\"","\"So many years, and he still hasn’t died?\"","\"Erase what you just said, if you want to die, don’t drag me into it.\"","\"Recklessly talking about the life and death of the Taoist, truly it’s the fearless who are ignorant...\"","...","Mo Hua suddenly became aware that this Demon Sect may not be as simple as it seemed.","He wanted to look further into the \"Taoist\" matters, but the conversation abruptly ended again.","The Magnetic Sea was vast, and he was restricted in his access, unable to find related content for a while.","Mo Hua had no choice but to patiently continue stealing the magnetic patterns, but the intercepted patterns afterward talked about something else:","\"Let’s rebel.\"","This simple line amazed Mo Hua after he deciphered it.","It turns out there are quite a few traitors within the Demon Sect.","He continued reading:","\"Mr. Tu lied, he definitely deceived us, he absolutely has other plans.\"","\"We can’t keep risking our lives, the Qian Learning State Boundary is not a place to stay for long, I’m afraid a great disaster will come soon...\"","\"There’s no escape, don’t forget, our entire inheritance is suppressed by Big Brother...\"","\"Then... let’s get rid of Big Brother!\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","The developments seemed to be getting interesting...","Mo Hua continued to watch with great interest.","\"You scoundrel, do you have the courage of a bear or a leopard to be disrespectful to Big Brother?\"","\"Fortune’s wheel turns...\"","\"Stop dreaming.\"","\"Don’t forget, Big Brother has a dragon tattooed on him...\"","...","Mo Hua, who was observing the drama, suddenly froze.","A dragon?","In a flash, a thought seemed to pass through his mind.","Big Brother has a dragon tattooed on him?","A dragon tattooed on him?","Mo Hua felt a tremor in his heart."]},{"number":1869,"title":"Chapter 1869 - 921: Four Symbols Azure Dragon","paragraphs":["\"Don’t forget, why the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was established...\"","\"So many cultivators were used for experiments, integrating various monster patterns into their bodies, causing them to degenerate into monster cultivators. The purpose was to keep making mistakes, iterating, and integrating, ultimately to nurture this ’Dragon’.\"","\"What does the Dragon signify?\"","\"The Four Symbols Dragon Pattern is a genuine divine beast pattern, only qualified to be refined by the Great Wilderness Imperial Family. Once refined, the bearer possesses the Green Dragon Power, their skin like dragon scales, indestructible, their roar like that of a dragon, full of majesty, all Ten Thousand Demons surrender, not daring to disobey...\"","\"You follow the path of the Bear Demon, though strong, don’t think of such a bold move against Big Brother, otherwise, you won’t even know how you died...\"","\"But, I see Big Brother he’s...\"","\"Shut up, don’t mention this matter again!\"","...","Mo Hua held the Guest Elder Order, staring at the words deciphered from the Magnetic Patterns, his expression blank, but his heart was surging with turbulence.","Dragon Pattern!","Divine Beast Pattern!","Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Pattern?!","The real purpose of nurturing so many monster cultivators in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was to use a large number of monster patterns, to continuously iterate, refine, and eventually produce the Azure Dragon Pattern?!","No wonder...","No wonder, in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Mr. Tu, realizing the unfavorable situation, didn’t hesitate for a moment to \"destroy the evidence.\"","The monster cultivators were all ordered by Mr. Tu to go to their deaths.","The Four Symbols Monster Patterns on the monster cultivators also all self-destructed, exploding into a cloud of blood mist.","Furthermore, all Formation Diagrams, books, and jade slips were either transferred or destroyed, leaving nothing behind.","He didn’t dare to leave any trace.","Fearing that any clue left behind might allow someone, through the remaining formations and following the principles of formation, to deduce his plot.","Mr. Tu’s true intention was to restore the authentic, possessing divine beast power, and the near-extinct Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation!","\"Such great ambition...\"","If it weren’t for Mo Hua, using the prototype of a Source Pattern from Returning to the Source, accidentally infiltrating and spying on these details within the Demon Sect, he wouldn’t have known Mr. Tu had such ambition.","So it comes to this...","\"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is used for research and experimentation on the Four Symbols Green Dragon Pattern...\"","\"The Dragon King Temple on the Mistwater River, it should also be related to this...\"","\"Dragon King Temple, Dragon Blood, Dragon Bone...\"","\"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons studies formations, the Dragon King Temple provides materials.\"","Mo Hua remembered, in the Dragon King Temple, that Mr. Witch who could transform into dragon scales, turning into a monster, invulnerable to swords and spears.","It seems Mr. Witch was also an \"experiment\" of the Green Dragon Formation?","Or, he also utilized the research of the \"Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation,\" to some extent gaining indestructible Green Dragon Power?","Mo Hua gradually linked everything together.","At the same time, a bold thought gradually arose in his mind:","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation...","\"What if my own Magical Treasure...\"","He restrained his excitement, forced himself to calm down, and then slowly pondered:","\"Copper Skin Iron Bone,\" is just a general term for a type of Magical Treasure, its core is using certain special spiritual materials, with secretive alchemy doctors, artifact refining, and formation methods, attached to the skin, or implanted in the bones, to strengthen the physical body.","But its essence is still an external \"layer of armor,\" or internal \"armor\" within the bones.","For body cultivation, this \"Copper Skin Iron Bone\" is naturally an all-in-one offense and defense, incomparably strong.","But for me, it still doesn’t quite fit, it’s still missing some \"soul.\"","And now, Mr. Tu’s plotting offered me a direction:","Formation!","Copper Skin Iron Bone is just a form, my Divine Sense Proving the Dao walks the path of formations, my own Magical Treasure should naturally relate to \"formation.\"","And before me, there seems to be the most suitable formation:","Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation.","Shedding the bloodthirsty monster pattern method of the Demon Sect, using the method to forge \"Copper Skin Iron Bone,\" this \"Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation,\" is to be my own Magical Treasure, integrated into my flesh, skin transforming into dragon scales, commanding the divine beast power!","Mo Hua was temporarily elated, then calmed himself and thought carefully:","\"But this Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation, is something Mr. Tu schemed for so long, consumed so much effort, and researched meticulously, surely it’s not that simple...\"","\"First is the materials...\"","\"Dragon Blood... I don’t have any...\"","\"The Mr. Witch at the Dragon King Temple, who could transform into dragon scales, surely consumed Dragon Blood, but he died cleanly, leaving no clues, then could it be... should I have a chance to find it at the Dragon King Temple?\"","\"Or, look within the Demon Sect, to the ’Big Brother’ in the mouth of the Golden Core Demon... which is the leader of the Demon Sect, since he cultivated the Four Symbols Dragon Pattern and nurtured the Green Dragon Power, he surely has Dragon Blood.\"","\"Dragon Meat... not sure if it’s needed.\"","\"Dragon Bone...\"","Mo Hua suddenly thought, \"The Dragon Bone Divine Statue in the Dragon King Temple!\"","This divine statue, made of Dragon Bone, hidden deep in the main hall of the Dragon King Temple, was found by me and hidden in the small fishing village, used as a habitat for the Little Silver Fish.","Then Mo Hua frowned again.","But this Dragon Bone Divine Statue has an ancient aura, mysterious power, and great cause and effect, I may not be able to merge it into my body.","Even if merged, it might not solve the repulsion between the Dragon Bone and the human body.","Moreover, the general method of merging \"Copper Skin Iron Bone\" should be unable to integrate Dragon Bone into a cultivator’s flesh.","This is \"Dragon\" Bone.","Even an ordinary River Dragon King’s bones contain powerful forces beyond what cultivators can bear,","not to mention, my physical body has always been weak."]},{"number":1870,"title":"Chapter 1870 - 921: Four Symbols Azure Dragon (Part 2)","paragraphs":["It’s not just the Dragon Bone, there are other issues as well.","The Four Symbols Monster Pattern of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, all use methods of the Evil Formation, and the Azure Dragon Divine Beast Pattern they raise is probably not a proper \"Azure Dragon.\"","If so, putting this Evil Formation on oneself, wouldn’t that be akin to entering the Demon Path?","Moreover, this Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation, according to the Demon Cultivators, is a Divine Beast Pattern that only the true Imperial Family of the Great Wilderness is qualified to refine.","If that is the case, then to refine this Azure Dragon Formation and inherit the power of the Four Symbols Divine Beast, there should also be a bloodline requirement?","In my own body, there is no blood of the Great Wilderness Imperial Family flowing, do I have the qualifications to refine the Green Dragon Pattern?","These are just the issues I can think of at the moment...","This powerful, ancient, almost lost, unprecedented Azure Dragon Formation that even Mr. Tu needs countless Monster cultivator lives to research, if I truly want to refine it into my own Magical Treasure, I’m afraid there would be many more difficulties...","Mo Hua’s frown deepened.","\"It’s too difficult, there are too many problems...\"","Mo Hua was entangled in his heart, but after carefully considering for a long time, hesitated several times, he finally made up his mind:","No matter, just mark a dragon for myself!","Choosing an ordinary Core Formation Magical Treasure is relatively safe and carries no risk. But no risk means only \"mediocrity.\"","To refine the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation, it’s obvious without thinking that it would inevitably be fraught with obstacles and extremely difficult. But precisely because of this, it holds the value of pursuit.","\"Own Magical Treasure\" is cultivated in conjunction with one’s life and spirit, accompanying a cultivator throughout their life, laying the foundation for Core Formation, and is one of the biggest \"watersheds\" for Golden Core Cultivators.","Many noble families’ direct lineage talents begin nurturing their Magic Treasure Embryos from the age of three.","Mo Hua is already significantly behind these noble family’s sons in terms of Spiritual Root, physique, and heritage, if he doesn’t choose a better own Magical Treasure, the gap in apparent cultivation in the future will only widen.","This Green Dragon Formation, if he didn’t know about it, it would have been the end of it, he wouldn’t have any thoughts.","But since fate and coincidence made him aware, that is another matter.","A once-in-a-lifetime opportunity is in front of him, no matter how difficult, he must try it.","If he misses this opportunity, it will be too late for future regrets.","What’s more, what he plans to do in the future, whether rescuing his master or seeking all techniques and attaining immortality, will be even more difficult.","If he shrinks back now, the road in the future will only become harder and harder.","Mo Hua nodded, heart resolved:","He was going to give himself a dragon!","Find a way to refine the \"Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation\" and make it his own Magical Treasure!","One should do their best and leave the rest to fate, to get anything good, one must put in the corresponding effort. Effort does not necessarily result in outcomes, but without effort, blessings certainly will not fall from the sky.","Since he decided, Mo Hua no longer hesitated.","\"If I want to refine the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation, the issue of materials can be considered later, the methods of the Evil Formation can also be scrutinized again, but before that, the first thing to do is to find a way to get the ’Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map’ in hand...\"","Mo Hua contemplated in his heart.","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map is the premise of everything.","Without the Array Map, everything else is empty talk.","And this Array Map is one of the most prestigious Formation inheritances among the Four Symbols Formations, bearing the name of the Divine Beast \"Azure Dragon.\"","Taking a step back, even if he doesn’t refine it into an own Magical Treasure, he must find a way to obtain this Array Map.","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map, just from its name, is extraordinary.","\"But again, how to get the Array Map...\"","Mo Hua sat at the table, propped his chin, his thoughts continually swirling, \"The leader of the Demon Sect, he gave himself the Green Dragon Pattern, that means he definitely has the Green Dragon Array Map on him.\"","\"But he is the leader, mysterious and unpredictable, and is at the late Golden Core stage, coupled with the Green Dragon Pattern—even if it is incomplete, his strength must be extremely formidable, thinking about going after him is a bit much...\"","\"Then... Mr. Tu?\"","\"Mr. Tu must also have it, but he is very likely in the Feather Transformation stage, even stronger than the leader of the Demon Sect, making it even more impossible to snatch from such a powerful tiger’s mouth.\"","\"Inside the Demon Sect, perhaps no one else knows about this Formation, even the ’think tank’ Elder You may not know any clues about this Array Map...\"","Mo Hua thought it over and over, seemingly unable to find any breakthrough...","His grand plan to mark a dragon as his own Magical Treasure had already \"collapsed\" before it even started...","In the following days, Mo Hua was mulling over this matter.","Finally, a few days later, he thought of a possibility:","\"The Merit Vault of the Demon Sect!\"","The Merit Vault is a place to store Sect treasures and inheritances, just as in the Righteous Dao, so it is in the Demon Path.","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map is definitely a Sect treasure, it might be stored in the Merit Vault of the Demon Sect.","But the problem is, this Array Map is so valuable, so valuable that not even the Merit Vault might qualify to store it.","Both are possible, but at least it’s a direction.","Having a direction is worth a try.","After finishing his contemplation, Mo Hua formally planned to target the Demon Sect’s \"Merit Vault\"—this was also an idea he had long ago when he first learned the Yuan Magnetic Formation principle:","Use the Yuan Magnetic Formation principle to alter Formation permissions and steal the resources and inheritances from other Sects’ vaults!","Mo Hua gave it a try, and unsurprisingly failed.","Stealing inheritance is not that simple.","He had overestimated his Yuan Magnetic Formation skill.","The \"Merit Scroll\" is a magnetic core of all Sects, any Sect, when constructing the Yuan Magnetic Formation, administers the \"Merit Vault\" with utmost rigor."]},{"number":1871,"title":"Chapter 1871 - 921: Four Symbols Azure Dragon_3","paragraphs":["But with strict management, Mo Hua did not fear. His greatest obstacle was still that he only had Foundation Establishment cultivation level, and his formation expertise could at most reach Second Grade.","With his Second Grade formation skills, it was simply impossible to infiltrate the Demon Sect’s \"Merit Vault.\" Even using something like the Thunder Magnetic Miniature wouldn’t work.","Just like that, the only path was blocked again.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but sigh, feeling emotional.","His cultivation level was indeed too low.","There were many formations he couldn’t learn, and sophisticated methods he couldn’t use.","\"When will I be able to form my Core, or even undergo Feather Transformation...\"","By then, he would be able to learn Third Grade, even Fourth Grade formations. The effectiveness and power of formations would reach a higher level.","Even with a Golden Core, mastering Third Grade formations would place one in the upper-middle mainstream within the entire cultivation world’s formation system. Most high-difficulty formations could be explored if the opportunity arose...","Mo Hua was momentarily lost in thought. Coming back to his senses, he realized he was thinking too far ahead.","He should first consider the matter of the Green Dragon Array Map.","\"Foundation Building Level, Third Grade Original Magnet...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment more, and suddenly his eyes lit up as he thought of something.","Once the ten-day rest period arrived, he arranged another meeting with Elder Zheng.","The two sat in a teahouse, drank a cup of tea together, and Mo Hua said, \"Elder Zheng, by a stroke of luck, I obtained a complete set of Thunder Magnetic inheritance, but I discovered...\"","\"Wait,\" Elder Zheng was taken aback for a moment, \"What did you say?\"","Mo Hua continued, \"I said by a stroke of luck, I obtained a complete set of Thunder Magnetic inheritance, including the array plate, formation diagram, and some formation book insights...\"","Elder Zheng opened his mouth, somewhat incredulous:","\"You mean... a complete set of Thunder Magnetic inheritance?\"","Thunder Magnetic inheritance, along with an array plate and formation diagram.","For a Formation Master, even one with a family legacy in Thunder Magnetic Arrays, this was a \"matter of life and death.\"","Could this be obtained just by coincidence?","Elder Zheng’s expression immediately turned serious, his gaze deepened, \"Did you... kill a Thunder Magnetic Array Master?\"","Without killing an orthodox Thunder Magnetic Array Master, you couldn’t have come by such belongings.","Mo Hua was also somewhat taken aback.","Elder Zheng was indeed perceptive; he quickly guessed the \"stroke of luck\" process Mo Hua was describing.","Mo Hua corrected, \"It wasn’t me who killed him.\"","\"Then who did?\"","\"The Taoist Court.\" Mo Hua spoke candidly.","\"The Taoist Court?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I provided a small clue, and the people from the Taoist Court followed it to locate a Thunder Magnetic Array Master, then killed him.\"","Elder Zheng’s expression suddenly became clear, immediately understanding why Mo Hua had come to ask him about \"Original Magnet positioning\" earlier. It was for \"targeted killings.\"","He was using his knowledge quite diligently...","Elder Zheng frowned.","\"He was a Demon Cultivator, did many bad things, and deserved to die.\" Mo Hua added, to ensure his \"upright and kind\" image in Elder Zheng’s mind.","Elder Zheng’s expression was peculiar, and he curiously asked, \"The Taoist Court killed this Array Master, yet they allowed you to take possession of these array plates and formation diagrams?\"","Mo Hua replied, \"I used a bit of, just a little bit of network.\"","Mo Hua was very modest.","Of course, that network wasn’t small at all; it included the True Transmission Elder of the sect and an influential Supervisor from the Taoist Court. He maneuvered among them and thus took those things—no, retrieved the formation inheritance belonging to Taixu Gate and temporarily kept it with him.","Elder Zheng had no words left.","Sometimes, he really suspected that an \"old sly demon\" resided in Mo Hua’s brain.","For a cultivator of his age to handle matters so impeccably was impossible.","Elder Zheng frowned, then advised, \"This matter ends here. Don’t mention it to anyone else.\"","\"This is no small matter. These Thunder Magnetic Array Masters with inheritance might have fellow sect members or mentors.\"","\"Thunder Magnetic Array Masters are secretive, and the teacher-disciple inheritance is closer. Killing a disciple might bring trouble, and if it’s exposed, you could be besieged by a group of Thunder Magnetic Array Masters. They’ll strip away all your personal information and find a thousand ways to harm you. You’ll be in big trouble...\"","Hearing this, Mo Hua’s heart tightened, and then he emphasized a bit:","\"I didn’t kill anyone.\"","\"Whoever has the items, the debt is theirs. Moreover...\" Elder Zheng silently glanced at Mo Hua, \"Are you really not involved at all?\"","Mo Hua felt somewhat guilty.","His involvement was extensive.","This \"Mr. Yuan\" was precisely located by him, the ambush set by him, the Taoist Court called by him, leading to the encirclement and killing.","Considering it, he was the \"chief culprit.\"","Yet, he hadn’t anticipated getting involved in such a cliché of \"killing the small leads to the big, killing the big leads to the elder\" cause-and-effect drama.","\"Perhaps you won’t truly encounter it; I’m just reminding you to be careful.\" Elder Zheng said.","\"Okay, I’ll remember.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Seeing this, Elder Zheng relaxed, took another sip of tea, and said, \"By the way, what did you want to ask me?\"","Only then did Mo Hua recall the main issue, sincerely asking:","\"Elder, in that Thunder... in that formation inheritance, especially the array plate, there are both Third Grade and Second Grade formations embedded in it. Why is that? Is it to ’lower the frequency’ of the formation?\"","\"That involves another type of formation knowledge.\" Elder Zheng thought for a moment, then slowly said, \"Let me ask you, how do you differentiate between First and Second Grade formations?\"","This question was too basic.","Mo Hua replied, \"By the number of formation patterns and the classification of formation patterns.\"","\"Have you ever tried using First and Second Grade formations together?\" Elder Zheng asked.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then shook his head, \"No.\"","As a Second Grade Array Master, why would he go back to drawing First Grade formations?","Moreover, his Divine Sense was much stronger than other cultivators of the same realm, and he had always been drawing high-rank formations, honing his Divine Sense in the process.","He hadn’t drawn First Grade formations in a long time.","\"Can First and Second Grade formations be used together?\" Elder Zheng asked again.","\"Probably... yes, in a Compound Formation, using a formation pivot to accommodate both First and Second Grade formations is possible.\" Mo Hua said, \"But such mixing doesn’t seem to have much point.\"","Elder Zheng nodded, \"Mixing First and Second Grades isn’t very meaningful because they’re both quite basic, but above Third Grade, it’s different.\"","\"For many cultivators, forming a Golden Core is a major barrier.\"","\"For many Formation Masters, Third Grade formations are similarly a Heavenly Chasm.\"","\"Many Formation Masters remain stuck on the threshold between Second and Third Grades for life, unable to advance further.\"","\"And Third Grade formations are significantly more powerful compared to Second Grade.\"","\"Many formations, when using only Third Grade patterns, would be very powerful. But in the real cultivation world, Third Grade Array Masters are few, Third Grade formations are difficult, their cost is high, and they’re extremely inconvenient both in maintenance and repair.\"","\"Thus, the typical Third Grade formation is a ’mixed’ compound formation, containing some Second Grade formations.\"","\"This technique is referred to by Formation Masters as ’pattern lowering.’","\"Its purposes are twofold: one is to lower the grade of formation patterns to reduce difficulty, control cost, and save on formation operation losses.\"","\"The second is to enable lower-realm formation masters to slightly activate some high-rank formation operations through mutual influence of formations...\""]},{"number":1872,"title":"Chapter 1872 - 922: Dao and Grades","paragraphs":["Elder Zheng patiently explained to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua nodded slowly, appearing thoughtful, \"So, as you say, is it possible for a Second Grade Array Master to mobilize a Third Grade Array?\"","\"In theory, yes, but the conditions are quite harsh,\" Elder Zheng responded, \"First of all, these formations must be designed and constructed from the start for cost-effectiveness using ’decoration patterns’.","Secondly, such arrays cannot be drawn by a Second Grade Array Master; at most, they can only be used.","After all, it’s a Third Grade Array, and without the appropriate realm, even if it can be used, the effectiveness will be greatly reduced.","Again, the condition for using the array is strictly Divine Sense.","Whatever realm your Divine Sense is, that’s the grade of formation you can use. Even with decoration patterns, a Third Grade Array requires at least a Divine Sense of Foundation Establishment Peak, which is too difficult for most cultivators.","Without learning formations and honing Divine Sense, most cultivators, even if they have achieved Foundation Establishment Peak, would never possess a Foundation Establishment Peak’s array.","Therefore, wanting to use a small portion of a Third Grade Array at the Foundation Establishment Realm is nearly impossible, and even if possible, the array’s effectiveness would be too weak to be meaningful.","But...","Elder Zheng glanced at Mo Hua, pondered lightly, then understood Mo Hua’s intention, thinking suddenly brightened his eyes, asking:","\"Are you thinking of trying to mobilize the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate you got from ’killing and robbing’?\"","\"I didn’t kill anyone!\" Mo Hua emphasized again, \"And it’s not killing and robbing.\"","He is a serious cultivator, generally doesn’t engage in such improper actions.","Unless absolutely necessary.","Elder Zheng obviously didn’t care about it, he pondered for a moment, \"Although the conditions for using decoration pattern formations are harsh, your talent is so exceptional that you actually meet all of them unexpectedly...\"","Especially since your Super Divine Sense is three levels above, it’s really incredible.","Elder Zheng still finds it extremely shocking recalling it up to now.","Sometimes he even feels a real impulse to knock open Mo Hua’s head to see what’s inside it, why at Foundation Building Middle Stage, he already possesses a Divine Sense of Foundation Establishment Peak.","\"The Thunder Magnetism Formation acts on the micro-scale of thunder magnetism, unlike common formations, it does not stress power size, nor the scale of spiritual power. ’Decoration patterns’ have little impact on their use.\"","\"However, you are, after all, only Second Grade, even if you mobilize the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, it could only activate a small part, the real thunder magnetism effect, couldn’t even reach a tenth or a fifth...\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"A little bit is enough.\"","He doesn’t completely rely on the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate.","The Thunder Magnetic Array Plate is just a \"door opener\", his true reliance is the Secondary Thunder Source Pattern from Returning to the Source, which is the \"Thunder Magnetic Miniature\".","\"As long as you know what’s important in your heart, that’s enough.\" Elder Zheng said.","Clever children don’t need too many constraints; letting them learn things in a divergent way often leads to pleasant surprises.","Of course, it would be even better if this \"surprise\" doesn’t develop into \"fright\"...","Elder Zheng silently looked at Mo Hua, then after a moment of contemplation, took out a jade slip, infused it with a bit of Divine Sense, recorded some words in it, and handed it to Mo Hua.","\"I’ve recorded some insights on ’decoration patterns’ into this jade slip, take a look when you have time, I won’t say more.\"","Mo Hua was overjoyed, took the jade slip, and thanked, \"Thank you, elder!\"","They finished discussing formations, Mo Hua acquired the jade slip, and the tea was also finished. Elder Zheng was going to leave, so Mo Hua got up to bid farewell.","\"Mo Hua.\"","Elder Zheng suddenly called out to him, his eyes showing contemplation as though there was something he wanted to say but was hesitant.","\"Elder, is there anything else?\" Mo Hua asked, puzzled.","Elder Zheng pondered for a moment, sighed, and slowly began speaking:","\"’Decoration patterns’ are not recognized by orthodox Array Masters, most Array Masters in the world aspire for more profound Array Dao, not to lower their grade to mix with low-level arrays.\"","\"But you should know, ’decoration patterns’ themselves are not about finding a shortcut or lowering oneself, they are a kind of ’Dao’ on their own.\"","\"In this world, low-grade and high-grade coexist, as do formations, especially in the large-scale, high-capacity large formations.\"","\"First Grade, Second Grade, Third Grade, and even above Third Grade formations are collectively managed and act upon large formations.\"","\"Just like this world, from Qi Refinement to Foundation Establishment, Golden Core to Feather Transformation Heaven Void, regardless of realm, all live together in this land.\"","\"The principles of the world encompass all things, accommodate all beings and help the common people.\"","\"Real major world affairs inevitably involve all beings of the world and profoundly affect every cultivator from Qi Refinement to Heaven Void, from low-rank to high-rank.\"","\"Feather Transformation Heaven Void, although high in realm and strong in cultivation, there’s still a lot one cannot achieve alone.\"","\"Formations are like people. Sometimes, high-grade formations may not really benefit all beings of the world.\"","\"To form a large formation, it must contain thousands of arrays, indiscriminately.\"","\"To accomplish major affairs, it must also concentrate every power from Qi Refinement to Heaven Void, none can be neglected.\"","Elder Zheng took a deep look at Mo Hua, \"These are merely some idle words, but...\"","\"Your talent is too strong, you learn formations... too fast, I fear you may keep learning upward and may climb too high, eventually overlooking some underlying issues...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, stunned, lost in thought.","He couldn’t help but recall long ago when he started learning formations and was casting a stove for his mother, she said:","\"It’s not just Array Masters, all cultivators are the same, when people climb high, they won’t look below...\""]},{"number":1873,"title":"Chapter 1873 - 922: Dao and Rank_2","paragraphs":["When he first heard these words, he felt a complex mix of emotions.","Now, recalling them, a sense of alertness stirred within him.","\"Am I, while climbing higher, unknowingly forgetting to look downwards?\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","Elder Zheng observed Mo Hua’s dazed and thoughtful expression, feeling both surprised and gratified.","Indeed, something like a Taoist Heart cannot be understood without having one; however, once it is had, a mere hint can lead to enlightenment.","...","After taking his leave from Elder Zheng and returning to the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua sat on the meditation mat, lost in thought.","Elder Zheng’s words, perhaps said with momentary intention and good will, deeply affected him.","Cultivators pursue Tao Cultivation, each grade a realm.","Cultivation, Formation, Pills, Artifact Refining, Runes—all have their \"grades.\" Cultivators follow these \"grades,\" advancing step by step.","With each step, with each grade surpassed, one becomes superior to others.","While realms have highs and lows, cultivation levels have strengths and weaknesses, yet \"grades\" seem to be a framework set by humans, forcibly delineated.","This point, my master also seemed to mention to me in the past.","Grades are man-made \"rules,\" a limitation of the Dao by humans, not the Great Dao itself.","Cultivators spend their lives pursuing \"grades.\"","Efforts in cultivation bring increased power and improved skills, but... does the essence of humankind change?","Are High-Rank cultivators human, while low-level cultivators are not?","Does elevating one’s realm entitle one to overlook, disdain, belittle, and even exploit, oppress, and slaughter low-level cultivators?","More importantly, grades are man-made rules.","Following such rules, is the end of \"grades\" truly the \"Dao\"? Can one truly become \"immortal\"?","Mo Hua began to harbor doubts.","The concept of \"grades\" for the first time showed signs of fading in his heart.","At the same time, he gained a subtle insight.","Cultivators should seek the \"Dao,\" not \"grades.\"","The Second Grade is formed from the First Grade.","Foundation Establishment is attained from Qi Refinement.","The Great Dao encompasses all things, so there’s no need to see grades as distinctly separate.","One should not only learn high-grade formations, ignoring the applications of low-grade formations.","Moreover, one should not only pursue higher realms, neglecting the myriad of beings below the High-Rank.","Mo Hua thought further: \"But the problem is, the ’grade’ of this realm also cannot be ignored...\"","Although rules are set by people, having been passed down for tens of thousands of years, they have become an established cultivation system.","If one is to cultivate step by step, gaining stronger power, this framework must be followed.","Given his current cultivation and understanding, Mo Hua cannot escape it.","He still needs to proceed step by step, ascending higher.","Formations progress from First Grade to Second Grade, from Second Grade to Third Grade... Cultivation follows likewise, from Qi Refinement to Foundation Establishment, from Foundation Establishment to Golden Core, and then to Feather Transformation...","Yet...","\"If I keep moving upward, adhering to this framework, might I one day become like other High-Rank cultivators, relying on strong cultivation to look down on others, treating them with disdain?\"","\"Wouldn’t that mean I am pursuing ’grades,’ not the ’Dao’?\"","It’s not impossible.","Mo Hua knew well that environment changes people.","If such a day comes when I hold a high position and power for a long time, what I still have in mind, whether it deviates from my original intentions, whether this current understanding will be forgotten, is hard to say.","\"When people climb higher, they do not look down...\"","His mother’s words resonated again in Mo Hua’s ears.","He pondered for a moment and thought in his heart:","\"As long as I remember these words, regardless of how high my realm is, how strong my cultivation is, if I frequently remember to look down, there shouldn’t be a problem...\"","\"When my cultivation is high enough, reaching the heavens, yet I still remember to look down, perhaps then, I will truly know what the ’Dao’ is, what ’immortality’ is.\"","Tao Cultivation, step by step, all these thoughts and insights, though seemingly useless, will settle within his heart and lay the foundation for his future pursuit of the Dao and quest for eternal life.","Mo Hua nodded, his gaze bright.","When he returned to his senses, he realized he still had work to do.","\"The Thunder Magnetic Array Plate!\"","This was the current priority.","Mo Hua began to gather his thoughts and continued studying the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate.","He first meticulously reviewed Elder Zheng’s insights on formations from start to finish, simulated it once in his mind, and then began to personally manipulate the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate before him.","The Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, with jade as the base, trimmed with red gold, etched with silver threads, densely adorned with Magnetic Patterns, was intricately constructed.","This should be a Third Grade Array Plate.","However, due to the limited expertise of the now deceased \"Mr. Yuan,\" a \"down-grading\" treatment was applied to the plate, so its true grade is somewhere between Second Grade and Third Grade, considered \"Quasi-Third Grade.\"","This represents Mr. Yuan’s insufficient capability while also providing convenience for Mo Hua.","Following Elder Zheng’s guidance, Mo Hua forcibly activated this Third Grade Array Plate using the Second Grade Formation eye inside it.","As Elder Zheng said, this was a kind of \"off-limits\" usage.","Even with Mo Hua’s Divine Sense, reaching the limit of the Peak of Nineteen-Pattern, it was still quite exhausting to initiate.","Moreover, the consumption of Spirit Stones was enormous; in the blink of an eye, hundreds of Spirit Stones merged into the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, continuing to deplete...","Mo Hua felt a little pained.","If he fails, all these Spirit Stones would be wasted.","However, to study the Thunder Magnetism Formation, and for his own Magical Treasure, these Spirit Stones must be spent whether he wants to or not."]},{"number":1874,"title":"Chapter 1874 - 922: Dao and Grade_3","paragraphs":["Fortunately, this Formation itself was designed according to specifications by others, and he only needed to simply activate it, so the difficulty wasn’t too high.","And the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate did not let Mo Hua’s Spirit Stones down.","After 30 minutes, it trembled slightly, emitting a pale blue thunder magnetic glow. A wisp of Secondary Thunder Flow with clear \"instructions\" seeped into the Guest Elder Token along the Array Plate, connecting to a small patch of Fixed Magnetic Patterns.","With Mo Hua’s strength, he could not fully activate this Thunder Magnetic Array Plate. This plate could only achieve this much.","But this was enough.","At the bottom layer of the Sect Token, the structure of the \"Merit Vault\" was the most tightly secured, with densely packed Magnetic Patterns forming a \"brick-like\" city, protecting the secrets within.","This was a strong Original Magnet City.","Mo Hua was not trying to break open this \"city.\"","Of course, with his abilities, he couldn’t break it open.","His Thunder Magnetic Miniature could only \"alter,\" without possessing \"attack and defense\" capabilities.","Therefore, he needed to use the \"Quasi-Third Grade\" Thunder Magnetic Array Plate to generate a Thunder Magnetic Flow with a \"disintegration\" command to open a small gap on this \"city.\"","This way, the Thunder Magnetic Miniature could pass through this \"gap,\" bypass the Magnetic Pattern defenses, and infiltrate the core \"Merit Vault\" of the Demon Sect.","The Thunder Magnetic Array for attack and defense, and the Thunder Magnetic Miniature for infiltration made a perfect combination.","The Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, under Mo Hua’s manipulation, produced a subtle Secondary Thunder Flow like an arrow, whistling along the predetermined Yuan Magnetic Patterns and striking against the \"city wall\" crafted from Magnetic Patterns at the bottom of the Demon Sect.","In an instant, the electric light and Original Magnet surged.","But the entire process occurred within the micro world of thunder magnetism, and besides Mo Hua, who silently orchestrated everything, no one could notice this miraculous and delicate scene.","Soon, on the Magnetic Pattern city wall solid as gold soup, a small breach was \"blasted\" open by the arrow-like Secondary Thunder Flow produced by the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate.","The Thunder Magnetic Miniature immediately slipped through this breach with a \"zip,\" infiltrating the Demon’s Merit Original Magnet Library, leaving behind only a faint electric light pattern.","\"Success!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","This was his first successful activation of the Thunder Magnetic Array Plate, marking the first step towards becoming a \"legitimate\" Thunder Magnetic Array Master.","This attempt also laid the foundations in his mind for combining the Thunder Magnetic Array and the Thunder Magnetic Miniature, complementing each other for thunder magnetic attack, defense, and infiltration.","With the Thunder Magnetic Miniature successfully infiltrating the \"Magnetic Pattern City,\" Mo Hua began the actual work.","Generally speaking, such obvious attacks and infiltrations would be detected by other Thunder Magnetic Array Masters.","But Mr. Yuan was already dead, the Demon Sect’s Thunder Magnetic Array was unmanned, and even the Guest Elder Token serving as the interface for the Original Magnetic Compound Formation was in Mo Hua’s possession.","Playing both thief and bodyguard, Mo Hua naturally had no worries.","With the Thunder Magnetic Miniature infiltrating the \"Merit Vault,\" Mo Hua could perceive in front of him the densely packed Magnetic Patterns, as neat and tight as \"tofu blocks.\"","Mo Hua was now quite proficient in annotating Magnetic Patterns.","These densely packed Fixed Magnetic Patterns, in his eyes, converted into text in mere moments:","\"Blood Lotus Skill, three layers, entry-level cultivation technique, absorbs the blood of others, merging into one’s own Blood Qi, capable of running up to twelve Circulations... needs Demon Points: 100.\"","\"Blood Lotus Fruit, an Evil Object needed for cultivating Blood Lotus Skill, tempered with human blood, a cycle every three years. Demon Points: 20...\"","\"Ten-year Blood Lotus Fruit, nourished with human blood, ten-year-old Blood Lotus Fruit... Demon Points: 200.\"","\"Blood Sucking Blade, Second Grade Evil Artifact, kills and absorbs blood, the more it absorbs, the stronger it gets. This is a standardized Evil Artifact derived from the Demonic Path Treasure Heaven-Swallowing Blood Blade... Demon Points: 400.\"","\"...\"","Beneath this were numerous Demon Sect cultivation methods and items of various categories.","\"As expected, it’s the Demon Sect’s Merit Vault.\"","\"Could the Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map be hidden inside?\"","Mo Hua thought.","If the Four Symbols top-level Formation possessing Divine Beasts’ power—the Green Dragon Array Map—was truly hidden in this Demon Sect’s treasure vault, it would save him a lot of trouble.","Then his own Magical Treasure would have a lead.","Mo Hua silently chanted in his heart:","\"Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map, Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map... it must be there, it must be there...\"","After chanting several times, Mo Hua began to \"search\" through one Magnetic Pattern after another.","One Magnetic Pattern after another was \"deciphered\" into text by Mo Hua, and then recorded onto a Jade Slip.","The Demon Sect was completely unaware that their most precious \"Merit Vault\" was being \"peeked\" at bit by bit by Mo Hua.","And this blood-sucking Demon Sect, whose lineage they followed was unknown, contained numerous merit items, leaving Mo Hua \"peeking\" one at a time, \"deciphering\" one at a time, unable to scan through quickly, thus being time-consuming.","In this manner, after a full half month, Mo Hua finally \"deciphered\" most of the Demon Sect’s \"Merit Vault,\" transcribing many entries.","Most of the inheritances or items were related to Demon Cultivators, unusable for Mo Hua.","A few belonged to the Righteous Dao, perhaps robbed through murder, of low grade and not rare, completely overshadowed by the profound Merit Scrolls of the Fifth Grade Taixu Gate, despised by Mo Hua.","Among them, there was no sign of the Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map.","Seeing the remaining items dwindling, Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel a bit anxious.","If the Green Dragon Array Map couldn’t be found in this Merit Vault, then the matter of his Magical Treasure would become extremely troublesome.","He would only have the option to come up with a way to kill the sect’s late Golden Core leader, who bore the Green Dragon Formation, with strength unfathomably deep.","That way, the difficulty would increase several times over.","In the Third-Grade State Boundary, killing such a Golden Core Realm Great Demon Head, while Mo Hua only had Late-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivation, truly felt like there was not the slightest clue.","\"Let me take it easy... save me some trouble...\"","\"Give me the Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map...\"","Mo Hua hoped in his heart.","But in the Demon Sect’s Merit Vault, the Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map still did not appear.","Mo Hua had no choice but to patiently keep searching and deciphering.","And so, he deciphered until the final item.","This item had the highest encryption level, and judging by its appearance, it was a \"Formation,\" causing Mo Hua’s heart to skip a beat and making him somewhat expectant.","\"Green Dragon Array Map, Green Dragon Array Map...\"","Mo Hua silently chanted a couple more times in his mind, then began \"decrypting.\"","Decrypting took some time.","Ultimately, the item name presented before Mo Hua was three characters long.","As expected, it was not the Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map.","Mo Hua’s suspended heart finally sank.","\"Indeed, there’s no such thing as free fortunes falling from the sky...\"","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Array Map, being so precious, although Mr. Tu used the lives of so many Monster cultivators from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons to research it, couldn’t simply fall into his hands...","Mo Hua sighed, disappointedly deciphered the last three characters, then glanced at it, suddenly freezing in place.","For a moment, he thought he had seen it wrong.","This is...","\"Reversed Spirit Formation?!\"","Below the Formation name, there was an annotation:","\"Second Grade Twenty Patterns, an unusual Formation Diagram, containing some Power of Spiritual Power Law, extremely difficult to comprehend, effect unknown, usage unknown. Demon Points: 3000...\"","Mo Hua slowly took a deep breath.","He never expected that the last item hidden in the Demon Sect’s Merit Vault would turn out to be...","The Second Grade Twenty Patterns Reversed Spirit Ultimate Formation?!"]},{"number":1875,"title":"Chapter 1875 - 923: Loyalty","paragraphs":["Mo Hua felt somewhat incredulous, while simultaneously harboring doubts in his mind.","Why would a Demon Sect that practices blood-sucking cultivation skills actually hide such a top-tier formation that contains powerful variations of spiritual power laws?","How did they acquire this Second Grade, Twenty Patterns Reversed Spirit Formation?","Did they acquire it through killing and robbing?","Did they directly transfer it from the Demon Sect inheritance of a higher level?","Or perhaps someone intentionally hid it inside?","Do they really understand what this formation truly signifies?","Mo Hua flipped through the annotations about the Reversed Spirit Formation in the Demon Sect merit vault:","\"Second Grade, Twenty Patterns, alternative formation diagram, contains a certain power of spiritual laws, extremely difficult to comprehend, effects unknown, purpose unknown. Demon Points: Three thousand...\"","Extremely difficult to comprehend, effects unknown, purpose unknown...","Mo Hua pondered deeply inside.","It means that these Demon Cultivators fundamentally do not know what the \"Reversed Spirit Formation\" is, what its purpose is, and no one can learn it.","Moreover, it only requires three thousand Demon Points.","These three thousand points aren’t a small amount in the Demon Sect’s merit vault, but compared to the extremely rare \"Reversed Spirit Formation,\" it’s nothing at all.","Any ultimate formation is a \"priceless\" treasure.","If there is an opportunity, perhaps you can encounter it; without the opportunity, no amount of Spirit Stones could buy it.","Three thousand as the price is simply an insult to this formation.","\"These Demon Cultivators are truly blind, unable to recognize a treasure when they see it...\"","Mo Hua murmured to himself, feeling that this Demon Sect is really wasting heavenly treasures, letting such a good thing gather dust in a warehouse.","But upon careful thought, it seems reasonable.","In the Demon Sect, the cultivators practice bloody demon skills, and there are very few who understand formations. It is estimated that none can understand this Reversed Spirit Formation.","In their eyes, this Reversed Spirit Formation might just be an alternative formation, complex and incomprehensible, and its purpose unknown.","Even if they could understand it and learn it, it would still be useless.","Without a strong foundation in formations, without proficiency in Divine Sense Calculation, unable to deduce the Spirit Traces of the formation, it is simply impossible to precisely apply the Reversed Spirit Formation, leading to formation collapse and spiritual power \"decomposition,\" causing devastating killing power.","The principles of the Reversed Spirit Formation are obscure and profound, making its application extremely difficult.","Mo Hua fondled the Guest Elder Token, looking at the three words \"Reversed Spirit Formation\" on it, his heartbeat quickened a bit.","In the hands of others, the Reversed Spirit Formation might just be a difficult and useless formation.","But in his possession, it is altogether different.","As long as he has the Reversed Spirit Formation, with a Large Formation, he could even destroy the Taoist Demon.","Of course, decomposing a Large Formation is too extravagant.","In this lifetime, he doesn’t know if there will be an opportunity.","But even if he cannot decompose a Large Formation, the Reversed Spirit Formation is extremely powerful.","With his current proficiency in formations, if he truly obtains the Reversed Spirit Array Map, learns the Second Grade Reversed Spirit Formation, plans and arranges in advance, it is completely possible to \"collapse and kill\" a Golden Core Realm cultivator with Foundation Establishment cultivation.","This is a true cross-border defeat!","Although strictly speaking, he is not relying on his own cultivation.","But Tao cultivation knowledge, in itself, implies power, and a powerful formation means powerful combat power.","\"I must get this Reversed Spirit Formation!\"","\"The Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation is great, but right now, I don’t know where it’s hidden. Instead, the fat meat in front of me has to be firmly bitten.\"","The fact that he could see this Reversed Spirit Array Map means he has this opportunity at this moment.","Missing it would surely lead to lifelong regret.","If he hesitated even for a moment, and the Demon Sect moved, or got wiped out, if the merit vault was destroyed, the treasure vault seized by the Taoist Court, or if other changes occurred, leaving this formation diagram in someone else’s hands, seeking it again would be like finding a needle in a haystack.","When the opportunity arises, it must be firmly grasped!","Mo Hua no longer hesitated and immediately began contemplating how to acquire this Reversed Spirit Array Map.","But after pondering for a moment, Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","\"It seems... it’s not that easy to obtain...\"","The Second Grade Reversed Spirit Array Map is something within the Demon Sect merit vault, requiring Demon Points to exchange.","Demon Points are actually manageable. He has now infiltrated the lower levels of the Original Magnet Compound Formation, and theoretically, the amount of Demon Points can be altered through magnetic pattern tampering.","But the problem is, even with Demon Points, how to exchange?","After exchanging, how to get hold of it?","Mo Hua now somewhat understands the Demon Sect and knows that according to the usual process, he first needs a clear, \"living\" identifiable identity of a Demon Sect cultivator, to use the Demon Sect Token and spend three thousand Demon Points to exchange for this Reversed Spirit Array Map.","After exchanging the formation diagram, this Demon Sect cultivator must personally go into the Demon Sect, to a place akin to the \"Merit Pavilion,\" to retrieve this formation diagram.","Then, he has to deliver this formation diagram into Mo Hua’s hands.","This entire process involves both operations on the Original Magnet level and actions in reality.","On the Original Magnet level, he can forge a \"Sequence Magnetic Pattern\" to create a nonexistent Demon Sect disciple to exchange for the formation diagram on his behalf.","But on the reality level, he has no way to create a real \"person\" to go into the Demon Sect and retrieve the Reversed Spirit Array Map.","Moreover, he does not know where the Demon Sect’s stronghold is, even if he could create such a \"person,\" he wouldn’t know where to go to retrieve his Reversed Spirit Array Map.","\"It’s a bit troublesome...\"","Mo Hua couldn’t help but lie on the ground, with his arms under his head, staring blankly at the ceiling in a trance.","After thinking for a moment, he murmured:","\"If only I knew how to ’Planting Devil in Taoist Heart,’ I could ask Uncle Gu to capture a Demon Sect disciple, plant the devil in his Taoist Heart, and have him go to the Demon Sect to help me pick up my ’parcel’...\""]},{"number":1876,"title":"Chapter 1876 - 923: Loyalty_2","paragraphs":["Of course, he only entertained such thoughts in his mind.","The genuine act of Planting Devil in Taoist Heart is a method of the Demon Path, where wily minds split and sow a Demon Thought to manipulate others.","Those who have been manipulated become \"puppets\" of wily minds, with their Divine Thoughts infected, and given time, will inevitably die.","This kind of wicked Taoist Skill is something he would never use.","\"However, this is also a train of thought... If I can’t use Planting Devil in Taoist Heart to ’manipulate’, then why not use Original Magnet information to ’induce’?\"","Mo Hua, who trained in the Dao of Divine Thoughts, deeply understood that human cognition is easily \"induced\", and one’s Taoist Heart is always fluctuating.","Especially when there’s a cognitive barrier or an information gap.","\"Utilizing Original Magnet for communication to induce cognition, ’tricking’ a Demon Sect disciple to act according to my plan...\"","In a sense, this is also a form of \"manipulation\".","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, and an idea slowly formed in his mind.","Afterwards, Mo Hua spent some time figuring out the plan.","However, to accomplish this plan, there are still many problems to overcome, especially regarding the Thunder Magnetism Formation.","His current level in Thunder Magnetism Formation is still lacking. There are many aspects of Thunder Magnetism he is still unclear about.","Mo Hua took some time to have tea with Elder Zheng, seeking advice on insights into formations related to Thunder Magnetism.","After returning to the Taixu Gate, he researched on his own and personally attempted it several times, ensuring his ideas were sound and his application of Thunder Magnetism was skilled, only then did he finally feel at ease.","Several days later, with everything ready, Mo Hua began to take action.","He first selected a candidate.","This \"candidate\" is crucial to the plan, responsible for helping him exchange the Reversed Spirit Formation and delivering the Reversed Spirit Formation out of the Demon Sect into his hands.","This candidate’s status couldn’t be too high, not above a Golden Core Elder.","Such a figure, he was currently incapable of \"controlling\".","Once a failure occurs, the rebound would be greater.","However, this candidate’s status couldn’t be too low either, preferably below an Elder, at the elite level of a Skill Transmission Disciple.","Mo Hua \"monitored\" the chats of Demon Sect disciples, and after several days of selection, he finally chose a suitable candidate:","Li San.","This name was rather ordinary.","This person had a Peak Foundation Establishment Cultivation, true name unknown, only known by the surname Li, ranking third in the Blood Cultivation Skill sequence, and was called \"Li San\".","Li San had deep standing in the Demon Sect and strong cultivation. Once he reached Golden Core, he had the qualification to be promoted to \"Elder\".","And his cultivation was only a step away from Golden Core.","Having mixed in the Demon Sect for a long time, he must have accumulated considerable Demon Merit, and exchanging the Reversed Spirit Formation worth three thousand points shouldn’t be a problem.","After the exchange, it’s also not easy to arouse suspicion.","Most importantly, he was greedy.","There was not a single Demon Sect cultivator who was not greedy, and Li San was particularly greedy.","Greed is the human nature that is best exploited.","Mo Hua, under the guise of \"Elder You\", sent a message to Li San:","\"Do you want to become an Elder?\"","Demon Sect disciples all yearn to become Elders, sometimes more intensely than those of the Righteous Dao.","The Blood Cultivation Skill they practice adheres to the \"Skill Transmission\" system.","The Elder transmitting skills sucks the blood of Skill Transmission disciples, and Skill Transmission disciples suck the blood of ordinary disciples, and ordinary disciples, in turn, suck the blood of innocent cultivators outside.","Disciples are all \"exploited\" by the Elders.","But once they become \"Elders\", it means gaining a certain degree of autonomy, no longer needing to \"offer up\" and possessing some \"Skill Transmission\" privileges.","The Demon Sect is unrestricted, and compared to ordinary sects, the power of an \"Elder\" is greater, allowing for more wanton actions.","Therefore, there is not a single disciple who doesn’t wish to become an Elder.","But becoming an Elder is not something they can do just because they want to.","The internal oppression within the Demon Sect is more direct, and the hierarchy is clearer. Each Elder has a spot, and to climb up, they must gain the recognition of other Elders.","Secondly, limited by the blood-sucking skill subjected to layer upon layer of exploitation, without permission from Golden Core Demon cultivators of \"Elder\" rank, and exclusive blood rewards from them, these Foundation Establishment Disciples attempting to break through to Golden Core is simply a pipe dream.","Therefore, the words \"Elder\" carry immense temptation.","In an unknown hideout of the Demon Sect.","Li San, who was thin, pale-faced, and had sharp, grim eyes, received Mo Hua’s message and immediately trembled all over, his whole body shaking with excitement.","The overwhelming joy surged through his heart.","The opportunity and possibility hinted at in the message made his long-anticipating heart become even more restless.","But at the same time, he couldn’t help but feel puzzled:","Why?","\"Why did Elder You send this message to me? What does his venerable self mean by this? Does he want... to recommend me to be an Elder?\"","\"Could such a pie fall from the sky?\"","Having muddled through the Demon Sect for many years, Li San, although greedy in nature, still retained necessary vigilance.","\"Elder You, this disciple is foolish, and doesn’t know what you mean by this...?\"","Li San pretended to be compliant.","But that message sank like a stone in the sea, with no response.","Li San felt uneasy, not knowing what Elder You’s intentions were.","Was he angry, or did something come up temporarily, leaving him no time to reply, or perhaps he was unsatisfied with my reply, too disdainful to respond?","Li San began to speculate Mo Hua’s intentions.","But the more he speculated, the more he felt at a loss.","He had no idea what schemes lay in the \"Elder You\" across from him.","He didn’t dare to ask personally.","He wasn’t willing to just ignore it either.","If by any chance this message was genuine... and Elder You truly intended to \"promote\" him, allowing him to become an Elder.","And if he acted coy, failing to show particular sincerity, it might cause Elder You to give up on him, thereby losing this \"advancement\" opportunity."]},{"number":1877,"title":"Chapter 1877 - 923: Loyalty (Part 3)","paragraphs":["At the thought of this, Li San couldn’t help but feel regretful.","His attitude towards this matter gradually changed from the initial alertness of \"how could there be such a good thing as a pie falling from the sky\" to the regret of \"why didn’t I seize this opportunity?\"","Just at this moment, the token trembled.","Li San’s excitement soared, and he hurriedly looked down, only to feel like he had fallen into an ice cave.","\"Idiot, forget it.\"","The simple four words from \"Elder You\" instantly drained the color from Li San’s face.","He was convinced at that moment that \"Elder You\" initially wanted to give him a chance to elevate his position.","But his hesitation disappointed Elder You.","That’s why Elder You called him an \"idiot\" and said \"forget it\".","The opportunity was gone...","Li San’s heart was in turmoil, his hands trembling, he quickly sent a message:","\"Elder! You are generous and magnanimous!\"","\"It was this disciple’s foolishness, this disciple’s ignorance, I plead with you to give me one more chance. I will go through fire and water at your command, regardless of my life! Please, I beg you for this opportunity!\"","Li San’s sincerity was earnest, but there was no longer a response from the other side.","An opportunity comes only once, and sometimes just a sentence, a response, can change a lifetime, but his moment of hesitation, an act of faux wisdom, made him miss it.","Li San’s regret gnawed at his heart.","But he refused to give up.","\"Elder! I beg you, please give this disciple another chance!\"","\"Elder! I am willing to do anything.\"","\"Elder! I am utterly loyal to you without any second thought!\"","\"Elder! Please trust me; I am absolutely loyal to you!\"","Henceforth, every morning, noon, and night, he would send messages to \"Mo Hua\" to express his \"loyal\" attitude.","After three days of effort, he finally received a response. He got a reply from \"Elder You\":","\"Hmm.\"","Li San was overjoyed, but at the same time, he felt a bit confused.","The word \"hmm\"... what does it mean?","Does it mean Elder You acknowledged his loyalty, forgave his foolishness, or was willing to give him another chance?","Li San pondered the \"deep meaning\" of Mo Hua’s word.","But he didn’t know that it was just Mo Hua casually responding with a mouthful of chicken leg, without any special implication.","Thus, he spent a whole day in anxiety over that \"hmm\".","In the evening, when Li San was still \"pondering the holy intentions,\" anxious and uncertain, he finally received another message from \"Elder You\":","\"Have you made up your mind?\"","Made up his mind?","Li San was stunned, then instantly recalled Elder You’s first question to him:","Do you want to become an elder?","This time, he did not hesitate at all, \"Yes!\"","Mo Hua asked again: \"Do you understand what I mean?\"","Li San hesitated for a moment, a bit unsure, but through previous interactions, he guessed that Elder You appreciated decisiveness, ruthlessness, determination, and ambition.","Most importantly, one must have ambition.","Li San said: \"Elder, you mean... to nominate me as a new ’elder’ of the Demon Sect?\"","Mo Hua asked back: \"Why would I do that?\"","Li San was dumbfounded by the question.","A moment later, he understood. No one in the world gives benefits to others for free, let alone someone of \"Elder You’s\" elder-level status.","If Elder You was willing to promote him, he must provide corresponding value.","Li San steeled himself, gritted his teeth, and said:","\"From now on, I am willing to be your most loyal ’hyena’, following your orders unconditionally. One day, if I am graced by your favor and become an elder, I will ensure that this life has no second thoughts!\"","\"Elder You\" seemed somewhat satisfied, and after a while, he said:","\"Now, do one thing for me.\"","Li San immediately replied: \"Yes.\"","Mo Hua asked him: \"Do you understand what I mean?\"","Li San contemplated briefly, then quickly said: \"I understand, this is Elder You’s test for me. Only by passing the test do I have the qualification to serve you loyally.\"","Mo Hua was stunned for a moment, then nodded and said: \"Nicely said.\"","\"Please instruct me, Elder You.\"","Mo Hua sent a name to Li San, \"Kill this person.\"","Li San looked at it and was instantly stunned.","\"Elder You, this...\"","\"What? Don’t dare?\"","\"No, it’s...\" Li San hesitated, \"This person is a skill transmission disciple of our Demon Sect, and has a bit of friendship with me. He has worked tirelessly for our Demon Sect and made quite a few contributions...\"","\"If you’re unwilling to kill, then forget it.\" Mo Hua said lightly.","Li San’s heart tightened, and he immediately sensed the displeasure of \"Elder You\" and understood at once.","What Elder You needed was absolute \"loyalty.\"","His orders were everything; anyone he wanted dead, no matter who, had to face the blade, with no need for explanation, no need for reason.","Only in this way could he show his loyalty.","Only then would he possibly truly trust and genuinely promote him to become an elder of the Demon Sect.","If he couldn’t be ruthless, couldn’t bring himself to lay a hand on a fellow from the Demon Path, how could he become Elder You’s right-hand man in the future?","Besides, where in the Demon Sect could one find \"comrades\"?","Once there was a conflict of interest, anyone could be killed, as long as you could do the killing.","Li San said, \"Rest assured, Elder You, I will certainly follow your orders and kill this person.\"","\"Follow my orders?\"","\"No, it’s because I want to kill him, it has nothing to do with Elder You!\" Li San said.","Mo Hua nodded slightly, and said again, \"Don’t force yourself.\"","Li San said, \"This is something the disciple has longed for, it’s no force at all.\"","Mo Hua was very satisfied, \"I’ll wait for your results.\"","\"I won’t disappoint Elder You!\"","Then Li San went off to commit the murder.","The person he killed was a skill transmission disciple in the Foundation Establishment Late Stage of the Demon Sect.","This person and he had some friendship, had killed people together, drank blood together, and even shared a blood slave, but in the face of future prospects, in the face of the position of elder, these things were insignificant.","Li San was at the Foundation Establishment Peak, and this disciple was only at the Foundation Establishment Late Stage. With calculated malice and during an outing, Li San caught him off guard, killed him, drained his blood, and threw his corpse into the mountains to feed monster beasts.","After doing all this, Li San returned to the sect and sent a message to \"Elder You\":","\"I have fortunately fulfilled the mission, the person has been killed.\"","\"Elder You\" said with gratification, \"Very good, this is your reward.\"","\"Reward?\"","Li San was stunned, and then he noticed the Demon Points in his Demon Sect Token rise rapidly, soon increasing by a full two thousand points.","Li San took a sharp breath.","Two thousand points!","For a Foundation Establishment Realm disciple of the Demon Sect, this was undoubtedly a huge sum of money.","Enough for him to exchange for a hundred Blood Lotus Fruits.","Even ten-year-old Blood Lotus Fruits could be exchanged for twenty!","And he, had merely killed a fellow disciple in the Foundation Establishment Late Stage...","Amidst his excitement, Li San did not lose his composure and said:","\"Elder, this is too valuable. Serving you is my duty as a disciple, I am undeserving of such merit.\"","\"Take it,\" Mo Hua transmitted, \"This is a reward for your loyalty. The more loyal you are, the more generous the reward.\"","Li San was immensely grateful, and his admiration for \"Elder You\" overflowed like a river breaking its banks, unstoppable.","\"Yes!\"","Mo Hua continued, \"Remember, all contact between us must be through this Disciple Token. Outside, I don’t recognize you, nor do I know who you are.\"","Li San felt a chill in his heart at these words.","He understood!","Elder You’s actions were for the sake of secrecy, indicating that his ambitions were vast, and Li San was his \"hidden hand.\" As long as he followed him, success was within reach!","\"The disciple heedfully follows Elder’s teachings, and I will not reveal a word!\" Li San said.","\"Very good.\"","After that, \"Elder You\" would have Li San kill a fellow disciple every few days to \"test\" his loyalty.","Li San, killing a fellow every few days, would receive a generous sum of merit, thus becoming increasingly \"loyal\" to \"Elder You.\"","During this time, within the Demon Sect, Li San also encountered Elder You in person.","As they brushed past each other, Li San saluted with folded hands.","Elder You, however, appeared \"oblivious,\" not acknowledging him at all.","As if he didn’t see Li San at all, not even giving him a glance.","Li San’s eyes narrowed, his heart filled with admiration:","\"Truly worthy of Elder You, pretending not to know me, handling it without a flaw, without the slightest break.\"","\"In this way, in the entire Demon Sect, no one will know the nature of our relationship...\"","...","Thus, after several more rounds of loyalty cultivation, seeing the time was ripe, Mo Hua finally revealed his true intentions.","He ordered Li San:","\"Go to the Merit Vault, exchange for this Formation, and take it to the place I mentioned last time...\""]},{"number":1878,"title":"Chapter 1878 - 924: Hatred of Evil","paragraphs":["Formation?","Why change the formation?","What use does this formation have?","After changing it, why take it out...","For a moment, Li San was filled with confusion, but in the next instant, he suppressed these doubts deep in his heart.","\"What Elder You needs is absolute loyalty, a loyalty that disregards all else and faces death fearlessly. All I need to do is follow orders without having too many thoughts.\"","\"Only loyalty can earn Elder You’s approval.\"","In recent times, through killing fellow sect members, he had already earned seven to eight thousand points of Demon Merit, such a generous reward was something impossible before.","This is the reward Elder You gives for his loyalty.","\"Rest assured, Elder You, I will not fail!\" Li San said.","\"I look forward to your performance,\" Mo Hua said.","\"Yes!\"","Afterwards, Li San didn’t hesitate, he went to the Merit Pavilion and spent three thousand Demon Merits to exchange for that \"Reverse Spirit Array Map.\"","The steward of the Merit Pavilion was a bit surprised and frowned, \"You are not a Formation Master... what are you doing changing formations for?\"","Li San replied coldly, \"Do I need to explain my actions to you?\"","Soon, he was destined to become an elder.","This was the promise Elder You made to him.","With this confidence, he felt no anxiety and faced others fearlessly, completely unaware that he was actually helping the Demon Sect’s \"insider\" steal the Demon Sect’s inheritance.","The steward was intimidated by his imposing presence and did not suspect anything for the moment.","It was just an odd formation, and if someone foolish wanted to spend Merit on it, what could he say?","The steward stored the Reverse Spirit Array Map in a wooden box and handed it to Li San.","After receiving it, Li San carefully placed it in his storage bag.","The entire process was very simple.","No one knew what this seemingly simple \"handover\" actually meant.","No one in the Demon Sect knew what kind of formation they had delivered into the hands of a \"monster.\"","Everything went smoothly afterwards.","Li San, already a Foundation Establishment Peak demon cultivator, had been in the Demon Sect for a long time, and his actions generally wouldn’t arouse suspicion.","Thus, he left the Demon Sect with the Reverse Spirit Formation and traveled for half a day to the small hillside designated by Mo Hua, then entered the small woods designated by Mo Hua.","Outside the small woods.","Mo Hua and Gu Changhuai were hiding in the bushes, watching Li San, dressed up as an old man, enter the small woods.","Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but ask Mo Hua:","\"What kind of spell did you cast on him to make him so obedient?\"","\"Not much,\" Mo Hua said, \"I just pretended to be a Demon Sect elder and spoke a few words to him.\"","Gu Changhuai obviously didn’t believe it, but thinking about it, it wasn’t impossible.","After all, Mo Hua’s tongue was so eloquent that he could make the living die and resurrect the dead with his words.","Seeing Li San entering the small woods and walking into the trap, with no other demon cultivators following, Mo Hua patted Gu Changhuai’s shoulder:","\"Uncle Gu, it’s up to you.\"","Gu Changhuai was tall, Mo Hua wasn’t, and even though they were both crouching, patting his shoulder was a bit of a stretch.","Gu Changhuai silently glanced at Mo Hua.","Until now, no colleague in the entire Taoist Court dared to pat him on the shoulder.","But there was nothing he could do.","Gu Changhuai sighed and accepted the fact, \"Alright, I’ll be right back.\"","Then Gu Changhuai stood up and walked into the woods.","From the woods came the fluctuations of spiritual power and evil qi, and the sounds of explosions rang out.","Green light and red light flashed, after a few rounds, Gu Changhuai came out, carrying the heavily injured and unconscious Li San in one hand, and holding a box in the other.","Mo Hua didn’t look at Li San, but instead looked at Gu Changhuai in shock, \"Uncle Gu, you’re at the Golden Core Middle Stage?\"","Gu Changhuai responded with a faint \"Hmm.\"","Outwardly, Gu Changhuai remained calm, but Mo Hua’s surprised expression did improve his mood quite a bit.","In the Golden Core Realm, each stage was a hurdle, breaking through was much more difficult than Foundation Establishment.","And because after forming the core, spiritual power crystallizes, the number of cycles increases, together with the boost from one’s own magical treasure, the strength gap between the initial, middle, and late stages of the Golden Core is significantly larger than before.","He had taken a big step forward by progressing from the initial to the middle stage of the Golden Core.","However, the two didn’t talk about it for long since there was still important business to handle.","\"What do you plan to do with this Li San?\" Gu Changhuai asked, \"Kill him?\"","Mo Hua pondered.","Logically, demon cultivators, who’ve committed numerous evil deeds, like this \"senior\" Li San, surely have many lives on their hands and naturally should be killed.","But for some unknown reason, this person was too brainwashed, too \"devoted.\"","So devoted that even Mo Hua felt it would be a waste to kill him.","\"Let’s spare his life for now and imprison him in the Taoist Prison. He might become a crucial pawn in the future,\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"Alright.\"","He then handed the box in his hand to Mo Hua, \"Is this what you wanted?\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, he nodded repeatedly, \"Yes!\"","After receiving the wooden box, Mo Hua checked it over, confirmed there were no problems, and then cautiously opened it.","Inside the plain wooden box was a piece of ancient parchment, bearing simple and obscure patterns, almost seamlessly continued from the First Grade Reversing Spirit Array.","Mo Hua could almost see the laws of spiritual power reverse transformation flowing through it slowly.","These reverse transformation laws were like a spark that, when kindled, could trigger a violent explosion with unimaginable killing power.","Mo Hua’s eyes gleamed."]},{"number":1879,"title":"Chapter 1879 - 924: Hatred of Evil (2)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai, standing to the side, couldn’t help but furrow his brow.","On the surface, this formation appeared only complex and obscure, yet it subtly emitted a sinister aura that made hearts tremble.","Moreover, this was a formation that Mo Hua had managed to acquire through great effort from within the Demon Sect...","Gu Changhuai’s gaze deepened, \"What kind of formation is this? Could it be... an evil formation?\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua shook his head, \"How could I learn such a thing?\"","Gu Changhuai was still somewhat suspicious.","Mo Hua then mentioned Elder Master Xun:","\"I learned the formation from Elder Master Xun. How could he lead me astray? Uncle Gu, you can rest assured.\"","Gu Changhuai indeed felt reassured.","Elder Master Xun of Taixu Gate was righteous and highly respected, surely it was impossible for him to guide Mo Hua off the right path.","As long as it’s not an evil formation.","But Gu Changhuai still harbored some doubts:","\"Then this is...\"","\"For setting off fireworks,\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai was taken aback, nearly doubting his own ears, \"Fireworks?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, mysteriously stating, \"Big fireworks!\"","Not knowing what to say, Gu Changhuai decided not to ask further questions; it would be pointless anyway.","But since it was \"for setting off fireworks,\" it probably wasn’t a big deal.","As a noble son’s descendant who grew up in the Great Immortal City, he had seen every kind of \"firework\" during festivals.","Gu Changhuai dismissed it from his mind.","Now that the ordeal was over, and the formation was in hand.","Li San lay on the ground, gravely injured, unconscious, with his body bound by a Spirit-binding Lock.","Gu Changhuai fed him a pill to sustain his life, added a few more locks to secure him, and then said to Mo Hua:","\"Let’s go back.\"","\"Okay.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Gu Changhuai dragged Li San along, accompanied by Mo Hua, heading down the mountain.","The path was lined with a serene mountain landscape, the forest lush and the greenery vibrant.","Yet occasionally, there would be patches of bloodstain and several corpses.","\"This mountain area often sees demon cultivators,\" Gu Changhuai succinctly stated.","Where there are demon cultivators, naturally, there are battles, deaths, and injuries.","It was normal, and Mo Hua said nothing.","The two continued ahead, along the mountain path, turning a mountain corner, suddenly encountering rows of low thatched cottages, built along the terrain, surrounded by simple fences, which seemed a peaceful and serene village inhabited by loose cultivators.","Mo Hua felt a certain inexplicable affection and impulsively moved towards the village.","Gu Changhuai grabbed him, \"What are you doing?\"","Mo Hua pointed to the village, \"I just wanted to rest a bit and ask around.\"","Gu Changhuai shook his head, \"No need, they’re all dead.\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"This place often sees demon cultivators. How could the loose cultivators living here survive?\"","Mo Hua felt a chill deep inside, releasing his divine sense to carefully perceive and indeed found no living breath in this small village.","This wasn’t tranquility but deathly silence.","Mo Hua was silent for a moment, then asked Gu Changhuai, \"May I take a look?\"","Gu Changhuai thought for a moment and did not refuse, \"Alright, as long as it doesn’t delay your return to the sect.\"","Mo Hua nodded and slowly walked into the village along the mountain path.","The village was worn, wooden walls and thatched houses, somewhat squalid.","Yet each courtyard represented a family.","In the yards were hunting traps, dried herbs, tattered garments hung to dry, children’s wooden horses for play, and grass and bamboo woven locusts.","Each family, though impoverished, lived striving and harmoniously.","At least once it was like this.","Mo Hua silently observed the dilapidated yards.","He saw the severed limbs on the ground, the blurred flesh on the land, the dirty blood splattered on the wooden horses and bamboo locusts, and the maggots and bloodthirsty flies...","\"Are all the villages nearby like this?\"","Gu Changhuai nodded, his voice cold:","\"In the eyes of demon cultivators, humans are merely ’spirit stones’ and ’food’ alive.\"","\"Whether cultivating or transmitting skills, they use humans as mediums, and where they go, they’re always accompanied by bloody massacres.\"","\"These ordinary loose cultivators, once they come into contact with demon cultivators, either get eaten, killed, or recruited into the sect and become demon cultivators accomplices. Those with decent spiritual roots might even be raised as ’blood slaves,’ suffering a fate worse than death. No one is spared.\"","\"The Taoist Court’s manpower is limited, even if they want to save, they can’t. When they occasionally receive news and arrive at a scene, this is what they find already...\"","Gu Changhuai deeply sighed.","Mo Hua said nothing, silently taking in the bloody, broken yards before him.","Being from a Monster Hunter background, he had traveled far and wide, and witnessed more gruesome and bloody scenes. However, none affected him as deeply as now.","The poor yet warm yard in front made him involuntarily think of his family’s small courtyard in Tongxian City.","The slain loose cultivators also reminded him of his parents and himself.","His parents were ordinary loose cultivators in Tongxian City.","And if it weren’t for certain opportunities, he would have just been a nobody small independent practitioner.","Other loose cultivators could be killed like ’weeds’ by demon cultivators.","His family could too.","In that fleeting moment, a heavenly secret subtly stirred.","Mo Hua seemed to glimpse at his alternative ’fate’:","Like all other loose cultivators in the world, dying tragically in the hands of heretical demons, being killed, eaten, refined into pills, drained of blood, turned into slaves...","Mo Hua’s heart trembled uncontrollably.","When he sat in Taixu Mountain, observing the movements of the Demon Sect through the Yuan Magnetic Formation, he knew demon cultivators killed, he knew they drank blood, he knew of their ’blood banquets.’"]},{"number":1880,"title":"Chapter 1880 - 924: Hatred of Evil (3)","paragraphs":["These things, he knew all about.","But without personally experiencing them, without seeing them with one’s own eyes, it’s impossible to understand the depth of this suffering.","The dead are not just names, not just numbers, but living individuals, children, parents, family members.","Mo Hua looked up, gazing into the distance.","In the distance, at the Qian Learning State Boundary, sects are abundant, families tower, terraces rise high, palaces are majestic.","\"Those standing high do not look down...\"","In fact, he was the same.","If he had always stayed within the Qian Learning State Boundary, interacting with families and sects, he might feel that time is peaceful and life is affluent, never realizing that in nearby corners, these silently, namelessly deceased, dust-like loose cultivators exist.","He would not see the injustices created by demon cultivators.","Perhaps he would also be indifferent to the dead cultivators...","Mo Hua felt a heavy heart.","\"Mo Hua...\" Gu Changhuai said softly, \"are you okay?\"","Seeing Mo Hua standing there, silent, his expression shifting several times, he felt some concern.","Mo Hua snapped out of it, shook his head, \"I’m fine.\"","Gu Changhuai looked around, sighed, and comforted Mo Hua: \"The Demon Sect will be eradicated, so focus on your cultivation, the rest is not your concern, don’t dwell on it.\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua replied softly.","Gu Changhuai, worried Mo Hua might overthink, said: \"It’s getting late, head back early.\"","\"Mm.\"","Afterwards, the two went to the Taoist Court and cast Li San into the Taoist Prison, and Gu Changhuai sent Mo Hua back to Taixu Gate.","Before parting, Gu Changhuai saw that Mo Hua seemed burdened by thoughts. He wanted to comfort him but, being better at cold and detached words, couldn’t find the right words to say, and ended up squeezing out these two sentences:","\"Cultivate well, don’t think about anything else.\"","\"Mm, I understand.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","...","After returning to the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua did not sleep all night.","Although he usually doesn’t sleep, practicing Formation on the Taoist Stele instead, this time he couldn’t settle his heart even to draw formations.","The scenes of the day lingered in his mind.","In the small mountain village, the loose cultivators, though poor, still struggled to survive, yet in a blink of an eye, regardless of age or sex, were all brutally slaughtered.","Mo Hua’s Divine Soul ached faintly.","A trace of malevolence rose from his heart.","Perhaps due to cultivating the Water Prison Sect’s Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill and imprinting the Water Prison Map on his Divine Soul, Mo Hua’s heart gradually gave birth to a desire for \"slaughter.\"","In this world, all heretical demons should be killed, all should die!","The reckless demon monsters and cultivators should be imprisoned in the Taoist Prison, tortured to death!","\"Kill!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes turned blood-red, and the intense Evil Qi started to gather deep in his pupils.","Around the embodiment of his Divine Thought, black energy flickered in and out.","For that moment, Mo Hua seemed to transform into a merciless \"Little Yama,\" determined to suppress and annihilate all heretical demon sin cultivators.","Mo Hua quickly realized the anomaly, hastily sat in meditation, and restrained the \"slaughter\" desire within his heart.","Yet the words \"Destroy Demons and Heretics\" seemed to be ingrained deeply in his Divine Soul alongside the Water Prison Map from the Water Prison Sect.","He wished to kill all demon cultivators.","Mo Hua calmed his mind in meditation.","But no matter how hard he tried, however much he steadied himself, he couldn’t restrain this killing intent.","Mo Hua could only reluctantly give up.","\"Since it can’t be suppressed, then don’t suppress it...\" Mo Hua’s gaze turned icy, \"Find a way to kill all the demon cultivators of this Demon Sect!\""]},{"number":1881,"title":"Chapter 1881 - 925: Killing Intent","paragraphs":["After confirming this thought, the killing desire in Mo Hua’s heart slightly subsided.","Once the killing desire subsided, Mo Hua suddenly realized:","\"As a Foundation Establishment, how can I wipe out a Demon Sect full of Third-grade Golden Core Demons?\"","Just a moment ago, he had made up his mind in a moment of impulse, realizing that he might have been overly arrogant now that he was calmer.","But the killing desire in his heart still surged restlessly.","The thought of \"eliminating demons and slaying evil\" was eager to move, as if the Demon Sect wasn’t eradicated, as if blood didn’t flow like a river and there weren’t extreme casualties, it would be difficult to suppress this hunger in his heart.","But he truly didn’t have that ability.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and took out the Reverse Spirit Array Map, \"Thinking of a way to set up a Reverse Spirit Formation, decompose a Second-grade Array, and obliterate the entire Demon Sect?\"","It seemed that if he really wanted to massacre demon cultivators on a large scale, this was the only way.","Under the decompose of a Large Formation, all beings are equal.","Even the Taoist Demons would be executed, let alone the mortal demon cultivators?","\"However, it’s not certain that a Large Formation would be established inside the Demon Sect... The destructive power of an ordinary Second-grade Array decomposition might not be that great.\"","Mo Hua looked at the Reverse Spirit Array Map again and sighed.","\"Moreover, I can’t learn this Reverse Spirit Formation right now...\"","The Reverse Spirit Formation is a Second-grade Twenty Patterns Formation, which requires a Divine Sense of Twenty Patterns to master.","He could try to learn and practice it now, but to truly master it and personally set up the Reverse Spirit Formation to decompose an array, the Divine Sense must reach the Golden Core Realm.","Cultivation Foundation Establishment, Divine Sense Golden Core.","The Divine Sense surpasses a Great Realm.","This is almost impossible according to the knowledge of normal cultivators.","But Mo Hua is different, he must take this path.","However, Mo Hua had a premonition; although his Divine Sense was only a line away from Core Formation, this gap was not easy to cross in a short period.","After all, this is Core Formation.","Cultivation Core Formation is already not easy, let alone achieving Divine Sense Core Formation in advance.","\"Since this is the case, how can the demon cultivators be exterminated?\"","Mo Hua pondered repeatedly and felt that he had to resort to \"killing with a borrowed sword.\"","A noble person’s nature is not different, but good at using things. What you can’t accomplish yourself should be pushed towards the desired direction through networks and strategies.","He couldn’t exterminate the demon cultivators himself, but someone could.","Ultimately, as long as these demon cultivators are wiped out, it doesn’t matter who did it, the \"killing desire\" in his heart should also be reduced.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and gradually made up his mind.","If the Demon Sect is not destroyed, who knows how many innocent cultivators will suffer tragically, and how many loose cultivators will become their blood slaves.","Mo Hua no longer hesitated and immediately sent a transmission to Gu Changhuai.","...","A few days later, during the ten-day break.","Inside the Secret Chamber of the Fifth Grade Taoist Court of the Qian Learning State Boundary.","Even the always aloof Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but whisper sneakily to Mo Hua:","\"Be very careful, don’t make any noise, and don’t let anyone know.\"","Gu Changhuai warned again, \"This is the Secret Chamber of the Taoist Court, strictly prohibiting any outsiders from entering. I sneaked you in, already breaking the rules; if others know, my job as a Supervisor would be over.\"","\"Does Sister Xia know?\" Mo Hua asked softly.","\"Nonsense,\" Gu Changhuai said, \"The key is in her hands, how could I bring you in without her opening the door?\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua’s expression was subtle.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Check what you need to check quickly, don’t waste time.\"","\"Hmm hmm,\" Mo Hua nodded.","Although the Taoist Court is bloated, with excessive staff, corruption, and inefficiency... despite these shortcomings, it doesn’t mean the Taoist Court is truly useless.","On the contrary, the information system of the Taoist Court is deeply rooted and has always been powerful.","Previously, Mo Hua had stolen secrets from the Demon Sect through the Original Magnet Compound Formation, designing the assassination of Demon Sect’s Golden Core.","But he didn’t think he was the only one who could acquire intelligence.","After all, large-scale, targeted campaigns against the Demon Sect have always been conducted by the Supervisors and Enforcement Leaders of the Taoist Court.","There must also be channels for obtaining information within the Taoist Court.","Listening to both sides enables clarity.","Mo Hua needed to integrate this intelligence, combining it with the secrets he had infiltrated from the Demon Sect, to find out the location of the Demon Sect, understand their foundation, and \"prescribe the right medicine,\" seeking ways to exterminate this Demon Sect.","This was also the reason why Gu Changhuai, including Xia Canonical Official, was willing to illegally let him into the Secret Chamber.","They also didn’t want this battle between the righteous and demonic to continue, to prevent further casualties and more innocent cultivators from dying tragically.","The Secret Chamber was filled with various and miscellaneous intelligence, including dossiers, records, jade slips, and some portraits.","Mo Hua’s fair fingers gently flipped through them, like a startled swan skimming across the water, going through all the dossiers and jade slips one by one.","Due to his strong Divine Sense and sharp mind, he almost never forgot any information he saw.","Moreover, he frequently monitored and had a deep understanding of the Demon Sect.","Therefore, in his eyes, this mix of information was distinctly categorized.","Issues not noticed by the Taoist Court, he could pay attention to.","Clues undetected by the Taoist Court, he could detect.","The information that seemed mundane to the Taoist Court, Mo Hua knew the specific meaning hidden within...","Mo Hua’s expression was focused and serious, his fingers flying swiftly, no piece of intelligence escaped his grasp.","Gu Changhuai watched in a daze, unable to help thinking:","\"This child, if he can enter the Taoist Court in the future, will surely achieve great things...\"","After reviewing for a while, Mo Hua found a jade slip, transcribed some information, handed it to Gu Changhuai, and also circled several locations on a map:","\"Yanluo Mountain!\""]},{"number":1882,"title":"Chapter 1882 - 925: Lust to Kill","paragraphs":["\"If I’m not mistaken, the Demon Sect’s hideout is deep within Yanluo Mountain, it’s where the Mistwater River flows through, and it’s interconnected, housing a Blood Pool.\"","\"These three places are the most suspicious. But whether they truly are, I dare not guarantee. I’ll leave it to the Taoist Court to send someone to investigate.\"","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"I’ll handle this. You’ve worked hard.\"","\"Not at all,\" Mo Hua paused for a moment, then asked, \"Uncle Gu, do you truly plan to besiege the Demon Sect?\"","Gu Changhuai was a bit surprised, \"You want to kill them?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Heretical Demons, all must be exterminated.\"","Gu Changhuai frowned slightly, then sighed softly, \"We’ve investigated, the Demon Sect currently should still have over ten Golden Core cultivators, apart from the regular ones, there are some who are Guest Elders.\"","\"Regarding the regular Elders, thanks to the intelligence you provided before, we’ve killed quite a few, but the real leaders are still there...\"","\"There are still those Guest Elders, who are Demon Golden Cores temporarily recruited, their strength and methods are mostly unknown.\"","\"Moreover, the Demon Sect’s Foundation Establishment Disciples, I’m afraid there are four or five hundred—these are the Skill Transmission Disciples, including ordinary disciples, and those blood slaves who have joined the Demon Sect, the number might be two or three thousand.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Do blood slaves also serve the Demon Sect?\"","\"The key to blood slaves is the word ’slave’. Slaves are pitiful, lamentable, but also hateful. Once reduced to a blood slave, they dare not defy their ’master’.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua felt quite conflicted.","Gu Changhuai continued, \"The current problem is, the Demon Sect’s influence is still too strong, they occupy the Second Grade State Border with a Third Grade base, with the Taoist Court’s strength, it’s not difficult to defeat them, but to completely annihilate them is almost impossible.\"","\"If the besiegement isn’t thorough, once the Demon Sect is defeated, many demon cultivators might scatter and flee, causing more casualties with reckless killings.\"","Mo Hua frowned, then after pondering for a moment, asked, \"How about... I ask the Sect Elders for help?\"","Gu Changhuai was taken aback, \"Your Sect Elders would listen to you?\"","\"How could they.\" Mo Hua shook his head and said, \"I’m just going back to ask, to see if I can invite some Golden Core Elders for assistance.\"","Gu Changhuai’s mind stirred.","The Golden Core Elders of Taixu Gate...","This indeed is a powerful aid.","But considering its magnitude, he’s momentarily undecided.","Mo Hua asked, \"Previously when the Taoist Court acted, would they invite people from the Sect for assistance?\"","Gu Changhuai thought for a moment and shook his head, \"Rarely...\"","\"This kind of large-scale besiege involving Golden Core Realm demon cultivators is rare, perhaps encountered once in a century or two.\"","\"Moreover, among the Sect, there are many noble family’s sons, complex compositions, asking them to act could easily lead to unexpected issues.\"","\"Also, cleansing the demon cultivators is the responsibility of the Taoist Court, most sects have their own matters and are not obligated to assist the Taoist Court.\"","Mo Hua nodded, indicating understanding.","\"How about this, Uncle Gu, discuss it with Sister Xia, decide whether to conduct a large-scale siege against the Demon Sect, if you’re short on manpower, just let me know.\"","\"Leave Taixu Gate to me, I’ll communicate with the Elders in advance.\"","\"If both sides have no issues, then let’s join forces and utterly destroy this wicked Demon Sect!\" Mo Hua said sternly.","Gu Changhuai only thought for a moment, then immediately nodded, \"Alright!\"","Currently, this indeed seems the best approach.","Taixu Gate is still trustworthy.","If Mo Hua can persuade the Elders of Taixu Gate to act, then the chance of success in this siege against the Demon Sect is very high.","After discussing, the two immediately left the Secret Chamber.","After all, such a confidential place shouldn’t be stayed in too long, if discovered, it would be hard to explain.","Gu Changhuai checked the documents and jade slips in the Secret Chamber again to make sure there were no omissions, then searched Mo Hua, ensuring he wasn’t smuggling anything, before feeling reassured.","Afterward, Gu Changhuai quietly led Mo Hua out of the Secret Chamber.","Out of the Secret Chamber, the two no longer needed to sneak around, casually walking down the corridor of the Taoist Court.","Gu Changhuai suddenly thought of something, said to Mo Hua, \"By the way, that Li San... I had him severely interrogated.\"","\"Did you get anything out of him?\"","\"No, he said nothing.\"","\"Such a hard mouth?\"","\"It’s not that his mouth is hard,\" Gu Changhuai’s expression was subtle, \"It’s rather like... he’s lost all will to live, so he’d rather die than say anything.\"","Mo Hua was stunned, \"Lost all will to live?\"","\"Yes.\"","Mo Hua also frowned, pondered for a moment, then his gaze stiffened, \"Uncle Gu, give him his Token.\"","Gu Changhuai shook his head, \"That’s against the rules.\"","\"Give it to him secretly, nothing will happen.\"","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Mo Hua then said, \"I have something very important.\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, then sighed, \"Alright.\"","\"Then I’ll return to the Sect first, Uncle Gu, I’ll leave this matter to you.\"","\"Hmm.\"","Afterward, Mo Hua bid farewell to Gu Changhuai and returned to Taixu Gate.","Gu Changhuai also remembered what Mo Hua had mentioned, didn’t delay too long, then called a Gu Family Enforcement Leader, and whispered a few words.","That Gu Family Enforcement Leader paused for a moment, nodded, then went directly to the Taoist Prison located underground in the Taoist Court, used to imprison Sin Cultivators.","The Taoist Prison was eerie, damp, gloomy, the stench of rot wafted through the air.","In one of the cells, after severe torture, Li San was lying on the cold ground, his body covered with blood marks, his eyes vacant, his expression indifferent, his whole being lifeless.","\"Elder You... he deceived me, he betrayed me...\"","\"This is all a scam.\"","\"What loyalty, what the position of Elder, all were lies.\"","\"He wants to kill me...\"","\"All lies...\""]},{"number":1883,"title":"Chapter 1883 - 925: Killing Intent","paragraphs":["Li San’s teeth were bloodstained, revealing a neurotic smile.","Just then, footsteps sounded, and an Enforcement Leader walked over, saying coldly: \"Meal time.\"","He placed a rough wooden tray on the ground and pushed it into the cell.","On the tray was a porcelain bowl, containing some kind of inedible porridge.","After serving the meal, the Enforcement Leader glanced at Li San and turned to leave.","Li San lay on the ground, motionless, as if waiting for death to descend in the darkness.","For a Demon Cultivator like him, entering the Taoist Prison only meant death.","With a heart full of despair, a very faint, yet familiar vibration reached his ears.","\"Is that... Sect Token?\"","Li San’s vacant eyes showed a glimmer of spirit, somewhat incredulous.","He struggled to crawl on the ground, inch by inch, toward the source of the sound in the darkness.","Finally, he reached the tray and pulled a token from the bottom of the porcelain bowl.","This token was so familiar to him; it had been with him since he entered the Sect, the Demon Sect Token.","When he was thrown into the Taoist Prison by that damn Gu-named Supervisor of the Taoist Court, this Demon Sect Token was also confiscated.","But now, someone had returned it to him?","Li San’s heart trembled, using his remaining weak Divine Sense, he perceived the words within the token:","\"All suffering is a test for you.\"","\"As long as you’re loyal enough, you won’t die.\"","\"Henceforth, in the Qian Learning State Boundary, changes are brewing, you must lie low in the Taoist Prison and work for me. When the time is right, I will give you guidance.\"","\"This is a heavy responsibility; only those of resolute mind and proven loyalty can undertake it...\"","Li San’s pupils gradually dilated, his body trembled, and suddenly endless strength surged within him. Moments later, his expression changed, muttering:","\"No, no...\"","\"He’s deceiving me, he’s already deceived me once, he’s still deceiving me now...\"","\"No,\" Li San thought, \"No, he’s not deceiving me.\"","\"Because I’m not dead...\"","\"I should have died, Gu Changhuai didn’t kill me, the Taoist Court didn’t kill me, I was thrown into the Taoist Prison, but no one killed me, and someone secretly handed the Demon Sect Token back to me...\"","\"All suffering is a test.\"","\"As long as you’re loyal, you won’t die.\"","\"I’m not dead, so Elder You didn’t deceive me, he’s testing me, sending me to the Taoist Prison is also part of the ’test’.\"","\"And the reason for sending me to the Taoist Prison...\"","\"It must be because Elder You has a grand scheme, such a scheme is unfathomable, far beyond my guessing.\"","\"Yes, Elder You didn’t deceive me!\"","In an instant, Li San’s gaze turned obsessive and loyal, with trembling hands, he held the Demon Sect Token and transmitted:","\"Disciple Li San will go through fire and water for the Elder, even at the cost of his life!\"","Then he lay on the ground, gazing at the prison ceiling, with a flame reigniting in his eyes.","...","Taixu Gate.","Mo Hua saw Li San’s words and nodded slightly.","This Li San was a Demon Cultivator. Originally, Mo Hua intended to dispose of him after using him, letting the Taoist Court finish him off.","But as the thought arose, it faded away unconsciously.","It seemed this Demon Cultivator’s \"Life Chart\" was somewhat special, destined to be useful in the future, not yet time for him to die.","This was just a vague feeling.","Mo Hua couldn’t say clearly, he didn’t even know what \"Life Chart\" was.","But for a moment, the premonition from the Heavenly Mechanism Causality conveyed this to him.","\"Li San... Life Chart...\"","\"Since he isn’t destined to die, let’s keep him for now...\"","As for whether he lives or dies, whether he survives in the Taoist Prison, that depends on his own fate.","Mo Hua put away the Guest Elder Token and organized matters related to the Demon Sect.","The next day, early in the morning, he went to visit Elder Master Xun.","There were some things he needed Elder Master Xun’s approval for.","\"Exterminate the Demon Sect?\" Elder Master Xun said unexpectedly.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Information has been gathered, the Taoist Court has a plan, but manpower is lacking, needs some reinforcements.\"","Elder Master Xun said: \"Is this something you’ve discussed with the Taoist Court?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua didn’t hide, replying candidly, \"After consulting with Uncle Gu from the Gu Family and Sister Xia from the Xia family, I decided.\"","\"And the other matters?\"","\"All arranged,\" Mo Hua said, \"Relevant intelligence, the Taoist Court is verifying, personnel are being mobilized in secret, other preparations are also underway...\"","\"But without the support of Taixu Gate, the plan to encircle and obliterate the Demon Sect would be difficult to implement. If the Demon Cultivators scatter without a thunderous strike, the consequences would be severe...\"","Mo Hua spoke leisurely and methodically.","Elder Master Xun raised an eyebrow, deeply looking at Mo Hua.","\"Unknowingly, Mo Hua, this child has grown, his aura has changed, even subtly taking on some strategic planning, mapping and organizing, with an air of calm confidence...\"","Elder Master Xun felt pleased, nodding: \"Good.\"","He pondered for a moment, then said directly: \"Go find Ziyou, say it’s my order, have him allocate some Elders to go with you to exterminate the Demon Sect.\"","\"Specific matters, you’ll handle them with the Taoist Court.\"","\"If there’s anything you don’t understand, you can also ask Ziyou and those Elders...\"","Mo Hua roughly guessed that Elder Master Xun should not refuse matters like demon-slaying and demon-removal, but didn’t expect his elder to agree so readily.","Mo Hua smiled, \"Thank you, Elder!\"","Elder Master Xun nodded slightly, reminding: \"Take care of yourself.\"","\"Alright!\"","Afterward, Mo Hua acted as the \"middleman,\" connecting and bridging, pushing the Taoist Court and Taixu Gate to join forces to encircle and eliminate the Demon Sect."]},{"number":1884,"title":"Chapter 1884 - 925: Killing Intent","paragraphs":["The Taoist Court gave their agreement.","Over on the Taixu Gate side, many of the Elders also gladly accepted.","Eradicating the Demon Sect is the duty of Righteous Dao cultivators, and going on this mission also brings them Merit Points.","Currently, ever since the Three Sects Unification, the biggest trait of Taixu Gate is sheer numbers.","It’s not just more disciples—they’ve also gained many more Elders.","The Sect’s Merit Points are limited; with more people comes fiercer competition, making the allocation of Merit increasingly tight.","The Elders also need to spend Merit Points for their daily affairs.","They are Golden Core Cultivators. Everything they need for cultivation—Spirit Stones, Spiritual Objects, Cultivation Technique inheritances—is pricier than the last.","So, when Merit Points run short, life inevitably gets tougher.","Now, Mo Hua is initiating a joint operation between Taixu Gate and the Taoist Court to hunt down Demon Cultivators—a huge operation. Every Elder who joins stands to earn a significant sum of Merit Points.","For this reason, all the Taixu Gate Elders—including those originally from Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect—are looking more and more favorably on Mo Hua.","And everything Mo Hua needed to do, he’s already accomplished.","In the days that followed, all seemed calm on the surface, but beneath that, the plans to hunt Demon Cultivators were underway with feverish intensity.","Soon, everything was set in place. In three days, the attack on Demon Sect would officially begin.","This time, Mo Hua also intended to go in person.","Because the Demon Sect Leaders most likely carried the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Diagram—and that Formation Diagram, imbued with the power of Divine Beast, is his \"preselected\" own Magical Treasure.","If he didn’t go see it himself, he simply wouldn’t be at ease.","At the same time, if that Formation Diagram did appear, with so many Taixu Gate Elders present to back him up, it’d be easier to secretly take it for himself.","This was one of the reasons he insisted on involving the Sect Elders in the Demon Sect extermination.","After all, with more \"insiders,\" things always went smoother.","Now, seeing the plan to wipe out the Demon Sect about to unfold, Mo Hua had to make his final preparations.","And that meant: getting ready some techniques to handle Golden Core opponents.","If he stayed hidden as the master behind the scenes, he wouldn’t need to worry so much.","But now, with him going to the front lines in person, he had to prepare ways to stand against the Golden Core Demons.","Theoretically, with Sect Elders protecting him, the Golden Core Demons shouldn’t be able to harm him.","But you can never be too careful; accidents happen.","You can’t put your life in someone else’s hands—risks must be grasped firmly by yourself.","He still couldn’t learn the Reversed Spirit Formation; even if he could, it’d be troublesome to set up and not practical for improvisation.","\"Aside from that, what methods does a mere Foundation Building Cultivator have to face Golden Core level Demons? How can I keep from being killed in a single exchange...?\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","\"Spells? No good...\"","Even the Mini Meteorite Forbidden Technique might not do much damage to a Golden Core Demon Cultivator—the main issue is that casting Mini Meteorite Skill takes time. In a real clash with a Golden Core Demon, there wouldn’t be any time to respond at all.","\"Body refinement... Even worse.\"","With his level of Body Refinement, if a Golden Core Demon closes in and lands a punch, he’d be dead on the spot.","\"That leaves Divine Sense...\"","The Soul-Shocking Sword might work.","Even if it can’t seriously injure a Golden Core opponent, in a critical moment, a bit of intimidation, a bit of disruption—enough to save his own skin—shouldn’t be an issue.","\"If the Soul-Shocking Sword is an option... What about the Godslaying Sword?\"","Mo Hua pondered in silence.","\"The Godslaying Sword... so far, I can only unleash it within the Sea of Consciousness. I can’t send it out yet...\"","\"But what if I could externalize it?\"","Mo Hua’s mind followed this line of thought, and before he knew it, he froze.","He had used the Godslaying Sword Forms to cut down an Evil Embryo, and defeated Third Grade Evil God remnants...","The Evil Embryo was hard to say, but a Third Grade Evil God’s remnant was definitely stronger than the Divine Sense of even a Golden Core Cultivator.","If that’s so, if his Godslaying Sword could leave his body, striking outward, didn’t that mean even without the help of the Reversed Spirit Formation, relying only on Divine Thought into sword—he could just...","Kill a Golden Core?","In other words, with just Foundation Building Cultivation, could he actually, by virtue of Divine Thought alone, slay a Golden Core?","This would truly be... Divine Sense Proving the Dao?!","Mo Hua’s breath caught—he himself could scarcely believe it for a moment."]},{"number":1885,"title":"Chapter 1885 - 926: God-cutting Soul Emergence","paragraphs":["\"The Godslaying Sword Emerges...\"","Mo Hua paused for a moment, looked down at his own palm, and gently clenched it.","Thinking that within his hand, he might hold the power to slay Golden Cores during a breakthrough, a surge of emotion rose within Mo Hua, and his gaze grew increasingly bright.","As long as the Godslaying Sword can emerge, his \"Divine Sense Proving the Dao\" will truly undergo a fundamental transformation.","Not only in the Divine Thought World, but also in reality, he could turn the virtual into reality and transform his strongest divine thought into the strongest killing move.","In reality, conduct divine thought slaughter.","\"I need to give it a try...\"","...","The next day, at Taixu Gate, north of the Disciple’s Residence.","On a quiet little hill.","The vegetation was lush, the mountain forest was majestic, shrouded in a faint mist, serene and peaceful.","Mo Hua sat on the grass, eyes closed, resting.","There was no one else around, only a big white dog lazily dozing under a large tree.","Sunlight filtered through the woods, painting the verdant mountain color, landing on Mo Hua.","The faint mist around also enveloped Mo Hua’s body.","Mo Hua cast aside distractions, cultivated his heart and nature, as motionless as a dead stone.","Not knowing how long had passed, he opened his eyes, where black, white, and gold hues flowed, and the aura around him changed accordingly.","Mo Hua brought his fingers together, pointed at his forehead, drawing out a trace of sword intent between his eyes, then with a sharp gaze, pointed forward with two fingers.","In the void, something seemed to break through, heading straight for the towering tree in front of him.","The mountain wind suddenly rose, the opposite tree, branches, and leaves rustled, seemingly trembling.","Time seemed to freeze at this moment...","Yet moments later, the mountain wind ceased.","Nothing happened.","There was no emergence of Divine Thought into a sword, no sword intent, and the tree remained completely unharmed.","Only Mo Hua maintained the \"sword\" posture, standing firmly.","But... still, nothing happened.","The big white dog not far away yawned out of boredom, mouth wide open.","It had already seen enough.","Mo Hua could only lower his fingers, sigh resignedly.","From morning till now, he had tried at least seven or eight times, but it was all in vain. The Soul-Shocking Sword could emerge, but the more sophisticated Godslaying Sword, though it could manifest in the Sea of Consciousness, simply couldn’t emerge from it.","Unable to emerge, hence unable to slaughter.","The distant big white dog wagged its tail, licked its fur, and lay down again to nap.","Mo Hua also sat cross-legged, beginning to ponder meticulously.","\"Where exactly is the problem? Is it the wrong method to emerge or my Divine Sense’s realm isn’t high enough?\"","Mo Hua recalled that Elder Xun Zixian seemed to have mentioned the typical progression of a cultivator’s divine thought:","\"Qi Refining Cultivators can sense external objects through Divine Sense external release;\"","\"Foundation Building Cultivators can manipulate objects with Divine Sense;\"","\"In the Golden Core Realm, object manipulation reaches mastery, and the power of manipulating artifacts and controlling swords further ascends.\"","\"Only upon reaching the Golden Core can one begin to delve into the spell points of Soul Emergence. It is not until Feather Transformation that one can truly master the art of soul emergence...\"","Few cultivators delve deeply into the path of Divine Thought. Elder Xun Zixian didn’t follow this path either but being a Formation Master, he had researched it due to personal interest.","His words carried some weight.","\"Only the Golden Core can begin delving...\"","Mo Hua muttered.","\"But that applies to typical cultivators, whereas during my use of the Soul-Shocking Sword, I was already undergoing soul emergence.\"","\"So... is there an issue with my Godslaying Sword’s emergence method?\"","Mo Hua pondered carefully again.","The emergence of the Godslaying Sword was more complex than the Soul-Shocking Sword.","The cultivation of the Soul-Shocking Sword involved imprinting sword intent or Evil Qi Map in the Divine Soul, using the eyes as the medium for emergence, revealing the Divine Soul.","The Godslaying Sword was different, having a deeper and more challenging spell point.","One must first hold their breath, accumulate divine thought, condense the God Slaying Sword Style in the Sea of Consciousness, then swing this sword.","Only then could one use the eyes as a medium to transmit the sword outside.","First \"swing the sword,\" then \"emerge.\"","Seemingly just one more step, but exponentially more difficult.","The ideal situation is for the sword to follow the mind, the mind to follow the eyes; with one divine thought, the Godslaying Sword condenses, and with one opening of the eyes, the divine thought transforms into a sword and slashes out.","Fast initiation, swift action, and killing with \"gaze\" is unforeseeable.","Truly \"I look at you, and you die.\"","Yet he was still far from this realm, only able to progress slowly, step by step.","\"Step by step...\"","Mo Hua first closed his eyes, concentrating, isolating all external interference, and focusing all his attention in the Sea of Consciousness.","In the Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua’s divine thought manifestation opened its eyes and held its hands in a void grip above his head.","The thick and pure divine thought, like a golden river, converged between his hands, condensing into a dazzling giant divine thought sword.","A myriad of sword paths flourished.","Gold-breaking, Mountain Opening, Gui Water, Li Fire, all forming within the sword in the form of Sword Array.","The ancient Tai Xu Sword Intent appeared.","The Supreme Emotionless Path, ruthless and devoid of self, cutting through everything, was also integrated.","Mo Hua held the giant sword, its brilliance dazzling, resembling a human god and demon.","If it were to cut down on the evil spirits or divine remains within the divine thought, or even slay the evil embryo, one slash would suffice.","But for emergence, it wouldn’t work.","Mo Hua had tried many times before, but all failed. Just slashing down like this, the power remained confined within the Sea of Consciousness, unable to break through the boundary between reality and illusion, unable to emerge, materialize in the world.","\"The method of emergence is incorrect...\"","\"No, or rather, the way I’m trying to slash out is incorrect...\"","In the previous attempts, Mo Hua always focused on \"emerging,\" striving to slash \"outwards,\" yet within the divine sense, there’s no distinction between \"inside\" and \"outside.\""]},{"number":1886,"title":"Chapter 1886 - 926: God-cutting Soul Emergence (2)","paragraphs":["As I thought of slicing outward, ultimately, this sword remained within my own Sea of Consciousness.","Contrasts give birth to existence, and difficulty complements ease.","Inside and outside are also relative.","If I cannot slice outward, then let me slice inward—was this sword cutting my own \"Divine Soul\"?","No, it wasn’t a simple \"cut,\" but a connection between the Divine Soul and reality?","The eyes are the windows to the Divine Soul.","So if I strike at the Divine Soul, does it mean transmitting the Divine Thought to the eyes, using them as windows to truly \"emerge\"?","Mo Hua speculated inwardly.","He was unsure, but after a moment’s hesitation, he decided to give it a try.","Failure is the mother of success. Cultivation of any spell point is always accompanied by multiple failures, and only by numerous trials and errors can one find the correct path.","After all, \"cutting oneself\" is something he has already grown accustomed to.","Tai Xu Sword Intent seeks to cut the ego; Supreme Emotion Cutting aims to sever human desires; now with the Godslaying Sword, cutting himself doesn’t seem too big a deal...","Mo Hua’s thoughts shifted, and with a solemn expression, he began to reverse the Giant Sword towards himself.","However, as the edge of the sword turned, the overwhelming Sword Intent directed at himself, Mo Hua instantly felt the pressure of impending life and death.","As if with this sword, he was destined to die.","Mo Hua was about to disperse the Godslaying Sword immediately, but at the next moment, he forcibly stopped himself.","\"Fear is nothing but an unnecessary emotion.\"","\"Supreme Emotion Cutting should also cut away ’fear.’\"","\"The Godslaying Sword is a creation of my Divine Soul, my understanding of Dao, my Sword of Divine Thought. My sword cannot kill me.\"","Mo Hua held firm in his beliefs, his heart as steadfast as Goldstone, unwavering even when facing the mighty Godslaying Sword capable of cleaving Evil Embryos.","\"Cut!\"","Mo Hua gave a light shout.","The enormous Godslaying Sword slashed down with a thunderous force, as if a celestial river cascaded down towards Mo Hua himself.","Mo Hua’s gaze remained unchanged, his will as firm as iron, unafraid.","And indeed, the Godslaying Sword did not actually cut him but, at the moment of contact, cut into his Divine Soul.","In an instant, Divine Thought twisted, mingling illusion and reality.","Mo Hua seemed to touch a layer, a barrier of illusion and reality, sensing the gap between them.","The boundary between illusion and reality was too profound for him to see through or break apart this gap.","But the merging of illusion and reality was himself, his own Sea of Consciousness.","He could use himself as a medium, his eyes as apertures, to transmit his \"illusory\" Divine Thought into the \"real\" real world.","Mo Hua pointed his finger at the center of his brow, channeling the Sword Intent within his Sea of Consciousness.","A moment later, he suddenly opened his eyes.","In his eyes, sword light was dazzlingly bright, filled with a tremendous sword light as vast as the Milky Way, embodying various Sword Daos like Gold-breaking, Mountain Opening, Gui Water, and Li Fire, displaying vibrant colors in motion.","Tai Xu Sword Intent floated silently in the background.","Supreme Emotion Cutting, no self, no life.","Mo Hua’s expression was indifferent, and the surrounding atmospheric changes began to occur.","The big white dog, who was dozing off nearby, suddenly jumped up in shock, eyes wide with disbelief at Mo Hua.","The time was ripe, enlightenment was on the verge.","Mo Hua pointed his fingers at his brow, the Sword of Divine Thought channeled through his eyes, then his eyes shone sharply. Mo Hua pointed forward with two fingers, and the Godslaying Sword Intent emerged from his eyes, breaking through the space in the direction he pointed, pressing forward relentlessly.","The big white dog was so shocked that its fur stood on end, its tail bristled upward.","Then a surge of Divine Thought churned and changed...yet nothing happened.","Despite the astonishing aura, the profound spell point, the strong and powerful Divine Thought, the extremely sharp sword technique, nothing happened upon execution.","Or rather, he never actually executed it.","The grass was still grass, without a leaf fallen.","The tree was still a tree, leaving not a single scratch.","The flowers and plants all around remained lush and vibrant, flourishing as before.","The big white dog stared for a long time, realizing it was just a false alarm, its upright tail drooping down, and its furry body lay back on the ground.","Mo Hua also collapsed onto the grass, feeling a bit disheartened.","\"Why is it still not working?\"","\"I’ve mastered the spell of soul emergence; why can’t this sword emerge?\"","Unconvinced, Mo Hua wanted to practice again, but as soon as he stood up, he felt dizzy and fell to the ground once more.","His Sea of Consciousness throbbed with pain, his eyes full of blood threads, somewhat swollen.","\"Practiced too much, it’s starting to rebound...\"","The Godslaying Sword was too powerful, the Divine Thought too strong, and forcibly using \"the eyes\" for emergence was too burdensome on the eyes.","\"Can’t practice anymore, need to rest...\"","Mo Hua quickly sat up, meditating to recover his Divine Sense, while taking some pills to nourish Blood Qi and clear his mind and eyes.","After recuperating, his Divine Sense restored and his eyes clearer, Mo Hua finally opened his eyes.","\"Still not working.\"","Mo Hua pondered. But in the short term, he had no way to practice the emergence of the Godslaying Sword again. Moreover, it was almost mealtime; time to eat.","\"Let’s go back...\"","Mo Hua packed his things, called out, \"Big white dog, let’s go back,\" and got up to leave. After a few steps, he turned around, seeing the big white dog still lying on the ground.","\"Big white dog?\"","The big white dog glanced sideways at Mo Hua, ignoring him, turning its head and continuing to doze off, seemingly a bit angry.","Mo Hua understood why it was upset, sighed, and explained: \"How many times have I told you, it’s not that I deliberately want to steal food.\"","\"Nor is it that I don’t bring you when eating good stuff...\"","\"Those things, you can’t digest...\"","\"It’s all Divine Remains, too unclean, giving it to you could cause problems...\"","\"Next time, next time when there’s good food, I’ll definitely bring you along.\""]},{"number":1887,"title":"Chapter 1887 - 926: God-cutting Soul Emergence_3","paragraphs":["The big white dog looked at Mo Hua’s storage bag.","Mo Hua said, \"That bone can’t be eaten, I’m keeping it for a reason...\"","\"Really, I’m not lying to you.\"","\"Next time there’s something delicious, I’ll definitely save some for you...\"","...","After Mo Hua’s persuasion, the big white dog finally calmed down, and with an aloof nod, it reconciled with Mo Hua.","\"Next time I encounter evil spirits, I’ll definitely bring a few for you, just bear with it,\" Mo Hua promised. \"Now, follow me to the dining hall, and I’ll order whatever you want as an apology.\"","With Mo Hua’s promise, the big white dog finally became happy, wagging its tail, it trotted after Mo Hua.","One person and one dog thus walked down the mountain path together.","Behind them, on the towering ancient tree that Mo Hua had \"cut\" with Divine Thought into a sword, a sword scar quietly appeared.","It looked like a sword scar, but also not quite.","On the sword scar, there were no signs of knife or sword chopping, but rather it seemed like natural withering and decay.","It was as if someone had erased the \"intent\" of growth around the sword scar on the tree.","This scar would never regrow, never heal, and would forever lack vitality.","This was a wound on the \"Divine Thought\" level.","It was a Divine Thought sword wound left by a trace of God-slaying Sword Intent.","In the long years that followed, this sword wound remained on this ancient Taixu Gate tree, enduring the elements, never fading.","...","Disciple’s Residence, dining hall.","A hungry Mo Hua was sitting at the table gnawing on a chicken leg.","Next to him, the big white dog was also lying on the table, its two front paws holding a large pork knuckle, happily gnawing away.","The disciple beside them was unfazed.","Generally speaking, spirit beasts are not allowed in the dining hall.","But this dog belonged to the Sect Leader, and the person with it was Mo Hua, so no one said anything.","Of course, they had no idea that this big white dog was not actually a spirit beast, nor a dog.","After a hearty meal, the last bit of grudge in the big white dog’s heart disappeared, reconciling with Mo Hua.","Mo Hua took it to the library, and before leaving, the big white dog barked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua nodded in response, \"Okay, okay, I won’t forget, I’ll definitely treat you to something nice when I have time.\"","The big white dog was satisfied and nodded.","Seeing the big white dog off, Mo Hua returned to his room, burned some calming incense, brewed some Cloud Mist Tea, and sat on the mat to calm his mind and think:","\"Why can’t I still release it?\"","\"I’ve mastered the Divine Thought Skill, and drawn the God-slaying Sword Intent to my eyes, but I still can’t release it, can’t cut it out, could it be because I haven’t reached Core Formation?\"","Only by establishing the Divine Sense Core can the God-slaying Sword emerge?","Mo Hua was not sure and thought about practicing more, but using the eyes as the aperture puts a great strain on them, and with his physical strength, he couldn’t afford to try many times.","If he practiced too much and blinded himself, that would be a big problem.","Mo Hua pondered, \"Forget it, first think about establishing the Divine Sense Core.\"","As long as the Divine Sense Core is established, not only can the God-slaying Sword emerge, the Reversed Spirit Formation can also be learned. His power would truly usher in a \"transformation.\"","But the current problem still needs to be solved. In two days’ time, it’s the day to encircle and suppress the Demon Sect.","If the Reversed Spirit Formation can’t be learned and the God-slaying Sword can’t be externally released, all offensive methods will be useless, so retreating to secondary options, he can only think of ways to \"survive.\"","If there’s really an accident and he’s targeted by a Golden Core Demon, at least he’d have a way to escape.","Whether the Concealment Technique can fool a Golden Core is hard to say. However, he recently learned a new movement technique.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and then went to the Dao Room to find Elder Yi.","\"A spar?\"","Elder Yi was taken aback, looking at Mo Hua, \"With me?\"","\"Yes!\" Mo Hua nodded.","Elder Yi didn’t know what to say.","A Foundation Establishment disciple sparring with me, a Golden Core Elder?","If it were another disciple, he would definitely say he didn’t have time, but since it was Mo Hua asking, Elder Yi couldn’t refuse.","On the flip side, the fact that he was willing to spar with him was, in a sense, a sign of \"respect\" for him.","\"Oh well, I’ll just take it as playing with this Taixu Gate’s treasured disciple...\" Elder Yi thought to himself, then asked:","\"How do you want to spar?\"","Mo Hua said, \"I run, you try to catch me, see if you can catch me.\"","Elder Yi understood.","This is an attempt to spar in movement techniques.","He nodded and said, \"Alright.\"","Then Elder Yi found a spacious Dao Room and said to Mo Hua, \"Let’s do it here, there’s plenty of space for you to run.\"","Mo Hua looked around and nodded, \"Okay.\"","And so, the sparring began.","Of course, it’s called \"sparring,\" but in essence, it’s just \"practice,\" and the atmosphere wasn’t that tense.","The two of them stood apart, a hundred feet away from each other, and Elder Yi said, \"Let’s start.\"","Mo Hua replied, \"Okay!\"","Before the words were finished, Elder Yi’s figure had disappeared.","Mo Hua’s expression tightened, and before he could react, he suddenly felt himself being lifted.","\"Got you.\" said Elder Yi, holding Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s expression was a bit dazed.","\"This...\"","The Late Golden Core Stage movement technique was really too fast. Elder Yi was also a Spiritual Cultivator, particularly proficient in movement techniques. In a short time, he started quickly, and before he even had time to react, the figure flickered past him, too fast for him to respond.","The True Transmission Elder of Taixu Gate, truly extraordinary.","Even though Elder Yi appeared amiable and understated, his power was surprisingly strong when he really started, leaving him with no room to react at all.","No wonder he could teach Taoist Skills among the Eight Great Gates, truly extraordinary...","Of course, there was another reason.","Mo Hua turned his head to look at Elder Yi, \"Elder, you must be at the Late Golden Core Stage, your cultivation level is too high.\"","Elder Yi was taken aback, \"It’s not my fault that my cultivation is high...\"","Mo Hua said, \"Could you lower it to the Initial Golden Core Stage?\"","The intensity of the Late Golden Core Stage was still too high, his movement techniques were being overwhelmed, and he couldn’t learn anything.","Elder Yi sighed.","What else could he do?","As a \"sparring partner,\" he could only do what this little ancestor said.","\"Alright, I’ll lower it to the Initial Golden Core Stage.\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Elder Yi put Mo Hua down, and the two stood apart again. Then, with a \"begin,\" Elder Yi’s figure disappeared once more.","But this time, Mo Hua managed to catch Elder Yi’s trajectory.","At the Late Golden Core Stage, he couldn’t react, but when his cultivation was lowered to the Initial Golden Core Stage, the pressure wasn’t as high.","In Mo Hua’s Divine Sense perception, Elder Yi’s figure stepped with an extremely profound step, shortening a foot to an inch beneath him, each step spanning several feet, and moved precisely into Mo Hua’s blind spot at his back.","This step was exceptionally exquisite and tricky, calculated and very particular about timing.","Soon, from the blind spot in Mo Hua’s vision, Elder Yi’s hand reached out, grabbing toward Mo Hua just like before.","But this time, Mo Hua was prepared, and just as the hand was about to grab him, his figure flickered and he slid back several steps.","Elder Yi softly exclaimed, \"Hmm?\"","\"There’s something there...\"","He continued to pursue, his form as ethereal as the wind, with footsteps subtly in harmony with the changes of the易Trigrams, fast and mysterious, making it hard for people to notice.","But after a few rounds, Mo Hua managed to evade Elder Yi’s big hand at the last moment each time, avoiding being caught.","Elder Yi nodded quietly to himself.","\"Not bad...\"","No wonder he had the confidence to spar in movement techniques with him...","Not only was his Divine Sense keen, but his movement technique was also quite refined. Judging by his ease, he must have put in a lot of hard work.","And the more they sparred, the more distinct Elder Yi’s figure became in Mo Hua’s Divine Sense, and the clearer his attacks became, making it easier for Mo Hua to dodge.","Watching Mo Hua dart around the Dao Room like a fish, Elder Yi’s eyes narrowed, and in his vision, the space filled with易Trigrams, causing his movement technique to change.","But this shift occurred within a hair’s breadth.","Mo Hua didn’t have time to react, he was still relying on his experience to evade Elder Yi’s captures, but just as he sidestepped, he realized the space around him was empty, and Elder Yi hadn’t moved to grab him.","\"Oh no!\"","Mo Hua immediately realized something was wrong, but it was too late.","Elder Yi emerged from another blind spot, seemingly invisible even though he clearly wasn’t.","His large hands grabbed Mo Hua by the shoulders.","Elder Yi smiled slightly, but his smile froze suddenly.","The Mo Hua he caught turned into water mist, dissolving right before his eyes..."]},{"number":1888,"title":"Chapter 1888 - 927: Spell Circulation","paragraphs":["Elder Yi was stunned.","\"What is this?\"","Then he immediately reacted: \"An illusion technique movement technique? This child actually has such a legacy? Where did he learn it?\"","Elder Yi’s expression became stern, and he grew serious.","With a sweep of his Divine Sense, he discovered Mo Hua escaping to the edge of the Dao Room, and immediately he stepped using the Yi family’s ancestral Six Harmonies Step technique, covering several meters in one step, his form mysterious, closing in on Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s Water Shadow Illusion had just dissipated, and when he looked up, Elder Yi was reaching for him again. Instantly, a chill ran through his heart, and he once more employed Water Passing Step, moving like flowing water, slipping through Elder Yi’s hands.","Elder Yi grabbed empty air, slightly furrowing his brows, then turned swiftly, his speed increasing as he reached for the fleeing Mo Hua.","Thus, the two continued in a cycle of chase and escape for several more rounds.","Mo Hua’s movements were becoming increasingly strained.","Elder Yi’s movements, on the contrary, became faster and faster.","Even though this was a \"spar,\" Elder Yi understood that his main task was to \"assist in training,\" so even though he suppressed his cultivation to the Initial Golden Core stage, at first he did not go all out, allowing Mo Hua time to adapt, and then gradually increasing his speed, applying pressure on Mo Hua.","At the same time, he observed Mo Hua’s movement technique tendencies, memorizing Mo Hua’s habitual evasive maneuvers.","Taixu Gate is ranked among the Eight Great Gates.","Being an Elder of Daoist Law, apart from the family legacy, he also held profound Taoist knowledge and ample experience in Magic Battles.","Exchanges in movement techniques were naturally no challenge.","Mo Hua’s experience in Magic Battles, although already considerable, still paled in comparison to Elder Yi of the Late Golden Core Stage.","In just a moment, Elder Yi spotted a flaw in Mo Hua’s movements, his movements like the wind, he reached out, heading straight for Mo Hua’s shoulder.","Just as he was about to grab Mo Hua, Elder Yi stopped.","He knew that the \"Water Shadow\" before him was surely fake.","\"The real Mo Hua...\"","...is behind!","A faint Water Qi emanated from behind, Elder Yi’s eyes narrowed sharply, immediately turning around, reaching out to grab, but upon seeing, he was stunned.","\"Three... three Mo Huas?\"","Behind him, there were three sneaky shadows, identical to Mo Hua, all shrouded in Water Mist.","\"What kind of movement technique... could be so bizarre?\"","Elder Yi was secretly amazed but knew now was not the time for astonishment. He swept with his Divine Sense, quickly identifying the Water Shadows, distinguishing the real from the fake.","He was at the Late Golden Core Stage, his Divine Sense much stronger.","Mo Hua could only deceive for a short time, unable to truly fool him.","Elder Yi reached out, aiming for the Mo Hua on the far right, almost touching Mo Hua’s hair when, with a flash of water light, Mo Hua slipped away again.","Even for Elder Yi, a bit of frustration flared in his heart.","This child... is truly infuriating.","Even someone like him, proficient in spells, couldn’t hold onto this slippery child; change the person, and facing such a movement technique, even catching a glimpse would be impossible, let alone touching a corner of clothing, it would drive one to spit blood.","\"No wonder the Ancestor values this disciple...\"","Now Elder Yi became truly serious.","His aura surged, harmonizing with the Yi number, seemingly real and illusory, his actions speedier by a considerable margin.","Mo Hua’s expression changed, only feeling Elder Yi’s aura suddenly become powerful, like a Bone-eating Maggot, dogging his every step, forcing him to go all out, not daring to show the slightest negligence.","\"This is the power of the Golden Core...\"","The pressure on Mo Hua increased sharply, losing his previously unflustered mindset, pushing his movement technique to its limit, fleeing frantically under Elder Yi’s grasp.","He could no longer care about appearances, using any embarrassing maneuvers like somersaults and rolls, exerting all his strength to evade Elder Yi’s capture.","However, operating the movement technique with full power for such an extended period was consuming a massive amount of Spiritual Power.","Mo Hua’s Spiritual Power was already insufficient, and with the continuous use of Water Passing Step and Water Shadow Illusion, he was running low on Spiritual Power.","After several more rounds, a flaw appeared for Elder Yi to exploit.","\"Caught you!\"","Elder Yi’s eyes flashed with a sharp gleam, reaching for Mo Hua.","Mo Hua employed Water Shadow Illusion, his form flashed, transforming into three Water Mist figures, but this move had already been used before Elder Yi.","Repeated moves couldn’t fool this experienced Elder of Daoist Law.","Elder Yi was prepared, and when he saw this movement technique, without hesitation, he pointed directly at the middle figure.","\"Now, let’s see where you...\"","With a point, the Water Shadow shattered, dissolving into a splash of Water Qi.","Mid-sentence, Elder Yi choked, somewhat stunned.","\"Guess wrong?\"","Impossible...","He clearly saw Mo Hua hiding in the middle Water Shadow after splitting his illusions; how could it be wrong?","Almost simultaneously, Elder Yi pointed at the Water Shadows on both sides, but with this point, all the Water Shadows dissolved into Water Mist, dissipating.","All three Water Shadows had been dispelled.","Yet in the arena, Mo Hua’s figure was absent.","Elder Yi’s mouth twitched, \"Where is he?\"","\"This kid... where did he run off to? How did he disappear...\"","After a moment’s pause, Elder Yi instantly understood.","\"Concealment Technique!\"","While using the Water Shadow movement technique, splitting illusions to confuse him, Mo Hua also employed a Concealment Technique to secretly escape.","Elder Yi felt a tingle on his scalp.","This kid is as sly as a ghost. Using illusion techniques for distraction followed by a quick escape with a Concealment Technique...","But this is in the Dao Room, such a large space, and a Concealment Technique won’t allow an escape out of here.","Elder Yi released his Divine Sense, sweeping carefully, and indeed found a faint, flickering figure in a corner."]},{"number":1889,"title":"Chapter 1889 - 927: Spell Flow_2","paragraphs":["\"This Concealment Technique is truly absurd, I almost didn’t catch it...\"","Elder Yi sighed inwardly, and without giving Mo Hua a chance to breathe, he employed the Six Harmonies Footwork to further close in on Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s Spiritual Power was nearly depleted.","But he wasn’t willing to concede so easily, treating it as a \"life and death\" combat, he continued to engage Elder Yi with all his might.","However, he truly had exhausted all his tricks.","The Water Passing Step, Water Shadow Illusion, and Concealment Technique were all used, exposing all his life-saving cards to Elder Yi.","In front of Elder Yi, who hailed from a family of Spells, it was hard to conceal any used movement technique a second time.","Moreover, there was a great realm gap between Foundation Establishment and Golden Core.","Elder Yi was a Golden Core Late Stage Cultivator; despite suppressing his cultivation, his vision, knowledge, and experience remained intact.","This time, Mo Hua simply couldn’t pull off any surprises.","His Water Passing Step was seen through by Elder Yi; even the Water Shadow Illusion was easily discerned by Elder Yi. Even if he borrowed the Concealment Technique afterward, under precaution, it couldn’t escape Elder Yi’s Divine Sense.","Almost at the instant Mo Hua concealed himself, Elder Yi flashed and appeared behind Mo Hua, gripped his shoulder gently, signifying the end.","Mo Hua straightforwardly said, \"I concede!\"","Elder Yi breathed a sigh of relief, simultaneously wiping a cold sweat from his heart.","Fortunately, he caught him; otherwise, it would have been quite embarrassing.","As a Golden Core, if he couldn’t catch a Foundation Establishment like Mo Hua, he couldn’t continue his role as an Elder of Daoist Law without losing face.","Of course, this was all internal.","Outwardly, he still said, \"You need more practice.\"","Mo Hua panted heavily, admiringly said, \"Elder Yi, your movement technique is truly formidable.\"","All this time, Elder Yi was the first to put such pressure on him during a sparring match involving movement techniques.","Even after exhausting all his cards, he still got caught.","Of course, it was precisely because it was a \"sparring\" that he got caught.","In reality, if he encountered a Golden Core intending to kill him, he would have run long ago, never giving such a \"sparring\" opportunity.","Elder Yi was \"praised,\" yet felt somewhat uneasy at heart.","He furrowed his brows.","Previously during the spar, he had no time to think much, but upon reflecting carefully now, a shiver ran through his heart.","He finally figured out why Mo Hua was so troublesome.","This kid wasn’t using just one movement technique.","He was switching between two types of movement techniques and one Concealment Technique.","Utilizing a strong Divine Sense, accelerating with the intricate Water Passing Step, the peculiar Water Shadow Step, and the quiet Concealment Technique, effectively using three techniques seamlessly. It felt like one complete spell.","Elder Yi felt a chill in his heart.","This required a terrifyingly strong and micro-controlled Divine Sense, incredibly mastered movement techniques, and exceedingly rich combat experience to achieve this level.","Elder Yi couldn’t help but worry: This kid is only at Foundation Establishment and already mastered such techniques; if he reaches Golden Core, could I really catch him?","How coincidentally, Mo Hua said, \"Elder Yi, next time I’ll seek you out for movement technique practice again!\"","Elder Yi couldn’t help but shudder slightly, a touch of insecurity, he coughed, \"Sure, sure, but... I’m quite busy, might not always have time.\"","\"I see...\" Mo Hua looked a bit disappointed.","Mo Hua’s disappointed expression caught Elder Yi’s eye, immediately making him feel guilty and a bit uneasy.","\"Mo Hua’s desire to refine his movement techniques is commendable, how could I let trivial matters of face delay his cultivation?\"","\"In light of the disciple’s progress, is the Elder’s dignity really that important?\"","\"Besides, is Mo Hua just any ordinary disciple? What’s his status in Taixu Gate? How many Elders would be eager to spar with him!\"","\"Him seeking me for movement technique practice is taking our old friendship into account; others would kill for such an opportunity...\"","Elder Yi promptly said, \"Ah, I misspoke. I actually have a lot of free time lately, so whenever you wish to practice your movement techniques, feel free to come find me.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"Really?\"","Elder Yi nodded repeatedly, \"Really, really.\"","Mo Hua smiled, \"Thank you, Elder Yi.\"","Seeing Mo Hua’s smile, Elder Yi felt his mood lift significantly.","\"Your movement technique is quite impressive, but there are certain details that need optimization, such as your Water Passing Step and your...\" Elder Yi paused.","\"Water Shadow Step,\" Mo Hua said.","He didn’t call it the Water Shadow Illusion, only the Water Shadow Step. While rare, it’s not that confidential.","Water Shadow Step?","Elder Yi was slightly perplexed, feeling that the Water Shadow Step in his memory differed somewhat from Mo Hua’s exhibition, but didn’t inquire further.","Mo Hua said it, so it was.","\"And your Water Shadow Step, when connecting, the Spiritual Power still has some blockage. This is an issue with the acupoint during the Spiritual Power’s circulation; you can adjust it based on the mental method...\" Elder Yi said.","\"How to adjust?\" Mo Hua humbly sought guidance.","Elder Yi pondered, \"For instance, when using the Water Passing Step, in the final move, circulate the Spiritual Power to the Water Spring Acupoint at your foot.\"","\"Thereafter, when connecting... with the Water Shadow Step, find a section in which the ’Water Spring Acupoint’ serves as the starting point of Spiritual Power Cycle from the Water Shadow Step.\"","\"In this way, the Spiritual Power at the end of the Water Passing Step halts at the Water Spring Acupoint, which conveniently serves as the start for the Water Shadow Step, allowing Spiritual Power to flow seamlessly, thus enabling swifter movement technique transitions, achieving effortless switching.\"","\"This is the rise and fall of Spiritual Power’s transitions.\""]},{"number":1890,"title":"Chapter 1890 - 927: Spell Cycle (3)","paragraphs":["\"Of course, if the two types of spells don’t happen to correspond to the same acupoint, you can just use nearby ones instead.\"","\"If you can’t go through the Water Spring Acupoint, then use the nearby Taixi acupoint...\"","...","Mo Hua suddenly saw the light.","These kinds of spell details, the subtleties regarding key acupoints—only someone like Elder Yi, who had spent years immersed in spellcraft, could know them so well.","He himself hadn’t even thought about it at all.","\"The linking and transitioning of spiritual power as it flows between acupoints...\" Mo Hua mumbled, then said gratefully, \"I’ve got it. Thank you, Elder!\"","Elder Yi saw that Mo Hua caught on instantly, and nodded with satisfaction.","Afterwards, Mo Hua consulted Elder Yi about movement techniques, then was ready to take his leave and ponder things by himself for a while.","Elder Yi looked at Mo Hua and suddenly seemed to recall something, asking, \"Mo Hua, what do you intend to choose for your own magical treasure?\"","Mo Hua was caught off guard, but didn’t hide anything: \"I want to pick a ’Bronze Skin Iron Bones’ kind of magic treasure, to reinforce my body and patch up my weak points.\"","Elder Yi frowned at his words.","\"Is that not good?\" Mo Hua couldn’t help but ask.","\"It’s not that it’s bad—strengthening your body isn’t a problem but...\"","Elder Yi was reminded of earlier, when Mo Hua, relying on his powerful divine sense, controlled the Water Passing Step, Concealment Technique, and, as Mo Hua called it, the Water Shadow Step clone movement technique, switching between them seamlessly. He suddenly had a realization.","These were life-saving movement techniques, connected flawlessly and tough to deal with as is.","If he used attack-type spells to coordinate and transition just as seamlessly, wouldn’t that be even scarier?","Previously, he had advised Mo Hua to \"master all spells,\" and it was the same idea, but that only applied to low-level spells.","Low-level spells use up little spiritual power, are quick to cast, require no breathing time between uses, and can be cast freely. But relatively, their might is limited.","The so-called \"master all spells\" approach uses quantity to compensate for quality.","But for middle-level and higher spells, that just can’t be done.","Because mid-level and higher spells are slower to cast, use up more spiritual power, and require time to adjust after being used.","But Elder Yi had never expected Mo Hua’s divine sense to be so formidable—so powerful that it could greatly accelerate his spellcasting speed.","He could even control various spells of different origins and types, linking them together fluidly and switching at will.","This was nearly unthinkable.","At its core, it was because of divine sense!","Hardly any Spiritual Cultivator possessed such a powerful and sharp divine sense as Mo Hua.","Like this, he could even use \"mid-level spells\" as easily as \"low-level ones.\"","With divine sense acceleration, his attacks would be incredibly fast. Seamless transitions—with no need for rest intervals.","With an overwhelming number of \"mid-level spells,\" mastering and interlinking them all in slaughter, the power would be terrifying.","It might look like his spells were only one grade higher, but with sheer variety, the destructive force was several times greater.","And on top of that, Mo Hua had the Five Elements Spiritual Root.","The Five Elements spells could work together to form a \"spell chain.\"","Any single spell would always have its vulnerabilities.","But with all Five Elements covered and a \"spell chain\" formed, metal, wood, water, fire, and earth would reinforce and balance each other—practically eliminating all weak points.","Other people’s spells are used one by one.","His would be used in sets—and used seamlessly, faster and more suppressive than anyone else...","Coming from a family of spell masters, and as an Elder of Daoist Law himself, even Elder Yi’s blood ran hot just imagining this.","But all this depended on having enough spiritual power.","Elder Yi considered and asked, \"Have you thought about using a Gathering-Spirit Gourd or something similar, a spiritual power treasure, as your own magical treasure?\"","Mo Hua shook his head: \"It’s too expensive, and I’ve already missed the window for nurturing it.\"","Elder Yi froze for a moment, then shook his head regretfully.","It’s true—although Mo Hua now looked to have a lot of options, because no one had helped him plan early and he missed the window for nurturing, he actually didn’t have much to choose from.","Elder Yi let out a long sigh, truly full of regret.","He was, in fact, an excellent Spiritual Cultivator seedling.","His Spiritual Root was lacking, but his perception was outstanding, his adaptability strong, and most importantly, his divine sense was practically monstrous.","If he could just walk the Spiritual Cultivator path to the end, he’d have countless spells at his fingertips—he’d be tremendously powerful.","The Taoist path is long; Body Cultivation is dominant in the early stage, Sword Cultivation in the mid-to-late stage.","But Spiritual Cultivators are strongest at the very end.","The further a cultivator progresses, the more abundant their spiritual power, the deeper their understanding of the Spiritual Power Law, and the more terrifying the might of their spells becomes.","Such a pity...","But Elder Yi couldn’t really say anything more.","Life is like this; it seems to offer many choices, but in fact, the path under your feet is only one or two—just step by step, moving forward.","As long as you haven’t become immortal, as long as you’re still human—even at the Heaven Void stage—you can’t do as you please.","\"Shoring up your weak points, making your body a bit stronger, is good, too.\"","Elder Yi consoled him.","Whether he was comforting Mo Hua or himself was unclear.","...","After saying farewell to Elder Yi, Mo Hua returned to the Disciple’s Residence, with some confusion in his heart.","Elder Yi’s regret—he was well aware of it, too.","But truth be told, his fleshly body was innately disadvantaged. No matter how hard he patched it, he couldn’t close the gap with others.","At best, he could go from terrible to just about passable.","The best method was still to play to his strengths.","His strongest suit was his divine sense, but divine sense doesn’t rely on magic treasures, and there aren’t really any magic treasures that can enhance it.","Other than that, it was his spellcraft.","Mo Hua’s spells were actually quite strong, but his weakness was below-average spiritual root and low spiritual power.","If he had enough spiritual power, he could learn more spells, ones of higher grade too.","And the stronger his divine sense grew, the faster he could cast—someday, he might even master an \"Instant Forbidden Technique.\"","As long as his spells were powerful enough to wipe out all his enemies, it wouldn’t matter if his body was weak or not.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but agonize again, and after a while, he sighed.","Enough—no point in overthinking it.","Life always carries regrets; nothing can ever go exactly your way.","Spiritual power treasures are nice, but he really didn’t have options.","As for the Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation, that was something else: a true-blue Four Symbols Divine Beast Formation Diagram. Mr. Tu poured who knows how many years of effort and monster cultivator lives into researching it—an all-but-lost ancient Four Symbols Formation.","The day to wipe out the Demon Sect was fast approaching, and the Diagram was already within reach.","All roads in the Great Dao lead to longevity and, in the end, to the same destination. Since you’ve chosen your path, just walk it without hesitation.","Mo Hua nodded to himself, his gaze gradually firming.","The next day, he sought out Elder Yi again, sparred in movement technique, polished his various movement techniques until they were flawless, and managed to last a few dozen exchanges under Elder Yi’s hand—only then was he satisfied.","A Golden Core Demon might not compare to Elder Yi in Daoist Skill.","If he could handle exchanges with Elder Yi, then against a Golden Core Demon, he could at least escape with his life.","As for the late Golden Core Demon Head—the leader of the Demon Sect...","With so many Dao Court Supervisors and Taixu Sect Elders watching, as long as he kept his distance, that guy wouldn’t have a chance to make a move on him.","Dao Court Supervisors aside, just the Taixu Sect Elders alone weren’t to be trifled with.","Preparations complete, on the third day, the plan to besiege the Demon Sect officially began.","Mo Hua personally headed to Yanluo Mountain.","The treacherous terrain, the tangled marshes and murky waters of Yanluo Mountain—here lay the Demon Sect’s lair.","Here, a bloody battle was about to unfold.","Mo Hua had to see the Demon Sect destroyed with his own eyes, watch demon cultivators’ blood flow like rivers—to vent the evil qi in his heart.","He also wanted to know if his own magical treasure, the \"Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation,\" was hidden within the Demon Sect.","And whether this ancient Four Symbols Formation would ultimately fall into his own hands."]},{"number":1891,"title":"Chapter 1891 - 928: Fan Jin","paragraphs":["Yanluo Mountain, eight hundred miles long.","The waterways are intricate, marshes are everywhere, with toxic mists and vapors engulfing the sky. Wild geese often fall victim to the poison and die, plummeting into the marshes, turning into putrid water, which is why it’s called \"Yanluo Mountain\".","A branch of the Mistwater River flows through the mountains.","The river water carries a fishy smell.","The depths of the mountain are treacherous and complex.","The Demon Sect is built here.","At this time, outside the deep mountains, in the perilous environment, many Righteous Cultivators have long been lying in wait among the mountain forests and marshes.","This encirclement of the Demon Sect is a grand affair.","The Taoist Court has dispatched fifteen Golden Core Stewards, as well as six hundred Enforcement Leaders at Foundation Establishment Late Stage, up to the Peak.","The Taixu Gate, allied with the Taoist Court, has dispatched twenty Golden Core Elders.","The Taixu Gate, with the unification of the Three Sects, has many cultivators and elders, therefore they dispatched as many as twenty elders, surpassing even the Taoist Court.","However, the Inner Gate Disciples are not many, only a hundred were sent.","Encircling the Demon Sect, particularly a Third Grade Demon Sect, and engaging with Golden Core Demons is extremely dangerous in combat.","For a Great Sect like the Taixu Gate, the disciples who can enter the Inner Gate are the very elite among the Heavenly Pride, the future pillars of the sect. Naturally, they wouldn’t let them risk their lives in a premature deadly battle with the Demon Sect.","Inner Sect Disciples are not \"cannon fodder,\" they are \"seeds.\"","Their participation in the encirclement of the Demon Sect is to temper their mindset, to let them witness the brutality of the Demon Sect, and to adapt to the bloody battles with Demon Cultivators, so they really can stand on their own in the future and become the pillars of the sect.","The only Outer Disciple in the field is Mo Hua.","Of course, he’s not here for training.","He’s the \"Hidden Hand.\"","The hidden hand pushing for the destruction of the Demon Sect.","The Qianxue State Boundary is a great state with many sects, any Demon Sect daring to show its head here is bound to be destroyed—it’s just a matter of time.","With or without Mo Hua, this result wouldn’t change.","Mo Hua merely accelerated this process, pushing the progress of the Demon Sect’s destruction from start to finish in one go.","And now, Mo Hua is on-site, personally witnessing the results of this action.","The only downside is that his position is a bit far from the Demon Sect, so he can’t see clearly.","He couldn’t help it; this was already the biggest compromise.","Uncle Gu from the Taoist Court, Sister Xia, Elder Master Xun of the Taixu Gate, and various elders, all unanimously disagreed with him joining this excitement.","Especially Elder Master Xun.","\"A precious son should never sit under the eaves.\" (An idiom meaning one should avoid unnecessary risks.)","Exterminating the Demon Sect and surrounding the Golden Core Demon is extremely dangerous. If something goes wrong, Mo Hua’s life would be in jeopardy, and by that time, it would be too late to regret.","But Mo Hua insisted strongly and promised to behave honestly and stay far away, not causing any trouble. Besides, with so many sect elders around, he thought it unlikely they couldn’t protect him.","Only then did Elder Master Xun reluctantly nod in agreement.","Therefore, while Mo Hua could participate in the extermination of the Demon Cultivators, he could only watch from afar, and he lost his \"personal freedom,\" having to mingle with the elders and not allowed to act independently.","Besides, there’s practically no need for him in exterminating the Demon Sect.","As the \"middleman,\" having connected and bridged this, his task was considered complete.","Other matters are taken care of by the Taoist Court and the sect elders, and he couldn’t intervene.","He lacks the strength to surround and kill the Golden Core Demon.","The formations near the Demon Sect are also handled by Elder Xun Zixian and other Formation Elders, requiring no input from him.","Moreover, most formations near the Demon Sect are Third Grade, beyond his Formation Method Classification, so even if he wanted to help, he couldn’t.","The only thing he could do was stand by obediently and learn humbly while Elder Xun Zixian broke the Demon Sect formations, getting an early understanding of the application and breaking rules of Third Grade Arrays.","After breaking the formations, it’s time to prepare for the battle.","A large number of Taoist Court cultivators secretly encircle the Demon Sect according to the set plan.","The elders of the Taixu Gate also began to act.","In the thin mist, everything unfolds urgently.","Located at the edge of the battlefield, Mo Hua instead found himself \"idle,\" watching silently with deep thoughts.","He is now staying in a temporary camp.","Near the camp, there’s another person as \"idle\" as he is.","This person is tall and strong, with a face full of whiskers, wearing a Taoist Court Supervisor’s robe, it is Fan Jin.","Fan Jin is responsible for the \"rear guard.\"","Such a big event as the encirclement of the Demon Sect is extremely dangerous, and with his Initial Golden Core cultivation, he’s not yet qualified to be at the forefront, charging and fighting.","Being behind the vanguard, as the main force of the great tribe to kill demon cultivators and earn merit points.","Such good deeds are not his turn.","Furthermore, things like reconnaissance, eavesdropping, and formation breaking, he doesn’t have the skills for those.","Therefore, he can only perform the \"rear guard\" duties. If the encirclement fails, he must cover the retreat. If the demon cultivators scatter and flee, he must stop and kill them. Some messy and tiring tasks afterward are also his responsibilities.","At this moment, still in the preparation stage, people come and go in the camp.","Fan Jin couldn’t help but look around, troubled by his thoughts.","Transferring from a small place to partake in the big event of encircling the Demon Sect is actually a good opportunity to meet and socialize with other fellow cultivators.","Tao Cultivation also cultivates relationships.","To progress, one must strive to find opportunities.","But after looking for a long time, he couldn’t find anyone to speak with.","The coming and going Golden Core cultivators were either Supervisors from families, stationed at the Qianxue State Boundary, inherently higher in status than him, a Supervisor from a remote state boundary.","Or they were True Transmission Elders from one of the Eight Great Gates of Qianxue State, the Taixu Gate, with profound cultivation and superior Taoist inheritance, so he didn’t dare try to network with them."]},{"number":1892,"title":"Chapter 1892 - 928: Fan Jin (2)","paragraphs":["Even if he spoke up, others would ignore him. After all, in terms of background origin, Taoist inheritance, and cultivation, he was not as good as others.","Tall Fan Jin stood among the crowd, yet felt he was half a head shorter than everyone else.","But he didn’t want to give up; the opportunity was only this one time.","Once the mission to destroy the Demon Sect was over, no matter the result, there might never be such a large formation, with so many Golden Core cultivators present.","Even if there were, he might not qualify to participate.","Fan Jin, with his vigilant demeanor, glanced around at the passing cultivators, trying to find someone with a lower status, who looked amiable and approachable, so he could strike a conversation and build some connections.","Looking around, he finally found someone.","Young, looking tender, weak blood qi, with low spiritual power, following behind a group of elders, seemingly like a \"tagalong.\"","Most importantly, he had a handsome appearance, clear eyes, and a friendly and charming smile, seemingly easy to talk to at first glance.","The only problem was, he was only at the Foundation Establishment stage.","But Foundation Establishment it was; he couldn’t speak with the Golden Cores anyway.","Moreover, he was wearing a Taoist robe from the Taixu Sect, probably a disciple of Taixu Sect, and maybe through him, Fan Jin could connect with the sect elders behind him.","The avenues of such a great sect, even if just a few words exchanged, names swapped, could sometimes be very useful.","Even if not, just mentioning it carried some face.","Fan Jin stealthily moved in front of Mo Hua.","Mo Hua, who was observing the surrounding mountains, also noticed this peculiar Golden Core steward, turned his head curiously to look at him, not knowing what he wanted to do.","Fan Jin braced himself and cupped his hands, saying:","\"I am Fan Jin, serving humbly as a steward of the Taoist Court. Little brother, you are... a disciple of the Taixu Sect, right?\"","Mo Hua glanced at his own Taoist robe of the Taixu Sect, thought he was stating the obvious, nodded and asked:","\"Is there something you need?\"","Fan Jin was immediately stuck.","Is there something?","He actually didn’t have anything in mind...","Just wanted to chat, to establish some connections, see if he could mingle and build some network.","He didn’t know this little brother, didn’t know his name, what he liked, nor what to talk about.","He had the heart to progress, but after taking the first step, he suddenly didn’t know how to proceed.","Mo Hua contemplated for a moment.","Fan Jin...","The name seemed familiar to him.","\"Do you know Uncle Gu?\" Mo Hua asked him.","Fan Jin was stunned, \"Uncle Gu?\"","\"Gu Changhuai,\" Mo Hua said.","Fan Jin nodded repeatedly, \"Of course, of course, Gu Changhuai, Supervisor Gu, I was temporarily seconded to the Qian Learning state boundary and always worked together with Supervisor Gu, receiving a lot of guidance from him.\"","Fan Jin let out a long breath in his heart.","This connection inexplicably continued, but he never expected it to be connected through the always impartial and stern Supervisor Gu.","Mo Hua also nodded slightly.","He remembered now, there was indeed such a supervisor.","At that time, when he used the token to inform the Demon Sect to \"cease operation due to an insider,\" this Master Fan was acting together with Uncle Gu.","Counting it, he had saved his life once.","\"Little brother, are you from the Gu Family?\" Fan Jin asked quietly.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"My surname is Mo.\"","Surname Mo...","Fan Jin felt a bit unfamiliar; in his impression, around the Qian Learning state boundary, there didn’t seem to be a family with the surname \"Mo.\"","However, this also verified his judgment.","\"Could it be... little brother is not a noble family’s son?\" Fan Jin asked.","Mo Hua asked him, \"How do you know?\"","Fan Jin whispered: \"Pardon me, little brother, it’s not that I’m boasting, I have a fair eye for people.\"","He glanced at Mo Hua, \"Your blood qi is weak; in your younger years, you must have lacked spiritual objects for nurturing. Your spiritual power is weak, your spiritual root must be average. This signifies that you aren’t from a prominent family or large clan.\"","\"Your admittance to the Taixu Sect is likely another fortuitous chance.\"","\"But then,\" Fan Jin shook his head and sighed, \"within the sect, you’re probably not very valued, reduced to running errands for the elders, serving tea and water, otherwise by now, you would show signs of nurturing your own Magical Treasure.\"","Mo Hua was silent for a moment, then nodded, \"You have a good eye for people.\"","\"Isn’t it?\" Fan Jin sighed, \"To be honest, we are quite similar, both from the bottom level, trying to make a name and career for ourselves, it’s really tough.\"","Mo Hua asked: \"Are you from a small family?\"","\"Exactly,\" Fan Jin nodded, \"The Fan family of Solitary Mountain City, a third-grade small family, but that’s in the past, and now it’s in decline, the family members scattered, I am pretty much alone too.\"","\"Solitary Mountain City?\" Mo Hua was taken aback.","He hadn’t expected that this Fan Jin would be from Solitary Mountain City.","\"Little brother, you know Solitary Mountain City?\" Fan Jin asked.","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I know Master Gu from the Gushan Refining Workshop.\"","Fan Jin was very surprised, \"You know Master Gu too?\"","\"You know Master Gu too?\"","Fan Jin said: \"I’ve drunk with Master Gu a few times, quite familiar, and years ago, it was me who helped handle the contracts for their refinery shop.\"","Fan Jin didn’t expect that he just chanced the conversation, and unexpectedly built a connection, and this connection, was growing more and more.","Fan Jin became more intimate and enthusiastic towards Mo Hua.","\"When you have the time to visit Solitary Mountain City, I’ll definitely treat you well, little brother!\"","\"Sure!\" Mo Hua agreed straightforwardly.","Fan Jin suddenly remembered something, shook his head, \"No, it’s better not to go to Solitary Mountain City, when I can be transferred to Qianxue state boundary, or another surrounding state boundary as a steward, I will hold a banquet to invite you, little brother.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, and then his eyes flickered slightly, \"Does Master Fan not wish to stay in Solitary Mountain City?\""]},{"number":1893,"title":"Chapter 1893 - 928: Fan Jin_3","paragraphs":["\"Who the hell would ever want to stay in that godforsaken place?\" Fan Jin waved his hand dismissively, a clear look of distaste on his face.","But Mo Hua’s eyes grew deeper as he caught a subtle shift in Fan Jin’s expression.","His face said disdain, but deep within his eyes, there was something else—wariness, maybe even a trace of... deep-seated fear.","Fear...","What was he afraid of?","What was there in Solitary Mountain City to be so scared of?","Mo Hua squinted, his gaze sharpening.","Fan Jin, however, had no interest in mentioning \"Solitary Mountain City\" again. Instead, he quickly changed the topic, looking toward Mo Hua with a worried expression:","\"Kid, since I’ve been around the block, let me give you a piece of advice. If you think it’s worthwhile, take it to heart. If not, just pretend... just figure I’m talking nonsense.\"","\"Master Fan, please go ahead,\" Mo Hua nodded in response.","Fan Jin spoke from the heart,","\"You’re at Foundation Establishment Late Stage. Next step is Core Formation. When it comes to your own Magic Treasure... you’ve got to choose carefully. Even if your Sect doesn’t value you, even if you’ve got no family backing, you can’t treat this lightly.\"","Originally, he’d wanted to use Mo Hua as a bridge to cozy up to Elders from his Sect, but Fan Jin was a warmhearted guy—after talking with Mo Hua for a bit, he’d actually forgotten all about his original plans and began offering sincere advice instead.","Not that Mo Hua really needed advice like this anymore.","Seeing Mo Hua’s calm and indifferent look, Fan Jin assumed he was being ignored and got a bit anxious:","\"Seriously, kid, I’ve been where you are, I wouldn’t lie to you. I totally screwed myself over—just thought if I could form my core, I’d be set. Figured I could skimp on the Magic Treasure and just use whatever would do the trick. Now I’m in Core Formation, but my Magic Treasure’s holding me back everywhere I go...\"","Mo Hua asked curiously, \"Master Fan, what is your Magic Treasure?\"","\"A hammer.\"","\"Your own Magic Treasure is a hammer?\"","\"Yep.\"","Fan Jin looked as if he’d swallowed a bitter pill, but couldn’t spit it out.","\"So when it comes to choosing your own Magic Treasure, you can’t be too careful. You’ve absolutely got to pick the right one. No shortcuts.\"","Mo Hua nodded slowly.","He’d been considering the issue of Magic Treasures for quite some time, so honestly, it didn’t matter much what Master Fan had to say. What he truly cared about was what had happened in Solitary Mountain City.","Mo Hua wanted to know—what exactly had happened in Solitary Mountain City that made this Golden Core Steward so scared?","But before he could ask, Elder Xun Zixian called out to him:","\"Mo Hua, come have some tea.\"","\"Oh, sure,\" Mo Hua quickly replied.","Fan Jin turned toward the voice and saw, to his shock, that the one calling Mo Hua over was none other than a Taixu Sect Elder: sword brows, star-bright eyes, the bearing and looks of a truly extraordinary Late Golden Core Stage Elder. Fan Jin’s heart jumped in his chest.","An Eight Great Gates Late Golden Core Stage True Transmission Elder—compare that to a small-timer like him, just an Initial Golden Core Steward. The gap between them was truly massive, like heaven and earth.","Fan Jin kind of wanted to thick-face his way over and network, but the difference in status was just too intimidating.","He basically had no confidence even speaking up.","Just then, a Taoist Court Enforcement Leader approached him. \"Master Fan, Supervisor Gu needs you. The operation’s about to start.\"","Fan Jin nodded, \"Got it.\" Then he cupped his fists toward Mo Hua, \"Fate brought us together today. I won’t disturb you further, little brother. If we get the chance, let’s chat again some time.\"","Mo Hua clasped his hands in return. \"Demon Cultivators are vicious, Master Fan, be careful.\"","\"Thanks for the heads up, little brother.\"","Fan Jin said his piece and turned to leave, though he couldn’t help feeling a bit disappointed inside. Damn, what a chance—if only he’d lingered a little longer, maybe chatted a bit more, he might actually have managed to connect with one of those Taixu \"big shots.\"","\"Such a shame...\"","Fan Jin walked a few steps, but couldn’t resist turning around for another look.","Right then, Elder Xun Zixian had Mo Hua sit down, poured him a cup of tea, and said kindly, \"A Taoist Friend gave me this—it’s called Snow Clear. Give it a try.\"","The tea leaves were white as snow, the tea itself was crystal clear, its fragrance fresh and mellow.","Mo Hua lifted the cup, took a sip, and squinted with a soft laugh, \"Thank you, Elder Zixian!\"","Fan Jin saw the whole scene and felt his brain buzz like it had exploded.","No way...","This can’t be right.","Isn’t it always the Disciple pouring tea for the Elder? Since when do Elders pour tea for the Disciple?","Just what kind of customs does the Taixu Sect have?","And not just any Elder, but one who was obviously of extremely high status and profound knowledge—a Late Golden Core Stage Elder at that.","This kind of great cultivator—even saying \"hello\" would’ve made Fan Jin nervous as hell, but here he was, pouring tea for this little brother with his own hands...","Fan Jin just stood there, dumbfounded, muttering to himself:","\"Just who the hell is this little brother...?\"","Then suddenly, he remembered: that Elder had called out this little brother’s name earlier—","Mo Hua.","\"Mo Hua...\"","Fan Jin frowned, the name ringing all kinds of bells in his mind. Where had he heard it before? He thought about it for a second before his eyes went wide and he sucked in a cold breath.","\"No way... could this be... that legendary ’Mo Hua’...?\"","\"The... the ’little monster’ from Taixu Sect?\"","...","An hour later, everything was ready—the war to wipe out the Demon Sect was officially underway.","But none of that had anything to do with Mo Hua.","Elder Xun Zixian was keeping Mo Hua company at Ancestor Xun’s orders—partly to keep an eye on Mo Hua and make sure he didn’t run off looking for trouble, partly to protect him so he wouldn’t come to any harm.","So Mo Hua just sat there drinking tea, doing as he was told, while his gaze swept toward the Demon Sect’s lair, quietly observing how things developed.","Taoist Court cultivators, Taixu Sect Elders, and Disciples followed the prescribed route, moving like a hidden tide, converging on the Demon Sect stronghold. They wove an invisible net, completely trapping the Demon Sect’s base within its threads.","The storm was gathering, battle just moments away.","The miasma-covered Yanluo Mountain grew more and more deathly silent.","Suddenly, violent tremors blasted through the air—the mountains shattered, the ground quaking beneath their feet.","That was the Demon Sect’s external Formation getting breached, the explosion of Spiritual Power from it rattling the terrain.","Then cries for battle erupted, shaking the heavens.","The Golden Core Cultivators in the lead each unleashed their Magic Treasures and charged deep into Demon Sect territory—Sword Qi, Spells, swords and armor clashing in a wild frenzy as they collided with Demon Cultivators in mortal combat.","The sky, which had just been clear, gradually turned blood-red, mingling with the thick miasma, entwining into a hellish canvas.","After the Golden Cores burst in, the main army crashed in behind them.","The Dao Court Canon led the Enforcement Leaders; Taixu Sect Elders led the Inner Sect Disciples, forming neat lines as they advanced—like meat grinders, slaughtering every Demon Sect Disciple in their path.","Five Elements Spiritual Power and Evil Demon Blood Qi collided and tangled, erupting in furious explosions.","Shattered limbs everywhere, flesh and blood flying, the carnage extreme.","Streams of blood poured into rivers, seeped into the marshes—the entire Yanluo Mountain was shrouded in a curtain of blood.","The process was long and grueling.","Thousands of cultivators fought to the death among the mountains and toxic swamps. Blood was everywhere, blades shattered, Spells whistled through the sky, hidden weapons snaked over the ground—the scene was colossal in scale.","No one knew how long it went on, but eventually, the fighting eased for a brief moment.","Mo Hua knew—it wasn’t over; it meant that the Golden Core Elders and Dao Court Canon had led the charge into the Demon Sect’s inner lair.","Sure enough, moments later, even stronger tremors rocked the earth.","These tremors split mountains and cracked boulders; wild, sweeping auras scattered in all directions like raging waves, making the miasma of Yanluo Mountain swirl back upon itself, the hills and marshes trembling and rolling.","At the same time, a savage, brutal, and terrifying roar—like that of some ancient, monstrous beast—echoed through Yanluo Mountain, making a hundred demons quake in fear, and sending dread rippling through the hearts of the Righteous Dao cultivators.","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted sharply.","\"That’s... a Dragon Roar?!\"","Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation...","Beside Mo Hua, Elder Xun Zixian—Late Golden Core Stage—heard the roar and his face changed color.","\"Evil Dragon...\""]},{"number":1894,"title":"Chapter 1894 - 929: Evil \"Dragon","paragraphs":["\"Evil Dragon?\" Mo Hua paused, glancing at Elder Xun Zixian.","Xun Zixian pondered and said, \"The dragon is an ancient divine beast, also the totem passed down through the Dao Court Emperor’s lineage. It calls the wind and summons the rain, commands thunder, and wields supreme, unmatched power.\"","\"Everything about the dragon—dragon soul, dragon bones, dragon meat, dragon blood, dragon scales—all are precious divine treasures.\"","\"Countless cultivators throughout the world wish to draw tremendous strength from the ’dragon,’ and thus various Daoist cultivation methods have arisen.\"","\"Among these cultivation methods, there are both righteous and evil ones.\"","\"Of the righteous, some examples are the Azure Dragon Skill, Mystic Yellow Dragon Skill, Dragon Blood Body Refining Skill, or dragon martial arts, dragon force Taoist skills, dragon bone spiritual artifacts, dragon spirit pills... and so on.\"","\"But as for the evil dragon techniques, there are many as well. These are all forbidden arts in the Demon Path, utterly inaccessible to common cultivators...\"","Xun Zixian’s gaze drifted to the distance, his expression grave:","\"Within that dragon’s roar hides human resentment, brimming with murderous intent and an extremely heavy evil aura. Who knows what forbidden rituals were used to breed such an evil dragon...\"","Mo Hua, however, understood—this was a Formation.","Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation...","It must have been Mr. Tu who altered the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation, turning it into the Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation, using human flesh to nourish it and thus producing the power of the Evil Dragon.","Yet...","Mo Hua’s brow furrowed lightly.","If this Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation has truly become an \"Evil Formation,\" with the Green Dragon now an evil dragon—can I still use it?","If I inscribe it as my own Magical Treasure’s pattern, wouldn’t I become a Demon Cultivator bearing an evil dragon myself?","Mo Hua looked off into the distance—blood qi filled the sky, the evil dragon’s screeches thundered, deafening the ears. Its overwhelming presence cast terror into every heart.","\"Are dragons... truly this powerful?\"","Mo Hua muttered under his breath.","Xun Zixian nodded. \"Anything even remotely related to ’dragon’ is never weak—and the evil dragon is certainly no exception.\"","Dragon...","Mo Hua fell into a daze and, unexpectedly, thought of Junior Brother Bai Zisheng.","He vaguely recalled, back atop the Corpse Mountain in South Yue City, when junior brother’s body summoned the phantom of an Azure Dragon, then man and spear became one. With one immensely powerful spear technique, he pierced the chest of Lu Chengyun, the Lu Family Head, traitor to the Minor Hidden Spirit Sect, once master of the ’Corpse King.’","This spear technique seemed to be called ’Returning Dragon Spear.’","Bai Zisheng was a trueborn of the Bai Family, so does that mean the Bai family’s inheritance is also tied to the ’dragon’?","If that’s the case, the Bai Family is truly extraordinary.","\"Anything associated with dragons is never weak...\"","Mo Hua softly repeated the phrase, grumbling internally:","\"I can’t speak for the other ’dragon’ techniques, but at the very least, that ’Dragon Soaring in the Sky’ my dumb junior brother taught me is a total scam. He just picked such a showy name because it sounded cool, in reality it’s all flash and no substance. Every time I tried it in a real fight, I’d end up beaten so badly I was picking my teeth off the ground later...\"","Mo Hua was lost in thought, and as his mind wandered, memories of traveling the world with his master and fellow disciples rose unbidden—he felt a pang of nostalgia.","\"I wonder where that idiot junior brother is these days...\"","But he didn’t have long to reminisce—a terrifying dragon’s cry shattered his thoughts and dragged him back to reality. At the same time, even stronger waves of spiritual power tore through the distance—mountains fractured, blood-red marshes splashed through the air, and a rank, evil wind swept toward them.","This was the aftermath of a full-powered battle between late Golden Core Cultivators.","The shockwaves alone could shatter mountains and split stone, striking fear in all who felt them.","Xun Zixian stepped in front of Mo Hua, flicked his sleeve, and Eryi spun and condensed into a crystalline barrier of spiritual power, blocking the blast’s aftershocks and shielding Mo Hua.","Mo Hua finally felt somewhat at ease.","At the same time, he grew even more cautious.","When cultivators at the Golden Core Realm clash at full force, the power of their spiritual strength is truly terrifying. It seems my usual caution has been justified.","Scheming from behind the scenes and letting one Golden Core kill another—that’s one thing.","But if I had to fight with my own hands and set foot in such danger, even being grazed by these Golden Core techniques could easily result in my body being blown to pieces.","I underestimated the Golden Core level...","Mo Hua grew uneasy. \"Elder Zixian, can the Sect Elders handle this evil dragon’s power? Won’t it be dangerous?\"","Xun Zixian’s brow furrowed slightly. After sensing for a moment, he shook his head and said:","\"This evil dragon’s strength is fierce, but its foundation is weak. Either the cultivation technique is incomplete, or the spell point hasn’t been fully developed. It hasn’t reached its final form.\"","\"And this time, Taixu Gate has dispatched only experts. Ziyou’s sword intent is outstanding, plus the late Golden Core Elders from Tai’a and Chongxu’s two lineages—their three sword techniques complement one another. There shouldn’t be too much danger...\"","Mo Hua felt somewhat relieved and asked again, \"Then is it possible to kill this demon head, imbued with evil dragon power?\"","\"Difficult,\" Xun Zixian replied. \"It’ll depend on luck.\"","Mo Hua let out a soft sigh.","If they can’t kill him, then there’s no way to capture him alive.","In that case, whether I can obtain this ’Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Map’ is completely up in the air.","The savage dragon roars still echoed across Yanluo Mountain.","But after a while, a clear, refreshing zither melody rang out—like a mountain stream, soothing the heart and suppressing the rampaging evil dragon’s cries.","It seemed a Golden Core Elder had taken action, using music to contest the dragon’s roar.","Sure enough, the dragon’s roar weakened and its baleful aura diminished noticeably. Now when the dragon’s song reached the ear, it no longer struck terror as before.","\"That is the Wenren family’s Heart-Clearing Zither—a rare zither-type magic treasure inheritance.\" Xun Zixian explained.","Mo Hua nodded in acknowledgment.","He remembered that, among the Supervisors sent this time, there was a Golden Core Cultivator from the Wenren family’s line.","The zither’s notes suppressed the dragon’s cry, and moments later, spiritual power fluctuations rose violently again.","This siege, it seemed, had reached its fiery climax."]},{"number":1895,"title":"Chapter 1895 - 929: Evil \"Dragon\" (Part 2)","paragraphs":["With Elder Xun Zixian protecting him, Mo Hua was quite safe, but gazing at Yanluo Mountain, shrouded in Blood Qi and Spiritual Power running rampant, he still couldn’t help but feel a pang of worry in his heart.","The turbulence of Spiritual Power and Blood Qi persisted, lasting for half a day before gradually ebbing away.","The Blood Qi in the air had gathered into a thick blood mist.","This siege had finally drawn to a close. Taoist Court cultivators were already tending to the aftermath.","The Demon Sect was defeated; all the Golden Core Demons they could kill were killed.","But it wasn’t over yet.","There was still a large number of Demon Sect disciples fleeing like wild beasts and birds.","The Taoist Court was blocking off the exits, hunting them down one by one, trying to wipe them out completely, to prevent these remnants from escaping and bringing disaster to innocent cultivators.","The great battle was ended, but all around Yanluo Mountain, small-scale skirmishes were still flaring up one after another.","Mo Hua wanted to go out and see, but Elder Xun Zixian didn’t allow it.","The grand battle was perilous, but the leftover slaughter afterward was just as deadly, full of hidden danger, and one couldn’t afford to drop their guard.","Xun Zixian wouldn’t dare let Mo Hua take that risk.","Mo Hua could only wait patiently.","After a while, it was instead the Golden Core Elders from Taixu Gate who came back one after another. Each of them looked weary, injured, their auras chaotic; clearly, the earlier battle had been extremely taxing.","Xun Ziyou also returned, his Taoist Robe marked with a clear streak of blood, half of his hair loose, face pale, blood all over him, and a fierce murderous glint still lingering in his eyes.","This was completely different from how Mo Hua had seen him before: the Elder Xun Ziyou who’d secretly followed him, liked to be lazy, and enjoyed sipping tea leisurely.","Xun Ziyou seemed still caught up in the killing, murder intent fixed on his face, but when he saw Mo Hua and met those clear, limpid eyes, he snapped back to himself and let out a long sigh of relief.","\"Elder Xun, are your injuries serious?\" Mo Hua asked.","Xun Ziyou replied gently, \"I’m fine, nothing major.\" He took a few Pills, then sighed, \"It’s just a shame we let the Demon Sect’s leader get away.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened a little.","Xun Zixian frowned, \"What happened exactly?\"","Xun Ziyou’s expression turned grave:","\"We fought our way forward, all the way to the Blood Pool, where we encountered the Demon Sect leader.\"","\"He looked half human, half ghost, extremely sinister. On his back was a carved dragon pattern—no idea where it came from. Once activated, his Blood Qi surged madly, and a green-black Evil Dragon circled through his body. Blade and spear couldn’t pierce him, spells couldn’t touch him, and his Dragon Roar was enough to shake the soul. Three or four late Golden Core Elders attacked together, but we just couldn’t take him down.\"","\"The Sword Intent of Taixu Gate, the sword edge of Tai’a Sect, and the Sword Qi of Rushing Void Sect—none of them could break through his defenses.\"","\"We stalemated for several hours. He finally sucked the Blood Pool dry, clearly spent, then transformed into a dragon shadow, unleashed a monstrous amount of Evil Power, broke through our encirclement, and fled deeper into Yanluo Mountain.\"","\"The Evil Dragon Escape Skill was way too fast. We didn’t dare pursue too far; had to let him go, focusing first on rooting out the other Demon Sect vermin.\"","After all, the disaster of the Demon Sect wasn’t just about one leader; more troubling was the crowd of tumors spreading Demon Skills.","If they could wipe out most of the demon cultivators, that was enough for victory.","Mo Hua felt a weight lift from his heart as well. If they succeeded in this siege against the Demon Sect, that was good enough, but he still felt regret inside.","The Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation was as strong as rumored.","This Demon Sect Leader possessed the power of the Evil Dragon—even three or four late Golden Core Sect Elders couldn’t hold him down.","But then, what about the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation Diagram?","With so many Golden Core Elders failing to subdue that Demon Sect Leader, there wasn’t a chance for him at all.","Mo Hua frowned in thought.","Meanwhile, after sitting down, Xun Ziyou drank a cup of tea that Elder Xun Zixian had just brewed, then suddenly remembered something and said:","\"I killed a Golden Core Demon.\"","Xun Zixian responded coolly, \"So you killed one, what’s the big deal?\"","A late-stage Golden Core killing one or two Golden Core Demons wasn’t worth mentioning.","\"That’s not it,\" Xun Ziyou frowned. \"Remember, I mentioned those Golden Core demon cultivators from Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?\"","Xun Zixian’s eyes narrowed, and he nodded.","Mo Hua was startled, and perked up his ears.","Xun Ziyou said: \"Back at Refining Demon Mountain, there were three Golden Core Elder demon cultivators in Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.\"","\"We found one’s corpse when we searched the mountain. There was a big claw mark across his chest, like someone had sliced him open—his storage bag gone, and the Monster Patterns on his skin had been cut off, so it’s impossible to tell what kind of demon cultivator he was.\"","\"The other two—a snake demon and a bear demon—were the very same two who surrounded Elder Xuan Jian from Rushing Void Sect in Demon Hunting Mountain before.\"","\"I fought those two demon cultivators, but they escaped. Later, when we searched the mountain again, never found any trace of them.\"","\"But just now, in the Demon Sect, I actually ran into them.\"","On hearing this, both Xun Zixian and Mo Hua were surprised.","\"So the matter of Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is connected to this Demon Sect?\" Xun Zixian frowned.","\"I think so...\" Xun Ziyou said.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","He’d already guessed before—once a demon cultivator in Valley of Ten Thousand Demons formed their core, they were eligible to leave the valley, and after leaving, this Demon Sect was likely one of their gathering points.","But that had only been speculation—now Elder Xun Ziyou’s words had just confirmed his deduction.","So Valley of Ten Thousand Demons really was connected to the Demon Sect.","\"Those two Golden Core demon cultivators—?\" Xun Zixian asked. \"Did you kill them?\"","\"Killed one,\" Xun Ziyou answered, \"the snake demon’s dead, the bear demon got away—don’t know where he escaped to. Maybe one of the other Elders took him out, maybe not.\"","Xun Zixian pondered for a moment. \"There’s something strange about all this...\"","Xun Ziyou nodded. \"Indeed.\"","Mo Hua was thoughtful as well. After a moment, just as he was about to speak, he suddenly sensed something wrong with the atmosphere, and quickly looked up at the sky.","He saw the heavens shrouded in a bloody haze, with Evil Qi swirling secretly along predetermined paths.","Mo Hua was startled and looked immediately to Xun Zixian, \"Elder!\"","Xun Zixian sensed the anomaly as well, face turning grim: \"A Formation!\"","He shot to his feet, unleashed his Divine Sense, and seemed to be making calculations in his heart. After a moment, his eyes narrowed sharply, and he addressed Xun Ziyou:","\"It’s a Turning Fiend Formation: it feeds on the Blood Qi and resentment of the dead, nourishing something. Spread the word—don’t kill off any more demon cultivators unless absolutely necessary, or this Formation is going to gorge itself.\"","Xun Ziyou wasn’t very versed in Formations, but he respected Xun Zixian’s skill, and immediately summoned several Inner Sect Disciples to pass down the order.","The Inner Gate Disciples hurried off to relay the command.","Xun Zixian was still deeply worried.","\"Not killing isn’t a real solution either—many people already died in the battle just now. Whether we kill now or not, this Evil Formation is still running, absorbing the Blood Fiend Qi.\"","Mo Hua knew this as well. He said: \"Elder Zixian, we’ve got to find a way to break this Formation. We can’t leave such an evil thing here.\"","Xun Zixian nodded slightly, but looked at Mo Hua with concern.","Mo Hua knew he was worried about his safety, so he said:","\"I’ll go with you—I won’t leave your side, I won’t wander off. All the Golden Core Demons are either dead or have fled; there shouldn’t be any real danger left.\"","Xun Zixian considered a moment, then nodded. \"Alright.\"","He rose, gathering a few Taixu Sect Elders who still had some strength, and headed into the poisonous swamp of Yanluo Mountain.","Once a poison swamp, it had now become a \"Blood Swamp.\"","The mist above was saturated with blood, bright crimson, carried on the lingering Formation power, floating in the air, condensed and undispersed.","Within the Blood Qi, life and death karma flowed faintly.","Xun Zixian took out a Si Nan, flicked it a few times with his fingers, and the Golden Needle spun, pointing the way toward the source of Evil Power.","Xun Zixian followed the direction indicated by the Golden Needle.","Mo Hua obediently followed behind, treading on withered grass, poisonous swamp, and severed corpse-parts of demon cultivators, step by step heading deeper into the marsh.","After half an hour, Xun Zixian stopped, eyes narrowing. He raised two fingers and pointed; a streak of sword light shot forth, flattening a grassy mound in front of them.","Beneath the mound lay a large White Bone Stele, covered in hideous patterns.","The Blood Fiend energy in the air was converging from all directions onto this White Bone Stele.","Nourished by the blood, those patterns on the stele’s face swelled with fresh blood and visibly glowed with evil red light, almost as if they had come alive, writhing bit by bit."]},{"number":1896,"title":"Chapter 1896 - 930: White Bone Evil Formation","paragraphs":["Xun Zixian’s eyes flickered. He immediately raised his fingers and summoned a beam of white sword light, stabbing toward the writhing blood-patterned White Bone Stele.","A layer of red light surfaced on the White Bone Stele.","The sword light pierced the sinister blood-colored barrier, grinding against it until the blood-red shield fractured inch by inch, then sliced straight onto the face of the White Bone Stele.","A crack split across the stele’s surface. Beneath the fissure, flesh squirmed, and a shrill scream sounded.","\"Ghost sound?\"","Xun Zixian’s expression shifted. He hurriedly covered Mo Hua’s ears, but Mo Hua’s face remained unfazed.","This level of Evil Spirit’s voice couldn’t shake his resolve or Divine Thought. On the contrary, several nearby Golden Core Elders all frowned, faces uncomfortable, some even nauseated to the point of retching.","Seeing the screams growing ever more piercing, Xun Zixian immediately said, \"Everyone, together! Tear this stele apart!\"","The other Golden Core Elders, knowing how wicked this bone stele was, all unleashed their Magic Treasures and, holding nothing back, shattered the blood-patterned White Bone Stele into dust.","The white bones turned to powder, flesh evaporated, and the writhing blood patterns, having lost their anchor, gradually faded until they vanished completely.","With the power of the Formation broken, the condensed Blood Qi scattered from all around, slowly dissipating.","Xun Zixian let out a small sigh of relief, but immediately his heart tightened again.","\"A Third Grade Evil Formation forged from white bone as medium, rotting flesh as foundation, and fresh blood for Mo—there are still plenty more around here. If we let them be, and they gorge themselves on blood and death, who knows what terrifying things might happen...\"","Xun Ziyou spoke up at once, \"I’ll go call the other Elders, inform the Taoist Court, and gather up a force. We’ll strive to destroy all these White Bone Formation Steles in short order.\"","\"Good,\" Xun Zixian nodded.","Soon after, more than a dozen Golden Core cultivators assembled. Guided by Xun Zixian, they located every scattered Evil Formation Stele in the blood-soaked swamps of Yanluo Mountain, shattering each and breaking the Formation entirely.","The blood-red in the sky faded a little, though still visibly coagulating at a slow rate.","The Evil Formations of Yanluo Mountain kept on operating.","\"Still too slow; I’m afraid we won’t make it in time...\" Xun Zixian frowned.","\"Elder,\" Mo Hua suddenly said, \"Let me take a group to look for the White Bone Stele as well. If we split into two teams, we’ll be faster.\"","Xun Zixian looked toward Mo Hua, \"These are Third Grade Evil Formations—can you find them?\"","\"Let me try,\" answered Mo Hua.","Xun Zixian never doubted Mo Hua’s insight and skill in Formation, but he was still a bit concerned, so he turned to Xun Ziyou.","Xun Ziyou understood, and nodded, \"I’ll bring a few Elders with Mo Hua. He won’t encounter any danger.\"","\"Mm,\" Xun Zixian nodded.","Time was pressing; there was no room for more deliberation.","Xun Zixian remembered something and solemnly warned Mo Hua, \"Just destroy them, don’t look too closely, don’t dwell on it, and never try to learn from them.\"","The more gifted a disciple, the quicker they might stray; one step on the Evil Path, and it’s eternal ruin.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Elder Zixian, I understand.\"","Thus the group split into two teams: one led by Elder Xun Zixian, the other by Mo Hua, searching for the White Bone Formation Steles and destroying them all.","The Evil Gods on the White Bone Formation Steles were Third Grade, well beyond Mo Hua’s Formation expertise.","But his Divine Sense was only a hair short of the Third Grade, Twenty Patterns; not drawing Formations, just finding Third Grade Formations wasn’t too difficult.","Moreover, these Evil Formations churned with fresh blood, had absorbed massive quantities of Evil Qi, and in Mo Hua’s Divine Sense, they stood out like ghostly flames at noon—glaring and unmistakable.","Mo Hua didn’t even need Formation Calculation; he could spot them at a glance.","Xun Ziyou, plus the Taixu Gate and several Taoist Court Golden Core Stewards, were all led by Mo Hua, moving through the blood-drenched toxic swamps of Yanluo Mountain.","Mo Hua took a few steps and, catching something from the corner of his eye, pointed with his finger, \"There!\"","Xun Ziyou and several Golden Core Elders exchanged glances, then unleashed their Spirit Swords and activated Golden Core Spiritual Power, tearing away the swamp weeds on the surface, and sure enough, uncovered a buried bone stele below.","Blood patterns writhed across its surface.","Xun Ziyou and company wasted no time—blade lights and spells burst forth, the bone stele became powder, blood patterns vanished, and the Evil Formation was destroyed.","Mo Hua forced himself to look away from the blood patterns, refusing to study the Evil Formation Patterns, lest those filthy evil glyphs corrupt his eyes.","Truth be told, though, he was a bit interested deep down.","He was a Formation Master; Formation Masters exhaust all the myriad arts.","Evil Formations were also a type of Formation, and within them lay a kind of \"Dao.\"","Besides, his Taoist Heart was steadfast; he devoured Evil Spirits, refines evil thoughts, and tempers Taoist Heart, with resistance to ordinary evil influences.","But still, he didn’t indulge.","Heeded good advice, filled his belly.","Elder Xun Zixian’s guidance was something he truly valued; it wouldn’t do to let pride arise just because his Divine Thought was strong.","The bone stele was shattered, ghost sounds dissipated, and the Evil Formation was destroyed here. Mo Hua then moved onward; after a while, he reached a hollow and pointed underground:","\"There’s another one.\"","Xun Ziyou’s group of Golden Core Elders joined forces again, dug open the earth, destroyed the stele, and broke the Formation.","After this, Mo Hua repeated the process—he’d point out a spot, and Xun Ziyou’s Golden Core Cultivators would destroy it.","With him and Elder Xun Zixian working in tandem, the pace of breaking Formations more than doubled.","Soon, the blood-patterned bone steles of Yanluo Mountain were nearly all destroyed.","The evil aura at the horizon faded as well.","The lingering blood mist in the air gradually evaporated away.","Everyone felt as though a heavy weight had been lifted.","Mo Hua reunited with Xun Zixian.","Xun Zixian looked at Mo Hua, nodded with comfort, and said, \"Well done. You’ve worked hard.\"","\"Elder, you’re too kind—this is what disciples ought to do,\" Mo Hua replied warmly and politely. He turned, glanced at Yanluo Mountain, and added, \"There are likely some bone steles still left behind in the mountain.\""]},{"number":1897,"title":"Chapter 1897 - 930: White Bone Evil Formation (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"It’s fine,\" Xun Zixian said, \"This place is covered in poisonous swamps and the terrain is complicated. We don’t have enough time to clear it all out now. I’ll have someone take care of the aftermath later.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Then the two raised their heads together, looking toward the white mist, where miasma and blood fog intertwined, a vast, indistinct sky—both of them furrowed their brows at the same time.","They were both Formation Masters, and exceptionally gifted ones at that, able to sense the strange energies permeating Yanluo Mountain’s Blood Swamp and the sinister currents in the bloody Evil Formation there.","\"So the Formation is fueled by slaughter...\" Mo Hua murmured.","Xun Zixian’s gaze trembled slightly, \"All killing brings blood, white bone, rotting flesh, and the resentment and terror people experience before death, the Yin Qi and Evil Qi that follow... These are the source power of the Evil Formation.\"","\"The deeper the slaughter, the stronger the Evil Formation grows.\"","\"And moreover...\"","Xun Zixian shifted his gaze from the blood-drenched sky to the vast earth below, his brows drawn tight.","Just now, when the Demon Sect was besieged, the fighting was fierce—a thousand Cultivators slaughtered.","The flesh, grudges, and Evil Qi of those dead Cultivators were absorbed by the Evil Formation, transformed into Evil Power, and finally all surged into the earth veins, and then—","vanished without a trace...","The vast land blocked any trace; it was impossible to track where that Evil Power had gone.","Not only did Xun Zixian fail to discern it—even Mo Hua, who had once resonated with the Earth Dao Meaning, couldn’t perceive the flow of power within the Evil Formation.","Earth is Kun—thick virtue bearing all things.","The earth embraces everything, whether living or dead, righteous or evil.","Once Evil Power flows into the earth veins, it disappears, leaving no trail.","And after all, Mo Hua is only at Foundation Establishment; even with superior comprehension, his realm limits him—much of the truth remains hidden from view.","Xun Zixian’s gaze was grave, \"There is someone behind the Demon Sect—the mastery of their Evil Formation... is unfathomable.\"","Mo Hua nodded in agreement.","He suspected it was Mr. Tu, but couldn’t be sure.","Among the Evil God’s lackeys, there could easily be an Evil Formation Master more formidable than Mr. Tu.","Xun Ziyou, standing to the side, finally understood and his expression shifted slightly:","\"So, we’ve walked into a trap, haven’t we? The Demon Sect laid this Formation deliberately, luring us into slaughtering their disciples, stirring up bloodshed, just to activate the Formation?\"","Xun Zixian’s brows knit even tighter.","But Mo Hua shook his head, \"Not necessarily...\"","He’s tangled with the Demon Sect—no, with the Great Wilderness Evil God behind the Demon Sect—far too many times; there are things he understands better than most.","\"This Formation was very likely designed this way from the beginning,\" Mo Hua said. \"Since the Demon Sect established themselves here, it was only a matter of time before a bloody war erupted.\"","Mo Hua looked out at the treacherous mountains and marshlands, his voice solemn: \"This Yanluo Mountain was destined to become a battlefield drenched in blood. Whoever laid down the Formation anticipated this and placed the Evil Formation here in advance. What they were waiting for was the inevitable bloodshed.\"","\"It’s just that the Demon Sect was eradicated sooner than expected.\"","\"If the Demon Sect had been left to develop for another ten or twenty years, with Demon Cultivators numbering in the tens of thousands—\"","\"At that point, if the Taoist Court launched another siege on the Demon Sect, the casualties would be ten times what they are now, or more.\"","\"The slaughter would be overwhelming, Blood Qi would shroud the sky; even if someone noticed that this toxic swamp was riddled with Evil Formations sucking up and converting deadly evilness, sending it into the earth veins, no one could stop it.\"","\"If it came to that, this Evil Formation would be completely saturated, and who knows what kind of nightmare would be unleashed...\"","Mo Hua’s tone was grave and heavy.","Xun Zixian and Xun Ziyou, together with the other Elders, all wore somber expressions.","The atmosphere grew even more oppressive.","Xun Ziyou sighed, \"Heretical Demon, truly cunning and vicious.\"","Xun Zixian nodded as well, then suddenly froze for a moment, stealing a glance at Mo Hua, his thoughts shifting softly.","The Demon Path is undeniably sinister, but this kid Mo Hua only took a few looks at the Formations and already grasped how the Evil Formation was operating, showing his quick mind; his intuition with Formations and his insight into things rival those of the Demon Head pulling strings from the shadows.","\"The old gentleman was right to worry—the more gifted he is, the less you can let him stray off the righteous path.\"","As this thought crossed Xun Zixian’s mind, he said to Mo Hua:","\"The Demon Sect siege is basically finished. Come back to the sect with me—the Taoist Court will take care of the cleanup.\"","Mo Hua hesitated briefly, speaking in a low voice, \"Elder, can I have a look inside the Demon Sect?\"","Xun Zixian kept a straight face, \"What do you want to see?\"","He wanted to see if there were clues to the Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation inside the Demon Sect...","But the Green Dragon Formation had the tendency to devolve into an Evil Dragon Formation; it wasn’t something Mo Hua wanted to say plainly, so he replied:","\"I just want to see for myself—what it’s really like inside the Demon Sect, and what the Demon Cultivators actually did.\"","Mo Hua had assumed Elder Xun Zixian would refuse.","But Xun Zixian seemed to think it over and, after only a moment’s hesitation, unexpectedly nodded, \"Very well, I’ll take you to have a look.\"","Xun Ziyou was a bit unhappy.","That kind of place—he didn’t want to go back even once, let alone see Mo Hua enter it.","But since Mo Hua wanted to go and Xun Zixian agreed, he couldn’t overrule the two and could only call a few more Taixu Sect Elders along to keep watch, worried that something might happen to Mo Hua he couldn’t answer for.","Inside the Demon Sect, everything was already in ruins.","The Taoist Court and Taixu Sect Elders had smashed through the outer Formation head-on, then battled to the death with the Demon Sect’s leaders and Golden Core Elders within. The Demon Sect’s grand hall was now collapsed, nothing but broken walls and shattered roofs everywhere.","But many of the Demon Sect’s cruelties remained.","Blood slaves kept like livestock in pigpens—blank-minded, skeletal, barely recognizable as human."]},{"number":1898,"title":"Chapter 1898 - 930: White Bone Evil Formation (3)","paragraphs":["Most of these blood slaves were already dead, drained dry of blood before the battle began.","A few were still barely clinging to life, but their Blood Qi had been depleted, their foundations damaged—it was doubtful they could be saved.","There were also some cultivators who’d had their blood extracted, turned into mummified corpses and hung from the rafters.","Some had their blood brewed into \"Blood Wine,\" stored in the cellars for Demon Cultivators to drink.","In the secret chamber, there were all sorts of cruel torture devices, inscribed with Evil Formations. No real purpose—just pure, twisted amusement at others’ suffering...","...","Mo Hua walked along, taking in every sight.","Some things—knowing and seeing—are two very different matters. Only by witnessing, by experiencing firsthand, can you truly understand what they mean.","Everything before him spoke, vividly and wordlessly, to Mo Hua:","In the eyes of Demon Cultivators, people are just emergency \"rations,\" wine-making \"produce,\" or bred \"livestock\"—but never, ever \"people.\"","These grim scenes engraved themselves deeply into Mo Hua’s mind.","Mo Hua said nothing, his silence heavy.","Xun Zixian caught the look on Mo Hua’s face, and finally spoke slowly: \"Cultivators have levels in cultivation, and the strength of their power differs.\"","\"Some cultivators, once their cultivation is strong, bear the world upon their hearts and benefit all living beings through their own efforts.\"","\"But others, armed with power, use it for oppression, enslavement, slaughter, even wanton massacre of weaker cultivators.\"","\"This is the division between Righteous and Demonic.\"","Xun Zixian then pointed to all the Evil Formations spread throughout the Demon Sect, and said:","\"Formations are just the same.\"","\"Some Formation Masters comprehend the Heavenly Dao and use Formations for the good of all.\"","\"Some Masters, however, have corrupt Heart Skills, exploiting Evil Formations for their own selfish gain—even obliterating their Taoist Heart, and committing slaughter in pursuit of powerful Formations.\"","\"This is the fundamental difference between Righteous Formation Masters and Evil Formation Masters.\"","\"Many cultivators live their whole lives sheltered, never understanding what ’Demon’ truly means. Some, on a stray thought, see no harm in falling into the demonic path, even thinking that becoming a Demon and killing at will makes them look powerful.\"","Xun Zixian sighed deeply, looked at Mo Hua one last time, and solemnly said:","\"Cultivating as a Demon may grant you strength and sway over the winds and rains, but you will never attain true Dao, nor transcend to immortality.\"","\"You must decide—do you want to become immortal, or are you just chasing raw power?\"","\"This question may seem easy at first. The real challenge is—after countless trials and suffering, after years have passed and time has worn you down—can you still hold onto your original aspiration, and still see this truth clearly?\"","Xun Zixian’s tone was grave and low.","Mo Hua’s pupils trembled slightly—he nodded deeply.","From then on, he was lost in thought all the way, until he reached the deepest part of the Demon Sect, where he met the Demon Head and laid eyes on the massive Blood Pool used for cultivation. Only then did he snap back to reality and study the Blood Pool before him.","The pool was enormous, cast from white bones, its edges dotted with monstrous demon statues carved from fiendish stone—all twisted, hideous forms.","To fill this Blood Pool, who knows how many deaths, how much blood would be needed?","But now, the pool was empty.","A whole pool of blood, drained by the Demon Head wielding the power of the Evil Dragon, at the moment of his last stand.","Inside the pool, Evil Formations were everywhere—but only the ordinary ones, meant for nourishing the pool and keeping the blood fresh and flowing.","It was not the mighty \"Four Symbols Green Dragon Evil Formation.\"","Mo Hua circled the Blood Pool once, found nothing of value, and gave up, following a group of elders, ready to set off back to Taixu Gate.","But before leaving, Mo Hua suddenly remembered something and went to ask Xun Ziyou:","\"Elder Xun, did you encounter a skinny elder in the Demon Sect, someone with a dog Pattern on his body, surname ’You’?\"","\"Dog Pattern?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Xun Ziyou thought for a moment, then shook his head. \"When raiding the Demon Sect, I fought with more than ten Demon Sect Elders, but never saw a Golden Core Demon with a dog Pattern carved on him.\"","Mo Hua frowned.","Never saw him...","Did that Elder You get wind of it and flee? Or was he killed by other Golden Core Elders?","\"Is he important?\" Xun Ziyou asked Mo Hua.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then shook his head.","He couldn’t really say.","By rights, this \"Elder You\" should be a key figure. But the dog Pattern made him seem like just a lackey.","Even so, as a Golden Core, it seemed unlikely he’d willingly act as a \"dog.\"","And although Mo Hua had tricked him, he could sense that Elder You was far from simple.","He was only fooled due to his lack of Formation knowledge.","When an expert cons a layman, it’s basically a guaranteed win.","Still, the real reason Mo Hua was preoccupied with Elder You was that the man owed him 1.8 million Spirit Stones.","That debt, Mo Hua remembered perfectly well.","\"Mo Hua?\" Xun Ziyou found Mo Hua daydreaming, his eyes flickering, obviously scheming something, so he called out, \"What’s the matter? Is there something suspicious about Elder You?\"","\"Nothing,\" Mo Hua replied, \"I was just asking off the cuff.\"","Xun Ziyou looked at Mo Hua with obvious doubt.","Mo Hua said, \"It’s getting late, Elder Xun. Let’s head back to the Sect, or Elder Master Xun will be worried.\"","Xun Ziyou’s focus shifted right away; he nodded:","\"You’re right, let’s head back.\"","For now, the urgent thing was to get the child Mo Hua back to the Sect—it was no good to have him wandering around this blood-soaked place, or who knows what he’d get mixed up in. There’d be no way to explain to the ancestors.","And so, the Taixu Sect Elders escorted Mo Hua, loading onto the carriage, heading back to Taixu Gate."]},{"number":1899,"title":"Chapter 1899 - 930: White Bone Evil Formation (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Before Mo Hua left, he turned to glance back at Yanluo Mountain.","Yanluo Mountain lay in ruins, with blood mist lingering in the air, miasma hazy and vague, shrouding the sky above.","As if there was a fog, concealing something unseen.","The Demon Sect leader who survived and escaped; the Golden Core Demon Cultivators from the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons; the missing Elder You;","And that unknown, writhing White Bone Evil Formation;","All these matters hovered within Mo Hua’s mind.","Mo Hua felt as though he’d gotten close to the heart of the Evil God’s conspiracy, yet far too many things remained murky and indistinct, hidden beneath the mist.","Especially that deadly evilness, transformed by the Evil Formation, streaming into the earth veins, its destination unknown...","A shadow crept over Mo Hua’s heart.","...","After returning to the Sect, Mo Hua burned incense and bathed, washing away the dust of travel, then lay down on the bed in the Disciple’s Residence.","The karmic entanglements of the Demon Sect, and Elder Xun Zixian’s words, still lingered within Mo Hua’s heart.","Mo Hua could not help but ponder inwardly:","\"Where, after all, could the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation be hidden?\"","\"Does it really require slaughtering the Demon Sect’s leader before I can claim this Formation?\"","Again Mo Hua recalled deep within the Demon Sect, that vast Blood Pool cultivated for the leader’s practice.","\"If the Four Symbols Green Dragon Formation truly requires the deaths of many, rivers of blood, only then to be successfully nourished...\"","\"To seek my own power, would I really have to slaughter countless innocent cultivators...\"","\"Could I really go through with such a thing?\"","\"Elder Xun Zixian was right—if I blindly pursue power, one day I will lose myself, forget my own heart, become a mere puppet to power. Instead of wielding it, I would become its slave...\"","Mo Hua’s thoughts swirled chaotically.","But for many of these problems, he could do nothing now.","Coupled with the exhaustion from hunting down Demon Cultivators these past days, the more he thought, the more his mind clouded, until, unknowingly, he simply fell asleep.","As Mo Hua slept, his guard down, a current of evil Qi followed the threads of karma, slowly appearing, flooding into his Sea of Consciousness, seeping into his eyes.","Within the evil Qi were scenes of Demon Sect cultivators, dying tragically under the Taoist Court’s purge, mingled with lingering resentment.","These resentments coalesced into evil Qi, flowing into Mo Hua’s eyes.","Unbeknownst to Mo Hua, the \"Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill\" he’d gained from the Water Prison Sect was quietly activating, cultivating in utter silence.","Mo Hua’s aura took on an icy chill as well.","Within that cold, a fearsome, murderous evil radiated—a sense of \"slaughter without remorse.\"","Yet this fierce evilness carried, too, a righteous aura of \"slaying monsters and demons.\"","...","Taoist Prison.","Wave after wave of Demon Cultivator Disciples were thrown into the dungeons.","To prevent the Evil Formation from operating and absorbing deadly evil Qi, the Taoist Court, in the aftermath, had not slaughtered them all to the last.","Quite a few Demon Sect Disciples, under the Taoist Court’s slaughter, survived in the end.","These Demon Sect Disciples were locked away within the Taoist Prison.","And all this, Li San watched with his own eyes.","The panic-stricken whispers among the Demon Cultivators echoed, word for word, into his ears.","Li San felt as if he’d plunged into an icy abyss.","\"It’s over...\"","\"Our Demon Sect... it’s finished?!\"","Every ounce of strength drained from Li San’s body; he collapsed limply to the ground, eyes empty, like a dead fish.","Yet stray fragments of words still slipped, unbidden, into his ears.","\"All gone, everyone’s dead...\"","\"Elder Jiu is dead, Second Elder is dead... all dead...\"","\"The leader’s alive...\"","\"So what?\"","\"The Demon Sect has been destroyed, utterly ruined, from top to bottom—completely finished...\"","Within this stream of broken voices, suddenly a single line slipped into Li San’s ear.","\"Didn’t see Elder You—seems he’s still alive...\"","...","\"Not once did I see him, from start to finish...\"","\"He wouldn’t even go down with the Sect—truly a traitor!\"","...","Elder You!","Suddenly, a spark of light flickered in Li San’s eyes. He could no longer hear anything after that; only those few words resounded in his mind:","\"Elder You isn’t dead!\"","Not dead...","Li San’s face was ashen, his thoughts racing, and then suddenly, his pupils narrowed:","\"I understand!\"","\"At last I understand why Elder You sent me to the Taoist Prison...\"","\"He foresaw that the Demon Sect would meet with disaster! He foresaw that so many fellow disciples would perish!\"","\"That’s why! He schemed to have me sent into the Taoist Prison!\"","\"This was to protect me—to let me escape this great calamity! And wait, in the future, for the Demon Sect’s restoration... its return from the ashes?!\"","\"If that day comes, wouldn’t I be the ’pillar of the Demon Sect’?!\"","\"The mere title of Elder would be nothing!\"","Li San’s formerly dead heart blazed anew from the ashes.","His expression grew resolute, and his faith in \"Elder You\" only solidified further.","\"Elder You didn’t deceive me—everything was according to Elder You’s plan!\"","\"Everything he did was right! Such far-seeing wisdom—Elder You must have grand ambitions.\"","\"And Elder You’s ambition needs me... Now, I must bide my time, and in the future offer him my very life...\"","In the dark prison cell, Li San slowly lay himself down on the ground, closing his eyes. No one saw the raging fire of faith and ambition burning deep within them.","...","Meanwhile, in a pitch-black secret chamber within a forbidden ground.","Pale-green candlelight flickered, ghastly sheep bones looming in the gloom.","Covered in cuts and bruises, skin and bones separating, tormented nearly beyond recognition by \"Divine Punishment,\" Mr. Tu let out a hoarse, vicious roar:","\"Sooner or later, I’ll see your Taixu Gate... wiped from the face of the earth!!\""]},{"number":1900,"title":"Chapter 1900 - 931: Dream Omen","paragraphs":["The divine punishment is intensifying; it is a compound sentence for multiple sins.","Mr. Tu’s bones are breaking inch by inch, his flesh twisted into strands, blood seeping into the floor, yet Mr. Tu did not dare resist, did not dare plead, could only endure all this.","His hatred towards Taixu Gate deepened into his bones along with this pain.","If it weren’t for Taixu Gate... the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons wouldn’t have been destroyed, the Rouge Boat wouldn’t have been ransacked, and his plans wouldn’t have been restricted at every turn.","And now, the Demon Sect is being besieged, with the main force still being those twenty Golden Core Elders from Taixu Gate!","Mr. Tu was driven mad with hatred, almost biting through his teeth.","At the same time, the divine punishment also approached its end.","After a series of bone-grinding pain, punishments like the Three Thousand Purgatories of the Great Wilderness, and various torturous punishments embedded in divine thoughts, Mr. Tu finally got a short reprieve.","He had been plotting for a millennium for the master of the Great Wilderness.","The divine punishment he had suffered over this thousand years was far less severe and brutal than this short period.","All this was given by Taixu Gate, which worshipped that Fierce God.","This hatred, he would not forget.","Mr. Tu’s flesh squirmed, white bone grew flesh, flesh regenerated skin, again forming into human shape, prostrating forward before the immense sheep bone statue, bowing his head in respectful return:","\"I exhausted my blood and sweat, but the Evil Dragon prepared for the master’s Divine Fetus escaped. It grew a strange heart, feeling its bloodline is noble, unwilling to dedicate everything for you, Divine Lord.\"","\"I will find it and flay its skin.\"","\"The Blood Refining Sect, Ten Thousand Demon Mountain... I borrowed their Taoist inheritance, spread the Divine Lord’s reputation, which provoked their covetousness. They also wished to meddle in the Qianxue state boundary and take a share...\"","\"This is of no consequence. Once the great calamity descends, allowing these true Demon Sects to wreak havoc will also present richer offerings for the resurrection of the Divine Lord...\"","\"When the time comes, believers will live, non-believers will die, these Demon Sects will be no exception.\"","\"These Demon Cultivators, habitual killers, disregarding of laws, simply don’t know the true Great Horror beyond their imagination in this world.\"","\"The Divine Fetus of the Dragon King Temple, it has become silent...\"","\"The Fierce God of Taixu Gate, truly a formidable foe of the Divine Lord, could suppress the power of the Divine Fetus, indeed terrifying, but that’s all.\"","\"I have other measures, a more suitable ’Divine Fetus’, as the ’vessel’ for your descent.\"","\"Circumstances are more urgent now...\"","\"The Taoist Court has become aware, the families have become cautious, Taixu Gate confronts us binarily, the Fierce God also eyes us covetously.\"","\"Now, before the Demon Sect even fully developed, it has been thoroughly besieged...\"","\"Someone is pressing me, leaving me no choice but to advance the plan.\"","\"Since that’s the case... then I will no longer wait.\"","Mr. Tu’s expression turned fierce, \"Next Dao Debate Conference...\"","\"I will make the Qianxue state boundary rivers of blood, slaughtering tens of thousands of cultivators, turning this piece of heaven and earth into purgatory, to welcome the descent of the Divine Lord!\"","Mr. Tu’s expression became feverish, and along with it, his surrounding injuries were rapidly recovering, as if the Evil God in the unseen realm had heard the news of resurrection and was \"rewarding\" his loyalty.","Mr. Tu knelt trembling, prostrate on the ground, under the eerie green candlelight, appearing sinister and terrifying as if a demon monster.","\"Next Dao Debate Conference... Rivers of blood...\"","...","Taixu Gate, Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua awoke abruptly, breaking out in a cold sweat.","It was as if he had foreseen something terrifying, even though he was awake, lingering fear remained.","\"What’s going on? I... had a nightmare?\" Mo Hua murmured.","\"No, that’s not right, I don’t even dream, besides...\"","\"Who dares let me have a nightmare?\"","Mo Hua frowned, touched his forehead, finding it cold, drenched in sweat.","Sensing something amiss, he tried tracing the cause and effect, yet his mind moved as if in a boundless sea, finding no way to grasp the source of this lingering dread.","Nor could he fathom what this cause and effect truly was.","\"Was it an illusion? Or... am I just too tired?\"","Mo Hua remained silent for a moment, still finding no clue, so he lay back on the bed, hoping to sleep more.","But as he rarely sleeps, having been rudely woken after finally sleeping once, sleep eluded him.","\"Never mind, I’ll practice formation...\"","With unsettled thoughts and indetermined situations, practicing formation was the first thing he’d do.","Mo Hua was accustomed to this.","He delved his divine sense into the Sea of Consciousness, and began consolidating and practicing some nineteen-pattern, even peak nineteen-pattern formations on the Taoist Stele.","Everything requires practice to become proficient, and formations are no different.","According to plan, Mo Hua practiced some Second Grade Nineteen-Pattern High-Grade Formations about ten times, warming up before he started on the Second Grade Twenty-Pattern Reversed Spirit Formation.","This formation, he couldn’t fully grasp or draw yet, but practicing was a start.","After all, his current formation skills had reached a bottleneck, beyond practicing the Ultimate Formation, there were no other formations to learn.","Like this, he practiced until dawn, only then did Mo Hua open his eyes.","Toward the rising sun, soaked in morning light, he routinely cultivated a bit, refining one circulation of Spirit Stone, accumulating a bit of spiritual power, then, as usual, attended class.","Sitting in the Tao Teaching Room, listening to the Elder’s lesson.","From being the \"hidden hand\" behind the fall of the Demon Sect, Mo Hua had transformed into a diligent little disciple of Taixu Gate.","A few days later, Mo Hua inquired about the aftermath of the Demon Sect’s fall from Gu Changhuai.","The two of them drank and ate in a restaurant in Tai Xu City.","The restaurant belonged to the Gu Family.","Having contributed much effort to the annihilation of the Demon Sect, Mo Hua was specially treated to another meal by Gu Changhuai to reward him.","Mo Hua didn’t hold back.","He knew Uncle Gu was a \"rich man,\" so he wouldn’t spare Spirit Stones for him.","Mo Hua ate as Gu Changhuai took a sip of wine and said to him:"]}]);
